{
	chapter.0189351395619B62.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 1: Prospecting, the copper workshop and empirical research turn survival into organized mining. Complete Copper Mining Camp Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.0189351395619B62.title: "Tier 1 - Copper Tier"
	chapter.02E137BC8B9A8A80.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 11: Vacuum titanium, high pressure and large processing lines relieve repetitive production and support deep extraction. Complete Vacuum Aerospace Works Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.02E137BC8B9A8A80.title: "Tier 11 - High Pressure Aerospace"
	chapter.0303D34F18B86030.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 15: Fusion, quantum control, earned GT precision, matter replication and spatial transport scale established industry. Complete Quantum Systems Mastered to finish this age."]
	chapter.0303D34F18B86030.title: "Tier 15 - Quantum and Reality Engineering"
	chapter.034647BE41128B91.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 7: Steel, freight, petroleum and electricity launch an expedition that returns useful cargo to Terra. Complete Launch Complex Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.034647BE41128B91.title: "Tier 7 - First Space"
	chapter.03B240B4945F83DE.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 3: Bronze steam industrializes ore preparation and pumping while the kinetic foundry supplies the machine hall. Complete Bronze Steam Hall Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.03B240B4945F83DE.title: "Tier 3 - Bronze Steam"
	chapter.04347F546E30FF44.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 13: Fuel preparation, coolant, output, instruments, controlled waste and recovery establish nuclear civilization. Complete Nuclear Complex Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.04347F546E30FF44.title: "Tier 13 - Nuclear Civilization"
	chapter.0438176E6ABCF370.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 12: Repeatable remote cargo, flight control and planetary extraction establish permanent deep-space supply. Complete Deep-Space Freight Yard Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.0438176E6ABCF370.title: "Tier 12 - Cosmonautics and Deep Space"
	chapter.0605D9FDE89DB248.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 0: Fire, ceramics and charcoal establish a survivable TFC settlement and first copper. Complete Stone Settlement Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.0605D9FDE89DB248.title: "Tier 0 - Stone Tier"
	chapter.065C522F18E2DC46.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 6: Generation, metering, protected conductors, the EE converter and recoverable loads establish electric service. Complete Low-Voltage Grid Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.065C522F18E2DC46.title: "Tier 6 - Low Voltage"
	chapter.076D000000000001.chapter_subtitle: [
		"&#B84A3FMIL&r — Civilian industry creates military capability, from field doctrine to exotic defense."
		"&#F8FAFBOptional&r — This completionist branch never becomes an ordinary Infinity dependency."
	]
	chapter.076D000000000001.title: "Military Science — Optional"
	chapter.077A000000000001.chapter_subtitle: [
		"&#90D8FFT7–T15&r — Rockets discover the Solar System; archaeology discovers the network."
		"&#F8FAFBRoute&r — Moon anomaly → Mars ruins → Venus field theory → Mercury coordinates → Abydos → Milky Way branches → Tollan → Pegasus."
	]
	chapter.077A000000000001.title: "Off-World Stargate Archaeology"
	chapter.078B000000000001.chapter_subtitle: [
		"&#48BFE3Aqua Mire&r — Lantea is a permanent hostile-ocean industrial frontier, not a boss excursion."
		"&#F8FAFBRoute&r — survey → pressure hull → submarine → logistics → extraction → permanent base → naval defense."
	]
	chapter.078B000000000001.title: "Aqua Mire — Lantea"
	chapter.08386D304607DDD9.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 9: The refinery feeds controlled chemistry, polymers, electronics and programmable supervision. Complete Chemical Laboratory Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.08386D304607DDD9.title: "Tier 9 - Chemical and Arcane Chemistry"
	chapter.094D8004B4BC61C6.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 5: Durable steel machinery and serviced freight terminals turn small hauling into repeatable bulk transport. Complete Steel and Railway Works Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.094D8004B4BC61C6.title: "Tier 5 - Steel Steam"
	chapter.09EAEA8CE2694C0A.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 4: Coke, refractory, petroleum, rubber and lubrication become permanent industrial feedstocks. Complete Heavy Industry District Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.09EAEA8CE2694C0A.title: "Tier 4 - Heavy Industry"
	chapter.0A4400DB026A65B8.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 14: Existing nuclear and chemical institutions reach extreme purity, neutron production and Starlight feedstocks. Complete Neutron and Starlight Works Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.0A4400DB026A65B8.title: "Tier 14 - Extreme Industry and Eternal Starlight"
	chapter.0AB49A5259787D47.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 2: Water power and Create/Greate forming establish the kinetic foundry; rail preparation supports this district. Complete Kinetic Foundry Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.0AB49A5259787D47.title: "Tier 2 - Alloy Foundry"
	chapter.0B17CFFFB67577AB.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 10: AE2 requests production and coordinates local machinery while rail and expeditions still move geographical bulk. Complete Digital Factory Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.0B17CFFFB67577AB.title: "Tier 10 - Stainless and Digital"
	chapter.0D87E40C49866C23.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 8: Returned space feedstocks become aluminum, advanced motors and a stronger Greate mechanical floor. Complete Advanced Electric Floor Proven to finish this age."]
	chapter.0D87E40C49866C23.title: "Tier 8 - Advanced Electric"
	chapter.0E552FF8F4187510.chapter_subtitle: ["&#FFD76ASHIFT&r — Read the ledger, learn the rules, and survive the first shift."]
	chapter.0E552FF8F4187510.title: "First Shift"
	chapter.0FDE3813B04FF993.chapter_subtitle: ["Age 16: Infinity material, stellar power, matter engineering, deliberate esoteric convergence and restart capacity complete the civilization. Complete Infinity Systems Mastered to finish this age."]
	chapter.0FDE3813B04FF993.title: "Tier 16 - Infinity and Final Ascension"
	chapter_group.0A85000000000001.title: "Survival"
	chapter_group.0A85000000000002.title: "Factory"
	chapter_group.0A85000000000003.title: "Grid"
	chapter_group.0A85000000000004.title: "Space"
	chapter_group.0A85000000000005.title: "Nuclear"
	chapter_group.0A85000000000006.title: "Endgame"
	chapter_group.0A85000000000007.title: "Optional"
	quest.000B35B0A1537BD6.quest_desc: [
		"Craft sixteen Mekanism advanced pressurized tubes."
		"Upgrade and label complete runs, keep incompatible chemicals separate, and preserve basic tubing for lower-pressure repairs."
	]
	quest.000B35B0A1537BD6.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen advanced tubes turn higher pressure into a routed system rather than a fragile single connection."
	quest.000B35B0A1537BD6.title: "Pressure Tubes"
	quest.0013CE219649AEA7.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the first RCS thrusters through Rocketnautics to prove their native component route."
		"After that proof, the MI Assembler can produce eight-unit service batches at higher power for fleet work."
	]
	quest.0013CE219649AEA7.quest_subtitle: "Four RCS thrusters make attitude control a balanced spacecraft system instead of a single impulse."
	quest.0013CE219649AEA7.title: "RCS Thrusters"
	quest.0021097E5B619BC4.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Milky Way Stargate."
		"The live route upgrades a complete Classic Stargate with variant crystals and Quantum circuits, so keep the earlier gate line intact."
	]
	quest.0021097E5B619BC4.quest_subtitle: "A fixed gate changes travel only after its address, power, and return route are all dependable."
	quest.0021097E5B619BC4.title: "Fixed Stargate Infrastructure"
	quest.00296840EB519311.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Create Crafts & Additions modular accumulator."
		"Charge it from an established source and test that it can start controls without the main grid."
	]
	quest.00296840EB519311.quest_subtitle: "A modular accumulator becomes a black-start bank only after the alternator and motor route can both be recovered."
	quest.00296840EB519311.title: "Accumulator Black-Start Bank"
	quest.002E706C40AD67E3.quest_desc: [
		"Craft eight Electro Energetics wire connectors from the live recipe."
		"Place connection points where they remain reachable, and avoid hiding the only isolation point behind a machine bank."
	]
	quest.002E706C40AD67E3.quest_subtitle: "Eight connectors turn stored wire into branches that can be inspected, extended, and isolated."
	quest.002E706C40AD67E3.title: "Terminate the Insulated Copper Run"
	quest.00389CA73AEDBAB2.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s raw-stone advancement while opening a proper underground working."
		"Support the route as it grows and keep a second way out before chasing the vein farther."
	]
	quest.00389CA73AEDBAB2.quest_subtitle: "Raw stone underground confirms the mine has passed from surface clues into real geology."
	quest.00389CA73AEDBAB2.title: "Expose Raw Stone Underground"
	quest.00552EFA819E0454.quest_desc: [
		"Build the copper anvil after the welding campaign is complete."
		"The TFC recipe consumes seven copper double ingots. Keep the charcoal forge hot, weld every pair with flux, then craft and place the finished anvil."
	]
	quest.00552EFA819E0454.quest_subtitle: "The first permanent metalworking station is the result of the welding chain, not its starting point."
	quest.00552EFA819E0454.title: "Build the Copper Anvil"
	quest.0068663671040869.quest_desc: [
		"Find and hold four legitimate cassiterite indicators."
		"Small cassiterite or mined poor, normal, and rich tin ore all count; follow their host rock and concentration before committing to a shaft."
	]
	quest.0068663671040869.quest_subtitle: "Cassiterite on the surface is the first sign that bronze may be possible nearby."
	quest.0068663671040869.title: "Tin Trail"
	quest.00C86AC92A2A0FA8.quest_desc: [
		"Produce a service batch in powered expandable machines; the Bio Generator remains unobtainable."
		"Age 9 biosteel combines raw biopolymer with ordinary MI steel. Stainless reinforcement belongs to the Age 10 digital biology upgrades."
	]
	quest.00C86AC92A2A0FA8.quest_subtitle: "Oritech cells make biofuel, biopolymer, and an Age 9 steel-biopolymer composite."
	quest.00C86AC92A2A0FA8.title: "Industrial Biology — Oritech Cell"
	quest.00E84A6CCFFC95F4.quest_desc: ["Deliver 250,000 FE through an FTB Quests Task Screen connected to the LV service. This task consumes delivered energy; it does not measure energy stored in a battery.","Supply the EE/FE boundary converter, meter and protect its circuit, then power a real factory load. Inspect generation, distribution and restart behavior separately from the delivery counter."]
	quest.00E84A6CCFFC95F4.quest_subtitle: "A quarter-million FE of working capacity gives start-up surges somewhere safer to land."
	quest.00E84A6CCFFC95F4.title: "Supply the LV Commissioning Cell"
	quest.00F99FF4ADD7B10D.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and hold at least seven flux before attempting the first copper welds."
		"Each copper double-ingot weld consumes flux. A campfire is not hot enough for copper welding; use a properly formed charcoal forge."
	]
	quest.00F99FF4ADD7B10D.quest_subtitle: "Dry flux is the quiet supply that makes hot welds hold together."
	quest.00F99FF4ADD7B10D.title: "Flux and Stone Logistics"
	quest.01013F6B2E344E41.quest_desc: [
		"Store eight Electro Energetics wire connectors and four Mekanism basic control circuits."
		"Keep them outside automatic machine crafting so a disconnected or failed chemical line can be rebuilt first."
	]
	quest.01013F6B2E344E41.quest_subtitle: "Eight connectors and four control circuits cover the ordinary failures between power and process."
	quest.01013F6B2E344E41.title: "Stock MV Control Repairs"
	quest.011962E2E7DA903D.quest_desc: ["Return to Terra with a Starcore and the recorded Starlight visit after the Superconductor material proof.","This is the Quantum research-cargo follow-up. Native first entry and the earlier Starlight industry do not require Seeking Eyes."]
	quest.011962E2E7DA903D.quest_subtitle: "Extreme industry and spirit research reveal a world that still demands native exploration."
	quest.011962E2E7DA903D.title: "Return Starlight Research Cargo"
	quest.012AB42FD633A80C.quest_desc: [
		"Combine advanced Enchanted work, both neutral cure paths, processed EvilCraft blood, quantum control, and a high-intensity Malum experiment."
		"The result requires every biological branch as well as the continuing research path."
	]
	quest.012AB42FD633A80C.quest_subtitle: "No single supernatural discipline can perfect biological continuity."
	quest.012AB42FD633A80C.title: "Age 15 — Perfected Living Research"
	quest.01340720D08D67A4.quest_desc: ["Complete the Enchanted Infinity Egg to prove the biological, arcane, industrial, and Infinity branches can converge in one reproducible artifact."]
	quest.01340720D08D67A4.quest_subtitle: "Required discipline mastery — contributes to the canonical age proof."
	quest.01340720D08D67A4.title: "Infinity Convergence Proven"
	quest.016857EA9D59D58A.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a Electro Energetics multimeter and thirty-two wires in the yard locker."
		"Test the meter on a known source and protect it from the same event that damages the main circuit."
	]
	quest.016857EA9D59D58A.quest_subtitle: "A multimeter and thirty-two wires make a repair reserve useful before anything is re-energized."
	quest.016857EA9D59D58A.title: "Stage Instruments and Wire"
	quest.0168C5BEAA769289.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four MI iridium plates after completing the platinum-group separation route."
		"Do not treat tiny-dust traces as finished stock; pack, blast, and form the metal through its installed stages."
	]
	quest.0168C5BEAA769289.quest_subtitle: "Four iridium plates turn separated PGM material into radiation-resistant navigation and control hardware."
	quest.0168C5BEAA769289.title: "Roll Iridium Navigation Plates"
	quest.016E1CFEFF48A3BA.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen titanium plates and four titanium large plates."
		"Keep the large plates in structural reserve and prevent automation from consuming them for small parts."
	]
	quest.016E1CFEFF48A3BA.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen plates and four large plates cover routine fabrication and the repairs ordinary sheet cannot span."
	quest.016E1CFEFF48A3BA.title: "Reserve Titanium Plates and Large Plates"
	quest.01863ECA388BDEB2.quest_desc: [
		"This freezer completes High Pressure titanium one hot ingot at a time without Cryofluid."
		"The eight-ingot Cryofluid recipe is a Quantum-era retrofit, not an Age 11 requirement."
	]
	quest.01863ECA388BDEB2.quest_subtitle: "The first vacuum freezer must exist before titanium plate can be asked to build anything else."
	quest.01863ECA388BDEB2.title: "Vacuum Freezer"
	quest.018AA9ACA248F094.quest_desc: [
		"Complete the original concentrate, purification, and electrolysis chain, then prepare one mixed-iridium feed in the Chemical Reactor and separate it in the Centrifuge."
		"Mature PGM runs retain a purified solution charge, scale the same proven feed, recover more trace iridium, and trade higher power for throughput rather than skipping the first platinum plate."
	]
	quest.018AA9ACA248F094.quest_subtitle: "Mixed platinum concentrate and a trace of iridium make harsh-world cargo useful to later sensors."
	quest.018AA9ACA248F094.title: "Recover Platinum and Trace Iridium"
	quest.01A9755D89820163.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Re:Avaritia neutron compressor and feed it from a renewable collector line."
		"Keep input accumulation visible and do not mistake one completed item for sustainable throughput."
	]
	quest.01A9755D89820163.quest_subtitle: "The compressor makes tiny neutron output useful only by concentrating it at a deliberately enormous scale."
	quest.01A9755D89820163.title: "Neutron Compressor"
	quest.01C61E8FF1EFF2B4.quest_desc: [
		"Build eight AE2 blank patterns."
		"Encode only stable recipes with reliable physical inputs and observable outputs."
	]
	quest.01C61E8FF1EFF2B4.quest_subtitle: "Eight blank patterns let the factory automate chosen work instead of handing Create cogwheels to an unrelated branch."
	quest.01C61E8FF1EFF2B4.title: "Encode a Pattern Batch"
	quest.01D2A9E6DC4A3410.quest_desc: [
		"Build bronze tank."
		"Press bronze plates and copper rings, then craft the tank around glass. Fill and buffer it before connecting a boiler."
	]
	quest.01D2A9E6DC4A3410.quest_subtitle: "A tank between the water source and boiler turns supply into a visible buffer."
	quest.01D2A9E6DC4A3410.title: "Store Water Before Making Steam"
	quest.01F1A14D9C4379BA.quest_desc: ["Retain a sulfuric-acid bucket from the working refinery chain; it confirms coke, crude separation, rubber, and acid processing now support one another."]
	quest.01F1A14D9C4379BA.quest_subtitle: "Discipline mastery — supporting branch; follow the chapter age proof for the main transition."
	quest.01F1A14D9C4379BA.title: "Petroleum Industry Mastered"
	quest.01FDBF9D1AE9A4C1.quest_desc: [
		"Assemble the MI advanced pump at 64 EU using 250 mB of lubricant."
		"Its live route needs fluid pipes, aluminum rotors and bolts, an advanced motor, and returned tharsite."
	]
	quest.01FDBF9D1AE9A4C1.quest_subtitle: "The advanced pump gives pressure chemistry a replaceable heart before gases enter the plant."
	quest.01FDBF9D1AE9A4C1.title: "Advanced Pump"
	quest.022B09856C4D4BFD.quest_desc: [
		"Build eight Electro Energetics wire connectors."
		"Mount them where conductor paths remain visible and keep voltage tier, grounding, and isolation consistent."
	]
	quest.022B09856C4D4BFD.quest_subtitle: "Eight connectors are enough to build a source, a protected branch, and a real load without loose ends."
	quest.022B09856C4D4BFD.title: "Wire and Connectors"
	quest.023A7897291258E3.quest_desc: ["Combine the existing districts into controlled fusion, precision manufacturing and distributed control.","Build the standard Superconductor Dust route first, then form its ingot, wire, cable, and coil lifecycle.","The metered MI Assembler feed proves Iridium, Platinum, Corronium, Solerium, Lithium, Starcore, Aethersent, Deepsilver, Deuterium, and Tritium.","The Tungsten-Steel Greate Press finishes the fusion reactor. Supply it from the superconductor, isotope, coolant and quantum-circuit lines, then expand the earned GT precision campus and its research facilities. After controlled fusion, build the RPP forming floor from the PGM refinery, Alchemistry rhodium cell and cleanroom LuV circuit campus. Its press finishes Quantum Links and the first Classic Stargate; the earlier tungsten-steel floor makes its first stock. Return Tollan trinium to the PGM/hot-metal district, upgrade to the Naquadah/ZPM forming floor and use it for the particle accelerator. Reuse lunar monazite and tin in the fusion cell for Darmstadtium, then extend the same crystal-circuit campus into UV mainframes. Its forming floor turns existing Dyson packages into beams and sails; PBI chemistry supplies its belts.","Use the existing quantum-circuit, superconductor and spatial-component batches as sustained demand grows. Keep prototype routes and independent restart power; a larger batch line is useful only when its complete supplier network can sustain it.","Return raw Corronium from Venus and finish it with Titanium Dust in an MI Blast Furnace at128EU/t. Bring graded spodumene from Mars; macerate it with a reusable Processing Unit to make crushed raw lithium. One normal ore supplies two crushed pieces.","After Industrial Mineral Extraction research (GEO-03), finish each crushed lithium piece in an MI macerator at2EU/t for200ticks to obtain one full Lithium Dust. Feed that dust, the returned Corronium and your Starlight materials into the standard Superconductor Dust line, then preserve the hot-ingot, cryogenic, wire and cable services."]
	quest.023A7897291258E3.quest_subtitle: "Quantum begins when superconductor production is a maintainable component line rather than one cold sample."
	quest.023A7897291258E3.title: "Superconductors and Fusion"
	quest.023F6BB2D31155A8.quest_desc: ["Turn the steel, petroleum and electrical districts into an expedition that brings useful cargo home.","Place and inspect the Stellaris rocket launch pad at the chosen launch site.","Keep its approach clear, separate ignition from fuel storage, and leave room for the station, cable, cargo, and an emergency exit.","Process returned raw desh and tharsite in the 32 EU/t cupronickel-coil blast furnace: each retained coke-assisted ingot batch takes 1,000 ticks. Build its full heatproof-casing body, two coil rings, item input/output hatches and LV energy input.","Finish the rocket on the Steel Greate Press, supply fuel, oxygen, power and cargo handling, and keep a return reserve on both ends of the route.","First access becomes valuable when it supplies later industry: desh and subsequent planetary tharsite feed aluminum reduction. Retain the terrestrial steel line and conventional return craft while remote supply is still fragile."]
	quest.023F6BB2D31155A8.quest_subtitle: "The launch pad fixes the point where every supply line must meet and every mistake must remain survivable."
	quest.023F6BB2D31155A8.title: "Launch Pad"
	quest.024A0D5BF6732528.quest_desc: [
		"Build a TFC Astikor Carts oak hand cart."
		"Test it with a real load between storage and a field site, then improve the roughest part of the path."
	]
	quest.024A0D5BF6732528.quest_subtitle: "A hand cart turns a footpath into a cargo route as long as the ground and return trip remain passable."
	quest.024A0D5BF6732528.title: "Hand Cart Route"
	quest.024F0B82259320A0.quest_desc: ["Produce and stock thirty-two TFMG coal coke in the TFMG process-gas coking ovens.","After CHE-01, use one TFMG Coke Oven with an open gravity chute above it. Drop one mined TFC bituminous coal onto the chute, then collect the finished coke from the oven front before feeding the next coal.","Vent CO2 continuously from a side outlet through MI pipes into a TFMG Exhaust; the top fluid port is unused. Each coal releases 36 L of CO2 during processing. For first-steel startup, process 35 coal: reserve 32 coke and crush the other three into fresh coke dust."]
	quest.024F0B82259320A0.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two coal coke is enough to feed heavy heat without mistaking one batch for a supply."
	quest.024F0B82259320A0.title: "Coke Reserve"
	quest.026641345CA85069.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight machine-grade bronze ingots."
		"Ordinary TFC Nether portals are disabled. Beneath is the intended route: hold a Scythe and kill a TFC Pig, Goat, or Sheep within five blocks of seven valid offerings."
		"Valid offerings include skulls, anvils, placed gold blocks, Pig Iron or Black Steel ingots, and gold- or Black Steel-plated blocks; the TFC Field Guide → Beneath has the live list."
		"Enter the portal, find a Blaze, and capture it with an Empty Blaze Burner. Bring it to the CBC foundry, fuel it, and compact 90 mB of molten bronze while heated."
	]
	quest.026641345CA85069.quest_subtitle: "Eight certified bronze ingots separate a production batch from primitive alloying."
	quest.026641345CA85069.title: "Cast Machine-Grade Bronze"
	quest.0278C12679F56049.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four Re:Avaritia neutron ingots from the operating collector and compressor chain."
		"Measure how quickly the pile refills before committing neutronium to Quantum projects."
	]
	quest.0278C12679F56049.quest_subtitle: "Four neutron ingots prove collection, compression, and bulk logistics can repeat beyond a single showcase craft."
	quest.0278C12679F56049.title: "Repeatable Extreme Industry"
	quest.0282549C54557CBB.quest_desc: ["Complete a batch of eight precision mechanisms.","Buffer every deployer input and return incomplete mechanisms to the sequence instead of discarding them.","After Automated Manipulation research, an andesite mechanical saw cuts one cold TFC wrought-iron ingot into nine ordinary iron nuggets. Use an upward-facing saw as the sole load on its own 8 RPM, 8 SU water-wheel drive, and collect each output before feeding another ingot. For the tube, millstone feed and one precision attempt, cut five new wrought ingots into 45 nuggets. Craft 36 into four ordinary iron ingots and press three of those into sheets. Two sheets plus the remaining ingot make four chutes: keep one for the millstone and three spare. The third sheet supplies the electron tube; reserve five nuggets for the attempt and leave four spare. This starts with earned TFC wrought metallurgy and avoids the precision-controlled macerator. The later steam-dust route remains available.","Sandpaper now uses one paper and one sand from the Minecraft sand tag, including TFC sand. Make rose quartz with one quartz and eight redstone, then hold it in the other hand while using fresh sandpaper until polishing finishes. The existing quartzite-milling recipe has a 5% quartz chance per run; keep milling until quartz is actually collected. Its millstone needs a separate 8 SU source from the fully loaded saw. The precision sequence still requires its gold sheet and all other supplies: five small cogs, five large cogs and five iron nuggets over 15 deployments. Its nominal precision share is four in five; a failed completed attempt spends all those inputs. Collect eight actual finished mechanisms for this objective; eight attempts do not guarantee eight results.","The first gold sheet can use a separate TFC charcoal forge before the rail workshop. Build the earlier stone furnace from eight raw rocks. Smelt 24 new TFC oak logs with 17 new TFC oak planks, made from 68 lumber, to collect 24 charcoal. Use eight charcoal for the forge pile and ten for heating; keep six spare. Add five new raw-granite insulation blocks at the sides and below. For the rain roof, chisel five loose granite into five stone bricks. In the earlier barrel, make limewater from one flux and 500 mB water; seal one TFC sand with 100 mB limewater for longer than 7200 calendar ticks to obtain 16 mortar. Four mortar and the five stone bricks craft four granite-brick blocks. Place a temporary brick scaffold at Y1 above the full charcoal pile, place the roof at Y2, then recover the scaffold before ignition. Keep Y1 above the forge empty and the adjacent west sky column open; three brick blocks remain spare. These are new inputs, separate from later rail and oil reserves.","Mine 16 additional normal native-gold ores and use the guaranteed hammer, sluice, quern and second sluice route to collect 80 clean gold powders. Fund a new stone hammer with one loose granite and a twig, and a new handstone with three raw granite and a second twig; this gold batch spends 16 hammer uses and 80 handstone uses. Knap four fresh ingot molds from ten clay and fire them in one kiln load with eight additional logs and eight straw. Let the molds cool before handling. With the covered forge and its ten counted fuel charcoal, melt five one-item powders at a time into the four output molds. Stop fueling after the counted batch and leave all molds in the forge until cold before pickup. No hot vessel transfer or bellows is needed for this gold route. All four molds may break after delivering four ingots. Press one ingot for the original attempt and reserve the other three for the wrench below. Additional attempts need new gold, cogs and nuggets.","The wrench can use the three cold gold ingots left by the new primitive batch: press them into three sheets. After Automated Manipulation research, the wrench recipe accepts a tier-0 Greate small cog. Make one extra cog with one of the two new shaft spares, one additional andesite alloy and one plank from four additional lumber, then add one wooden rod for the wrench. One shaft spare remains and no gold ingot remains. The combined first-attempt and wrench bill is 60 alloy and 228 lumber. Keep the five small cogs, five large cogs and five nuggets reserved for the attempt; do not take this wrench from later workshop reserves.","Build the forming drive with every shaft and cog on axis X. Relative positions: water wheel (-8,-3,-3); small cogs (-6,-3,-3), (-4,-2,-2), (-2,-1,-1); large cogs (-6,-2,-2), (-4,-1,-1), (-2,0,0); five shafts (-7,-3,-3), (-5,-2,-2), (-3,-1,-1), (-1,0,0), (1,0,0). Put the earlier andesite press at (0,0,0) and the downward USE deployer at (2,0,0), with its horizontal shaft axis X. Place depots two blocks below the press and deployer. The press and deployer work before the oil spout exists; leave (4,0,0)/(4,-2,0) empty. When oil handling is ready, translate this layout to the spout/depot while preserving its tank and pipes. Three small-to-large reductions give 1 RPM: press plus deployer use 5 SU of the 8 SU drive. Later replace the empty andesite press with the steel press at the same position for 6 SU total. Normal wrench clicks on the body rotate the deployer or its shaft axis; the protruding hand can toggle mode, so verify USE after adjustments. Sneaking can dismantle blocks. Keep work cells clear and preserve the same workpiece’s sequence marker when moving it between depots.","For the minimum eight-success branch, keep the first funded attempt and add supplies for seven more: 131 andesite alloy, 13 foundry lids, 600 lumber and four cold TFC wrought-iron ingots. Make 13 batches of eight shafts, 105 small cogs and 35 large cogs. Each large cog consumes two small ones: 70 small cogs become the 35 large ones, leaving 35 small cogs for deployment. Cut the four wrought ingots into 36 nuggets; with the four old spares, 35 are spent and five remain. The seven earlier spare shafts plus 104 new ones leave six after crafting. Use 560 lumber for cog planks and reserve 40 lumber for ten furnace-fuel planks. Keep the installed drive cogs and prepared steel-press parts separate.","Reuse the cleared cold primitive forge and its roof. Process 32 new normal gold ores into 160 clean powders; the retained gold hammer and handstone spend 32 and 160 uses, leaving 12 and 10. Make eight fresh molds from 20 clay and fire two four-mold kiln loads with 16 logs and 16 straw; all molds may break. After the old furnace fuel expires, smelt 14 more logs with the ten new planks. Combine the 14 charcoal with the six saved spares. Repeat the earlier four-gold cold-forge schedule twice, each with ten charcoal, a successful strong ignition and the full cooling wait. Eight new cold ingots fund seven sheets and leave one ingot. Hold eight finished precision mechanisms together for this non-consuming objective before spending one on the steel press; seven then remain. A branch allowing one failed attempt instead needs 150 alloy, 15 lids and 680 lumber for eight further attempts; its gold, pottery, fuel and four-wrought bill is unchanged. These alternate bills never guarantee success: replenish missing inputs after further failures."]
	quest.0282549C54557CBB.quest_subtitle: "Eight precision mechanisms show the sequence can carry a batch without hand rescue."
	quest.0282549C54557CBB.title: "Batch Precision Mechanisms"
	quest.02A78138FF4577A2.quest_desc: [
		"Separate aromatic refinery products, make the required reagents, and cure epoxy resin into sheets."
		"The sheets become chemical-resistant liners rather than a decorative duplicate polymer."
	]
	quest.02A78138FF4577A2.quest_subtitle: "Eight cured epoxy sheets prove that organic chemistry has become construction material."
	quest.02A78138FF4577A2.title: "Epoxy Materials"
	quest.02D49BE93C02161E.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the placed vacuum freezer and stage two Mekanism advanced chemical tanks."
		"Separate hot material handling from pressure lines and leave service access around every valve, cable, and output."
		"Underwater pressure, compressed process gas, and vacuum fail differently; their shared discipline is rated hardware, isolation, measurement, and recovery—not interchangeable mechanics."
	]
	quest.02D49BE93C02161E.quest_subtitle: "Visible boundaries between vacuum, pressure, hot input, cold output, storage, and emergency drain space make the plant serviceable."
	quest.02D49BE93C02161E.title: "Lay Out Vacuum and Pressure Service"
	quest.02E5283B1C03046C.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a TFMG oil can with eight rubber sheets."
		"Use the can for controlled samples, not as permanent refinery storage; return identified fluids to labeled tanks."
	]
	quest.02E5283B1C03046C.quest_subtitle: "An oil can and eight rubber sheets make field sampling and seal replacement one portable kit."
	quest.02E5283B1C03046C.title: "Oil Can Locker"
	quest.02FA22723578F334.quest_desc: ["Inspect the chemical washer, pressurized reaction chamber, and electrolytic separator in their operating lines.","Label every gas and fluid route and ensure one blocked output cannot silently stop fuel or coolant preparation.","Mechanical commissioning: finish the pressure-reaction chamber on an Aluminum Greate Press or higher. This is a production duty for the Advanced Electric floor you have already established."]
	quest.02FA22723578F334.quest_subtitle: "Washer, reaction chamber, and separator make fuel and coolant chemistry a district with several failure boundaries."
	quest.02FA22723578F334.title: "Commission the National Chemical Complex"
	quest.0319133589379A6C.quest_desc: [
		"Build a hand crank and a section of the pack’s copper fluid pipe."
		"Use the crank only for setup and recovery; sustained processing belongs on a properly sized water-power line."
	]
	quest.0319133589379A6C.quest_subtitle: "A hand crank keeps testing possible when water power or transmission is unavailable."
	quest.0319133589379A6C.title: "Prepare a Manual Restart"
	quest.0319E7AB634015F4.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the electric macerator during work and stock sixteen bronze plates."
		"Feed enough material to expose input starvation, output blocking, or voltage instability."
	]
	quest.0319E7AB634015F4.quest_subtitle: "An observed electric macerator and sixteen plates prove the line can process and maintain itself through a real shift."
	quest.0319E7AB634015F4.title: "Run a Sustained Macerator Batch"
	quest.0321E6A3F539CA7E.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Applied Flux Flux Accessor."
		"Connect it to protected storage and verify direction, rate, and behavior when either network loses power."
	]
	quest.0321E6A3F539CA7E.quest_subtitle: "A Flux Accessor exposes external energy to the network while preserving where that power actually comes from."
	quest.0321E6A3F539CA7E.title: "Flux Access Terminal"
	quest.032D2E661C629440.quest_desc: ["Complete a civilization that can sustain its final projects and recover from their shutdown.","Create an Eternal Singularity through Re:Avaritia’s installed singularity recipe type.","Audit every contributing singularity line before convergence so a missing input is found at its source.","Bring the established singularity, stellar-power, matter-engineering and reality-infrastructure branches together. ESO-04 and FRN-06 are deliberate final convergence; maintain the industries that supply those branches.","Trace each final ingredient to a running production line and keep replacement controllers, transport and restart energy accessible. The ending is a working, recoverable industrial system, with optional military, aviation, apiary and exploration mastery still available."]
	quest.032D2E661C629440.quest_subtitle: "The Eternal Singularity is not a shortcut; it is a census of material systems the factory already controls."
	quest.032D2E661C629440.title: "Eternal Singularity"
	quest.0331F135BE053E50.quest_desc: [
		"Store sixteen basic pressurized tubes and eight HDPE sheets."
		"Keep repair stock outside automatic expansion recipes and beside compatible empty tanks."
	]
	quest.0331F135BE053E50.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen tubes and eight sheets cover ordinary leaks, reroutes, and damaged polymer fittings."
	quest.0331F135BE053E50.title: "Stock Containment Repairs"
	quest.033679DB57674DF5.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four Mekanism Elite Control Circuits once platinum, iridium, atomic alloy, and chemical osmium are established."
		"Use them for Cosmonautics rocket, booster, and vector-thruster control, then carry the same component standard into later reactor logic."
	]
	quest.033679DB57674DF5.quest_subtitle: "Elite control is introduced at the aerospace handoff, before the first Rocketnautics thruster recipe that consumes it."
	quest.033679DB57674DF5.title: "Elite Control Circuit"
	quest.0339B09DF8C41256.quest_desc: [
		"Place the MI electric water pump and connect it to a useful fluid route."
		"Give its output a buffer and confirm the turbine can carry the pump together with the rest of the LV load."
	]
	quest.0339B09DF8C41256.quest_subtitle: "An electric pump gives water service its own powered, controllable place on the grid."
	quest.0339B09DF8C41256.title: "Electric Water Pump"
	quest.033A52EBB5BF4556.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four control crystals and sixteen superconductor wires."
		"Keep the components outside routine autocrafting and document which gate each repair set serves."
	]
	quest.033A52EBB5BF4556.quest_subtitle: "Control crystals and winding wire make a gate repair possible without storing sixteen finished portals."
	quest.033A52EBB5BF4556.title: "Control Crystal Reserve"
	quest.033EAFA0AE07DA62.quest_desc: [
		"Cut reinforced glass for labware and qualify a platinum electrode for the chemical vat."
		"Electrolysis begins with brine and air separation, while dangerous products remain in industrial tanks and pipes."
	]
	quest.033EAFA0AE07DA62.quest_subtitle: "A platinum electrode turns the refinery branch into a controlled laboratory."
	quest.033EAFA0AE07DA62.title: "Laboratory Electrolysis"
	quest.0346506881CE520F.quest_desc: [
		"Place and operate the steel macerator while the quest observes it."
		"Feed a real ore batch, provide product storage, and confirm the steam supply does not sag through the cycle."
	]
	quest.0346506881CE520F.quest_subtitle: "The steel macerator moves routine ore work onto machines built from the new authority material."
	quest.0346506881CE520F.title: "Steel Processing Machines"
	quest.034CEC92A93F2DFA.quest_desc: [
		"Electrolyze brine, combine the resulting chlorine with hydrogen, and contain hydrochloric acid."
		"This is applied wet chemistry: trace every inlet, isolate the acid line, and keep primitive vessels out of service."
	]
	quest.034CEC92A93F2DFA.quest_subtitle: "Chlor-alkali chemistry makes chlorine useful only after it is safely contained."
	quest.034CEC92A93F2DFA.title: "Practical Acids"
	quest.0368DC2703C1B435.quest_desc: ["The redstone battery uses five ordinary lead plates, two tin cables and two redstone after ELE-02. This terrestrial cell supplies first-space equipment before Venus antimony; later battery alloys still require the planetary supply."]
	quest.0368DC2703C1B435.quest_subtitle: "A visible pad and six cables make power, control, fuel, and flight lanes part of the site plan."
	quest.0368DC2703C1B435.title: "Lay Out the Launch Complex"
	quest.037824F4D286C61E.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 8 opens, assemble and inspect the first portable industrial engine."
		"Its live recipe consumes a commissioned Railcraft loader, proving that practical freight aviation follows a working railway terminal."
	]
	quest.037824F4D286C61E.quest_subtitle: "Industrial propulsion turns the experimental frame into useful freight hardware without granting autonomous flight."
	quest.037824F4D286C61E.title: "Industrial Propulsion"
	quest.039F6290CE6208F8.quest_desc: [
		"Keep three launch-pad blocks and eight raw desh ingots available."
		"Macerate Moon desh ore after return; do not describe the removed vanilla smelting route or count reward items as cargo."
	]
	quest.039F6290CE6208F8.quest_subtitle: "Pad sections at home and raw desh from the Moon prove both ends of the route are supplied."
	quest.039F6290CE6208F8.title: "Stage Pad and Returned Concentrate"
	quest.03AF7E430EC377B5.quest_desc: ["Recover or produce four Eternal Starlight aethersent ingots through the live tier route.","Preserve the first legitimate sample for seeded scaling and keep exotic storage separate.","Wait for a natural meteor shower in Starlight and safely recover raw Aethersent from a large fallen meteor. Meteor drops are enabled even though this pack disables their replacement of terrain blocks; no fixed waiting time guarantees a fall.","Smelt raw Aethersent in a furnace with fuel: one raw piece makes one ingot. Bring back at least four ingots for this objective and replenish the separate Starcore, Deepsilver and isotope supplies for superconductors."]
	quest.03AF7E430EC377B5.quest_subtitle: "Four aethersent ingots turn an expedition return into a material line that can be studied and repeated."
	quest.03AF7E430EC377B5.title: "Extract Aethersent from Starlight"
	quest.03C02147C62E2D84.quest_desc: [
		"Forge and hold a copper shield as a concrete safety upgrade."
		"Safe routes and real equipment matter more than activity counters."
	]
	quest.03C02147C62E2D84.quest_subtitle: "Rough ground charges interest on every careless jump."
	quest.03C02147C62E2D84.title: "Field Shield"
	quest.03C5DC9FE6C1A093.quest_desc: ["Modern Industrialization remains the main electrical factory. The earned Greg wing supplies final precision manufacturing, while Greate remains the visible mechanical hierarchy.","Enter through the authored IV converter after mature Quantum, fusion, AE2, Electro Energetics, and Stargate infrastructure. The Greate Wire Coating Factory adds parallel cable manufacture: its controller consumes MI Quantum controls, a mature hull, IV pumps, and titanium Greate pumping equipment.","Build the native 5 x 5 x 5 structure with at least 70 watertight casings, 12 tempered-glass blocks, 12 PTFE pipe casings, and the internal depot and spout. Use its native structure preview to position hatches and air spaces. Supply wire and the specified insulation from the existing metal and polymer districts; expand power, freight, and output buffers with throughput."]
	quest.03C5DC9FE6C1A093.quest_subtitle: "MI builds the civilization; the earned Greg wing performs its final precision work."
	quest.03C5DC9FE6C1A093.title: "Earned GregTech Precision Campus"
	quest.03DC1833EB6821E2.quest_desc: ["Make steam a working machine hall, supplied by the kinetic foundry.","Build the bronze machine casing from MI bronze plates around a foundry-brass casing.","This pack uses Create/CBC-certified bronze and brass here; primitive TFC alloys do not satisfy the machine bridge.","MEC-03 lets the tier-0 Greate saw machine one heavy Railcraft invar gear into two MI industrial gears. Use those smaller gears for the heatproof casings needed by the first electric blast furnace.","Bring certified bronze and brass, formed plates, water and fuel to the hall. Route ore preparation and pumping through the steam machines while the foundry continues making mechanical stock.","Scale the proven ore line with the Large Steam Macerator when demand warrants it. Keep water, fuel and a starter stock isolated from export so the hall can restart after a supply interruption."]
	quest.03DC1833EB6821E2.quest_subtitle: "The first bronze casing gives separate components a standard machine frame."
	quest.03DC1833EB6821E2.title: "Bronze Machine Casing"
	quest.03FE97AA919CEA27.quest_desc: [
		"Build an MI plasma turbine and demonstrate fifty million FE of storage."
		"Connect the turbine through protection and keep enough alternate generation to control the plant when plasma flow stops."
	]
	quest.03FE97AA919CEA27.quest_subtitle: "A plasma turbine beside fifty million stored FE proves fusion output can join the grid without becoming its only lifeline."
	quest.03FE97AA919CEA27.title: "Plasma Choir"
	quest.041F4B5AC4F14916.quest_desc: ["Build it, survey a bounded site, buffer output, and retain the spare parts needed for restart."]
	quest.041F4B5AC4F14916.quest_subtitle: "The first conventional electric quarry is a powered, lubricated industrial machine."
	quest.041F4B5AC4F14916.title: "MI Electric Quarry Restored"
	quest.0438A4CA3176B806.quest_desc: [
		"Find and hold four legitimate sphalerite indicators."
		"Small sphalerite or mined poor, normal, and rich zinc ore all count; mark the last compatible host-rock sign before prospecting below."
	]
	quest.0438A4CA3176B806.quest_subtitle: "Sphalerite completes the field survey the foundry will later turn into brass."
	quest.0438A4CA3176B806.title: "Zinc Trail"
	quest.043A38CEB7149E39.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen cured Rubberworks sheets and sixteen raw Rubberworks rubber."
		"Keep the raw and finished authorities labeled and replace stock after maintenance."
	]
	quest.043A38CEB7149E39.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen finished sheets and sixteen raw rubber cover both immediate seal replacement and the next forming batch."
	quest.043A38CEB7149E39.title: "Stock Refinery Seal Material"
	quest.043BFA6ACC76CB69.quest_desc: [
		"Build four CROWNS heat exchangers for the service route."
		"Keep them outside the reactor boundary and verify that replacement does not require crossing a fueled core."
	]
	quest.043BFA6ACC76CB69.quest_subtitle: "Four replacement water heat sinks make cooling maintenance a stocked operation rather than a last-minute craft."
	quest.043BFA6ACC76CB69.title: "Run the Coolant Supply Check"
	quest.044B1D6D6C012D9E.quest_desc: [
		"Complete MI’s digital-circuit advancement through its current clean-processing chain."
		"Retain board, wafer, and wire capacity for another batch after the trigger fires."
	]
	quest.044B1D6D6C012D9E.quest_subtitle: "The digital-circuit advancement confirms semiconductor control has become reproducible factory output."
	quest.044B1D6D6C012D9E.title: "Digital Circuit Crown"
	quest.044ED8C12F7EB2A5.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the Mekanism fission logic adapter and carry a Mekanism dosimeter."
		"Simulate loss of the normal feed under safe conditions, confirm the shutdown state, then verify cooling and monitoring on emergency power."
	]
	quest.044ED8C12F7EB2A5.quest_subtitle: "A logic adapter and dosimeter test whether automatic shutdown remains visible and verifiable when normal power disappears."
	quest.044ED8C12F7EB2A5.title: "Run the Blackout Shutdown Drill"
	quest.047549F249559E07.quest_desc: ["Craft one MI steel machine casing from four MI steel plates, two precision mechanisms, two nickel ingots and one TFMG steel casing.","For the TFMG casing, fill one TFC oak plank with 250 mB creosote in a spout over a depot. Place the hardened plank, apply one TFC steel ingot, then mine the resulting casing with a correct pickaxe. Application produces a placed block; collect it before crafting.","The steel steam packer uses this casing, three bronze gears, three MI fluid pipes and two MI item pipes. Keep the early heavy-copper-gear/brass-sheet item-pipe recipe. Heat a water- and charcoal-fed bronze boiler and precharge 2,000 mB ordinary steam. A bronze compressor turns three more steel plates into three curved plates at 400 mB steam each; the packer uses 200 mB for four ordinary buckets. These jobs consume 1,400 mB and leave 600 mB before other machine use.","Allow eight new steel ingots after the earlier ignition/shaft pair: five for the casing chain and three for bucket plates. For eight further furnace batches, supply 54.4 L hot air and three additional coke dust per batch, carrying the fuel state. Vent CO₂ through an additional real exhaust. A full furnace-gas hatch can lose gas while steel still completes; discarded gas is unavailable for later use.","Before this first casing, make two additional precision mechanisms with the earlier andesite press and deployer. Complete PRE-01 Precision Mechanisms research; crafting does not wait for the eight-item quest. Keep the original attempt, wrench gold, six saved charcoal and later eight-item batch separate. These two early mechanisms are consumed here.","For two successful attempts, add 38 andesite alloy, four foundry lids, 188 lumber and two earned cold TFC wrought-iron ingots. Craft four batches of eight shafts, 30 small cogs and ten large cogs. The large cogs consume 20 small cogs; the sequence spends the remaining ten small cogs, ten large cogs and ten nuggets over 30 deployments. Use 160 lumber for gear planks and 28 for seven furnace-fuel planks. If one of three attempts fails, instead allow 57 alloy, six lids and 268 lumber; the gold and wrought bill is unchanged. More failures need more inputs, and failure scraps are not part of this bill.","For a separate four-gold batch, add 16 normal native-gold ores, ten clay, eight straw and 18 logs: ten for furnace charcoal and eight for one kiln. Start with two loose granite, three raw granite and four twigs for a fresh hammer, handstone and firestarter; knapping consumes one loose stone. The gold spends 16 hammer uses and 80 handstone uses. Reuse the cleared furnace and cold covered forge. Seven fresh planks smelt the ten charcoal; use all ten charcoal for the earlier four-mold gold schedule and wait for cold molds before pickup. Allow two successful strong ignitions; failed ignition attempts cost extra wear. Two gold sheets feed the two attempts. Keep the two remaining gold ingots, eight nuggets and two shafts separate from later reserves. The two wrought ingots still require their earlier bloomery and forging supplies.","Nickel can precede vanilla buckets. Hammer 16 normal garnierite ores from the earlier gabbro deposits, then use the sluice, quern and second sluice to obtain 80 clean powders. Four fresh molds receive four nickel ingots; allocate two to this first casing and keep two separate. Reuse the cold covered primitive gold forge. Put a new bellows at north (0,1,-1), facing SOUTH toward the forge (0,0,0). Keep its west sky vent (-1,1,0), air above and roof clear. Use manual bellows, disconnected from crank networks; this route needs no nickel compressor, steam or oil bucket.","The additional bill is 16 normal garnierite, 29 oak logs, 82 lumber, ten clay, eight straw, three small sheepskin hides, three loose limestone, two twigs and 3,000 mB fresh water. Knap two new sedimentary knives before crushing the last limestone into two flux. Make three new barrels and one wooden bucket from 24 lumber; six more lumber and the three new leathers make the bellows. The remaining 52 lumber make 13 furnace-fuel planks for 19 new charcoal logs. Eight logs fire four new molds in one kiln; one log makes tannin and one remains the scraping surface. Wait for old furnace fuel to expire and collect actual charcoal; saved charcoal and later tools remain reserved.","Fill each new barrel with 1,000 mB water. Convert one to limewater with both flux, another to tannin with its counted oak log, and keep the third for rinsing. Process all three hides separately through the earlier soaking, scraping, rinsing and tanning route. Each sealed run requires more than 7,200 calendar ticks; one tannin run and nine hide runs leave 100 mB in each barrel. Pay 34 knife uses on the first knife and 17 on the second. The earlier precision hammer, handstone and firestarter pay 16 ore hammer uses, one flux use, 80 quern uses and two successful ignitions, retaining 27/90/4 uses. Spend all 19 charcoal on the existing nickel schedule: 1,000 warmup calls, 16 waves of 1,000 calls with five powders each, bellows every 40 calls, then 4,000 cooling calls with pumping stopped. Keep all four molds in output slots until below 300°C; all may break after extraction. The forge ends cold and without air pressure, ready for the later gold batches."]
	quest.047549F249559E07.quest_subtitle: "The steel casing is the first standard frame built from the pack’s approved industrial steel."
	quest.047549F249559E07.title: "Steel Machine Casing"
	quest.04A01A53CD67A510.quest_desc: [
		"Build the MI steel upgrade through the current steam-age route."
		"Keep bronze rotors and other inherited parts in production; the steel tier depends on the repair floor below it."
	]
	quest.04A01A53CD67A510.quest_subtitle: "A steel upgrade proves old machinery can become stronger without discarding the factory that built it."
	quest.04A01A53CD67A510.title: "Repairable Steel Factory"
	quest.04A5BEDCF0921BC0.quest_desc: [
		"Collect native copper nuggets, load at least 100 mB into a fired vessel, and heat it until the copper is liquid."
		"Place a fired ingot mold in the vessel’s output slot and pour. Let the filled mold cool before removing the copper ingot."
	]
	quest.04A5BEDCF0921BC0.quest_subtitle: "Pottery, fuel, ore, and controlled heat now meet in one legitimate metal proof."
	quest.04A5BEDCF0921BC0.title: "Cast the First TFC Copper Ingot"
	quest.04C35F62E0D31D66.quest_desc: ["Build a hollow 3×3×3 Railcraft coke oven from 26 coke oven bricks, with full top and bottom layers and air in the center. Seven crafts make 28 bricks, leaving two spare. Each TFC oak log produces one charcoal and 250 mB of creosote; leave room for both outputs.","In the MI Bronze Mixer, combine 500 mB of Railcraft creosote and one redstone to make 500 mB of MI lubricant. Supply steam from the bronze boiler throughout mixing; this recipe uses 2 EU/t for 100 ticks.","Convert each 1,000 mB of MI lubricant into 1,000 mB of TFMG lubrication oil in an andesite mechanical mixer, with a basin two blocks below. No burner is needed. One small water wheel at 8 RPM can drive this mixer at 8 RPM: its 4 SU load fits the 8 SU source and andesite limit.","Eight oak logs and four redstone supply two litres of oil through four Bronze Mixer batches and two mechanical mixing batches. Boiler water and fuel, the machines and their construction materials are additional supplies. Keep a dedicated oil buffer tank.","Keep steam, creosote, lubricant and oil pipe networks separate. Keep basin extraction disabled while feeding and mixing; stop lubricant feed and wait for the input to empty before extracting the finished oil. Drain the output before the next batch.","Form vanilla buckets in the MI Steel Packer: three steel curved plates make four buckets. Pipe 1,000 mB of TFMG lubrication oil into a Create spout and place an empty vanilla bucket on a depot two blocks below it. Refill the spout for each bucket.","Oil mixing consumes 800 mB of steam. Precharge a separate bronze boiler with 2,000 mB of ordinary steam, leaving 1,200 mB after these four jobs and before other use. The casing and steel-steam bucket route needs eight new steel ingots beyond the earlier ignition/shaft pair. Fill two of its four buckets with these two litres of oil and retain two empty buckets. Boiler heat-up water and fuel, construction parts and other machine use are additional supplies."]
	quest.04C35F62E0D31D66.quest_subtitle: "The first lubricant comes from rail creosote and the existing Bronze Mixer; refinery self-supply follows."
	quest.04C35F62E0D31D66.title: "Lubrication Oil Buffer"
	quest.04EDCB87A68F7B52.quest_desc: ["Build a Stellaris oxygen tank from the live LV-gated recipe and make all four pieces of the Stellaris space suit before departure.","Feed suitable grain to adult TFC sheep until they are familiar enough to produce wool, then shear them when wool is available. Spin wool with a spindle, weave yarn into cloth, then weave white wool.","Pan ore deposits in claystone or dolomite using fresh water to find raw amethyst. Grind it in a quern fitted with a handstone.","Make the visor through TFC glassworking: heat a suitable batch such as hematitic glass, apply amethyst powder, pour into a brass-plated basin, let it cool and cut it with a gem saw.","Fill tanks in the water separator’s oxygen output slot. Wear the chestplate and crouch-use a charged tank to transfer oxygen; check its gauge and carry a separate reserve."]
	quest.04EDCB87A68F7B52.quest_subtitle: "An oxygen tank is not comfort equipment; it is the time available to solve the next problem."
	quest.04EDCB87A68F7B52.title: "Oxygen Equipment"
	quest.04FBF658EF792751.quest_desc: ["Build all eight UIV functional families and verify that each recipe consumes its matching UEV component; this prepares shared-service megastructures."]
	quest.04FBF658EF792751.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Ultra Immense Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.04FBF658EF792751.title: "UIV Component Standard"
	quest.0500D1DFEC4CD2F5.quest_desc: [
		"Place an AE2 pattern provider against a machine that already completes its process manually."
		"Encode a processing pattern, preserve output space, and verify the network cannot insert a recipe the machine cannot finish."
	]
	quest.0500D1DFEC4CD2F5.quest_subtitle: "A pattern provider is useful only when it points at a real machine with honest input and output buffers."
	quest.0500D1DFEC4CD2F5.title: "Autocrafting Backbone"
	quest.0506EC6258285666.quest_desc: ["Build the authored Low Voltage consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.0506EC6258285666.quest_subtitle: "The LV standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.0506EC6258285666.title: "LV Consumer Proof"
	quest.0508212BC51078BD.quest_desc: [
		"Weld seven copper double ingots on a stone anvil."
		"Heat each pair of copper ingots in a charcoal forge until both say Can Weld, add flux, and complete the weld while the metal remains workable. Seven double ingots are required for the copper anvil."
	]
	quest.0508212BC51078BD.quest_subtitle: "Seven successful welds prove the forge, flux, hammer, and stone anvil are all working before the copper anvil is requested."
	quest.0508212BC51078BD.title: "Weld Copper Double Ingots"
	quest.0509E9FAACA4664D.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four Infinity nuggets and one Eternal Singularity."
		"Treat the singularity as controlled infrastructure stock, not a casual replacement for missing production."
	]
	quest.0509E9FAACA4664D.quest_subtitle: "Four nuggets beside an Eternal Singularity preserve both a spendable batch and the larger proof behind it."
	quest.0509E9FAACA4664D.title: "Infinity Nugget Reserve"
	quest.050B4A9A7B169386.quest_desc: [
		"Craft sixteen basic pressurized tubes; the live recipe produces eight per craft."
		"Use short labeled runs and keep incompatible gases on separate networks."
	]
	quest.050B4A9A7B169386.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen tubes are enough to route gases visibly without stretching one line across the whole laboratory."
	quest.050B4A9A7B169386.title: "Lay Sixteen Pressure Tubes"
	quest.052CFE80111FC9AE.quest_desc: [
		"Build four Cargo Boats buoys."
		"Place them at approaches, shallow hazards, and turns instead of clustering them beside the dock."
	]
	quest.052CFE80111FC9AE.quest_subtitle: "Four buoys make the safe line visible in fog, darkness, or unfamiliar water."
	quest.052CFE80111FC9AE.title: "Mark the Harbor Channel"
	quest.0535341822E236AD.quest_desc: [
		"Build a four-machine bronze macerator cell and inspect it during a sustained split-feed run."
		"Give each machine a service side and independent or safely merged output storage so one blocked branch cannot stop all four."
	]
	quest.0535341822E236AD.quest_subtitle: "Four bronze macerators prove that steam-era parallelism is a real production cell, not a single spare machine."
	quest.0535341822E236AD.title: "Parallel Bronze Macerator Cell"
	quest.05544396CE6D7F9E.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a Create schedule and a Cargo Boats motorboat in reserve."
		"Program and test the schedule before an outage, and store it with the bypass route notes."
	]
	quest.05544396CE6D7F9E.quest_subtitle: "A spare schedule and motorboat keep instructions and transport together when the primary service fails."
	quest.05544396CE6D7F9E.title: "Schedule Binder Stack"
	quest.0592767DB06D292B.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Vampire Fang and a Werewolf Tooth from creatures that already inhabit the TFC world.","Study does not require accepting either transformation.","This is an optional discipline at this age; the canonical factory proofs govern normal progression."]
	quest.0592767DB06D292B.quest_subtitle: "Supernatural factions existed before you learned how to investigate them."
	quest.0592767DB06D292B.title: "First Supernatural Evidence"
	quest.0594CC115B4311E6.quest_desc: [
		"Build one Rocketnautics rocket thruster and one booster thruster."
		"These are completed flight assemblies, not loose nozzles; stage them with the cargo and fuel plan for the next vehicle."
	]
	quest.0594CC115B4311E6.quest_subtitle: "A shipyard becomes credible when both orbital maneuvering and booster thrust have replacement hardware."
	quest.0594CC115B4311E6.title: "Stock the Orbital Shipyard"
	quest.0595297A22D475B5.quest_desc: ["Assemble and place the bronze boiler from the live pack recipe.","Connect buffered water before fuel, give steam a destination, and stay nearby long enough to inspect the running installation.","Make clear glass through TFC glassworking: potash, lime heated from flux, and white sand make four silica glass batches. Use one batch for a basin pour and one for a table pour; keep the other two. Fire ceramic blowpipes at 1399 C and provide two pipes so breakage after either successful pour cannot stop the second. Keep the loaded pipe in hand and above 480 C, below its 1500 C melting recipe.","The basin needs five brass blocks around an empty cell. Pour once, let the glass cool, then break it normally to collect a glass block. Use a separate isolated brass block as the pouring table, with air above; table-pour, flatten promptly with a paddle, let it cool and break it for a glass pane. TFC disables the vanilla pane craft. Reserve the block for the bronze tank and the pane for the MI fluid-pipe batch; the remaining boiler materials and fuel still need supplying."]
	quest.0595297A22D475B5.quest_subtitle: "The boiler makes stored water and solid fuel behave like a factory power system."
	quest.0595297A22D475B5.title: "Build the Bronze Boiler"
	quest.05A227A2ADF9216A.quest_desc: [
		"The Infinity Catalyst contains exactly eighty-one ingredient entries, including two Star Fuel, the established Starlight representatives, and final Greg precision components."
		"It now depends on the two-Star-Fuel staging proof as well as Universal Matter Fabrication; it remains the serializer ceiling and a whole-factory capacity test."
	]
	quest.05A227A2ADF9216A.quest_subtitle: "Exactly eighty-one entries prove every era can still deliver production-scale output."
	quest.05A227A2ADF9216A.title: "Infinity Catalyst"
	quest.05A7D004C02A22B2.quest_desc: [
		"Build the structural airframe at the commissioned Stellaris Rocket Station; the station now outputs an incomplete rocket rather than a flight-ready vehicle."
		"Use Create to install the battery and engine, add launch fuel, and press the vehicle closed before loading oxygen, return fuel, tools, and cargo."
	]
	quest.05A7D004C02A22B2.quest_subtitle: "The first rocket concentrates years of workshop practice into one machine that must also bring you home."
	quest.05A7D004C02A22B2.title: "First Rocket"
	quest.05BA7B31EF14DF31.quest_desc: ["Make remote cargo a scheduled industrial input instead of a sequence of one-off trips.","Prove the complete mixed-concentrate, purified-solution, electrolysis, mixed-feed, Centrifuge, packing, blast, and forming route.","The batch line retains purified solution, prepares four of the same mixed-iridium feeds, and recovers extra trace iridium at higher power.","Connect planetary extraction, life support, flight control and return storage to the terrestrial PGM separation works. Establish buffers at both ends before scaling downstream precision production.","Repeat shipments support specialist materials and larger aerospace batches. Keep local isolation, conventional return capacity and a spare cargo reserve; advanced spatial equipment appears later and is not a substitute for establishing these routes."]
	quest.05BA7B31EF14DF31.quest_subtitle: "Platinum and iridium become useful only after mixed concentrate is dissolved, separated, packed, heated, and formed."
	quest.05BA7B31EF14DF31.title: "Separate the Platinum-Group Stream"
	quest.05BFC094C0A68CBD.quest_desc: [
		"Build one Electro Energetics generator clutch through the authority recipe."
		"Connect it to the established housing and commutator route, meter the output, and retain a safe mechanical disconnect."
	]
	quest.05BFC094C0A68CBD.quest_subtitle: "The Electro Energetics generator clutch keeps mechanical input visible and disconnectable without reviving the hidden alternator duplicate."
	quest.05BFC094C0A68CBD.title: "Generator Clutch Room"
	quest.05C95B0C6F679A3F.quest_desc: [
		"Open your inventory, select Quests, and follow the short gold First Shift row."
		"Createch 2 is a long-form expert progression pack. Beta means balance and polish are still evolving—not that the campaign lacks an endgame."
		"TerraFirmaCraft establishes survival, physical materials, geology, and metallurgy. Create and TFMG turn that base into mechanical automation, heavy industry, and petroleum."
		"Modern Industrialization scales the factory; GregTech adds higher-tier precision components; Electro Energetics owns electrical infrastructure. Later systems build on these roles."
		"Use EMI as the pack's recipe and ingredient browser; JEI remains only as a hidden compatibility backend."
		"Pick up two sticks from the ground or foliage. No quest completes merely because a world was created."
	]
	quest.05C95B0C6F679A3F.quest_subtitle: "Pick up two sticks to begin; deep water, fire, electricity, and alien atmospheres become safe only through engineering."
	quest.05C95B0C6F679A3F.title: "Welcome to Createch 2"
	quest.05D7794894BC51C0.quest_desc: ["Build a settlement that can survive while the first metal is being made.","Dig a one-block hole and Place up to four unfired items inside. Add eight straw or two thatch blocks, then eight logs.","Light the top with a Firestarter or tossed torch. The stack burns for about six in-game hours and reaches roughly 1400 °C.","Keep food, clean drinking water, firewood and charcoal close to the pottery and casting area. Fired molds and vessels are the workshop's first reusable infrastructure.","The payoff is dependable copper tools and storage. Keep a firestarter, spare molds and fuel aside so an empty stockpile does not strand the next workshop."]
	quest.05D7794894BC51C0.quest_subtitle: "Eight straw and eight logs turn unfired clay into permanent tools."
	quest.05D7794894BC51C0.title: "Fire the First Pit Kiln"
	quest.05E1344D8F7B9045.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement OPV motors, pumps, robot arms, sensors, emitters, and field generators for the terminal component ladder, then verify the UXV line still operates."]
	quest.05E1344D8F7B9045.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.05E1344D8F7B9045.title: "OPV Recovery Proof"
	quest.05E487281942D4A6.quest_desc: ["Travel to the Stellaris Mars dimension, establish a safe route home, and return with Mars Tharsite for the next industrial stage.","The opening Advanced Electric aluminum reduction consumes both Moon Desh and Mars Tharsite, so aluminum remains locked until this expedition is complete.","With the basic 3,000 mB tank, depart for Mars full and carry three additional fuel buckets for the return. Crouch-open the lander to recover the rocket with its remaining fuel; bring launch-pad equipment, oxygen and mining tools."]
	quest.05E487281942D4A6.quest_subtitle: "Mars is a required Tharsite supply line for Advanced Electric aluminum, not optional sightseeing."
	quest.05E487281942D4A6.title: "Set a Course for Mars"
	quest.05E764D33EB28B72.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Electro Energetics portable battery."
		"Label its state, protect its leads, and never treat portable storage as harmless because the main switch is open."
	]
	quest.05E764D33EB28B72.quest_subtitle: "A portable battery lets instruments and controls be tested without energizing the entire yard."
	quest.05E764D33EB28B72.title: "Prepare a Portable Test Source"
	quest.05F1C6028E36F345.quest_desc: [
		"Infuse and stock four Mekanism basic control circuits."
		"Provide separate redstone and iron inputs, keep the infuser powered, and preserve output space for the next chemical machines."
	]
	quest.05F1C6028E36F345.quest_subtitle: "Four basic control circuits make the first Mekanism machine a repeatable part of the factory."
	quest.05F1C6028E36F345.title: "Infuse the First Control Circuits"
	quest.05F403F6322AFFE5.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Re:Avaritia Infinity Sword with the installed tier-four table recipe."
		"This is final equipment, so its cost may be extravagant without serving as a gate to unfinished progression."
	]
	quest.05F403F6322AFFE5.quest_subtitle: "The sword is no longer preparation for another age; it is a deliberate use of a world already mastered."
	quest.05F403F6322AFFE5.title: "Forge the Infinity Sword"
	quest.05F7ABD1605BA3AB.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Stellaris fuel refinery and connect it to the LV-backed launch complex."
		"The live block requires TFMG steel distillation, an MI pump and hull, an analog circuit, and Stellaris cable; buffer both feed and rocket fuel."
	]
	quest.05F7ABD1605BA3AB.quest_subtitle: "The refinery turns TFMG fuel production into a measured reserve for departure and return."
	quest.05F7ABD1605BA3AB.title: "Launch Fuel Refinery"
	quest.05FA143275241AF5.quest_desc: [
		"After the pressure route, build and inspect the MI Large Steam Turbine multiblock."
		"It accepts normal steam at 1 EU per mB or high-pressure steam at 8 EU per mB and can reach 16,384 EU/t, but it returns no water."
		"Plan a Heat Exchanger or independent water replacement before sustained operation; keep steam buffered and electrical output isolated."
	]
	quest.05FA143275241AF5.quest_subtitle: "Titanium and high-pressure infrastructure now exist for MI’s 16,384 EU/t turbine."
	quest.05FA143275241AF5.title: "Build the Large Steam Turbine"
	quest.063C251E8AD7A5DF.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 15 opens, place and inspect an MI fusion reactor."
		"Provide independent control power, plasma conversion, protected distribution, and service access around the plant."
	]
	quest.063C251E8AD7A5DF.quest_subtitle: "A stellar array is fusion treated as civilization infrastructure rather than a single spectacular reactor."
	quest.063C251E8AD7A5DF.title: "Stellar Power Array"
	quest.063E964BB6CF6EA6.quest_desc: ["Produce four MI digital circuits with the current clean-processing route.","Buffer wafers, boards, fine wire, and assembly outputs; AE2 will coordinate this line, not replace it.","PRE-02 unlocks the MI electronic-circuit sapphire prototype; PRE-03 unlocks the Mekanism advanced-control prototype. Pan TFC chalk-region deposits in fresh water for raw sapphire, then polish it with TFC sandpaper; keep boards, TFMG transistors and capacitors supplied."]
	quest.063E964BB6CF6EA6.quest_subtitle: "Four digital circuits bring precise control to machines whose material flows are already disciplined."
	quest.063E964BB6CF6EA6.title: "Digital Circuit Line"
	quest.064379FAF6EC93B9.quest_desc: [
		"Build vessel."
		"Shape the clay form first, then fire it in a covered pit kiln with straw and logs."
	]
	quest.064379FAF6EC93B9.quest_subtitle: "The first fired vessel makes storage, cooking, and metal preparation possible."
	quest.064379FAF6EC93B9.title: "Fire the First Vessel"
	quest.0655E46718DD0069.quest_desc: ["Turn stored parts into requested production while keeping geographical freight in service.","Produce sixteen MI stainless-steel ingots through the installed alloy and blast-furnace chain.","Survey claystone pyrolusite for manganese and retain the native electronic-control catalyst during ore preparation. The stainless dust batch uses six iron, one chromium, one nickel and one manganese dust for nine dust. Use the cupronickel blast furnace and then vacuum-freeze the hot ingots before forming plates.","Obtain antimony from the existing Venus stibnite deposits. The basic full 3,000 mB tank admits the native trip; carry two additional 1,000 mB fuel buckets and return-launch equipment. Wear the complete oxygen-filled pressure suit, carry reserve oxygen and provisions, and monitor exposure. Process normal stibnite with the retained electronic control, then make lead-antimony battery alloy and the native silicon battery.","Assemble the first vacuum freezer from three electronic circuits, an advanced hull, three large pumps and two large aluminum plates. Follow its native 3 by 3 by 4 plan: thirty frostproof casings, the controller, steel item input/output hatches and one LV energy hatch. Use stainless plates, the silicon battery, the earlier circuit board, aluminum cables and polyethylene for the first digital circuit board.","Macerate mined bituminous coal under CHE-01: one coal gives one coal dust. The native resistor batch combines one dust, two paper and two fine copper wires for three resistors; charcoal is not this feedstock.","Use silicon plates, steel plates, glass and fine electrum wire for native transistors and diodes. Combine four resistors, four transistors and one diode per op-amp. Finish one digital circuit from one OR gate, two NOT gates, one AND gate, four electronic circuits and the digital circuit board. Keep the circuit line supplied before committing parts to AE2.","Prepare Eyes of Ender through the existing dry-region Skeleton Dungeons: retained spawners can produce Ember Skeletons for blaze powder and Ender Skeletons for pearls. Search dune, mesa or badlands terrain with mining and combat equipment, light and provisions. Each native drop can be zero; keep useful spawners intact. Reserve at least twelve eyes for portal frames plus extras for locating the stronghold.","Check your Overworld respawn before entering the completed stronghold portal. Bring the native flint bow, ordinary arrows from the same skeleton hunts, spare pearls for gateways, bronze mining tools, light, building stock and provisions. Defeat the dragon to activate the exit fountain and create a gateway to the outer islands.","Certus is in the outer End biomes, not the main island. Use the gateway to reach them and its linked gateway to return to the central island before leaving through the fountain. Mine ordinary TFC Metallurgy certus ore, then run one ore with a reusable MI digital circuit at 32 EU/t for 300 ticks: two AE2 crystals and a 25% chance of one dust. Precharge the LV turbine for the 9,600 EU batch.","Make the silicon press from seven stainless plates, one silicon plate and one digital circuit. Use the MI electric packer for printed silicon from silicon ingots, and the other three stencils with gold, certus or diamond for their printed processors. The stencils are retained. Assemble each printed processor with printed silicon and 90 mB molten redstone in the MI assembler. Wafers belong to the later monocrystalline line. Macerate a certus crystal for guaranteed dust; the ore separator’s chance dust is a bonus. The native MI electrolyzer charges certus, and its mixer combines charged certus, quartz and redstone with water present to make two fluix crystals.","COM-04 also provides the physical AE2 inscriber. Build it from four stainless plates, three advanced pumps, one advanced hull and one digital circuit. Use a dedicated LV steam turbine and MI tin cable to power a rear, side, top or bottom face. Leave its speed-card slots empty for commissioning, precharge the turbine with 16,000 mB steam and keep the boiler supplied. Each unupgraded operation needs 2,020 AE, equivalent to 404 EU at the pack settings; the 1,600 AE internal buffer needs replenishing during work. Keep the cable connected, inputs in place and output space clear through power pauses.","Use processed AE2 silicon for the inscriber line. Macerate three guaranteed certus crystals into three dust, then smelt the dust in the earlier furnace with one fresh charcoal for three silicon. The three 200-tick smelts fit its fuel budget. Print three silicon parts, then one gold, one certus and one diamond processor part with the matching stencils. Printing retains the four stencils. For each finished processor, press its printed part with one printed silicon and one ordinary redstone; finishing consumes those three inputs. These nine printing and finishing operations need 3,636 delivered EU with continuing FE supply. Reserve five certus crystals for this start: one for the calculation stencil, one for its print and three for silicon. Three ordinary ore-separator batches guarantee six crystals, leaving one; chance dust is a bonus.","Commission the forming line with one small water wheel and five successive small-to-large cog reductions, using andesite shafts and cogs throughout the reducer. The 8 RPM source becomes 0.25 RPM in magnitude. An upward-facing steel saw on this drive cuts one aluminum plate into six shafts; five shafts, five steel cogs and five more aluminum plates make five aluminum cogs. Collect the output and use the empty steel saw in the aluminum-saw upgrade. Cut one stainless plate into six stainless shafts, then use two shafts for the two stainless cogs needed by the stainless press. Retain the other four. The aluminum saw, stainless press and ordinary deployer can share this reduced drive: their combined load is 2.75 SU within its 8 SU limit. Keep the shafts aligned, give the wheel continuous flow and keep other factory loads outside the line.","Reserve three logic processors, one calculation processor and one engineering processor. Printing five silicon parts, three logic parts, one calculation part and one engineering part, then finishing them, takes fifteen inscriber operations and 6,060 delivered EU. Spend two logic processors in the formation-core and annihilation-core crafts; each craft makes two cores, leaving one spare of each after the controller assembly. Prepare the controller workpiece in the MI assembler from an advanced hull, four stainless large plates, three fluix crystals and 144 mB soldering alloy. Make its control chip through the existing 72 mB soldering batch. Five native soldering-dust blast-furnace batches yield 450 mB: allocate three batches to the assembler jobs and two to the spout, leaving 54 mB in the assembler and 36 mB in the spout after use.","Place separate depots two blocks below the deployer, spout and stainless press. Point the deployer down in USE mode and connect its shaft to the reduced drive. Keep one controller workpiece and feed exactly one component at each deployment, in this order: logic processor, calculation processor, engineering processor, formation core, annihilation core, digital circuit, energy acceptor, control chip, fluix glass cable and EE converter. Transfer that same marked workpiece to the supplied spout for 144 mB soldering alloy, then to the tier-3 stainless press for the controller. Configure an MI fluid-pipe connection from prepared soldering stock into the spout and wait until its tank has enough fluid. Preserve the workpiece progress while moving between stations; keep its output space clear.","Make the Synaxis circuit diagram from the existing circuit, paper and blue dye after its research unlock. Native TFC graphite supplies the dye: prospect the metamorphic rock districts, mine graphite ore with a bronze pick or better, then grind one ore in a quern with a usable handstone for four graphite powder. Craft each powder into one blue dye with the native TFC recipe. One four-dye batch supplies one diagram and leaves three dye for later work. This route keeps regional mining and the early quern useful beside the digital factory.","Use the existing digital-circuit line to build a Stainless Steel Greate Press before finishing the AE2 controller. Connect processor production, item and fluid buffers, and the machines that fulfil requests.","Use the existing processor batches and Processing Array where they fit. AE2 coordinates local production; trains and expeditions still deliver bulk feedstock. Reserve essential circuit and motor stock outside a request chain that could consume its own restart parts."]
	quest.0655E46718DD0069.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen stainless ingots give clean processing and digital machinery a material standard that can be replaced."
	quest.0655E46718DD0069.title: "Stainless Steel"
	quest.0656012BA717BD74.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Mekanism Solar Neutron Activator through its live pack recipe."
		"Stage shielding, input quarantine, recovered output storage, waste handling, and a shutdown path before use."
	]
	quest.0656012BA717BD74.quest_subtitle: "The fuel reprocessor acknowledges that spent material remains an engineering responsibility after the first burn."
	quest.0656012BA717BD74.title: "National Nuclear Fuel Complex Project"
	quest.0663EC95288CB1F8.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect an AE2 inscriber and stock sixteen Fluix glass cables."
		"Plan dense trunks, service branches, machine faces, storage access, and an offline recovery chest."
	]
	quest.0663EC95288CB1F8.quest_subtitle: "An inscriber and sixteen cables establish processor, power, storage, and channel routes without a clipboard task."
	quest.0663EC95288CB1F8.title: "Lay Out the AE2 Factory"
	quest.066B1B32AD7E0708.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight AE2 fluix crystals through the installed transformation."
		"Keep a repeatable charged-certus route and reserve crystals for cable, controller, and processor infrastructure."
	]
	quest.066B1B32AD7E0708.quest_subtitle: "Eight fluix crystals turn certus, redstone, and charged material into the signal path of the first network."
	quest.066B1B32AD7E0708.title: "Fluix and Processors"
	quest.06B2B66E78C40CBC.quest_desc: ["Place the Re:Avaritia neutron collector after returning Starlight samples.","Its live craft requires matrix, plutonium, starcore, fission hardware, and a rocket thruster; protect the output route.","Mechanical commissioning: the neutron collector finishes on a Titanium Greate Press or higher. Keep the mature aerospace forming floor operating; Quantum research and tungsten-steel machinery are not needed for this press step."]
	quest.06B2B66E78C40CBC.quest_subtitle: "The neutron collector converts long waiting and extreme inputs into a new industrial feedstock."
	quest.06B2B66E78C40CBC.title: "Neutron Collector"
	quest.06C979F2D1DC6D66.quest_desc: [
		"Return with sixteen Rocketnautics lunar regolith."
		"Mine from a prepared frontier route and keep life support, return fuel, and cargo capacity separate from the sample load."
	]
	quest.06C979F2D1DC6D66.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen lunar regolith brought home makes the Moon a freight source rather than a sightseeing stop."
	quest.06C979F2D1DC6D66.title: "Moon Frontier Cargo"
	quest.06D5580001F28452.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four Rocketnautics titanium-alloy sheets."
		"Assign the batch to known hull or nozzle work and retain ingot and plate reserves for pressure infrastructure."
	]
	quest.06D5580001F28452.quest_subtitle: "Four titanium-alloy sheets make the next aerospace expansion a planned fabrication run."
	quest.06D5580001F28452.title: "Vacuum Aerospace Works Expansion Contract"
	quest.06D83DFD0A495597.quest_desc: ["Mine and return with sixteen raw desh from the Moon. Use a TFC bronze, wrought-iron or better pickaxe for the iron-grade lunar blocks.","Ordinary mining already drops raw desh. Silk Touch is optional: preserved Moon desh ore can be macerated at 16 EU for two raw desh, while direct smelting remains removed.","After the lunar visit, unload at least sixteen raw desh into your inventory on Terra to record the return. Finished desh still requires the blast-furnace route; keep a return reserve."]
	quest.06D83DFD0A495597.quest_subtitle: "Eight Moon ore is useful because it crossed the whole route back to a powered macerator."
	quest.06D83DFD0A495597.title: "Return Moon Desh Cargo"
	quest.06DA2CC545D9F9D7.quest_desc: [
		"Produce one Re:Avaritia crystal-matrix ingot after recovering a legitimate Starlight catalyst."
		"The live recipe consumes diamond lattice, platinum and nuclear-alloy plate, an atomic alloy, and the crystalborn catalyst."
	]
	quest.06DA2CC545D9F9D7.quest_subtitle: "One crystal-matrix ingot is the first proof that nuclear-era materials and Starlight evidence can share one recipe."
	quest.06DA2CC545D9F9D7.title: "Crystal Matrix Production"
	quest.070AA619EDA9169A.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Create’s precision-mechanism advancement through the installed sequence."
		"Make the intermediate loop visible so a missing deployer input is obvious before a full batch stalls."
	]
	quest.070AA619EDA9169A.quest_subtitle: "Sequenced assembly turns a fragile intermediate into a repeatable precision part."
	quest.070AA619EDA9169A.title: "Complete Create’s Precision Sequence"
	quest.070B3C43DEE47186.quest_desc: [
		"Sleep in a bed on three occasions during normal work."
		"Use the return to unload food, refill water, inspect clothing, and plan the next day."
	]
	quest.070B3C43DEE47186.quest_subtitle: "Three nights of returning to shelter show that the field route ends somewhere safe and repeatable."
	quest.070B3C43DEE47186.title: "Keep a Three-Night Routine"
	quest.0710BE372D3EB0CA.quest_desc: ["Reach 4,194,304 FE of usable capacity behind the completed ray-receiver chain to close the Dyson progression."]
	quest.0710BE372D3EB0CA.quest_subtitle: "Required discipline mastery — contributes to the canonical age proof."
	quest.0710BE372D3EB0CA.title: "Stellar Grid Capstone"
	quest.071F82930443AD4B.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Eternal Starlight starcore block after the first return."
		"Keep the institute supplied by documented samples and nuclear support rather than one-off loot consumption."
	]
	quest.071F82930443AD4B.quest_subtitle: "A starcore block gives the Astral Institute enough concentrated sample to begin controlled work."
	quest.071F82930443AD4B.title: "Astral Research Institute Project"
	quest.0732478B0B0442D2.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a TFMG steel fluid tank and eight rubber sheets ready."
		"Use the tank only after labeling and separating it from the active fuel main."
	]
	quest.0732478B0B0442D2.quest_subtitle: "A steel tank and eight rubber sheets support isolation and seal replacement without rewarding a progression machine."
	quest.0732478B0B0442D2.title: "Prepare the Fuel-Isolation Kit"
	quest.074057A4E4462FC1.quest_desc: [
		"Build three basin foundry lids."
		"Each uses three copper ingots, two andesite alloy, and four pieces of foundry masonry. The shaft batch, water wheel, and basin each consume one lid."
	]
	quest.074057A4E4462FC1.quest_subtitle: "The foundry lid is the copper-built key that opens machine-grade alloy work."
	quest.074057A4E4462FC1.title: "Cast the Foundry Lid"
	quest.074117DEDB1F318A.quest_desc: ["Build the Greate andesite-alloy mechanical press.","Stack an andesite-alloy shaft, an andesite casing, and a physically welded TFC copper double sheet, then drive the press from the water wheel. Its 1 SU per RPM load must fit an 8 SU andesite network; gear down to 8 RPM for a single press and allow room for other connected loads. Keep this forming cell supplying the later steel workshop."]
	quest.074117DEDB1F318A.quest_subtitle: "The press turns rotation into the first standardized factory operation."
	quest.074117DEDB1F318A.title: "Build the Mechanical Press"
	quest.074D0E92A8F63947.quest_desc: [
		"Build ingot mold and pickaxe head mold."
		"Shape both casting molds, dry them, and pit-fire the pair before any molten metal is prepared."
	]
	quest.074D0E92A8F63947.quest_subtitle: "Casting begins long before the metal melts; it begins with intact molds."
	quest.074D0E92A8F63947.title: "Prepare Casting Molds"
	quest.0752DBE386C64C0C.quest_desc: ["Stage the listed UEV reserve for Infinity-era convergence; keep the batch outside automatic consumption so expansion does not erase repair stock."]
	quest.0752DBE386C64C0C.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.0752DBE386C64C0C.title: "UEV Production Cell"
	quest.075A000000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Copper-era Research Lab after proving repeatable copper-sheet production."
		"Research consumes evidence packs. Each pack represents work your civilization actually performed and recorded."
		"Parent nodes and other prerequisites must be understood before later research can begin."
		"Completed research may unlock recipes, but it does not count as physical proof."
		"FTB Quests still owns age gates and the machines, routes, and production you physically prove."
		"Later machines improve evidence production rather than replacing this first institution."
	]
	quest.075A000000000001.quest_subtitle: "Observation becomes an institution when evidence can be repeated, stored, and shared."
	quest.075A000000000001.title: "Establish the Research Laboratory"
	quest.075A000000000002.quest_desc: [
		"Research’d records what your team understands and owns configured recipe unlocks. FTB Quests still records what you physically build and prove. GuideME explains how those systems fit together."
		"The first six evidence families can begin as handwritten observations. Electrical, computational, propulsion, nuclear, and frontier evidence begin in real test equipment."
		"Old Research Pack routes remain valid, but workshop experiments, instrumented cells, automated laboratories, specialist facilities, and frontier institutes produce the same evidence far more efficiently."
	]
	quest.075A000000000002.quest_subtitle: "Research starts as observation and becomes another permanent industrial district."
	quest.075A000000000002.title: "The Age of Organized Science"
	quest.0764F8C5D0DAC768.quest_desc: ["Spend returned space resources on a more capable factory floor.","Reduce bauxite through the live MI blast-furnace recipe to obtain aluminum.","The pack recipe consumes bauxite dust, TFMG coke, and returned desh and tharsite; direct aluminum smelting is not the intended route.","The first bauxite reduction runs at 32 EU/t for 4,800 ticks. Its eight bauxite dust, one desh ingot, one tharsite ingot and two coke still yield two aluminum ingots and four bauxite tiny dust. Keep three steel boilers above 1,300 C, supplied with water and charcoal, and feeding the LV turbine for this long batch.","Establish Beneath’s native Nether route for magnetic-alloy production. Cast and assemble a bronze scythe with its required handle, rivet and glue. At a prepared site away from the settlement, place eight copper anvils within five blocks horizontally and two below to three above a native TFC sheep, then deliver the final blow with the scythe in your main hand. The native event creates a portal with a strength-10 explosion, eight zoglins and damaging lightning; prepare protection and a clear approach before triggering it.","Mark the portal and return route. Isolate Nether netherrack on all sides and let TFC drop the whole block automatically; direct mining gives pebbles. Return with that block to craft an empty blaze burner with four iron plates. On a later expedition, use it on a living vanilla blaze in a Nether Fortress, then bring the captured burner home alive. Ember Skeletons and Soul Blaze variants are not the required capture.","Place the captured burner directly below a basin, with an andesite mixer two blocks above the basin. Feed the burner fresh charcoal. A dedicated small water wheel drives the mixer at 8 RPM through an andesite gearbox and adjacent vertical cog: the mixer consumes 4 SU of the source’s 8 SU. Greate accepts this slow drive. Mix two nickel ingots, two steel ingots and one TFMG silicon ingot for two magnetic-alloy ingots, then press the sheets for advanced motors. Keep the burner fueled and the output space clear.","Run four basic-upgrade batches in the MI assembler before installing upgrades. Each batch consumes two conveyors, four ordinary motors, two robot arms and one analog circuit board, producing four basic upgrades at 8 EU/t for 200 ticks. Use the completed stack of sixteen on the assembler to raise its recipe limit from 32 to 64 EU/t. Connect the assembler to the LV steam turbine with MI tin cable, using a dedicated circuit with no other consumers.","Mix one redstone with 500 mB creosote in an MI mixer to make 500 mB lubricant. The first bronze cutting machine needs one diamond. The existing compression route uses sixteen coal blocks: macerate 144 geological coal into coal dust, compress the dust to coal, and pack nine coal into each block with the reusable block template. Run the 4 EU/t, 6,000-tick diamond batch in the electric compressor on the dedicated LV circuit; its 24,000 EU budget needs steam refilling. Craft the bronze cutter with the diamond, copper gears, bronze casing, glass and fluid pipes. Cut seven aluminum rods with 7 mB lubricant to make fourteen bolts: eight for the two rotors, four for their pair of rings and two for the pump.","To retain an advanced motor as well as a pump, make two advanced motors, then spend one in the pump: the three batches use 450 mB lubricant. Reserve another 7 mB for the fourteen bolts, leaving 43 mB. Each motor needs 25,600 EU; the pump needs 32,000 EU. Fully charge the turbine with 16,000 mB steam, run one batch at a time, then refill its steam tank while the assembler pauses. Two full steam charges cover each batch; the LV supply advances these 64 EU/t recipes more slowly. Keep the upgrades installed, the machine intact and output space clear while refilling. The boiler needs fuel, water and time to rebuild the steam reserve.","Aluminum, advanced hulls, motors and pumps build the Aluminum Greate Press and commission the Oritech machine cell. The same press later finishes the pressure-reaction chamber for the chemical works.","Move repeated motor and pump demand to the existing lubricated batches and scale ore preparation with the Large Electric Macerator. Keep the earlier hull and motor lines supplying these upgrades; reserve enough returned feedstock to repair the expedition and the new floor."]
	quest.0764F8C5D0DAC768.quest_subtitle: "Aluminum is the first proof that returned planetary material can change the factory at home."
	quest.0764F8C5D0DAC768.title: "Aluminum Reduction"
	quest.076C09B300000001.quest_desc: [
		"Macerate graded tetrahedrite, dissolve ten powder into dirty copper slurry, wash it, crystallize it, and recover copper dust."
		"Retain sulfur dust as a useful fraction for the sulfuric-acid network. The TFC quern remains the lower-infrastructure fallback."
	]
	quest.076C09B300000001.quest_subtitle: "A complete pilot proves that ore can become chemistry without enabling universal native Mekanism 5x processing."
	quest.076C09B300000001.title: "Precision Beneficiation Plant Proven"
	quest.076C10B100000001.quest_desc: [
		"Commission the MultiBuilder Tool with portable power and two HV robot arms."
		"Only approved standards already proven by hand may be reconstructed. The first valid proof remains manual, and reconstruction never advances progression."
		"Utilities, wiring, control, pollution handling, rail alignment, and site design remain manual responsibilities."
	]
	quest.076C10B100000001.quest_subtitle: "Reconstruct approved proven standards; never automate first proof or progression."
	quest.076C10B100000001.title: "Commission Standardized Reconstruction"
	quest.076C10B200000001.quest_desc: [
		"Stage a dissolution chamber, Railcraft loader, HV breakers, and an advanced computer as representative plant infrastructure."
		"Reconstruction places only an approved machine standard. Build and connect process utilities, electrical isolation, control, pollution handling, and rail alignment manually."
		"Inspect every connection, recommission the plant under control, and verify stable operation before declaring recovery complete."
	]
	quest.076C10B200000001.quest_subtitle: "A reconstructed machine is not a commissioned plant; every utility and safety boundary remains yours."
	quest.076C10B200000001.title: "Recommission Reconstructed Infrastructure"
	quest.076C10B300000001.quest_desc: [
		"Stock HV motors, pumps, sensors, fuse holders, and an AE2 network tool before a standardized line fails."
		"Use the operator sequence: isolate, de-energize, inspect, repair, restock, restart, recommission, and verify."
		"Recovery stock replaces damaged parts; it does not automate utilities, controls, site design, first proof, or progression."
	]
	quest.076C10B300000001.quest_subtitle: "Prepared recovery stock makes reconstruction maintainable without making it autonomous."
	quest.076C10B300000001.title: "Stock Reconstruction Recovery Parts"
	quest.076D010000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Carry the Stone Javelin forward as the first recorded projectile and defensive field observation."
		"Research MIL-01 with Ordnance Reports; primitive survival weapons themselves remain ungated."
	]
	quest.076D010000000001.quest_subtitle: "A weapon becomes doctrine when its use is observed, compared, and taught."
	quest.076D010000000001.title: "Organized Defense"
	quest.076D020000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Commission the TaCZ gunsmith table after steel mechanisms and controlled metallurgy. TaCZ is the sole infantry-firearm authority."
		"The first service sidearm is a standardized machine product; JEG has been retired instead of maintaining a duplicate arsenal."
	]
	quest.076D020000000001.quest_subtitle: "Metallurgy turns field defense into standardized small arms."
	quest.076D020000000001.title: "Metallurgical Arms"
	quest.076D030000000001.quest_desc: ["Commission TaCZ ammunition tooling, produce a 5.56 casing batch through Create, and build the CBC cannon builder with one standardized shot.", "Infantry ammunition and artillery now share steel, brass, explosives, mechanisms, and factory logistics.", "Maintain repeatable projectile and ammunition batches. This optional doctrine measures supply capacity; there is no requirement to collect every gun."]
	quest.076D030000000001.quest_subtitle: "Artillery is a product of the heavy industrial district, not an isolated crafting tree."
	quest.076D030000000001.title: "Industrial Ordnance"
	quest.076D040000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Build a ballistic calculator and radar fire controller, then operate the instrumented proving-ground report route."
		"Both instruments remain installed as reusable zero-consumption test articles while ammunition and paper are consumed."
	]
	quest.076D040000000001.quest_subtitle: "Recorded firing solutions replace guesswork with computation and precision metrology."
	quest.076D040000000001.title: "Instrumented Ballistics"
	quest.076D050000000001.quest_desc: ["Build powered pitch and yaw control, an Air War interceptor battery, and a shield generator after long-range airframes and the high-energy grid.", "Use radar, guidance, artillery coordination, protected power, and supervised control to defend infrastructure.", "Integrate the radar/fire-control chain with a supervised interlock. CC:Tweaked monitors the physical installation; it cannot substitute for power, aiming hardware or ammunition transport."]
	quest.076D050000000001.quest_subtitle: "The civilization progresses from carrying a weapon to defending a facility."
	quest.076D050000000001.title: "Automated Defense"
	quest.076D060000000001.quest_desc: ["After reactor instrumentation and advanced metrology, manufacture the gated plutonium strategic weapon.", "Possession is the proof. Do not detonate it to complete this quest.", "Keep the optional strategic store isolated, instrumented and recoverable. Prove containment and shutdown on inert equipment before live deployment; detonation is not a campaign requirement."]
	quest.076D060000000001.quest_subtitle: "Strategic capability exists only because an entire nuclear civilization already exists."
	quest.076D060000000001.title: "Strategic Deterrence"
	quest.076D070000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Apply frontier observation, controlled fusion, and esoteric synthesis to one installed exotic CBC payload."
		"This is the optional military capstone and remains independent of ordinary Infinity."
	]
	quest.076D070000000001.quest_subtitle: "Exotic infrastructure creates exotic threats—and finally, an engineered response."
	quest.076D070000000001.title: "Exotic Threat Response"
	quest.076D080000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Build an ammunition depot around rail access, bulk storage, and stocked field containers."
		"Combat endurance is constrained by production and delivery, not by weapon ownership."
	]
	quest.076D080000000001.quest_subtitle: "Supply is firepower."
	quest.076D080000000001.title: "Military Logistics Depot"
	quest.077954D362FC1914.quest_desc: [
		"Store 5,000,000 FE in an isolated nuclear support grid."
		"Test the path to reactor logic, coolant circulation, monitoring, waste transfer, and control-room lighting without starting fission."
	]
	quest.077954D362FC1914.quest_subtitle: "Five million FE reserved for controls and pumps protects shutdown capability when the main turbine is dark."
	quest.077954D362FC1914.title: "Charge the Nuclear Black Start"
	quest.077A010000000001.quest_desc: [
		"After the first legitimate Moon expedition, search newly generated lunar terrain for a small glyph monument. Existing chunks cannot gain newly added structures."
		"The anomaly is deliberately inert: its cartouche has collapsed into isolated stone symbols, and it contains no functional Stargate or complete destination address."
		"Recover one Stone Symbol and establish a safe rocket route home."
	]
	quest.077A010000000001.quest_subtitle: "Someone was here before us."
	quest.077A010000000001.title: "First Signal — Lunar Anomaly"
	quest.077A020000000001.quest_desc: ["Turn the recovered symbol, lunar rock, navigation instruments and paper into a Lunar Artifacts research pack. Ordinary Rocketnautics lunar fragmented rock is a valid sample; intact lunar rock and older Stellaris Moon stone also work.","Complete Research'd milestone FRN-04A — Off-World Anomaly. Its unlocked Archeologist Notebook is the proof item for this quest.","Reserve another recovered Stone Symbol and a lunar rock sample for the unlocked Archeologist Notebook.","This establishes evidence handling; it does not reveal a destination or unlock gate construction."]
	quest.077A020000000001.quest_subtitle: "The first conclusion is evidence of design, not knowledge of purpose."
	quest.077A020000000001.title: "Off-World Anomaly"
	quest.077A030000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Use a rocket to reach Mars and locate the abandoned archaeological complex in newly generated terrain."
		"Its functional transport machinery has failed, but repeated hieroglyphs match the Lunar symbols and prove the site belonged to a multiworld civilization."
		"Recover one Sandstone with Hieroglyphs for controlled comparison."
	]
	quest.077A030000000001.quest_subtitle: "The Lunar anomaly was not isolated."
	quest.077A030000000001.title: "Red Planet Ruins"
	quest.077A040000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Compile a Martian Records research pack from recovered hieroglyphs, Martian geology, and the Archeologist Notebook."
		"Complete FRN-04B — Extraterrestrial Archaeology, then craft the unlocked Memory Crystal to preserve the correlated sequence."
		"The sequence implies a network, but it still provides neither field physics nor a dialable address."
	]
	quest.077A040000000001.quest_subtitle: "They operated across multiple worlds."
	quest.077A040000000001.title: "Extraterrestrial Archaeology"
	quest.077A050000000001.quest_desc: ["Land on Venus by rocket and find the ruined containment station in newly generated terrain.","Its rings, panels, power cells, and liquid-energy hardware are inert by design, leaving only architectural and symbolic evidence.","Recover a Red Sandstone Symbol and measure how the installation survived heat, pressure, and corrosive chemistry.","The station contains one Red Sandstone Symbol. Recover it with a bronze pickaxe or better, then survey another station for the second symbol. Mine Venus Stone directly; Silk Touch is not required."]
	quest.077A050000000001.quest_subtitle: "The ruins were high-energy machines, not monuments."
	quest.077A050000000001.title: "Field Theory of the Ancients"
	quest.077A060000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft five Venusian Field Data packs from two recovered Red Sandstone Symbols, one Venus Stone, four paper, one Memory Crystal and one Electronic Circuit.","Complete FRN-04C — Dimensional Field Theory. Craft the unlocked Energy Crystal as a controlled laboratory reconstruction.","One field component cannot operate a gate; it only proves the containment model."]
	quest.077A060000000001.quest_subtitle: "Controlled spacetime requires containment before it requires a destination."
	quest.077A060000000001.title: "Dimensional Field Theory"
	quest.077A070000000001.quest_desc: ["Reach Mercury by rocket and locate the ancient calibration relay in newly generated terrain.","Recover its Red Sandstone Cartouche and compare the glyph arrangement against stellar coordinates, chevron order, and a point of origin.","The Solar-System sites now form one navigational theory, but the machine remains beyond present manufacturing.","Stage through Venus with a full basic 3 L tank and seven reserve Stellaris Fuel Buckets. Refill with two buckets on Venus, three on Mercury and two on Venus before returning to Earth; recover the rocket at every stop and carry launch-pad, pressure-suit and oxygen supplies.","Return normal-grade iridium, osmium, uraninite and wolframite ore from Mercury’s basalt veins, plus raw Solerium from its native ore. These cargoes feed advanced metallurgy, nuclear fuel and aerospace manufacture; Silk Touch ore blocks are not required."]
	quest.077A070000000001.quest_subtitle: "The glyphs are coordinates, and the structures form a transportation network."
	quest.077A070000000001.title: "Celestial Addressing"
	quest.077A080000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft five Mercurian Coordinates packs with four paper, one Mercury Stone, two compasses, one recovered Red Sandstone Cartouche and one Quantum Circuit.","Complete FRN-04D — Address Geometry and craft the unlocked Communication Crystal.","You can now describe how a gate would dial; you still cannot build the gate."]
	quest.077A080000000001.quest_subtitle: "Knowing an address is not the same as opening a wormhole."
	quest.077A080000000001.title: "Address Geometry"
	quest.077A090000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Complete FRN-04E — Stargate Reconstruction after controlled fusion, superconductors, quantum computation, extreme metrology, and all four Solar-System evidence lines are ready."
		"Use the synthetic Naquadah bootstrap route to assemble a Classic Stargate and Classic DHD before any Abydos resource can be reached."
		"This is the first functional gate. Solar-System travel remains rocket territory."
	]
	quest.077A090000000001.quest_subtitle: "Age 15 industry answers the mystery that began on the Moon."
	quest.077A090000000001.title: "Reconstruct the Impossible"
	quest.077A0A0000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Power the reconstructed Stargate, verify the return plan, and make Abydos the first legitimate dial."
		"Complete both SGJourney's wormhole-travel and Abydos-visit advancements; reaching Abydos by command or unrelated portal is not the intended proof."
		"Do not use the gate as a shortcut to Moon, Mars, Venus, or Mercury."
	]
	quest.077A0A0000000001.quest_subtitle: "The Solar System was the tutorial for the galaxy."
	quest.077A0A0000000001.title: "First Dial — Abydos"
	quest.077A0B0000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Find an intact Abydos cartouche in newly generated terrain and recover its Sandstone Cartouche block."
		"Abydos supplies geological Naquadah and the first trustworthy archive of additional Milky Way destinations."
		"The archive opens two expedition branches rather than dumping every address at once."
	]
	quest.077A0B0000000001.quest_subtitle: "Abydos is one node in a network that still spans the stars."
	quest.077A0B0000000001.title: "The Network"
	quest.077A0C0000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Dial Chulak from the Abydos branch and establish a protected return route."
		"Survey its fortified living culture, military archaeology, Jaffa sites, and cartouche traditions for the lead toward Rima."
	]
	quest.077A0C0000000001.quest_subtitle: "Some Stargate civilizations survived far longer than the Solar-System ruins."
	quest.077A0C0000000001.title: "Branching Address — Chulak"
	quest.077A0D0000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Dial Unitas from the Abydos branch and document its ruined industrial civilization."
		"Recover its metallurgical and heavy-engineering history, then follow the extraction records toward Cavum Tenebrae."
	]
	quest.077A0D0000000001.quest_subtitle: "Alien industry leaves process evidence even after its operators disappear."
	quest.077A0D0000000001.title: "Branching Address — Unitas"
	quest.077A0E0000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Follow the Chulak records to Rima and survey its radioactive, anomalous ecology."
		"Carry independent dosimetry, containment, and return power; environmental consequences are part of the archaeological record."
	]
	quest.077A0E0000000001.quest_subtitle: "A lost world can be both a scientific archive and a warning."
	quest.077A0E0000000001.title: "Lost World — Rima"
	quest.077A0F0000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Follow the Unitas extraction records into Cavum Tenebrae."
		"Establish a subterranean expedition for PGM, Iridium, and Osmium resources while tracing the buried industrial network that once moved them."
	]
	quest.077A0F0000000001.quest_subtitle: "The deepest mines conceal the oldest network infrastructure."
	quest.077A0F0000000001.title: "Lost World — Cavum Tenebrae"
	quest.077A100000000001.quest_desc: [
		"After both Milky Way branches are proven, dial Tollan and recover its preserved address theory."
		"Tollan is a knowledge destination, not another bulk-resource checklist. Completion awards one Advanced Memory Crystal containing the records required for the Tollan Records research pack."
		"Reserve that crystal; consuming it anywhere else requires another recovery route."
	]
	quest.077A100000000001.quest_subtitle: "Seven chevrons describe one galaxy; Tollan proves the network reaches farther."
	quest.077A100000000001.title: "Tollan Knowledge"
	quest.077A110000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Encode the awarded Tollan memory crystal into a Tollan Records pack with quantum computation and the established Milky Way gate model."
		"Complete FRN-04F — The Eighth Chevron, then craft its Advanced Control Crystal and Pegasus DHD proof items."
		"This research opens a new galactic address space; it is not merely another gate variant recipe."
	]
	quest.077A110000000001.quest_subtitle: "The network crosses the void between galaxies."
	quest.077A110000000001.title: "The Eighth Chevron"
	quest.077A120000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Use the intergalactic address solution to reach Athos and establish the first Pegasus foothold."
		"Treat it as a forward operating base: verify biological resources, independent logistics, power, and a return route before continuing."
	]
	quest.077A120000000001.quest_subtitle: "Athos proves that intergalactic logistics can survive beyond a single dial."
	quest.077A120000000001.title: "Pegasus Foothold — Athos"
	quest.077A130000000001.quest_desc: [
		"From the Athos foothold, reach Lantea and locate an Ancient ocean outpost in newly generated terrain."
		"Document its advanced crystal and dimensional infrastructure as the culmination of the Stargate archaeological campaign."
		"Lantea now bridges Stargate knowledge into Infinity-era reality engineering."
	]
	quest.077A130000000001.quest_subtitle: "The Solar System was only the beginning."
	quest.077A130000000001.title: "City of the Ancients — Lantea"
	quest.078B010000000001.quest_desc: ["Return to Lantea with a fathometer. Its 256-block sea column makes depth a measured engineering hazard."]
	quest.078B010000000001.quest_subtitle: "Arrival begins with measurement, not conquest."
	quest.078B010000000001.title: "Hostile Ocean Arrival"
	quest.078B020000000001.quest_desc: ["Build rated viewing material and a hull barometer before committing crews below the shallow-water envelope."]
	quest.078B020000000001.quest_subtitle: "Pressure is the first design load."
	quest.078B020000000001.title: "Rate the Hull"
	quest.078B030000000001.quest_desc: ["Commission ballast, propulsion, electrolysis, and atmosphere circulation as one submarine life-support system."]
	quest.078B030000000001.quest_subtitle: "A vessel is a moving factory boundary."
	quest.078B030000000001.title: "Commission a Submarine"
	quest.078B040000000001.quest_desc: ["Join surface cargo docks to subsea cable and pulley infrastructure. Ships feed the outpost; submarines and lifts reach the floor.", "After the Lantea expedition, unload eight oxyhelium on Terra. This records returned native subsea supply rather than only owning a boat and cable."]
	quest.078B040000000001.quest_subtitle: "The water column becomes a logistics network."
	quest.078B040000000001.title: "Subsea Supply Chain"
	quest.078B050000000001.quest_desc: ["Extract Lantean certus quartz and abyssal oxyhelium. Both justify repeated industrial voyages and permanent local capacity.","Survey submerged stone ceilings in Lantea's Bioshroom Caves and Prismachasm. Oxyhelium hangs down into water; harvest its native buds and retain support stems for later collection. New expeditions must reach newly generated terrain for the corrected habitat."]
	quest.078B050000000001.quest_subtitle: "The abyss must feed the wider civilization."
	quest.078B050000000001.title: "Abyssal Extraction"
	quest.078B060000000001.quest_desc: ["Install decompression, alarms, and permanent light. This is a maintained settlement, not a disposable landing camp.", "Bring decompression, alarm and oxygen-diffuser service spares plus four oxyhelium below Y 33 on Lantea after the native deep-dive milestone. This detects service stock at depth; verify the installed base pressure, decompression and power continuity separately."]
	quest.078B060000000001.quest_subtitle: "Remain, maintain, and expand."
	quest.078B060000000001.title: "Permanent Deep-Sea Base"
	quest.078B070000000001.quest_desc: ["Bring recovered abyssal amethyst into the titanium, computation and submarine instrument industries to build sonar, underwater mines, and shielded naval infrastructure.","Lantea's native eels can drop treasure pouches; those pouches can contain abyssal amethyst. These are chance rewards from the existing ocean fauna, so provision repeated voyages and protect the return cargo."]
	quest.078B070000000001.quest_subtitle: "Ocean logistics eventually require defended routes."
	quest.078B070000000001.title: "Fortify the Shipping Lanes"
	quest.079535A07FBDF71A.quest_desc: ["Craft high covalence dust and the Stone. Ordinary conversions remain physical and taxed."]
	quest.079535A07FBDF71A.quest_subtitle: "Matter becomes fungible only after chemical and arcane proof."
	quest.079535A07FBDF71A.title: "Philosopher's Stone and High Covalence"
	quest.07A31A9A4492C18F.quest_desc: [
		"Use Age 9 chemical control to craft a Philosopher's Stone and prepare High Covalence Dust through the live ProjectE route."
		"Establish the exchange law in writing: only learned ordinary matter may move through EMC, every conversion pays a visible tax, and engineering proof remains physical."
	]
	quest.07A31A9A4492C18F.quest_subtitle: "Alchemical exchange begins when matter has a known origin, a measured value, and a real loss."
	quest.07A31A9A4492C18F.title: "Age 9 — Discover and Establish Alchemical Exchange"
	quest.07B149407A13A6AC.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Mekanism turbine casing at the power-conversion site."
		"Plan steam input, condensate or coolant return, output power, relief capacity, and a maintenance aisle before assembly."
	]
	quest.07B149407A13A6AC.quest_subtitle: "The turbine hall must be sized for the reactor you run, not the reactor you hope to run later."
	quest.07B149407A13A6AC.title: "Turbine Hall"
	quest.07C42795A9A676E6.quest_desc: [
		"Stock thirty-two charcoal and eight TFC garlic."
		"Keep clean water, food, a bed, and ventilation available, and seek safer shelter before exposure worsens."
	]
	quest.07C42795A9A676E6.quest_subtitle: "Charcoal and garlic support warmth and meals in a sickroom without pretending either is magical medicine."
	quest.07C42795A9A676E6.title: "Stock the Warm Recovery Room"
	quest.07D6107F8A83258B.quest_desc: [
		"Sneak-Use logs to form connected Log Piles, then surround every outside face with solid, nonflammable blocks."
		"Light one exposed pile, immediately seal that opening, and wait until smoke stops before uncovering. Use a shovel to collect the charcoal."
	]
	quest.07D6107F8A83258B.quest_subtitle: "A sealed log pile turns gathered wood into dependable high-temperature fuel."
	quest.07D6107F8A83258B.title: "Make Charcoal Repeatable"
	quest.07DA54624831C405.quest_desc: [
		"Build copper saw."
		"Cast and haft the copper saw, then use it to turn logs into the lumber needed at the mining camp."
	]
	quest.07DA54624831C405.quest_subtitle: "A copper saw turns the mine’s wood demand into measured lumber instead of whole logs."
	quest.07DA54624831C405.title: "Saw Lumber for the Mining Camp"
	quest.07FFD57D5A1F33CE.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four MI digital circuit boards from current raw and intermediate supplies."
		"Use physical buffers through the entire route and only reconnect automated demand after the line is stable."
	]
	quest.07FFD57D5A1F33CE.quest_subtitle: "Four fresh circuit boards confirm the MI electronics line still works without an AE2 shortcut."
	quest.07FFD57D5A1F33CE.title: "Rebuild Digital Boards from Feedstock"
	quest.0805E46BFACC635A.quest_desc: ["Build a district that supplies industrial fuel and chemistry to every later factory.","Assemble and place the TFMG coke oven, then observe a sealed coal-carbonization batch.","Route coke and carbon-dioxide process gas before loading the oven. TFMG does not make creosote in Createch 2.","Use a TFC workbench in the mechanical crafter recipe, alongside one brass casing and one electron tube. Each craft yields one crafter; prepare enough for the pattern you intend to assemble.","For the first crushing-wheel pattern, arrange nine mechanical crafters in a 3 by 3 grid. Point each row toward the right column and that column toward the bottom-right output. A dedicated small water wheel supplies 8 SU at 8 RPM: use five small-to-large cog reductions to reach 0.25 RPM, where nine crafters consume 4.5 SU within the andesite limit. Keep other loads outside this drive.","Place the crushing-wheel pair one block apart with parallel axes and opposite inward rotation. Give each wheel its own 8 RPM small-water-wheel drive: each wheel consumes 4 SU of its source’s 8 SU. Feed and collect through chutes. The first quartz route uses the andesite millstone instead: drive its bottom shaft at 8 RPM through an andesite gearbox from another small wheel, leaving 4 SU of capacity. Feed raw quartzite from above and collect the result with an empty hand.","Survey native quartzite, clear the six adjacent spaces and let TFC drop the isolated raw block automatically; ordinary direct mining produces loose rock. Mill raw quartzite for quartz at a 5% chance per 50-tick run, allowing repeated zero-result runs. Quartz from the crushing recipe is an optional secondary output reserved for stainless-steel-tier or higher wheels.","Use the native TFMG silicon furnace after establishing the mined-coal coking line. Build three complete 3 by 3 layers: twelve fireproof-brick corner supports, twelve fireproof-brick wall blocks including the floor center, one outward-facing bottom-side output and one hatch above the top center. Leave the two upper center cells clear. This quartz recipe needs coke dust fuel and no hot-air tuyere. Recover three quartz through the earlier quartzite milling route, process them into 120 mB liquid silicon, and pipe 90 mB to the casting basin for one ingot; retain the remaining 30 mB.","Connect coke and refractory production to iron processing, then establish petroleum separation, rubber and lubricant storage. Give every process output a destination before increasing throughput.","The first distillation controller still assembles on the existing foundry. Steel machinery must not be required to obtain its own petroleum support. Keep ordinary rubber, coke and lubricant in production after advanced polymers arrive."]
	quest.0805E46BFACC635A.quest_subtitle: "TFMG owns heavy-industry carbonization and process gas, not rail creosote."
	quest.0805E46BFACC635A.title: "Coke Oven District"
	quest.0809AB3E724C9978.quest_desc: [
		"Build and store four bronze rotors."
		"Replenish their ring and plate inputs afterward so using a spare does not empty the next repair tier."
	]
	quest.0809AB3E724C9978.quest_subtitle: "Four spare rotors let the first factory survive wear without returning to hand processing."
	quest.0809AB3E724C9978.title: "Stock Spare Bronze Rotors"
	quest.080BC37A71F8863F.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the Eternal Starlight starcore block in the Astral workcell."
		"Keep it in contained storage with a defined input and output route for later seeded processing."
	]
	quest.080BC37A71F8863F.quest_subtitle: "The starcore workcell becomes real when one placed sample can be handled without consuming its provenance."
	quest.080BC37A71F8863F.title: "Operate the Starcore Workcell"
	quest.081F382E5FEA2995.quest_desc: [
		"Build four control-rod assemblies after completing the radiation-meter and PPE branch."
		"Install manual and logic shutdown paths, verify coolant and waste capacity, and begin at the lowest useful burn rate."
	]
	quest.081F382E5FEA2995.quest_subtitle: "Control rods become permission to operate only after independent meters and isotope PPE already exist."
	quest.081F382E5FEA2995.title: "Authorize Reactor Operation"
	quest.0823DFC8C79A1D46.quest_desc: ["Contain the singularity with vibrant glass, fluix pearls, and the first Quantum circuit in the MI Assembler.","Install the second Quantum circuit and Engineering Processor, stabilize the workpiece with UU Matter on the Create line, and test both sides before trusting remote storage.","Finish the Quantum Link sequence on a Rhodium-Plated Palladium Press or higher. Controlled fusion now feeds a sulfur-and-copper rhodium cell; the PGM refinery supplies palladium and platinum. Form the first RPP stock on the tungsten-steel floor, and obtain LuV control computers from the cleanroom circuit campus. Keep those suppliers running for additional links."]
	quest.0823DFC8C79A1D46.quest_subtitle: "An AE2 Quantum Bridge makes distance a network condition instead of a cable length."
	quest.0823DFC8C79A1D46.title: "AE2 Quantum Bridge"
	quest.083A27A23EE346E8.quest_desc: [
		"Observe the TFMG coke oven through another completed batch."
		"Confirm coal enters continuously and every coke, gas, or liquid output leaves without manual clearing."
	]
	quest.083A27A23EE346E8.quest_subtitle: "One complete coke batch reveals every output the first firing allowed you to ignore."
	quest.083A27A23EE346E8.title: "Watch the Coke Oven Finish a Batch"
	quest.0863C18CB67C4313.quest_desc: [
		"Produce one Infinity nugget."
		"Before spending it, confirm the catalyst, singularity, matrix, neutron, and Quantum inputs can all be made again."
	]
	quest.0863C18CB67C4313.quest_subtitle: "The first Infinity nugget is the quiet moment when the whole factory fits into one inventory slot."
	quest.0863C18CB67C4313.title: "Produce the First Infinity Nugget"
	quest.086B7F4E67494272.quest_desc: [
		"Lay out the reactor boundary, glass reserve, and eight Nuclear Alloy Plates before fuel loading."
		"The plate batch retains a first plate and grants measured precision savings without erasing zirconium, iridium, platinum, boron, or the mixed-plate route."
	]
	quest.086B7F4E67494272.quest_subtitle: "A visible casing boundary and glass reserve force fuel, coolant, control, waste, and evacuation onto the plan."
	quest.086B7F4E67494272.title: "Lay Out the Nuclear Complex"
	quest.086C9BB82624C4F9.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen MI steel plates and sixteen MI steel rods."
		"Separate structural stock from precision mechanisms so construction cannot empty the LV preparation shelves."
	]
	quest.086C9BB82624C4F9.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen plates and rods form the ordinary structural language of the expanding factory."
	quest.086C9BB82624C4F9.title: "Structural Plate Rack"
	quest.0879EE2CB9AFE1B1.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and store sixteen MI steel rods from the approved steel stream."
		"Keep them with pump spares instead of consuming the entire batch on expansion."
	]
	quest.0879EE2CB9AFE1B1.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen steel rods cover pump shafts, frames, and the repairs between them."
	quest.0879EE2CB9AFE1B1.title: "Stock Pump and Frame Rods"
	quest.08802334BAA9018C.quest_desc: [
		"Deliberately fill the electric macerator output until the machine stops without spilling or damaging the line."
		"Disable the Modern Dynamics extractor, clear the destination, restore sixteen item pipes to repair stock, and restart under observation. Programmable factory control comes later through CC:Tweaked."
	]
	quest.08802334BAA9018C.quest_subtitle: "A blocked enclosed line is safe only when its isolation and restart procedure are understood."
	quest.08802334BAA9018C.title: "Recover a Modern Dynamics Line Jam"
	quest.088A2813D0ACCAF2.quest_desc: [
		"Synthesize PAN precursor, stabilize and carbonize the fibers, then bind them with epoxy resin."
		"Four composite sheets prove the laboratory can supply repeatable specialty materials."
	]
	quest.088A2813D0ACCAF2.quest_subtitle: "Carbon fiber and epoxy turn a chemical plant into structural materials production."
	quest.088A2813D0ACCAF2.title: "Composite Materials"
	quest.0898C2F97628F439.quest_desc: [
		"Fire a second large vessel for homestead-scale storage."
		"Dry the larger clay mass completely, then give it a fully covered pit firing."
	]
	quest.0898C2F97628F439.quest_subtitle: "A second large vessel expands the homestead pantry beyond the first camp-scale store."
	quest.0898C2F97628F439.title: "Fire a Homestead-Scale Storage Vessel"
	quest.08ACD10B84F19375.quest_desc: ["Use the steel steam packer: three tin wires and six industrial rubber sheets make three cables.","Follow the native LV turbine recipe. The turbine consumes steam and produces MI EU; use the converter boundary for exchange with the EE grid."]
	quest.08ACD10B84F19375.quest_subtitle: "Steam crossing this turbine becomes the first electricity the factory is expected to trust."
	quest.08ACD10B84F19375.title: "LV Steam Turbine"
	quest.08E09986F1C1EF63.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the MI bronze boiler and stock sixteen bronze plates."
		"The milestone reward is decorative; Heavy Industry still depends on coke, refractory, oil, rubber, and real freight."
	]
	quest.08E09986F1C1EF63.quest_subtitle: "A working bronze boiler and sixteen plates show the steam hall can operate and reproduce its own structure."
	quest.08E09986F1C1EF63.title: "Bronze Steam Line Online"
	quest.08EF4DC9F0013FA3.quest_desc: [
		"Enter the Stellaris Space biome during a prepared transit."
		"Track fuel, oxygen, navigation, and the distance to the nearest safe landing rather than treating empty space as harmless."
	]
	quest.08EF4DC9F0013FA3.quest_subtitle: "Crossing the space biome confirms the route between planetary landmarks is itself an operating environment."
	quest.08EF4DC9F0013FA3.title: "Space Biome Transit"
	quest.08EFE63BC1D6AFF3.quest_desc: [
		"Build an MI advanced machine casing, then its advanced machine hull through the live recipes."
		"Keep aluminum plate, electronic circuits, silicon batteries, Electro Energetics connectors, desh, and tharsite available for replacements."
	]
	quest.08EFE63BC1D6AFF3.quest_subtitle: "The advanced hull gives MV machinery a common frame built from aluminum and space-returned parts."
	quest.08EFE63BC1D6AFF3.title: "Advanced Machine Hull"
	quest.08F38A8D9B9C4FBD.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an AE2 molecular assembler beside the post-Chainer pattern provider."
		"Its recipe keeps Processing control and a calibrated relay visible; encode one stable craft and test repeated output before loading a library of patterns."
	]
	quest.08F38A8D9B9C4FBD.quest_subtitle: "The molecular assembler handles shaped work cleanly when patterns, channels, and output capacity are explicit."
	quest.08F38A8D9B9C4FBD.title: "Molecular Assembler Cell"
	quest.08F811F25BA3B5C3.quest_desc: [
		"Knapp any native stone tool head, then craft it with a stick or twig to complete TFC’s Stone Age advancement."
		"A stone knife is the strongest first choice because it harvests straw; an axe is needed for logs."
	]
	quest.08F811F25BA3B5C3.quest_subtitle: "Knapping a head and attaching a stick opens the working tier ledger."
	quest.08F811F25BA3B5C3.title: "Shape a Stone Tool"
	quest.092B1A04FC93296D.quest_desc: [
		"Find and hold four legitimate copper indicators."
		"Native copper, malachite, and tetrahedrite all count in their small or mined graded forms. Record the host rock; surface evidence points toward a buried vein."
	]
	quest.092B1A04FC93296D.quest_subtitle: "Surface copper is a direction to investigate, not a vein by itself."
	quest.092B1A04FC93296D.title: "Mark Copper Indicators"
	quest.092D0BAB89F1F9E0.quest_desc: ["Return thirty-two lunar regolith and retain two MI iridium ingots.", "The capstone reward does not provide nuclear monitoring or reactor components; those remain the next system.", "Bring eight raw platinum into your Terra inventory after the lunar mining proof. The yard then has a recurring cargo contract for PGM contacts, aerospace control and later nuclear/precision manufacturing."]
	quest.092D0BAB89F1F9E0.quest_subtitle: "A regolith cargo backed by iridium proves navigation, landing, loading, and return can all repeat."
	quest.092D0BAB89F1F9E0.title: "Commission the Moon Freight Route"
	quest.09485D430EB88FEF.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen MI superconductor wires."
		"The wiremill makes two per ingot; protect the stock from unrestricted autocrafting."
	]
	quest.09485D430EB88FEF.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen wires feed the corrected MI cable route; transformer cores remain Electro Energetics switchgear instead of becoming Quantum cable stock."
	quest.09485D430EB88FEF.title: "Stock Field-Winding Wire"
	quest.09593A41C8AFBD75.quest_desc: [
		"Place the MI electric compressor and complete a useful forming recipe."
		"Provide dedicated input and output buffers, then verify its demand does not brown out the macerator or water pump."
	]
	quest.09593A41C8AFBD75.quest_subtitle: "The electric compressor brings repeatable forming work onto the first measured power system."
	quest.09593A41C8AFBD75.title: "Add an Electric Compressor"
	quest.0971DD094AF6398D.quest_desc: [
		"Buffer eight thousand millibuckets of TFMG lubrication oil and eight cured natural-rubber sheets."
		"Replace both from active production before releasing the reserve."
	]
	quest.0971DD094AF6398D.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of lubrication oil and eight rubber sheets make a practical petrochemical maintenance batch."
	quest.0971DD094AF6398D.title: "Buffer Lubricant and Rubber"
	quest.0989D998D50A0493.quest_desc: [
		"Obtain and stock sixteen AE2 certus quartz crystals through the live discovery or growth route."
		"Preserve some crystals while grinding others, because presses, processors, dust, and growth all draw from the same supply."
	]
	quest.0989D998D50A0493.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen certus crystals are enough to begin processor work without treating the first meteor as a warehouse."
	quest.0989D998D50A0493.title: "Certus Quartz Supply"
	quest.09935DE852B3D01A.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a shield generator assigned to the three-shift containment reserve."
		"Verify its stored energy and crystal supply, and keep its protected power plan separate from reactor cooling loads."
	]
	quest.09935DE852B3D01A.quest_subtitle: "A dedicated shield reserve keeps containment from borrowing the last energy from reactor cooling."
	quest.09935DE852B3D01A.title: "Charge the Three-Shift Shield Reserve"
	quest.09953DB83DB1F565.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Rocketnautics copper nozzles through the current installed recipe."
		"Use the pair to verify the fabrication route and retain one as an inspection reference."
	]
	quest.09953DB83DB1F565.quest_subtitle: "Two copper nozzles give thrust work a measured prototype before scarce titanium enters the design."
	quest.09953DB83DB1F565.title: "Prototype the Rocket Nozzle"
	quest.09AC68AE662EB766.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight bronze gears through a current MI material recipe."
		"Choose a route your steam hall can repeat and keep rings, bolts, and plate stock separated for other repairs."
	]
	quest.09AC68AE662EB766.quest_subtitle: "Eight gears prove shaped bronze parts can follow the same standard repeatedly."
	quest.09AC68AE662EB766.title: "Standardize Bronze Gears"
	quest.09B0371253FF1CA0.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Stellaris rocket station after returning the first planetary cargo."
		"Give it protected cable, cargo staging, fuel access, and a clear transfer path to the pad."
	]
	quest.09B0371253FF1CA0.quest_subtitle: "The rocket station turns launch hardware into a route that can be scheduled, loaded, and repeated."
	quest.09B0371253FF1CA0.title: "Station and Rover Planning"
	quest.09DA0EFC9C85F330.quest_desc: ["Give the factory a protected electrical service, then attach useful loads.","Produce four MI analog circuits through COM-01 using Create electron tubes, TFMG copper spools, tin, redstone and industrial rubber.","Keep vacuum tubes and conductors buffered for motors, machine hulls and launch support. Semiconductor transistors remain inputs to later electronic controls and mature batches.","Keep the refinery supplying insulation and lubricant and the foundry supplying conductors and motor parts. Meter the EE supply, protect its conductors, and place the converter at the boundary to FE machinery.","Electric circuit and motor batches relieve repeated component crafting. Commission one load at a time and reserve a way to restart generation; owning a converter does not make a safe or functioning grid."]
	quest.09DA0EFC9C85F330.quest_subtitle: "Terrestrial analog controls turn petroleum electronics and metalwork into LV machinery."
	quest.09DA0EFC9C85F330.title: "Analog Control Line"
	quest.09F4F2BEE517E878.quest_desc: [
		"Build and inspect an MI plasma turbine."
		"Provide clear plasma input, output handling, and a grid connection sized for generation at this scale."
	]
	quest.09F4F2BEE517E878.quest_subtitle: "The plasma leaving fusion is still an industrial fluid; the turbine makes its violence useful."
	quest.09F4F2BEE517E878.title: "Plasma Turbine"
	quest.09FD7508F3C8FDDE.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the neutron compressor that anchors the megaforge district."
		"Keep collector output moving into protected storage and leave room for the extreme-crafting work that follows."
	]
	quest.09FD7508F3C8FDDE.quest_subtitle: "The neutron compressor becomes planetary infrastructure when slow collectors can feed it without hand carrying every pile."
	quest.09FD7508F3C8FDDE.title: "Commission the Planetary Megaforge"
	quest.09FDB3E8F5BFDD83.quest_desc: [
		"Place and power the mechanical press, then remain nearby through a complete working cycle."
		"Give pressed parts an output space so a finished item cannot stall the next input."
	]
	quest.09FDB3E8F5BFDD83.quest_subtitle: "Watching one full press cycle reveals whether input, power, and output actually agree."
	quest.09FDB3E8F5BFDD83.title: "Watch the Press Complete a Cycle"
	quest.0A35E553B53C11B8.quest_desc: [
		"Use the verified catalyst production to craft an Infinity Ingot."
		"Keep the remaining reserve intact and leave a complete record for the next deliberate build."
	]
	quest.0A35E553B53C11B8.quest_subtitle: "Turning the audited catalyst lot into an ingot closes the final loop without hiding any of its cost."
	quest.0A35E553B53C11B8.title: "Convert the Catalyst Audit into an Ingot"
	quest.0A38BAB96AC33D42.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect a working MI fusion reactor and plasma turbine together."
		"Confirm confinement, plasma transfer, grid protection, and alternate control power before calling the array commissioned."
	]
	quest.0A38BAB96AC33D42.quest_subtitle: "The stellar array is simply fusion made dependable enough to disappear into the background."
	quest.0A38BAB96AC33D42.title: "Commission the Stellar Power Array"
	quest.0A503177E33387EA.quest_desc: ["Recover an Eternal Starlight starcore through legitimate exploration or structure loot and bring it home.","Quarantine the first sample and record its source before using it to seed later scaling.","After your first Gatekeeper trial, recover and open the native reward to obtain an Orb of Prophecy. Use the reusable Orb on the Portal Ruins frame, mark both portals and keep the passage intact for your return.","In Starlight Forest, mine grimstone Starcore and Deepsilver ores below Y=0 with a bronze TFC pickaxe or better, without Silk Touch. Starcore drops directly; smelt raw Deepsilver for ingots. Return these supplies to the existing superconductor works."]
	quest.0A503177E33387EA.quest_subtitle: "The first starcore is evidence from somewhere genuinely alien, not yet another factory intermediate."
	quest.0A503177E33387EA.title: "Starcore Returns"
	quest.0A6C53082103E54A.quest_desc: ["Deliver 1,000,000 FE into an FTB Quests Task Screen. The counter consumes delivered energy and does not measure connected storage."]
	quest.0A6C53082103E54A.quest_subtitle: "One million stored FE proves the yard can buffer a working load instead of merely holding loose batteries."
	quest.0A6C53082103E54A.title: "Deliver a Megajoule"
	quest.0A8073D8F00EA64E.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a hand crank and spare shaft at the drive end of the workshop."
		"Turn disconnected sections by hand to check alignment before reconnecting the full water-powered load."
	]
	quest.0A8073D8F00EA64E.quest_subtitle: "The black-start kit lets an idle transmission prove itself before the load returns."
	quest.0A8073D8F00EA64E.title: "Build the Black-Start Kit"
	quest.0A817EE2BA7D85FB.quest_desc: ["Integrate the fusion chambers, Quantum hull, Quantum circuit, superconductor cable, and cryofluid in the MI Assembler to create the chamber-bank workpiece.","Install the second Quantum circuit, plutonium battery, coil bank, chamber, hull, heat exchanger, grid breaker, TFMG generator, cryogenic service, and final containment closure on the Create line before placing the native reactor.","Mechanical commissioning: finish the fusion reactor on a Tungsten-Steel Greate Press or higher. Supply the sequence from the existing quantum-circuit, superconductor, nuclear-alloy and heat-exchanger industries. Keep the previous reactor and power system available for commissioning."]
	quest.0A817EE2BA7D85FB.quest_subtitle: "Fusion turns a fuel problem into a confinement problem measured in heat, field strength, and uninterrupted power."
	quest.0A817EE2BA7D85FB.title: "MI Fusion Reactor"
	quest.0A8BCEFA2AB80684.quest_desc: [
		"Build four Mekanism fission fuel assemblies through the live nuclear recipe."
		"Do not load the reactor until monitoring, PPE, coolant, waste storage, logic, and manual shutdown are ready."
	]
	quest.0A8BCEFA2AB80684.quest_subtitle: "Four fuel assemblies turn enriched material into a reactor geometry that still needs control and cooling."
	quest.0A8BCEFA2AB80684.title: "Fission Fuel Assemblies"
	quest.0A9CDCB37BBA2E9E.quest_desc: ["Combine a powered chimney pump with the ENV-02 aerometer once Digital-era emissions instrumentation is available.","Earlier chimney capture and LV power remain useful. The aerometer is a later measurement capability, separate from constructing the first electrical service."]
	quest.0A9CDCB37BBA2E9E.quest_subtitle: "Ventilation is now an electrical load with a black-start procedure."
	quest.0A9CDCB37BBA2E9E.title: "Instrumented Emissions Control"
	quest.0AA25E949D1B6390.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight Rubberworks rubber sheets through the plantation route."
		"Replenish resin or raw rubber and keep sheets away from unrestricted progression crafting."
	]
	quest.0AA25E949D1B6390.quest_subtitle: "Eight cured natural-rubber sheets connect tapped-tree feed to the seals and belts heavy industry consumes."
	quest.0AA25E949D1B6390.title: "Rubber Supply"
	quest.0AB6D0CC350EED1C.quest_desc: [
		"Store eight AE2 engineering processors and eight stainless-steel ingots."
		"Keep the reserve in physical storage with the presses and redstone needed to replace it."
	]
	quest.0AB6D0CC350EED1C.quest_subtitle: "Eight engineering processors and stainless ingots reserve the hardware needed to rebuild storage and crafting."
	quest.0AB6D0CC350EED1C.title: "Engineering Processor Reserve"
	quest.0ABD6A56F73EBB80.quest_desc: [
		"Search wet ground and shorelines for TFC clay plants and exposed clay, then collect clay balls."
		"Keep enough for a vessel and both ingot and pickaxe-head molds before leaving the deposit."
	]
	quest.0ABD6A56F73EBB80.quest_subtitle: "Clay deposits turn the camp into durable storage and casting infrastructure."
	quest.0ABD6A56F73EBB80.title: "Find Clay"
	quest.0ADD8B1590469343.quest_desc: [
		"Retain eight cured Rubberworks sheets, then build the MI Distillery after electronic circuits and LV machine parts exist."
		"Choose one live oil fraction in EMI, provide the stated voltage, and give its selected output dedicated storage before starting the batch."
	]
	quest.0ADD8B1590469343.quest_subtitle: "The MI Distillery requires the LV component line that its old Heavy Industry placement lacked."
	quest.0ADD8B1590469343.title: "Feed Rubber into Electric Distillation"
	quest.0AE33BC31290CD84.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare sixteen TFMG fireclay through the installed heavy-industry route."
		"Keep clay, refractory inputs, and fired products separated so the next structure does not consume the working batch."
	]
	quest.0AE33BC31290CD84.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen fireclay turns the hot side of the district from a sketch into construction stock."
	quest.0AE33BC31290CD84.title: "Fireclay and Refractory"
	quest.0B137C08641718E7.quest_desc: ["Commission the large electric macerator as the bulk-processing anchor for high-pressure ores. Its assembly retains four ordinary electric macerators and adds a pair of Greate aluminum crushing wheels and an aluminum gearbox.","Keep the earlier crusher district, motor shop, polymer works and lubricant reserve supplying it. Inspect the native multiblock shape and provide power, separate output buffers and room to service a stopped line."]
	quest.0B137C08641718E7.quest_subtitle: "Required discipline mastery — contributes to the canonical age proof."
	quest.0B137C08641718E7.title: "Mass Processing Ready"
	quest.0B14230D1C03E98D.quest_desc: [
		"Place the steel boiler on a buffered water and fuel line, then inspect it during a controlled run."
		"Connect a useful steam load and reserve shutdown space before increasing throughput."
	]
	quest.0B14230D1C03E98D.quest_subtitle: "The steel boiler raises steam capacity only after water, fuel, and relief storage grow with it."
	quest.0B14230D1C03E98D.title: "Steel Boiler Line"
	quest.0B1605697FB15D81.quest_desc: ["After completing the Superconductor material quest, infuse 1 Ender Eye with 4 Blazing Quartz, 2 Malignant Pewter Ingots, 1 Dosimeter, and 1 Superconductor Plate.","Supply 16 Aerial, 16 Arcane, and 12 Sacred spirits. The infusion yields four Seeking Eyes for locating deeper Starlight structures and bosses; they are not used to enter the dimension."]
	quest.0B1605697FB15D81.quest_subtitle: "Seeking Eyes are post-entry navigation tools made only after the Starlight-fed superconductor line is proven."
	quest.0B1605697FB15D81.title: "Seeking Eyes for Deep Expeditions"
	quest.0B1EFF0CED56336E.quest_desc: [
		"Produce 4 brass ingot."
		"Heat three copper ingots and one zinc ingot in a basin with the foundry lid; the lid returns with four brass ingots."
	]
	quest.0B1EFF0CED56336E.quest_subtitle: "Foundry brass gives Create the material it needs to begin precise control."
	quest.0B1EFF0CED56336E.title: "Make Foundry Brass"
	quest.0B43C7371D48D3E1.quest_desc: [
		"Restore thirty-two coal coke and eight rubber sheets after a simulated shutdown."
		"Begin from coal, fresh resin, and Rubberworks rubber rather than consuming the repair inventory."
	]
	quest.0B43C7371D48D3E1.quest_subtitle: "Coke and rubber stock let the district recover before the next pump or seal fails."
	quest.0B43C7371D48D3E1.title: "Restart Coke and Rubber"
	quest.0B5A5B1254EE88FF.quest_desc: ["Assemble the TFMG tower from its controller, steel fluid tanks and one output for every cut. Supply crude from a surveyed petroleum province and isolate each product buffer.","For the first run, feed Railcraft creosote from the coke works into a TFMG firebox below the tower. Connect its exhaust to an exhaust outlet; a full exhaust buffer stops firing. Creosote primes the refinery before it has distilled its own fuel.","Prime the controller with the earlier steam-mixed lubricant. Once the tower runs, collect fuels and naphtha separately; keep the coke works, rail tank yard and refinery linked by labeled transfer lines."]
	quest.0B5A5B1254EE88FF.quest_subtitle: "Distillation begins when crude input and every separated output have somewhere safe to go."
	quest.0B5A5B1254EE88FF.title: "Commission the Oil Distillation Unit"
	quest.0B6341EA11DF8D0C.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen cabbages and sixty-four charcoal."
		"Rotate food by age and keep heating fuel away from the active kitchen fire."
	]
	quest.0B6341EA11DF8D0C.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen cabbages and a stack of charcoal carry the homestead through a poor weather interval."
	quest.0B6341EA11DF8D0C.title: "Buffer Harvest and Hearth"
	quest.0B75AB968BC64D7A.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four MI digital circuits and sixteen stainless-steel ingots."
		"Run both lines from current feedstock and keep their intermediate buffers visible to the network."
	]
	quest.0B75AB968BC64D7A.quest_subtitle: "Four circuits and sixteen ingots made again prove the network does not consume the factory beneath it."
	quest.0B75AB968BC64D7A.title: "Repeat Stainless Digital Control"
	quest.0B76CFAC2BB0A49F.quest_desc: ["Commission the fusion reactor only after fuel, radiation, shutdown, waste, and containment procedures can support it as one controlled facility."]
	quest.0B76CFAC2BB0A49F.quest_subtitle: "Discipline mastery — supporting branch; follow the chapter age proof for the main transition."
	quest.0B76CFAC2BB0A49F.title: "Reactor Safety Office Proven"
	quest.0B82EFAF0A5BC4B5.quest_desc: ["Build all eight UEV functional families and verify that each recipe consumes its matching UHV component; this prepares Infinity-era convergence."]
	quest.0B82EFAF0A5BC4B5.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Ultra Excessive Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.0B82EFAF0A5BC4B5.title: "UEV Component Standard"
	quest.0B86C31CB0DC04C0.quest_desc: ["Use a worldgen Dark Gem, blood evidence, Age 5 control, and Malum materials to discover the Blood Extractor.","Process blood through EvilCraft and produce Hardened Blood natively.","This is an optional discipline at this age; the canonical factory proofs govern normal progression."]
	quest.0B86C31CB0DC04C0.quest_subtitle: "A specimen opens the branch; native blood processing proves mastery."
	quest.0B86C31CB0DC04C0.title: "Discover and Master EvilCraft"
	quest.0BBBBFBA196043D2.quest_desc: [
		"Build four 1k item storage cells and stock sixteen AE2 silicon."
		"Run from current Certus and processor production, then restore the component reserve."
	]
	quest.0BBBBFBA196043D2.quest_subtitle: "Four 1k cells and sixteen raw silicon trace digital storage back through its physical component line."
	quest.0BBBBFBA196043D2.title: "Rebuild Cells from Silicon"
	quest.0BD20729F29B9FED.quest_desc: [
		"Build sixteen Roads & Roofs base-course blocks to establish a useful route."
		"Connect camp to water, clay, food, or a mine entrance, and mark the path well enough to follow it home."
	]
	quest.0BD20729F29B9FED.quest_subtitle: "A road begins as a path you can recognize in bad weather."
	quest.0BD20729F29B9FED.title: "First Road"
	quest.0BE1347755FDE1C7.quest_desc: [
		"Commission the complete gate, then stage eight Ring Blocks, four Chevron Blocks, and four Base Blocks through their seeded structural batches."
		"This proves repeatable Stargate construction rather than possession of a single assembled portal."
	]
	quest.0BE1347755FDE1C7.quest_subtitle: "A complete gate and structural batch stock prove Stargate manufacturing rather than one portal."
	quest.0BE1347755FDE1C7.title: "Commission the Interplanetary Gate"
	quest.0C125A550DDD8B92.quest_desc: [
		"Craft an Infinity Ingot on the required Re:Avaritia table."
		"Make the ingredients from current production; no quest reward supplies the ingot or any of its progression inputs."
	]
	quest.0C125A550DDD8B92.quest_subtitle: "An Infinity Ingot is what remains when neutron matter, crystal matrix, Quantum machinery, singularities, and catalysts agree."
	quest.0C125A550DDD8B92.title: "Infinity Ingot"
	quest.0C2315AC2B7F7568.quest_desc: [
		"Build another basin with a cogwheel for its drive branch."
		"Separate incompatible processes and provide each station with visible input and output space."
	]
	quest.0C2315AC2B7F7568.quest_subtitle: "A second basin lets mixing continue while another process owns the first station."
	quest.0C2315AC2B7F7568.title: "Build a Second Processing Station"
	quest.0C25C9409C10CBC4.quest_desc: [
		"Restart titanium forming from the standard chloride, blast-furnace, and one-at-a-time vacuum route."
		"Do not plan around the eight-ingot Cryofluid finish until Quantum refrigeration is online."
	]
	quest.0C25C9409C10CBC4.quest_subtitle: "Eight curved plates and ingots rebuild the pressure floor without stripping the working vacuum line."
	quest.0C25C9409C10CBC4.title: "Restart Titanium Forming"
	quest.0C26A049C9F82AC7.quest_desc: ["Use high-pressure chemistry and vacuum processing to relieve large material and extraction workloads.","Run the original three-feed Chemical Reactor route first. It proves rutile, carbon, sodium, hydrochloric acid, and chlorine before the retained purified-PGM batch charge is trusted.","The mature chlorination run processes eight raw titanium into ten dust, improving yield and machine utilization without replacing the initial route.","Finish the first titanium lifecycle before upgrading to the Titanium Greate Press. That press manufactures the deep-drill installation and later reactor instrumentation; stronger mechanics now serve extraction and containment.","The mature titanium, PGM and aerospace batches reward the established reagent, heat and power supply. Keep the first reactor and vacuum route available, and isolate deep extraction from the power and spare parts needed to recover it."]
	quest.0C26A049C9F82AC7.quest_subtitle: "Four batches of titanium sponge prove rutile can survive the entire chloride-chemistry route."
	quest.0C26A049C9F82AC7.title: "Prepare Titanium Sponge"
	quest.0C33EE9AF0BA27FC.quest_desc: ["Combine digital control with Malum materials and spirits to discover a CAD Assembler.","Build the Programmer and execute Psi work through the native system.","This is an optional discipline at this age; the canonical factory proofs govern normal progression."]
	quest.0C33EE9AF0BA27FC.quest_subtitle: "Digital logic gives repeatable form to mental spell construction."
	quest.0C33EE9AF0BA27FC.title: "Age 10 — Discover and Master Psi"
	quest.0C462947C2A27098.quest_desc: ["This objective checks one cured natural-rubber sheet. Each 500 mB of resin makes one rubber, then one pressed sheet; an optional first stock batch of eight sheets uses 4,000 mB.","Tap a naturally grown GTCEu rubber tree in warm, wet TFC terrain. Leave an air block between the sapper and trunk, with at least two matching trunk blocks and five natural leaves nearby. Make the sapper's leather through the earlier TFC hide-and-tannin work. One solitary sapper produces 100 mB per completed cycle: five cycles for one sheet, forty for the eight-sheet stock batch.","For this route, run two steel batches with 36 separate 8-L furnace-gas tanks and 10 separate 8-L CO₂ tanks. Budget two 55-L hot-air charges, six coke dust, two iron dust and two flux; carry the fuel timer and stored gases between runs. Disable tuyere insertion while charging. Before firing, stop intake/stove feed, switch hot-air banks to extraction and enable the tuyere. Stonecut one ingot into two TFMG rebar. One rebar plus flint makes the ignition tool; consume it with three iron ingots and two string for the flint bow. Keep the other steel ingot for the plate and shafts. Follow the existing Beneath route, manufacture an empty burner and capture a fortress blaze for an alive portal return. Fresh charcoal in the burner below a basin melts three copper ingots plus one tin ingot into 360 mB of CBC bronze; load the ingots before placing the foundry lid. Two separate MI pipes feed a TFMG casting basin: four 90-mB casts yield four bronze ingots, two for the sapper. Use the earlier wheel-making press at 8 RPM, with a depot two blocks below, to turn one TFC steel ingot into one MI steel plate. On a separate 8-RPM drive, point the andesite saw upward and install an Attribute Filter. Sample an earlier andesite shaft and allow only the Added by Greate attribute in whitelist-any mode. Drop the plate onto the saw, then collect all six shafts with an empty hand. For the rubber drive, reduce 8 to 4 to 2 RPM and run one Rubberworks machine at a time. Seven MI pipes and one ordinary Create tank hold the optional 4 L resin batch; keep tank extraction disabled while filling.","Stop the sapper drive by replacing its driving cog with the turning gearbox, leaving the sapper and its tank intact. Feed an east-facing compressor through its west port at positive 2 RPM. Maintain ordinary fire below it using the TFC firestarter. Keep the east-front block clear and put the collector depot one block east and one block down. Enable tank extraction and process the resin in 500 mB batches.","Collect the rubber, disconnect the compressor's input shaft and power the separate andesite press at 2 RPM magnitude. Move the same depot to two blocks below the press, then press one rubber per sheet. The two water-wheel networks stay separate; each has an 8-SU limit."]
	quest.0C462947C2A27098.quest_subtitle: "Rubber sheet gives belts, seals, and later electrical work a common industrial material."
	quest.0C462947C2A27098.title: "Rubber Sheet Supply"
	quest.0C4F7FBDB9DA914D.quest_desc: ["Use industrial steel to turn local machinery and bulk hauling into reliable services.","Cast sixteen canonical TFC steel ingots through the TFMG industrial-blasting and casting route.","Feed crushed raw iron or iron dust with TFMG coal coke, collect molten steel separately from slag and furnace gas, then cast 144 mB per ingot.","Upgrade the forming line to a Steel Greate Press. It finishes steel mechanisms, steam locomotives and the supported engine assemblies; the same press later finishes the first rocket. It needs precision mechanisms to build, so commission it before its steel-mechanism output.","Connect fuel, loading, unloading and cargo buffers into a serviced freight route. As demand grows, use the existing steel- and precision-mechanism assembler batches; retain the first assembly line for repairs and restart stock."]
	quest.0C4F7FBDB9DA914D.quest_subtitle: "Industrial steel begins as a controlled stream of iron, coke, hot air, slag, and furnace gas."
	quest.0C4F7FBDB9DA914D.title: "Industrial Steel"
	quest.0C5DEA1230C0DFB5.quest_desc: [
		"Place the bronze macerator on the steam line and inspect it through a working ore cycle."
		"Provide an output inventory before loading a batch so dust cannot stop the machine at completion."
	]
	quest.0C5DEA1230C0DFB5.quest_subtitle: "The macerator is the first steam machine that makes ore preparation repeatable."
	quest.0C5DEA1230C0DFB5.title: "First Ore Processing"
	quest.0C658BD8E07F2260.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect a Quantum hull, AE2 Quantum Link, and Milky Way Stargate."
		"Test each system independently, then verify a fault in transport cannot remove access to local controls or storage."
	]
	quest.0C658BD8E07F2260.quest_subtitle: "Quantum machinery, remote storage, and a fixed gate make matter and distance parts of one controlled system."
	quest.0C658BD8E07F2260.title: "Commission Quantum Transit Systems"
	quest.0C88C50112E775CA.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four seeking eyes and four neutron ingots."
		"Keep the kit at home with spare gear, route notes, food, medicine, and storage."
	]
	quest.0C88C50112E775CA.quest_subtitle: "Four seeking eyes and neutron ingots make both the route and the extreme factory replaceable after loss."
	quest.0C88C50112E775CA.title: "Prepare an Astral Restart Kit"
	quest.0C8A197B96F944BB.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight HDPE sheets and one Alchemistry reactor casing from current inputs."
		"Keep the occult/element branch physically separate from pressure gases until each transfer is intentionally defined."
	]
	quest.0C8A197B96F944BB.quest_subtitle: "HDPE beside an Alchemistry casing connects industrial polymer work to controlled element processing."
	quest.0C8A197B96F944BB.title: "Build Polymer and Reactor Stock"
	quest.0CAB92CC888C9309.quest_desc: ["Build a closed fuel-cycle nuclear complex with a controllable path from fuel to useful output.","Establish the Mekanism reactor shell as the start of the nuclear installation. Mekanism supplies radiation, fuel, waste, reactor control and turbine systems; CROWNS adds Create thermal hardware.","The chemical works prepares fuel; the Titanium Greate Press finishes reactor instrumentation. Connect coolant and heat transfer, turbine output, dosimetry, waste storage and reprocessing before increasing power.","Use the existing fuel, heat-exchanger and turbine batches once the first installation works. Test isolation and restart procedures, keep waste capacity ahead of production, and retain enough independent power to recover pumps and controls."]
	quest.0CAB92CC888C9309.quest_subtitle: "The test shell teaches pressure-boundary discipline inside the Mekanism reactor campus."
	quest.0CAB92CC888C9309.title: "Establish the Nuclear Complex"
	quest.0CB76416347AACB7.quest_desc: [
		"Place the bronze mixer and run a useful installed recipe while the quest observes it."
		"Buffer each input separately; one overfilled ingredient should not prevent the next balanced batch."
	]
	quest.0CB76416347AACB7.quest_subtitle: "The mixer gives the steam hall control over clay, dust, and future compound inputs."
	quest.0CB76416347AACB7.title: "Bronze Mixer Line"
	quest.0CE287D5352A1692.quest_desc: [
		"Produce one Chemlib ammonia bucket through an installed Alchemistry route."
		"Keep it identified and contained; this branch does not replace Mekanism gas handling or MI chemical authority."
	]
	quest.0CE287D5352A1692.quest_subtitle: "An ammonia bucket gives Alchemistry a measured feedstock for its own element-processing branch."
	quest.0CE287D5352A1692.title: "Ammonia Feedstock"
	quest.0CE508638149FAD9.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Mekanism rotary condensentrator and complete a useful conversion."
		"Set the operating direction deliberately and provide compatible storage on both sides before allowing automation."
	]
	quest.0CE508638149FAD9.quest_subtitle: "The rotary condensentrator lets the laboratory choose whether a chemical moves as gas or fluid."
	quest.0CE508638149FAD9.title: "Condense the Chemical Loop"
	quest.0CE75E9681893924.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Cargo Boats capacity upgrades."
		"Install them on a working route and test the heaviest planned cargo before relying on the extra space."
	]
	quest.0CE75E9681893924.quest_subtitle: "Two capacity upgrades are useful only after the boat still docks, turns, and unloads safely at full load."
	quest.0CE75E9681893924.title: "Test Capacity Without Overload"
	quest.0CF0A3FF6C3AB33C.quest_desc: [
		"Build copper propick head."
		"Pour copper into a fired prospector-pick-head mold and let it cool; store the spare head at the mine entrance."
	]
	quest.0CF0A3FF6C3AB33C.quest_subtitle: "A cooled prospector head is a promise that the next field tool can be replaced locally."
	quest.0CF0A3FF6C3AB33C.title: "Cast a Prospector Pick Head"
	quest.0CFA39D4B7A4841C.quest_desc: ["Produce a repeatable batch and consume part of it in a real exotic subsystem."]
	quest.0CFA39D4B7A4841C.quest_subtitle: "Strange Matter begins at the accelerator and feeds spatial, black-hole, and maximum-addon projects."
	quest.0CFA39D4B7A4841C.title: "Strange Matter and Exotic Infrastructure"
	quest.0D047BB664502A58.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a TFC Firestarter from two sticks and keep it in hand for detection."
		"Hold Use on the ground to attempt ignition. A proper firepit comes after stone tools, straw, and logs."
	]
	quest.0D047BB664502A58.quest_subtitle: "Two sticks provide the first controlled ignition tool."
	quest.0D047BB664502A58.title: "Make a Firestarter"
	quest.0D0CD1A42E105656.quest_desc: [
		"Build 16 ladder."
		"Craft and place a continuous ladder to a second exit; do not rely on loose blocks for emergency escape."
	]
	quest.0D0CD1A42E105656.quest_subtitle: "A continuous ladder makes retreat possible when loose blocks and panic would fail."
	quest.0D0CD1A42E105656.title: "Build a Safe Mine Exit"
	quest.0D170F8306E6D741.quest_desc: [
		"Build water wheel."
		"Craft the pack recipe with planks, one shaft, and another foundry lid; place it in flowing water and connect the shaft before adding load."
	]
	quest.0D170F8306E6D741.quest_subtitle: "Flowing water gives the workshop its first steady mechanical heartbeat."
	quest.0D170F8306E6D741.title: "Power the First Water Wheel"
	quest.0D1E5D0514DC8A08.quest_desc: ["Run a loaded motorboat between marked docks, unload it, and preserve a manual return route."]
	quest.0D1E5D0514DC8A08.quest_subtitle: "A real shipment moves by water before regional rail exists."
	quest.0D1E5D0514DC8A08.title: "River Works Cargo Proof"
	quest.0D281B4106EB3A2B.quest_desc: ["Prove a repeatable steel batch, retain coal coke, and route its dirty process through the pollution campaign."]
	quest.0D281B4106EB3A2B.quest_subtitle: "Coke, steel, pressure, and captured byproducts become district infrastructure."
	quest.0D281B4106EB3A2B.title: "Material Epoch III — Heavy Treatment"
	quest.0D3793B4390087D3.quest_desc: [
		"Travel one kilometer by boat and retain an oak hand cart and motorboat."
		"Mark docks, portages, storage, hazards, and the return leg while the route is fresh."
	]
	quest.0D3793B4390087D3.quest_subtitle: "A freight map is proved by one hundred thousand centimeters of river travel plus vehicles that can repeat the route."
	quest.0D3793B4390087D3.title: "Regional Freight Map"
	quest.0D38915855917D2A.quest_desc: [
		"Build the first Magnetic Stabilizer through Rocketnautics authority."
		"The mature four-unit run keeps the iridium sensors and uses eight heavy connectors—the same connector burden as four standard crafts—while improving automation."
	]
	quest.0D38915855917D2A.quest_subtitle: "The magnetic stabilizer ties iridium sensing, digital control, and heavy electrical connections into one navigational reference."
	quest.0D38915855917D2A.title: "Magnetic Stabilizer"
	quest.0D3CCAB136834E0D.quest_desc: ["Make the refinery the chemical supplier for materials, electronics and advanced mechanics.","The refinery now branches into a chemical works. Build a steel chemical vat so petroleum feedstocks become measured reagents for electrical reactors and larger Greate lines. CHE-01 unlocks the native two-vat batch: six TFMG heavy plates, two nickel plates and one steel fluid tank. Cast-iron vats start lower-temperature work; use the steel or fireproof vessel required by each polymer recipe. Survey chalk-hosted saltpeter and deep granite-hosted sulfur, then use a quern and handstone to grind their ores. In a steel or fireproof vat with an installed mixer blade, CHE-01 combines three sulfur powders, one saltpeter powder and 1,000 mB water into the native 500 mB sulfuric-acid batch. Supply the mixer from thirteen coupled small water wheels at 8 RPM, using aluminum transmission and two large-to-small gear stages to reach 32 RPM. This dedicated drive supplies 104 SU for the 96 SU mixer with 8 SU reserved; the aluminum network limit is 128 SU. Keep other factory loads outside it, establish flow at every wheel, and keep fluid inputs and outputs separate. THM-02 divides one ordinary steel ingot into nine canonical TFMG steel nuggets; the native cable connector consumes three of these fractions, a fired ceramic insulator and a copper ingot.","Supply the MI silicone precursor reaction with silicon dust, chlorine, water, and methane recovered from cracked naphtha. Store both acid outputs separately. Cure nine precursor dust with sulfur to make 1,296 mB silicone rubber; heated Greate aluminum-or-higher compacting uses 864 mB for one belt connector. Keep the earlier rubber works supplying lower-tier lines and seals.","After Wet Chemistry (CHE-02), mine native underground halite for salt powder. The MI electrolyzer accepts two units of the established chemistry salt at 8 EU/t for 400 ticks, producing 125 mB chlorine and one sodium dust. Supply the LV steam turbine from a boiler, water and charcoal; retain output space for both products.","At Polymer Materials (CHE-03), use the MI chemical reactor to steam-crack naphtha, then distill it for acetylene. Hydrogen and chlorine supply hydrochloric acid for the vinyl-chloride step; lead tiny dust assists PVC polymerization. Cast 144 mB PVC per sheet in the TFMG basin. Three sheets and light-gray dye make a blank board; deploy a silver plate onto it, then etch it with 250 mB sulfuric acid in a compatible vat. Heat the boiler and precharge the LV turbine steam tank between batches; run one consumer at a time.","Commission the pressure-reaction chamber on the Aluminum Greate Press. Separate reagent supply from product storage, and connect polymers, acids, seals and electronic substrates to their consumers. Chlorine, recovered methane and fluorite-derived acid also feed the later PTFE belt line, so keep the chemical district connected to the Quantum forming floor.","Automate recurring reagent demand and supervise the plant with instruments. Keep ordinary rubber and the older petroleum cuts available: higher polymers add capability without replacing every earlier consumer."]
	quest.0D3CCAB136834E0D.quest_subtitle: "Bulk feedstock becomes controlled wet chemistry in the TFMG vat."
	quest.0D3CCAB136834E0D.title: "Chemical Works"
	quest.0D66981AB002C00B.quest_desc: [
		"Build four AE2 1k cell components."
		"Keep components separate from completed cells until type and capacity needs are known."
	]
	quest.0D66981AB002C00B.quest_subtitle: "Four 1k cell components are a modest storage reserve whose eventual purpose can still be audited."
	quest.0D66981AB002C00B.title: "Cell Component Reserve"
	quest.0D69E049660E31DD.quest_desc: [
		"Build an AE2 Quantum Ring."
		"It consumes superconductor plates, a Quantum circuit, processors, and a Quantum hull; pair it only after both network ends are stable."
	]
	quest.0D69E049660E31DD.quest_subtitle: "A Quantum Ring is a boundary where the network stops caring which side of the world holds the storage."
	quest.0D69E049660E31DD.title: "Planetary Data Nexus Project"
	quest.0D7A4DBF1F2D963A.quest_desc: ["Craft the Metallurgic Infuser with four Aluminum Plates, one MI Electronic Circuit, two Advanced Pumps, an Advanced Machine Hull and a Hanging Glass Insulator.","For two Basic Control Circuits, supply one MI Electronic Circuit and two Redstone Dust in the infusion slot. A separate Redstone Dust in the energy slot provides the 10000J needed for one unupgraded 200-tick batch.","Make Infused Alloy with the ingredient shown in EMI. For Reinforced Alloy, convert two Diamond Dust into20diamond infusion and process one Infused Alloy. Empty the redstone infusion before changing chemical type; energy and infusion materials use separate slots.","Two Basic Control Circuits, one Reinforced Alloy, a TFC Sapphire, a TFMG Capacitor, two Aluminum Plates and two Redstone Dust craft two Advanced Control Circuits."]
	quest.0D7A4DBF1F2D963A.quest_subtitle: "The metallurgic infuser is the controlled doorway from MV industry into pressure chemistry."
	quest.0D7A4DBF1F2D963A.title: "Bootstrap the Metallurgic Infuser"
	quest.0D92FCECF7743F3C.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the expansion cooking pot."
		"Feed it from the pantry without routing away the field reserve or oldest stock."
	]
	quest.0D92FCECF7743F3C.quest_subtitle: "A second cooking station separates daily meals from preservation and large harvest work."
	quest.0D92FCECF7743F3C.title: "Open a Second Kitchen Line"
	quest.0D9E4C35C291AC59.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect a neutron compressor during a sustained run."
		"Feed it from collectors, provide bounded output storage, and verify the line stops safely when storage fills."
	]
	quest.0D9E4C35C291AC59.quest_subtitle: "Extreme compression is unattended only when pile input, compressed output, and overflow all remain observable."
	quest.0D9E4C35C291AC59.title: "Run Extreme Compression Unattended"
	quest.0DABBB719EE336B1.quest_desc: ["Build a Spirit Jar, Runic Workbench, and a pair of item pedestals.","Pressure, improved metallurgy, and controlled storage make spirit handling safer in Age 4.","Optional during normal age progression. Esoteric evidence becomes required only at final Reality Engineering through ESO-04 to FRN-06."]
	quest.0DABBB719EE336B1.quest_subtitle: "Containment and placement replace improvised handling."
	quest.0DABBB719EE336B1.title: "Controlled Spirit Handling"
	quest.0DD5A97327961323.quest_desc: [
		"Make a bronze rotor through an installed MI material route."
		"The craft and assembler recipes consume bronze rings and other shaped parts, so replenish those shelves before building several."
	]
	quest.0DD5A97327961323.quest_subtitle: "A finished bronze rotor turns shaped stock into a replaceable moving component."
	quest.0DD5A97327961323.title: "Steam Rotor Components"
	quest.0DEBEEC0D0063526.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Electro Energetics portable battery for the locker."
		"Label its charge state and test it with the same leads and instruments used during a restart."
	]
	quest.0DEBEEC0D0063526.quest_subtitle: "A second portable battery keeps test power available while the first is deployed or charging."
	quest.0DEBEEC0D0063526.title: "Portable Battery Locker"
	quest.0DEE1DD112355C06.quest_desc: ["Forge a copper anvil to prove the mining camp can turn mapped ore, charcoal, flux, and hauled metal into durable working infrastructure.", "Prospecting, the copper workshop and empirical research turn survival into organized mining."]
	quest.0DEE1DD112355C06.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 1 PROOF — Copper"
	quest.0DEE1DD112355C06.title: "Copper Mining Camp Proven"
	quest.0DF8E5661B161C00.quest_desc: [
		"Complete a Create precision mechanism through its installed sequenced-assembly route."
		"Arrange the deployer steps and intermediate handling so an incomplete mechanism can loop without being lost."
	]
	quest.0DF8E5661B161C00.quest_subtitle: "The precision mechanism is where the moving workshop learns repeatable sequence."
	quest.0DF8E5661B161C00.title: "Assemble a Precision Mechanism"
	quest.0DFC44DF39807CD3.quest_desc: [
		"Assemble a basic chemical tank using cured epoxy and the established MI pressure body."
		"From here Mekanism owns pressurized chemical handling; Chemica remains the applied-process layer that made the transition possible."
	]
	quest.0DFC44DF39807CD3.quest_subtitle: "Chemica-qualified liners and seals make the first Mekanism pressure vessel physically credible."
	quest.0DFC44DF39807CD3.title: "Pressure Chemistry Handoff"
	quest.0E148778351D90CA.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four Rocketnautics titanium alloy through the live cross-mod route."
		"Keep MI titanium as material authority and preserve enough ingots and plates for vacuum and pressure-machine repairs."
	]
	quest.0E148778351D90CA.quest_subtitle: "Four titanium-alloy pieces show aerospace metallurgy can repeat without consuming every finished ingot."
	quest.0E148778351D90CA.title: "Titanium Alloy"
	quest.0E224B9C82027E65.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Rocketnautics titanium casings through the live titanium route."
		"Reserve one for the current craft and one for recovery; keep MI titanium plate and digital parts renewable."
	]
	quest.0E224B9C82027E65.quest_subtitle: "Two titanium casings give deep-space controls a pressure-rated shell and a replaceable spare."
	quest.0E224B9C82027E65.title: "Deep-Space Titanium Casing"
	quest.0E23DA3DBC9BCB9C.quest_desc: [
		"Place a Electro Energetics grounding rod and retain a multimeter."
		"Plan source, storage, protection, disconnects, routes, and loads with clear service access."
	]
	quest.0E23DA3DBC9BCB9C.quest_subtitle: "A grounding rod and multimeter establish that reference and measurement come before energization."
	quest.0E23DA3DBC9BCB9C.title: "Lay Out the Grid Yard"
	quest.0E2455931392BE9E.quest_desc: ["Move one shipment from boat or road cargo into a Railcraft cargo cart through a serviced loader."]
	quest.0E2455931392BE9E.quest_subtitle: "Rail becomes the regional backbone because other vehicles feed it."
	quest.0E2455931392BE9E.title: "Road Meets Rail"
	quest.0E65C7EB59CF6F35.quest_desc: [
		"Complete the TFC charcoal advancement and keep a fired ingot mold ready."
		"Seal every face of the log pile, ignite through one opening, then close it before air turns the batch to ash."
	]
	quest.0E65C7EB59CF6F35.quest_subtitle: "A sealed charcoal pit is the first process that must finish while you wait."
	quest.0E65C7EB59CF6F35.title: "Charcoal Without Shortcuts"
	quest.0E6E769F6D06C5D5.quest_desc: [
		"Build and store eight Mekanism turbine blades."
		"Keep them outside the turbine hall with tools and a verified zero-steam maintenance procedure."
	]
	quest.0E6E769F6D06C5D5.quest_subtitle: "Eight replacement blades keep power conversion serviceable after the reactor is already shut down."
	quest.0E6E769F6D06C5D5.title: "Stock Turbine Repairs"
	quest.0EAC06C57F45B1AD.quest_desc: [
		"Produce two MI steel large plates."
		"Leave the four-plate repair reserve untouched and assign this pair to the planned expansion."
	]
	quest.0EAC06C57F45B1AD.quest_subtitle: "Two large plates are enough for one deliberate structural job without raiding emergency stock."
	quest.0EAC06C57F45B1AD.title: "Large Plate Stack"
	quest.0EB6B5C1CAC5426E.quest_desc: ["Preassemble the stainless network chassis in the MI Assembler with an advanced hull, fluix crystals, and soldering alloy.","Install all three processors, formation and annihilation cores, network power, control chip, digital supervision, Fluix cabling, and the protected grid interface on the twelve-operation Create line before powering the native Controller.","Mechanical commissioning: build the Stainless Steel Greate Press from the existing digital-circuit line, then use it to finish the AE2 controller. No AE2 controller is required to construct that press. Higher presses also work."]
	quest.0EB6B5C1CAC5426E.quest_subtitle: "The controller makes channels and network shape visible before the factory becomes too large to reason about casually."
	quest.0EB6B5C1CAC5426E.title: "First AE2 Controller"
	quest.0EBFFB873D2AE935.quest_desc: [
		"Build four MI motors with Electro Energetics copper coils and copper cord, steel rods, and a magnetic steel rod."
		"The LV assembler can later produce pairs using lubricant, but the live shaped recipe provides the bootstrap."
	]
	quest.0EBFFB873D2AE935.quest_subtitle: "The motor is where Electro Energetics copper, rubber, magnetic steel, and MI machinery finally meet."
	quest.0EBFFB873D2AE935.title: "Motor Package"
	quest.0EC4D7DE80696A8D.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and quarantine eight aethersent ingots."
		"Keep source, process, and destination recorded before releasing the batch to Quantum work."
	]
	quest.0EC4D7DE80696A8D.quest_subtitle: "Eight aethersent ingots in quarantine make an exotic production batch traceable from sample to output."
	quest.0EC4D7DE80696A8D.title: "Quarantine an Aethersent Batch"
	quest.0EF0FC1E179BF40A.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect an MI replicator, buffer eight buckets of UU Matter, and demonstrate one hundred million FE."
		"Meter the replicator separately so optional products cannot consume the feed reserved for convergence."
	]
	quest.0EF0FC1E179BF40A.quest_subtitle: "Universal fabrication begins when a replicator has measured matter feed, deep power reserve, and no need for quest-supplied inputs."
	quest.0EF0FC1E179BF40A.title: "Commission the Universal Matter Fabricator"
	quest.0EFDF3590C0EDCEC.quest_desc: [
		"Build an MI Quantum machine hull."
		"The live recipe combines a Quantum circuit, plutonium batteries, Quantum casing, and Electro Energetics transformer cores."
	]
	quest.0EFDF3590C0EDCEC.quest_subtitle: "A Quantum hull is ordinary machinery rebuilt around singular power density and superconducting control."
	quest.0EFDF3590C0EDCEC.title: "Quantum Matter and Networks"
	quest.0F14F8CEE2FBDEA0.quest_desc: ["Display fuel, oxygen, power, route state, communications health, alarm state, and last safe manual action."]
	quest.0F14F8CEE2FBDEA0.quest_subtitle: "Synaxis cameras and a control chair feed CC telemetry so mission control can watch real state and issue bounded commands."
	quest.0F14F8CEE2FBDEA0.title: "Mission Control Telemetry and Alarm Wall"
	quest.0F16DEDF6E39443D.quest_desc: ["Batch sixteen bronze ingots and sixteen ordinary industrial iron dust with your kinetic and bronze-steam workshop.","After Industrial Heat research, mill earned TFC wrought-iron ingots in the MI macerator: one ingot makes one iron dust. Keep TFC first metallurgy and the bronze boiler, water and fuel supplies working."]
	quest.0F16DEDF6E39443D.quest_subtitle: "Create and steam machinery improve throughput without erasing the early route."
	quest.0F16DEDF6E39443D.title: "Material Epoch II — Kinetic and Steam Batching"
	quest.0F28D3D80B0C8D2E.quest_desc: [
		"Stock two Infinity Catalysts and four crystal-matrix ingots."
		"Seal the reserve from autocrafting and replenish its Starlight, neutron, and cross-age ingredients after use."
	]
	quest.0F28D3D80B0C8D2E.quest_subtitle: "Two catalysts and four matrix ingots provide a small deliberate reserve without turning Infinity into warehouse chores."
	quest.0F28D3D80B0C8D2E.title: "Stage a Three-Shift Catalyst Reserve"
	quest.0F3775755728B764.quest_desc: [
		"Assemble an MI advanced motor at 64 EU with 100 mB of lubricant."
		"Buffer heavy connectors, both wire types, a TFMG magnetic-alloy sheet, and aluminum rods before starting the assembler."
	]
	quest.0F3775755728B764.quest_subtitle: "The advanced motor converts annealed copper, electrum, aluminum, and magnetic alloy into controlled torque."
	quest.0F3775755728B764.title: "Advanced Motor"
	quest.0F4EF8A7EE0ED6CD.quest_desc: [
		"Complete the Stellaris rocket advancement with the live rocket-station recipe."
		"Keep a second mission’s fuel, oxygen, and repair inputs in production before moving the rocket to the pad."
	]
	quest.0F4EF8A7EE0ED6CD.quest_subtitle: "The rocket advancement records a vehicle assembled from the factory rather than delivered by the book."
	quest.0F4EF8A7EE0ED6CD.title: "Rocket on the Pad"
	quest.0F51EECF30BEB39F.quest_desc: [
		"Pick up a loose rock. Hold at least two rocks and Use one to open TFC rock knapping."
		"Rock type follows local geology; the native advancement accepts every valid knapping stone."
	]
	quest.0F51EECF30BEB39F.quest_subtitle: "Loose surface stones are both material and the knapping interface."
	quest.0F51EECF30BEB39F.title: "Pick Up Loose Rock"
	quest.0F52610DCF194BF3.quest_desc: [
		"Find 8 small sphalerite."
		"Set the sphalerite marker from field evidence and leave enough notes to resume the survey later."
	]
	quest.0F52610DCF194BF3.quest_subtitle: "Eight sphalerite samples turn a chance find into a zinc route for the foundry."
	quest.0F52610DCF194BF3.title: "Sphalerite Claim Marker"
	quest.0F573E8D8FBAA0D6.quest_desc: ["Turn scattered surface finds into a mapped mining camp and a repeatable copper workshop.","Use the earlier stone hammer to prepare flux and weld seven copper double ingots on a stone anvil. Heat the pairs in a charcoal forge until they can weld; a campfire is insufficient. Craft and place the copper anvil before making the fitted copper hammer.","On the copper anvil, use the stone hammer to forge one copper ingot into two rods. Work one rod into two copper stamens, then one stamen into five rivets, keeping each workpiece hot enough for the native forging steps. This leaves one rod and one stamen for later tools.","Fire the hammer-head mold, cast 100 mB copper into it and let the head cool. Have a copper rivet and glue ready for the installed metal-tool recipe; a stick is valid for its medium handle and for the stock head-and-stick recipe. The tool overlay uses one rivet, leaving four from the batch. Complete the copper hammer before proving the mining camp.","Use prospecting and the first copper tools to supply tin, zinc and copper. Bring fired vessels, charcoal and ore back to one workshop; establish the Research Laboratory alongside it.","Research records what the workshop has learned. The next foundry consumes real metal output, so keep mining, casting and paper production working instead of spending the entire reserve on tools."]
	quest.0F573E8D8FBAA0D6.quest_subtitle: "A copper hammer moves the settlement from casting shapes to working metal deliberately."
	quest.0F573E8D8FBAA0D6.title: "Copper Hammer and Workshop"
	quest.0F6BE12A29E46669.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Quantum circuit through the established MI circuit chain."
		"Reserve the clean intermediates and high-tier components before expanding into gates or replication."
	]
	quest.0F6BE12A29E46669.quest_subtitle: "Quantum circuits make uncertainty repeatable enough to put inside a machine hull."
	quest.0F6BE12A29E46669.title: "Quantum Circuit Matrix"
	quest.0F755AE875487F12.quest_desc: [
		"Stage eight normal basalt rutile ore and sixteen MI carbon dust."
		"Keep geology grade and rock source explicit, then reserve sodium, chlorine, hydrochloric acid, and empty reactor outputs."
	]
	quest.0F755AE875487F12.quest_subtitle: "Basalt rutile and carbon on the same pallet define the next titanium campaign before acids arrive."
	quest.0F755AE875487F12.title: "Stage Rutile and Carbon Feedstock"
	quest.0F7D49128E3B5E46.quest_desc: [
		"Build sixteen blank patterns and stock eight charged Certus crystals."
		"Separate encoded production patterns from unassigned emergency stock."
	]
	quest.0F7D49128E3B5E46.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen blank patterns and eight charged crystals make a pattern library expandable without consuming its recovery stock."
	quest.0F7D49128E3B5E46.title: "Pattern Library Stack"
	quest.0F7F5B1B0E844BAA.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a TFC firestarter and a fired ingot mold together."
		"Store them away from the active fire so a failed camp or kiln does not remove the tools needed to begin again."
	]
	quest.0F7F5B1B0E844BAA.quest_subtitle: "The minimum recovery kit is ignition, water, and a mold that survived."
	quest.0F7F5B1B0E844BAA.title: "Restart Fire and Water"
	quest.0F8EFF35F5ACA850.quest_desc: [
		"Produce two MI basic machine hulls."
		"Reserve one for the turbine route and keep the second available for the next LV machine rather than consuming both immediately."
	]
	quest.0F8EFF35F5ACA850.quest_subtitle: "Two basic hulls make the first powered machine a repeatable standard instead of a one-off shell."
	quest.0F8EFF35F5ACA850.title: "Basic Machine Hull"
	quest.0FC8DDA0D19B4A93.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen cured Rubberworks rubber sheets."
		"Keep them clean, dry, labeled, and separate from belt or cable production."
	]
	quest.0FC8DDA0D19B4A93.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen rubber sheets are enough for an actual seal locker without burying the player in reusable utility stacks."
	quest.0FC8DDA0D19B4A93.title: "Rubber Seal Locker"
	quest.0FD62A2D2C3B5137.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen MI platinum plates and eight mixed iridium ingots."
		"Protect the reserve from unrestricted crafting and maintain the harsh-world and acid-separation inputs behind it."
	]
	quest.0FD62A2D2C3B5137.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen platinum plates and eight mixed iridium ingots are enough PGM reserve for serious control work without excess grind."
	quest.0FD62A2D2C3B5137.title: "Platinum Plate Reserve"
	quest.0FEA677AEB4B4369.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare a Create schedule and thirty-two replacement tracks."
		"Include a bypass stop or manual transfer and test it before closing the main line."
	]
	quest.0FEA677AEB4B4369.quest_subtitle: "A dead-rail timetable describes how service continues while one segment is unavailable."
	quest.0FEA677AEB4B4369.title: "Dead Rail Timetable"
	quest.102A58D325A45A3D.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect an MI bronze macerator, stock sixteen bronze plates, and sixteen item pipes."
		"This Bronze-era start does not require electric machines before Low Voltage exists."
	]
	quest.102A58D325A45A3D.quest_subtitle: "Manual processing ends when a Bronze macerator has material, pipes, and enough structural stock to run as a line."
	quest.102A58D325A45A3D.title: "Manual Processing Ends Here"
	quest.105999522478B894.quest_desc: [
		"Build jug."
		"Form and fire the jug before filling it; an unfired clay shape cannot carry the trip water."
	]
	quest.105999522478B894.quest_subtitle: "A filled jug turns fresh water from a location into a carried resource."
	quest.105999522478B894.title: "Carry Clean Water"
	quest.105F6DE657BD7CE5.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the new Cargo Boats dock."
		"Run a loaded arrival, unload without hand carrying the full shipment, and confirm the boat can depart."
	]
	quest.105F6DE657BD7CE5.quest_subtitle: "A second dock becomes an expansion only after its upstream route and downstream storage both work."
	quest.105F6DE657BD7CE5.title: "Commission the Expansion Dock"
	quest.106CF84B838656DF.quest_desc: [
		"Build unfired propick head mold."
		"Use the clay interface for the prospector-pick mold, then fire that specific form before casting."
	]
	quest.106CF84B838656DF.quest_subtitle: "Shape the replacement mold before the first prospector head becomes urgent."
	quest.106CF84B838656DF.title: "Shape a Prospector Pick Mold"
	quest.1078926FA05F312A.quest_desc: [
		"Produce 32 charcoal."
		"Seal a log pile completely, ignite it through one opening, then close the opening and let it finish."
	]
	quest.1078926FA05F312A.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two charcoal shows the pit can support work beyond one firing."
	quest.1078926FA05F312A.title: "Complete a Charcoal Burn"
	quest.108D7D5563D708D7.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Applied Flux 1k FE storage cell."
		"Install it for a defined load and keep generation, protection, and black start outside AE2."
	]
	quest.108D7D5563D708D7.quest_subtitle: "A 1k FE cell is a small buffer for network-managed energy, not a replacement for Electro Energetics infrastructure."
	quest.108D7D5563D708D7.title: "FE Storage Cell"
	quest.10A5DB24E275C6A2.quest_desc: [
		"Build propick head mold."
		"Shape the prospector-pick mold carefully and pit-fire it before committing the first tool metal."
	]
	quest.10A5DB24E275C6A2.quest_subtitle: "The prospector’s pick starts as a clay plan for reading buried ore."
	quest.10A5DB24E275C6A2.title: "Prepare the Prospector Mold"
	quest.10E12019B00BD62D.quest_desc: ["Stock eight Create electron tubes for the first analog-control line.","The terrestrial foundry supplies these vacuum tubes before space. Semiconductor transistors remain in later electronic controls and mature batches; they are not LV prerequisites."]
	quest.10E12019B00BD62D.quest_subtitle: "TFMG transistors are the stock the first analog-control factory actually consumes."
	quest.10E12019B00BD62D.title: "Stock Create Electron Tubes"
	quest.10E260D3B2D70D21.quest_desc: [
		"Visit the Rocketnautics Deep Space dimension and establish a recoverable route."
		"Carry redundant oxygen, fuel, power, food, navigation, shelter, tools, and cargo storage."
		"Return with four raw titanium as the cargo proof; the route is not complete until the material reaches the home-side inventory."
	]
	quest.10E260D3B2D70D21.quest_subtitle: "Deep space removes familiar landmarks, so navigation and return reserves must exist before the first correction burn."
	quest.10E260D3B2D70D21.title: "Deep Space Cargo Route"
	quest.10ED3DA5474CCAB6.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an MI LV steam turbine."
		"Connect steam input and electrical output at the intended tier; an MV turbine is not the LV introduction."
	]
	quest.10ED3DA5474CCAB6.quest_subtitle: "The LV steam turbine is the first deliberate handoff from a physical steam plant to electrical machinery."
	quest.10ED3DA5474CCAB6.title: "LV Turbine Hand-Off"
	quest.1172ACBAAE690A02.quest_desc: ["Stage the listed UIV reserve for shared-service megastructures; keep the batch outside automatic consumption so expansion does not erase repair stock."]
	quest.1172ACBAAE690A02.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.1172ACBAAE690A02.title: "UIV Production Cell"
	quest.118FB021E97CD161.quest_desc: ["This is a mature LV/MV component standard: its silicone and control suppliers follow Chemical Industry. Machine voltage labels do not make it a pre-space bootstrap requirement."]
	quest.118FB021E97CD161.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.118FB021E97CD161.title: "LV Production Cell"
	quest.11BE8AEE296C5123.quest_desc: [
		"Keep an oak hand cart and thirty-two Create tracks ready."
		"Mark the bypass, protect workers from traffic, and repair the original route before dismantling the detour."
	]
	quest.11BE8AEE296C5123.quest_subtitle: "A hand cart and thirty-two spare tracks let freight move while the damaged section remains isolated."
	quest.11BE8AEE296C5123.title: "Prepare a Broken-Route Bypass"
	quest.11DAECD240AEF379.quest_desc: ["Stock four analog circuits and four MI motors from the terrestrial prototype routes.","Shut consumers off before restarting generation, restore storage first, then reconnect one branch at a time."]
	quest.11DAECD240AEF379.quest_subtitle: "Keep analog circuits and motors outside automatic consumption for a cold restart."
	quest.11DAECD240AEF379.title: "Prepare an LV Cold Restart"
	quest.12384157DE04CE1C.quest_desc: ["Build all eight IV functional families and verify that each recipe consumes its matching EV component; this prepares reactor control and turbine operations."]
	quest.12384157DE04CE1C.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Insane Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.12384157DE04CE1C.title: "IV Component Standard"
	quest.12392D03F43E5C4F.quest_desc: ["Stage the listed EV reserve for vacuum, pressure, and aerospace machinery; keep the batch outside automatic consumption so expansion does not erase repair stock."]
	quest.12392D03F43E5C4F.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.12392D03F43E5C4F.title: "EV Production Cell"
	quest.127AA578D1BFC6A1.quest_desc: ["Harvest legitimate material from a climate-valid farm or forestry site; no machine may create the first specimen."]
	quest.127AA578D1BFC6A1.quest_subtitle: "TFC crops, saplings, compost, and food waste remain the first biological source."
	quest.127AA578D1BFC6A1.title: "Industrial Biology — Physical Source"
	quest.127E3D371D14E0B5.quest_desc: [
		"Build two basic chemical tanks and keep the chemical washer available."
		"Assign each tank to a known slurry or gas, and preserve one recovery path during cleaning."
	]
	quest.127E3D371D14E0B5.quest_subtitle: "Two tanks beside a washer create a clean transfer rack for dirty input and recovered output."
	quest.127E3D371D14E0B5.title: "Chemical Tank Rack"
	quest.12AB1DAB04AEB7EC.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the Mekanism Fission Reactor Logic Adapter and build one Mekanism dosimeter."
		"Lay out clean and controlled access, instrument storage, reactor boundary, cooling, emergency power, waste, and a path that never crosses the hot side unnecessarily."
	]
	quest.12AB1DAB04AEB7EC.quest_subtitle: "The controller and a personal dosimeter put reactor state and worker exposure at the center of the site plan."
	quest.12AB1DAB04AEB7EC.title: "Nuclear Site Plan"
	quest.12B768245F2167BF.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Re:Avaritia’s neutron-compressor advancement."
		"Connect renewable pile supply and keep compressed output in restricted storage."
	]
	quest.12B768245F2167BF.quest_subtitle: "The neutron-compressor advancement confirms extreme accumulation can become a controlled factory input."
	quest.12B768245F2167BF.title: "Compressor Cathedral"
	quest.12C0953FF327567E.quest_desc: [
		"Replenish sixteen bronze bolts and sixteen bronze plates."
		"Begin from the foundry bronze route rather than dismantling stored machines or consuming the repair shelf."
	]
	quest.12C0953FF327567E.quest_subtitle: "Bolts and plates made again from certified bronze close the steam hall’s supply loop."
	quest.12C0953FF327567E.title: "Replenish Bronze Components"
	quest.12C7A8C43CC9C9B4.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen foundry brass ingots and press eight of them into brass sheets."
		"Use the live copper-and-zinc basin batch; TFC brass is not a substitute for this Create authority material."
	]
	quest.12C7A8C43CC9C9B4.quest_subtitle: "Brass ingots and sheets put control parts and casings on the same dependable route."
	quest.12C7A8C43CC9C9B4.title: "Build a Brass Working Reserve"
	quest.12C8D5A7E9661235.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s logging advancement by using the proper tool route to produce lumber."
		"Reserve some lumber for storage, mine supports, and the next tool replacement before expanding the shelter."
	]
	quest.12C8D5A7E9661235.quest_subtitle: "Lumber is the point where gathered trees become planned construction."
	quest.12C8D5A7E9661235.title: "Turn Logs into Lumber"
	quest.12D2114047FE954F.quest_desc: [
		"Travel one hundred thousand centimeters by minecart or rail service."
		"Ride a useful route and inspect any section that causes repeated slowing or manual intervention."
	]
	quest.12D2114047FE954F.quest_subtitle: "One kilometer by rail is long enough for grades, junctions, and unloading delays to become operational concerns."
	quest.12D2114047FE954F.title: "Rail Freight Record"
	quest.12E1FB85FE0D8768.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Re:Avaritia’s neutron-collector advancement with the current recipe."
		"Place the collector where output cannot fill unnoticed."
	]
	quest.12E1FB85FE0D8768.quest_subtitle: "The neutron-collector advancement begins a slow production clock that should keep running in the background."
	quest.12E1FB85FE0D8768.title: "Neutron Watch"
	quest.12EEC49CE6043572.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 16,000 mB of TFMG diesel to a launch-site buffer."
		"Use a real tank and route, label the convoy destination, and preserve refinery supply for the home factory."
	]
	quest.12EEC49CE6043572.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of diesel make the launch site a destination on the refinery freight map."
	quest.12EEC49CE6043572.title: "Diesel Drum Convoy"
	quest.131F9DCE3A94FBFC.quest_desc: [
		"Keep the commissioned Large Diesel Generator and stock thirty-two Electro Energetics wires."
		"Commission metering, isolation, grounding, storage, and a real load before declaring the source available."
	]
	quest.131F9DCE3A94FBFC.quest_subtitle: "Late diesel generation now joins the protected grid in the same tier that builds it."
	quest.131F9DCE3A94FBFC.title: "Commission the Generation Grid"
	quest.135D759EBFDF5019.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement UEV motors, pumps, robot arms, sensors, emitters, and field generators for Infinity-era convergence, then verify the UHV line still operates."]
	quest.135D759EBFDF5019.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.135D759EBFDF5019.title: "UEV Recovery Proof"
	quest.13600CBD07081E1A.quest_desc: ["Build another steel macerator and hold sixteen canonical TFC steel ingots for its supply chain.","Confirm boiler and turbine capacity before connecting both ore lines at once."]
	quest.13600CBD07081E1A.quest_subtitle: "A second macerator lets bulk ore continue while one line changes material or stops for service."
	quest.13600CBD07081E1A.title: "Install a Second Steel Macerator"
	quest.138DBB3F19366FA5.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one Stellaris star crawler away from the launch vehicle."
		"Light and mark the approach, use prepared cover, and inspect the perimeter before beginning cargo work."
	]
	quest.138DBB3F19366FA5.quest_subtitle: "A star crawler tests the perimeter where low visibility and valuable machinery meet."
	quest.138DBB3F19366FA5.title: "Star Crawler Perimeter"
	quest.13993CDFDECA8379.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the first eight shafts through the live foundry-gated recipe."
		"One batch supplies the water wheel connection and leaves enough shafting to reach the basin and press."
	]
	quest.13993CDFDECA8379.quest_subtitle: "Eight shafts are the first real transmission batch, not an activity counter."
	quest.13993CDFDECA8379.title: "Craft the First Shafts"
	quest.13AD566A7B53B4A9.quest_desc: ["Build the permanent drill through its sixteen-operation quarry, pressure, drive, sensing, control, routing, grid, lubrication, and closure line; consume a processed sample for a cartridge, run a bounded batch, and recover after power loss.","Mechanical commissioning: finish the deep drill on a Titanium Greate Press or higher. Feed the installation from the existing high-pressure material, lubricant and control lines; preserve ordinary extraction for recovery."]
	quest.13AD566A7B53B4A9.quest_subtitle: "Processed samples authorize extraction cartridges; the drill can never make first discovery."
	quest.13AD566A7B53B4A9.title: "Bounded Deep Drill Campus"
	quest.13AF4FDD113C2ED8.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight substrate and inspect the operating electrolytic separator."
		"Confirm water, oxygen, hydrogen, and product buffers before assigning the sample to HDPE production."
	]
	quest.13AF4FDD113C2ED8.quest_subtitle: "Eight substrate beside the separator preserves a sample of the polymer chain and the gases that feed it."
	quest.13AF4FDD113C2ED8.title: "Substrate Sample Box"
	quest.13E8E3545A9126D4.quest_desc: [
		"Stage an Extended Inscriber, an Ingredient Buffer, and four Engineering Processors for a failed specialist cell."
		"Restore ordinary AE2 routing first, then reconnect the extension and verify blocked-output behavior."
	]
	quest.13E8E3545A9126D4.quest_subtitle: "The extension must fail back to understandable AE2 behavior."
	quest.13E8E3545A9126D4.title: "ExtendedAE — Recovery Stock"
	quest.14254C918D43005E.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight certus quartz crystals and eight stainless-steel ingots."
		"Store the reserve outside unrestricted autocrafting and maintain the mine, growth, alloy, and blast routes that replace it."
	]
	quest.14254C918D43005E.quest_subtitle: "Equal small batches of certus and stainless protect both processor and machine construction."
	quest.14254C918D43005E.title: "Buffer Certus and Stainless"
	quest.144579534CFB1FBD.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the Mekanism Solar Neutron Activator after both readiness branches."
		"Trace material custody, power loss, waste capacity, instrument access, and manual isolation through the expanded line."
	]
	quest.144579534CFB1FBD.quest_subtitle: "Repair stock and a rehearsed cold start allow the waste line to expand without weakening control."
	quest.144579534CFB1FBD.title: "Commission the Expanded Safety Line"
	quest.145C0B0950506A3F.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight control-rod assemblies and sixteen heavy wire connectors."
		"Prove shutdown logic, coolant, turbine capacity, waste storage, meters, and PPE before accepting the operating milestone."
	]
	quest.145C0B0950506A3F.quest_subtitle: "Eight control rods and a heavy connection reserve make power output subordinate to deliberate control."
	quest.145C0B0950506A3F.title: "Commission Reactor Control"
	quest.14D56ABE98F3CD46.quest_desc: ["Stage independent pollution and radiation meters; the two hazards remain mechanically separate."]
	quest.14D56ABE98F3CD46.quest_subtitle: "Planetary and nuclear sites carry their own atmosphere kit and waste route."
	quest.14D56ABE98F3CD46.title: "Remote Industry Still Has Consequences"
	quest.14DF82E9EFF563F7.quest_desc: [
		"Store 10,000,000 FE and build a Create Addition modular accumulator."
		"Route the dump path intentionally and keep it separate from black-start controls and coolant pumps."
	]
	quest.14DF82E9EFF563F7.quest_subtitle: "Ten million FE behind a dump bus gives a sudden trip somewhere to send power without compromising shutdown systems."
	quest.14DF82E9EFF563F7.title: "Reactor Dump Bus"
	quest.14E51AB81CD74EF5.quest_desc: [
		"Assemble the authored batch of two Microprocessors from the cleanroom board, chip, and standard SMD chains."
		"This is the first complete Greg processor family produced by the MI-supported precision wing."
	]
	quest.14E51AB81CD74EF5.quest_subtitle: "The cleanroom's component lines converge into a repeatable processor batch."
	quest.14E51AB81CD74EF5.title: "Microprocessor Batch"
	quest.14F1986FE2EF7969.quest_desc: [
		"Store sixteen fluix glass cable and eight stainless-steel ingots outside AE2."
		"Keep a physical chest, manual crafting access, and a known cable path available when the controller is dark."
	]
	quest.14F1986FE2EF7969.quest_subtitle: "Cable and stainless stock keep a network outage from hiding the machines needed to repair it."
	quest.14F1986FE2EF7969.title: "Stage a Manual Network Repair"
	quest.1535CE7D1B6278A9.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s prospector-pick advancement by taking a real reading in the field."
		"Sample a deliberate grid and record strong results so the excavation follows evidence instead of random shafts."
	]
	quest.1535CE7D1B6278A9.quest_subtitle: "The prospector’s reading narrows a search; it never replaces understanding the host rock."
	quest.1535CE7D1B6278A9.title: "Read the Vein with a Prospector Pick"
	quest.15380E3932D29868.quest_desc: ["Stock eight Create electron tubes and eight Electro Energetics accumulators.","Keep the tube, rubber, battery-alloy, acid and conductor suppliers running; this reserve supports LV restart without offworld aluminum."]
	quest.15380E3932D29868.quest_subtitle: "Keep TFMG electronics and accumulator suppliers ready for another workcell."
	quest.15380E3932D29868.title: "Controls and Battery Reserve"
	quest.154F82F34DD72648.quest_desc: ["Use the mineral finder to turn surveyed geology into deliberate advanced-electric prospecting."]
	quest.154F82F34DD72648.quest_subtitle: "Read the ground before committing the mine."
	quest.154F82F34DD72648.title: "Mineral Finder"
	quest.156A51C1EA94D3A8.quest_desc: ["Retain a neutron ingot from the live compression line; it links slow neutron production with contained Starlight materials and recovery stock.", "Existing nuclear and chemical institutions reach extreme purity, neutron production and Starlight feedstocks."]
	quest.156A51C1EA94D3A8.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 14 PROOF — Extreme Industry and Eternal Starlight"
	quest.156A51C1EA94D3A8.title: "Neutron and Starlight Works Proven"
	quest.157801AA7BCFC8C6.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight coal-coke blocks and eight rubber sheets."
		"Separate furnace fuel from maintenance polymers so the hot works cannot consume both reserves."
	]
	quest.157801AA7BCFC8C6.quest_subtitle: "Eight coke blocks and rubber stock prepare both high heat and the seals around it."
	quest.157801AA7BCFC8C6.title: "Coke Block Stockyard"
	quest.1587DC7E74666D26.quest_desc: ["Build a radiation-shielding module to turn the field-survival branch into equipment for working safely beyond ordinary shelter."]
	quest.1587DC7E74666D26.quest_subtitle: "Discipline mastery — supporting branch; follow the chapter age proof for the main transition."
	quest.1587DC7E74666D26.title: "Field Survival Mastered"
	quest.15A7E24C0064F8EF.quest_desc: [
		"Demonstrate one hundred million FE in connected storage."
		"Test the fusion source against a real load and confirm control power survives output isolation."
	]
	quest.15A7E24C0064F8EF.quest_subtitle: "One hundred million stored FE synchronizes the stellar array with a grid large enough to absorb and survive it."
	quest.15A7E24C0064F8EF.title: "Stellar Array Sync"
	quest.15A912FA31E79D23.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the Stellaris rocket station during a normal operating cycle."
		"Leave valves, tanks, access paths, and the next checklist in a condition another shift can understand."
	]
	quest.15A912FA31E79D23.quest_subtitle: "A station is ready for an unattended interval only when fuel, oxygen, and cargo remain in known states."
	quest.15A912FA31E79D23.title: "Run the Station Unattended"
	quest.15F09D0C13ED7C79.quest_desc: ["Craft a Water Flasks leather flask.","Fill it before departure and keep a known fresh-water point on the return route.","For early leather, take a small sheepskin hide from a TFC sheep killed by the player and use a knife to make a small raw hide. Knap a sedimentary stone knife and axe; gather oak twigs for their handles and two oak logs from a cool, wet oak forest. Keep one log as the scraping surface.","Make three oak barrels (seven oak lumber each) and one wooden bucket (three lumber). Reuse the bucket to put 1,000 mB of fresh water in each barrel. In barrel B, two flux make 1,000 mB of limewater; add one raw hide and seal it. In barrel A, seal one oak log with the water to make tannin.","Place the soaked hide on top of the spare oak log with air above it, then scrape all sixteen cells with the knife. Seal the scraped hide in barrel C to rinse it into a prepared hide; seal that hide in barrel A's tannin to get one leather. Each sealed recipe has a 7,200-calendar-tick duration; let it finish before opening. The three hide steps use 300 mB each and leave 700 mB in each barrel. Repeat the leather batch for the flask's displayed recipe."]
	quest.15F09D0C13ED7C79.quest_subtitle: "A refillable leather flask makes water part of the route instead of a place you hope to find."
	quest.15F09D0C13ED7C79.title: "Field Water Discipline"
	quest.15F24AC290B8494F.quest_desc: [
		"Hold five clay balls and Use them to open clay knapping. Shape an unfired vessel first."
		"Also prepare an unfired ingot mold and pickaxe-head mold so the same kiln batch advances the copper route."
	]
	quest.15F24AC290B8494F.quest_subtitle: "Clay knapping prepares the vessel and molds that the first kiln will harden."
	quest.15F24AC290B8494F.title: "Shape Unfired Pottery"
	quest.1610577D9E2536FF.quest_desc: [
		"Store 1,000,000 FE in the nuclear support system."
		"Connect it to monitoring and shutdown loads, then prove it remains isolated from routine factory demand."
	]
	quest.1610577D9E2536FF.quest_subtitle: "One million FE is the first containment reserve: enough to wake instruments and controls before fuel moves."
	quest.1610577D9E2536FF.title: "Containment Black-Start"
	quest.164E950854259C1C.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Mekanism’s metallurgic-infuser advancement with the current pack recipe."
		"Run a useful circuit batch and leave the machine empty of the wrong infusion type for its next job."
	]
	quest.164E950854259C1C.quest_subtitle: "Infuser certification means the first pressure-chemistry machine is powered, supplied, and understood."
	quest.164E950854259C1C.title: "Infuser Certification"
	quest.16A0822F40B45BCB.quest_desc: [
		"Craft three Mekanism radiation-shielding modules through the live recipe."
		"Store them with instructions and monitoring equipment; they are engineered PPE upgrades, not a substitute for distance, containment, or time limits."
	]
	quest.16A0822F40B45BCB.quest_subtitle: "Three shielding modules create a replaceable protection reserve for suits assigned to controlled nuclear work."
	quest.16A0822F40B45BCB.title: "Shielding Module Locker"
	quest.16AA09BAD2AC62D0.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen certus quartz dust and eight stainless-steel ingots."
		"Protect the drawer from recipes that can consume either stock without preserving crystals or structural plate material."
	]
	quest.16AA09BAD2AC62D0.quest_subtitle: "Certus dust beside stainless keeps fragile processor work and clean machine construction supplied together."
	quest.16AA09BAD2AC62D0.title: "Certus Dust Drawer"
	quest.16CD8044DA572D9A.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s forge advancement by building and using a charcoal-fired forge."
		"Place it where fuel, flux, water, and the anvil can be reached without crossing the mine’s main traffic."
	]
	quest.16CD8044DA572D9A.quest_subtitle: "The camp forge brings metal back to working heat without returning every job to a vessel."
	quest.16CD8044DA572D9A.title: "Light the Camp Forge"
	quest.16E93E4B40AB1715.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen printed silicon and eight Certus quartz crystals."
		"Keep press output labeled and reserve raw Certus for Fluix and cell work."
	]
	quest.16E93E4B40AB1715.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen printed silicon and eight Certus crystals keep the inscriber supplied with the two stocks every processor line revisits."
	quest.16E93E4B40AB1715.title: "Processor Press Stock"
	quest.16F1830789E192C5.quest_desc: ["Produce four analog circuits and sixteen copper wire for LV machine controls, conductors and restart stock.","Keep the electron-tube, rubber and TFMG copper-spool lines supplied; the first analog circuit is hand-built, so assembler production cannot lock out a cold restart."]
	quest.16F1830789E192C5.quest_subtitle: "Repeat the analog and conductor supply before adding more loads."
	quest.16F1830789E192C5.title: "Repeat Circuits and Wire"
	quest.16F421FFEF690AA7.quest_desc: [
		"Locate a Stellaris Moon Dungeon structure and return safely."
		"Approach with combat supplies, oxygen, marked exits, and empty inventory space; do not let loot displace return equipment."
	]
	quest.16F421FFEF690AA7.quest_subtitle: "A lunar dungeon is valuable only after its hazards, route, and cargo can all be brought home."
	quest.16F421FFEF690AA7.title: "Moon Dungeon Survey"
	quest.170759DC92DBF678.quest_desc: [
		"Build the live cast-iron pumpjack assembly and inspect its placed base."
		"The base requires a cast-iron tank, vat, pipe, pump, and precision mechanisms; provide storage before starting extraction."
	]
	quest.170759DC92DBF678.quest_subtitle: "The pumpjack makes buried oil a sustained feedstock instead of a found container."
	quest.170759DC92DBF678.title: "Commission the Pumpjack"
	quest.17138C41AFEA7B9E.quest_desc: ["Produce and buffer 8,000 mB of Stellaris fuel.","The live Create mixing bridges TFMG kerosene, gasoline, or diesel into equal-volume rocket fuel; use fixed tanks and preserve a return share.","Fill vanilla buckets with Stellaris fuel under a Create spout, then use the rocket fuel input. Keep biomass for its industrial consumers."]
	quest.17138C41AFEA7B9E.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of launch fuel separate a repeatable mission from a single departure."
	quest.17138C41AFEA7B9E.title: "Refine a Relaunch Reserve"
	quest.172780152FA83CA0.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight titanium curved plates and sixteen flat plates."
		"Store matched batches where hull construction cannot consume the emergency patch stock."
	]
	quest.172780152FA83CA0.quest_subtitle: "Curved and flat titanium together prove the pressure hull can be formed and patched from one certified stream."
	quest.172780152FA83CA0.title: "Pressure Hull Curve"
	quest.177293286F2EECF6.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen printed silicon and sixteen Fluix glass cables."
		"Keep them outside network-only storage and label the intended recovery branch."
	]
	quest.177293286F2EECF6.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen printed silicon and sixteen cables put processor repair and network repair in one controlled tray."
	quest.177293286F2EECF6.title: "Printed Silicon Tray"
	quest.178A582A2A044059.quest_desc: [
		"Build 8 oak support."
		"Use a saw to cut lumber, craft horizontal and vertical supports, then brace the mine before extending it."
	]
	quest.178A582A2A044059.quest_subtitle: "Mine supports turn a promising tunnel into a place you can safely revisit."
	quest.178A582A2A044059.title: "Cut Mine Supports"
	quest.179043EF25421123.quest_desc: ["Perform manual takeoff, controlled flight, landing, inspection, repair, and recovery with no autopilot active.", "Atmospheric craft are not authorized for spaceflight.", "AIR-01 → AIR-03 provides terrain-independent mobility and specialist freight. This aviation branch does not replace the Low-Voltage Grid age proof, bulk rail or first-access rockets."]
	quest.179043EF25421123.quest_subtitle: "Discipline mastery — supporting branch; follow the chapter age proof for the main transition."
	quest.179043EF25421123.title: "The Wright Brothers"
	quest.179693A0395D3D8D.quest_desc: [
		"Accumulate 200 metres of climbing on a maintained vertical route."
		"Add lighting, fall protection, rest points, and a second way down before calling the route operational."
	]
	quest.179693A0395D3D8D.quest_subtitle: "Two hundred vertical metres prove the crew can retreat through terrain that a vehicle cannot cross."
	quest.179693A0395D3D8D.title: "Complete the Cliff Recovery Route"
	quest.17B3EAE8E6909271.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s firestarter advancement by lighting your first working fire with the intended tool."
		"Protect the firestarter from weather and store kindling where a cold restart can reach it."
	]
	quest.17B3EAE8E6909271.quest_subtitle: "Reliable flame begins with learning what the firestarter will and will not ignite."
	quest.17B3EAE8E6909271.title: "First Flame Proof"
	quest.17BA3A7302ABD355.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a steel machine casing and four steel large plates as a cold rebuild set."
		"Isolate steam, drain connected storage, and inspect the cause before installing the replacement."
	]
	quest.17BA3A7302ABD355.quest_subtitle: "A casing and four large plates prove the steel hall can rebuild its pressure boundary."
	quest.17BA3A7302ABD355.title: "Recover the Hot Line"
	quest.17C7A7DBFE59857A.quest_desc: [
		"Produce at least four rubber sheets and four coal coke in later runs."
		"Replace the resin, raw rubber, and coal consumed so both lines remain ready for another order."
	]
	quest.17C7A7DBFE59857A.quest_subtitle: "A second batch proves solid fuel and polymer output can share the district without starving each other."
	quest.17C7A7DBFE59857A.title: "Repeat Coke and Rubber Production"
	quest.18068C9060097A6D.quest_desc: [
		"Stage RCS control stock, platinum repair metal, and two Big Fuel Tank Upgrades for a working flight fleet."
		"The mature tank run uses two native T4 tanks and the material burden of two standard upgrades, with pumps, controls, polymer, and lubricant paying for automation."
	]
	quest.18068C9060097A6D.quest_subtitle: "RCS, platinum, and two mature tank upgrades carry control and propellant repairs across several missions."
	quest.18068C9060097A6D.title: "Stage Three-Shift Flight Stock"
	quest.1807EB5C02D2A745.quest_desc: ["Build a titanium rocket casing to prove returned ore, PGM controls, propulsion, life support, cargo handling, and recovery now support repeatable deep-space freight.", "Repeatable remote cargo, flight control and planetary extraction establish permanent deep-space supply."]
	quest.1807EB5C02D2A745.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 12 PROOF — Cosmonautics and Deep Space"
	quest.1807EB5C02D2A745.title: "Deep-Space Freight Yard Proven"
	quest.1872493EE179B692.quest_desc: ["Build a Railcraft Item Loader and install it beside a serviced freight track and cargo cart.","Transfer a real production batch through the loader, then document the destination and the manual recovery path before expanding the corridor.","Operate a Create portable storage interface on the serviced train route; its native advancement records an actual interface connection. Railcraft loading and unloading handles the mature terminal. Route throughput and unattended recovery still need an operating check.","Each item loader and unloader needs an item detector: craft eight stripped wood blocks around one stone pressure plate. Use full stripped wood blocks and stone pressure plates; TFC variants of both are accepted. Supply the rail-grade steel plates, standard rails and controller circuits for both terminal machines through their existing production lines.","Each Railcraft controller circuit uses one repeater, two red wool blocks, one slime ball, one gold ingot, one lapis gem and two redstone dust. Ordinary slime balls match the installed common tag; TFC lapis gems match the lapis tag. Reserve four circuits for the selected locomotive, loader, unloader and advanced-loader crafts.","Look for Beneath's slimed netherrack in the Nether and return alive with 13 raw slime. The quern makes 13 ordinary slime balls: reserve four for circuits and craft nine into a slime block, then nine TFC glue. One glue, paper, flux, sand and gem powder make sandpaper. Mine four TFC lapis ores in limestone or marble (Y -20 to 80) and polish them; four crafts use four of a fresh sandpaper's 40 durability. One panned amethyst ore gives four gem powders in the quern, with only one needed here. Prepare the expedition's tools before departure; this extra glue batch supplies the later sandpaper.","Spin eight TFC wool into 64 yarn, weave four cloth, then eight white wool. The MI bronze mixer dyes all eight with one red dye for 200 mB steam; use the rail-stock packet's last clean hematite powder for that dye. Add a mixer and two steam pipes; the mixer craft also consumes two pipes. An additional 2,000 mB charge from the existing boiler leaves 1,800 mB after this job; keep earlier machine residues separate and supply water, heat and fuel. Reserve four gold ingots and 20 redstone dust for the four repeaters and final circuit crafts.","Mine 16 normal native-gold ores from TFC igneous rock veins (Y 0 to 70). Hammer them into 80 rocky chunks, wash those in the sluice, quern the 80 gold chunks, then wash all 80 dirty powders. Each clean gold powder melts into five TFC metal units at 1,060 °C: the 400 units supply exactly four gold ingots. Allow 16 additional hammer uses and 80 handstone uses; optional washing drops do not count toward this batch.","Use a separate charcoal forge for these four gold ingots. Knap four fresh ingot molds from 10 additional clay balls and fire them together with eight oak logs and eight straw; let the fired pottery cool for 4000 player ticks before pickup. Build an eight-charcoal pile with five additional raw-granite insulation blocks at the four sides and below. Use one of the two spare blast-furnace bricks temporarily above the pile to place the other brick two blocks above it as a rain cover. Recover the temporary brick before lighting; keep the space directly above the forge empty and a neighboring sky column open. One spare brick remains. Reserve 23 charcoal from the earlier coking byproducts while preserving the 550-charcoal rail-furnace reserve: eight build the forge, ten fuel it and five stay spare. For a cold forge, warm for 1500 ticks, then process sixteen loads of five powders for up to 1000 ticks each, with four fresh molds in the mold output slots. The covered forge reaches 1350°C without bellows, above gold’s 1060°C melt; rain without the cover lowers it too far. After all four molds fill, stop feeding fuel and leave them in the unheated output slots for 4000 player ticks before collecting. Pickup must be below 300°C because TFCHotOrNot can eject hot items. Extract four cold ingots and assume all molds break. No hot vessel transfer or later nickel equipment is needed; reserve all four ingots for the circuits. Extra delays and the other factories’ fuel remain additional.","For two item detectors, craft 24 additional oak logs into 18 full wood blocks. Place 16, strip them with a fresh sedimentary stone axe, then recover them with that axe; keep the other two full wood blocks. The 16 stripping actions and 16 recoveries use 32 of the axe’s 50 durability, leaving 18. Obtain the 24 actual logs separately and allow additional forestry wear. Four ordinary raw-granite mining drops provide at least four loose granite rocks (one to four per drop). Chisel four bricks, then two stone pressure plates; these six crafts use six chisel durability. Each detector consumes eight recovered full stripped wood blocks and one plate.","Prepare a new copper chisel from a forged head, copper rivet, glue and a stick handle. Two additional TFC copper ingots supply one head and the rod-to-stamen-to-rivet line; keep one spare rod, one stamen and four rivets. Use one of the input packet’s eight spare glues, leaving seven. One further stick makes the fresh axe; rock knapping requires two sedimentary loose rocks in hand and consumes one. Work at the Copper anvil with a stone hammer and workable-temperature feed. A fresh 600-durability copper chisel retains 594 after the brick and plate crafts. Budget forging-hammer wear and working heat separately.","For the four controllers, mine three cinnabar ores with a bronze pick or better. Look in gneiss, phyllite, quartzite or schist: deep veins occur below Y 10, with mountain veins at Y 120–280. Each ore gives seven rocky chunks under the hammer. Sluice all 21, quern the resulting chunks, then sluice the dirty dust into 21 ordinary redstone dust. Use a fresh intrusive stone hammer and handstone: three hammer crafts leave 57 of 60 durability, and 21 quern jobs leave 229 of 250. The earlier workshop’s redstone and tool costs remain additional.","Collect 15 raw granite blocks by exposing all six faces and allowing TFC to drop the isolated block: reserve 12 for repeaters and three for the new handstone. Obtain two loose granite rocks for the new hammer’s knapping threshold; one is consumed. The enabled utility craft turns two additional oak logs into 16 sticks: spend one on each tool and eight on torches, leaving six. Allocate the 21 dust once: eight for eight torches, four for four repeaters, and eight directly for four circuits, leaving one dust. The circuits also consume the reserved four gold ingots, four lapis gems, four slime balls and eight red wool. Keep both detectors for the terminal crafts.","For the two hoppers, make five additional steel ingots; the earlier forty are already allocated. Twenty more normal hematite ores become 100 clean powders and 25 pellets: five briquets plus five separate pellets supply five 100-unit blooms and five wrought ingots. Mill those ingots with a new 2000 mB steam charge, then add five flux for steelmaking. Allow at least 125 mB more boiler water plus heating fuel and additional forging-tool wear. Twelve new bituminous coal become twelve coke dust: add these to the retained furnace fuel unit at timer 400. Eleven dust would leave the fifth batch unable to complete. Coke 218 more actual oak logs for 54,500 mB creosote; with the prior 60 mB, spend 54,400 mB on the five hot-air replenishments, leaving 160 mB. Ten of the new charcoal byproducts fuel the five blooms. Reuse 20 hammer and 100 handstone uses from the circuit packet, leaving 37 and 129 respectively.","Press the five new steel ingots into five ordinary MI steel plates at the existing independent 8 RPM, 8 SU tier-0 depot press. The MI hand recipe turns eight further oak logs into four ordinary chests; use one chest and all five plates for two hoppers, retaining three chests. These eight logs are additional to the 218 fuel logs. Keep the existing typed slag line: the five batches raise stored slag from 5760 to 6480 mB in its 8000 mB tank. The full furnace-gas bank retains none of the additional gas. Craft and detect the base item loader before upgrading it. The loader, unloader and upgrade together consume both hoppers, both detectors, three circuits, twelve rail plates, six standard rails and the crowbar. Finish with one advanced loader and one unloader; the base loader has been consumed. Keep one circuit, one plate, one standard rail, one track part and the underframe for the still-unfinished locomotive."]
	quest.1872493EE179B692.quest_subtitle: "Rail freight is the first durable bridge between separated heavy-industry sites."
	quest.1872493EE179B692.title: "Freight Transfer Line"
	quest.18819BDF2078A956.quest_desc: [
		"Stock thioquartz for analysis and Deepsilver for conductive work."
		"Deepsilver remains a required authority in both the standard and mature Superconductor Dust lines and later represents Starlight in the Infinity Catalyst."
	]
	quest.18819BDF2078A956.quest_subtitle: "Thioquartz and Deepsilver preserve both research stock and the conductive authority required by Quantum."
	quest.18819BDF2078A956.title: "Stock Conductive Starlight Samples"
	quest.189A9AA2D3ED80A2.quest_desc: [
		"Craft an Infinity Catalyst after commissioning the universal fabrication anchor."
		"Use current production from every authority and preserve the records needed to repeat the order."
	]
	quest.189A9AA2D3ED80A2.quest_subtitle: "An Infinity Catalyst closes the program only because every earlier district can still provide its own contribution."
	quest.189A9AA2D3ED80A2.title: "Commission the Megastructure Program"
	quest.18AD71552677CA5D.quest_desc: [
		"Reach Eternal Starlight’s Abyss biome."
		"Use visible markers, secure vertical access, and turn back before consuming the recovery reserve."
	]
	quest.18AD71552677CA5D.quest_subtitle: "At the Abyss edge, poor visibility and vertical risk make the retreat route more important than the next sample."
	quest.18AD71552677CA5D.title: "Abyss Edge Survey"
	quest.18E7AAE45B74D5E5.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 15 opens, build a Rocketnautics rocket thruster."
		"Stage it as a completed propulsion module with fuel, control, installation, and replacement plans."
	]
	quest.18E7AAE45B74D5E5.quest_subtitle: "An orbital shipyard replaces bench assembly with gantries, pressure-hull staging, propulsion tests, and recoverable launch hardware."
	quest.18E7AAE45B74D5E5.title: "Orbital Shipyard"
	quest.18EE5CEF26DFC976.quest_desc: [
		"Build eight Rocketnautics engine nozzles through the installed route."
		"Inspect and label the batch, then replenish titanium and alloy components before committing them to multiple craft."
	]
	quest.18EE5CEF26DFC976.quest_subtitle: "Eight engine nozzles prove aerospace fabrication can run as a batch without turning into an arbitrary stockpile."
	quest.18EE5CEF26DFC976.title: "Batch Engine Nozzles"
	quest.18FEC984A51A865A.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer eight thousand millibuckets of TFMG lubrication oil."
		"Store it in a labeled maintenance tank and keep the final reserve out of ordinary fuel lines."
	]
	quest.18FEC984A51A865A.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of lubrication oil turn machine care into a supplied service instead of an emergency bucket search."
	quest.18FEC984A51A865A.title: "Lubricant Reserve"
	quest.190CE1149DE78F57.quest_desc: ["Commission an airship station and transponder so aeronautic vehicles can be identified, routed, and recovered."]
	quest.190CE1149DE78F57.quest_subtitle: "Give every vessel a home and an identity."
	quest.190CE1149DE78F57.title: "Airship Station and Transponder"
	quest.193CA92A032C17A8.quest_desc: [
		"Build and crate two Cargo Boats capacity upgrades for controlled issue."
		"Test them with actual cargo and expand destination storage before increasing scheduled volume."
	]
	quest.193CA92A032C17A8.quest_subtitle: "Two capacity upgrades let the yard compare a larger load against the route’s real unloading limit."
	quest.193CA92A032C17A8.title: "Cargo Upgrade Crate"
	quest.196E3668D6B0A39C.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four Quantum Circuits, sixty-four superconductor ingots, and one mature twenty-four-dust run."
		"The ingot target requires sixty-four one-output cryogenic cycles, so automate the Assembler and cryogenic feed before treating this as facility-scale reserve stock."
	]
	quest.196E3668D6B0A39C.quest_subtitle: "Sixty-four ingots and twenty-four dust prove sustained Quantum fabrication rather than a one-off sample."
	quest.196E3668D6B0A39C.title: "Stock Quantum Fabrication"
	quest.1978E82D0E882F14.quest_desc: ["Build all eight LUV functional families and verify that each recipe consumes its matching IV component; this prepares the neutron and Starlight works."]
	quest.1978E82D0E882F14.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Ludicrous Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.1978E82D0E882F14.title: "LUV Component Standard"
	quest.197EA43E280550A0.quest_desc: [
		"Build and store two Rocketnautics engine nozzles."
		"Keep their current material route documented and isolate used hardware from clean replacement stock."
	]
	quest.197EA43E280550A0.quest_subtitle: "Two engine nozzles keep one failed burn from returning the whole aerospace works to prototype parts."
	quest.197EA43E280550A0.title: "Vacuum Aerospace Works Repair Shelf"
	quest.19A1AC76720FD9EC.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a QuarryPlus quarry inside the surveyed boundary."
		"Provide power, overflow, shutdown, and a plan for every extracted material."
	]
	quest.19A1AC76720FD9EC.quest_subtitle: "A quarry is mass processing’s front door; its output rate is useful only when geology, power, and storage remain accountable."
	quest.19A1AC76720FD9EC.title: "Quarry Pit Contract"
	quest.19CA3FCDD6FF44DC.quest_desc: ["Produce a Stellaris desh plating block from returned material.","Raw desh from ordinary lunar mining, or from macerating Silk Touch ore, is blast-furnaced with TFMG coal coke before fabrication."]
	quest.19CA3FCDD6FF44DC.quest_subtitle: "A desh plating block proves Moon ore has crossed the complete return-processing chain."
	quest.19CA3FCDD6FF44DC.title: "Plate the Returned Desh"
	quest.1A0898B9C30A00BF.quest_desc: [
		"Complete AE2’s fluix advancement through the installed transformation."
		"Use the result in a controller-backed network and keep enough material to recover its first cable branch."
	]
	quest.1A0898B9C30A00BF.quest_subtitle: "The first fluix signal marks certus and redstone becoming a medium for an actual powered network."
	quest.1A0898B9C30A00BF.title: "Fluix First Signal"
	quest.1A440C7058DEB8B6.quest_desc: [
		"Build four Rocketnautics titanium nozzles and eight MI titanium curved plates."
		"Inspect throat, casing, alloy sheet, and plate supply before accepting the batch for spacecraft work."
	]
	quest.1A440C7058DEB8B6.quest_subtitle: "Four titanium nozzles and curved plates put a complete second propulsion shift on the rack."
	quest.1A440C7058DEB8B6.title: "Stock Titanium Nozzles for Second Shift"
	quest.1A536FFC498094E4.quest_desc: [
		"Find 8 small native copper."
		"Compare loose native-copper flecks with the surrounding rock and mark the search radius before digging."
	]
	quest.1A536FFC498094E4.quest_subtitle: "A wider scatter of copper flecks makes the geology worth recording."
	quest.1A536FFC498094E4.title: "Read Copper Flecks in the Field"
	quest.1A57E0F180BD83FE.quest_desc: ["Hold a steel upgrade and one canonical TFC steel ingot after commissioning the main line.","The decorative reward closes this branch; LV circuits, wire, batteries, and generators still require their own work."]
	quest.1A57E0F180BD83FE.quest_subtitle: "A steel upgrade backed by fresh ingot production marks a factory that can improve itself."
	quest.1A57E0F180BD83FE.title: "Repairable Steelworks Online"
	quest.1A97FD1D97E6F468.quest_desc: ["Install an AE2 pattern provider as proof that processors, channels, storage, and physical workcells can coordinate repeatable manufacturing.", "COM-04 also establishes stainless Greate machinery. Encode machine processes that already work, then request their outputs. Digital stockkeeping does not replace freight terminals or offworld return supply."]
	quest.1A97FD1D97E6F468.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 10 PROOF — Stainless and Digital"
	quest.1A97FD1D97E6F468.title: "Digital Factory Proven"
	quest.1AC7A9885837340A.quest_desc: [
		"After Steel Steam opens, build the TFMG steel distillation controller."
		"Complete the tower with safe crude input, separate product tanks, and room to service every outlet."
	]
	quest.1AC7A9885837340A.quest_subtitle: "The steel distillation controller makes TFMG the visible authority for separating crude into useful petroleum streams."
	quest.1AC7A9885837340A.title: "Steel Distillation Tower"
	quest.1ACDE689B1BC9AC4.quest_desc: [
		"Stock 4 copper ingot."
		"Melt and cast the copper reserved for the first pick without consuming the ingot assigned to the proof batch."
	]
	quest.1ACDE689B1BC9AC4.quest_subtitle: "Four copper ingots in reserve keep the first tool failure from closing the mine."
	quest.1ACDE689B1BC9AC4.title: "Reserve Copper for the First Pick"
	quest.1AD8FC4A225A10DD.quest_desc: ["Commission a Classic Stargate only after launch, return, remote-hazard, reserve, and recovery procedures form a maintainable space program."]
	quest.1AD8FC4A225A10DD.quest_subtitle: "Discipline mastery — supporting branch; follow the chapter age proof for the main transition."
	quest.1AD8FC4A225A10DD.title: "Space Operations Corps Proven"
	quest.1ADEC4166C3A7F2D.quest_desc: [
		"Build four MI advanced motors and eight Electro Energetics wire connectors."
		"Replenish annealed copper, electrum, aluminum, magnetic alloy, and accessible connector stock after the batch."
	]
	quest.1ADEC4166C3A7F2D.quest_subtitle: "Four advanced motors and eight connectors cover one meaningful MV expansion without building an arbitrary motor warehouse."
	quest.1ADEC4166C3A7F2D.title: "Buffer Motors and Grid Connectors"
	quest.1AFAEEC008E29AB2.quest_desc: [
		"Build one Stellaris fuel module."
		"Confirm its current recipe, then place it with the launch hardware instead of counting reward inventory as mission equipment."
	]
	quest.1AFAEEC008E29AB2.quest_subtitle: "A completed fuel module packages the propellant system for use beyond the refinery yard."
	quest.1AFAEEC008E29AB2.title: "Build the Fuel Module"
	quest.1B4C281509EC6A33.quest_desc: [
		"Store 500,000 FE in the laboratory power system."
		"Restart pumps and containment first, verify every tank and tube route, then energize reaction and separation machines one at a time."
	]
	quest.1B4C281509EC6A33.quest_subtitle: "Half a million FE can restore controls and transfer hazardous contents before normal production resumes."
	quest.1B4C281509EC6A33.title: "Charge the Laboratory Black Start"
	quest.1B638A41D009EC7F.quest_desc: ["Milestone 4: establish the digital apiary with the advanced hive. Field cages and manual centrifuging came first; LV incubation and space breeding established controlled stock.","Supply the correct species and flowers. This optional Age 10 shell supports later powered handling and ME integration, not first resource discovery."]
	quest.1B638A41D009EC7F.quest_subtitle: "An advanced hive turns bees into managed livestock only after Chemical-era materials make the enclosure possible."
	quest.1B638A41D009EC7F.title: "Industrial Apiary Shell"
	quest.1BE68BA11E58B77A.quest_desc: ["Stabilization uses the mature mechatronics and sensor suppliers of Deep Space. Keep manual control and override available before automated routing."]
	quest.1BE68BA11E58B77A.quest_subtitle: "Stable flight starts with measured movement."
	quest.1BE68BA11E58B77A.title: "Gyroscope and Stepper Servo"
	quest.1C0958F6F78A3138.quest_desc: ["Build the authored Overpowered Voltage consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.1C0958F6F78A3138.quest_subtitle: "The OPV standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.1C0958F6F78A3138.title: "OPV Consumer Proof"
	quest.1C1D30DE13588D17.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the AE2 energy acceptor and stock eight charged Certus crystals."
		"Open the main feed, restore local power, confirm storage, then resume crafting."
	]
	quest.1C1D30DE13588D17.quest_subtitle: "An inspected energy acceptor and eight charged crystals make restoration a known sequence rather than a scavenger hunt."
	quest.1C1D30DE13588D17.title: "Run the Network Blackout Drill"
	quest.1C3BABEE6504FB9D.quest_desc: [
		"Charge Certus after Stainless and Digital materials and the first bounded CC:Tweaked wired-control route are established; Processing Arrays and Machine Chainers are not prerequisites for this entry."
		"AE2 begins here as powered storage and networking. Mature autocrafting waits for processing control and a proven coordinated machine floor."
	]
	quest.1C3BABEE6504FB9D.quest_subtitle: "Charged Certus and Fluix begin a network whose convenience must remain tied to physical power and material flow."
	quest.1C3BABEE6504FB9D.title: "Certus and Fluix Start"
	quest.1C5D52EED7C076D4.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a basic chemical tank in the laboratory quarantine area."
		"Keep it compatible with the intended contents, disconnected from unrelated gases, and empty enough for an emergency transfer."
	]
	quest.1C5D52EED7C076D4.quest_subtitle: "Containment planning begins with an accessible tank that can receive a line before it is opened."
	quest.1C5D52EED7C076D4.title: "Inspect Emergency Chemical Storage"
	quest.1C67DB519D49BC6E.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Rocketnautics rocket thrusters through the live mechanical-crafting pattern."
		"Inspect symmetry and input quality before assigning the pair to a spacecraft."
	]
	quest.1C67DB519D49BC6E.quest_subtitle: "A matched rocket-thruster pair makes the next propulsion build a planned assembly instead of vertical busywork."
	quest.1C67DB519D49BC6E.title: "Prepare a Second Thruster Shift"
	quest.1C8D795AC23565E5.quest_desc: [
		"Open working cargo storage 25 times while loading or auditing real mission supplies."
		"Separate outbound equipment, surface consumables, samples, and the protected return reserve."
	]
	quest.1C8D795AC23565E5.quest_subtitle: "Repeated chest work records the unglamorous loading discipline that keeps remote crews supplied."
	quest.1C8D795AC23565E5.title: "Stage Mission Cargo"
	quest.1C99DF0F6E19C544.quest_desc: [
		"Run a second batch of eight Quantum circuits and eight superconductor ingots."
		"Run both lines from replenished inputs, including Starlight samples, fusion isotopes, and cryofluid."
	]
	quest.1C99DF0F6E19C544.quest_subtitle: "A second batch proves PGM, Deepsilver, Starlight catalysts, isotope feed, cryofluid, and cable production can all recover together."
	quest.1C99DF0F6E19C544.title: "Run a Second Quantum Batch"
	quest.1C9A44B11C45964D.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a Stellaris rocket engine and fin on the inspection stand."
		"Look for the part that caused abnormal handling or fuel use, then replace from stocked inputs rather than cannibalizing the next rocket."
	]
	quest.1C9A44B11C45964D.quest_subtitle: "Engine and fin together make post-flight inspection a system check instead of a glance at the hull."
	quest.1C9A44B11C45964D.title: "Engine Inspection Stand"
	quest.1CB1D6FE111F9B27.quest_desc: ["Compact six raw Rubberworks rubber into one Greate rubber belt connector with an andesite-alloy press and basin. Gear a single andesite press to 8 RPM or lower so it stays within the native 8 SU network limit.","Use rubber belts with andesite-alloy or steel shafts. Later grades pair silicone rubber with aluminum/stainless, polyethylene with titanium/tungsten steel, PTFE with palladium/naquadah, and PBI with darmstadtium/neutronium. Build a depot on the working line and keep loading, overflow, and maintenance visible."]
	quest.1CB1D6FE111F9B27.quest_subtitle: "Once Heavy Industry supplies real rubber belts, a depot can separate moving cargo from machine timing."
	quest.1CB1D6FE111F9B27.title: "Greate Belts and Depots"
	quest.1CE701199DF997EE.quest_desc: ["Stage eight bauxite dust, two desh ingots, and two tharsite ingots.","Keep the planetary catalysts out of general storage and preserve coke and empty blast-furnace output space.","MAT-03 unlocks poor, normal and rich TFC bauxite maceration at 32 EU with a reusable MI analog circuit. Macerate the crushed bauxite again into dust for reduction; small surface samples mark deposits rather than supply this process."]
	quest.1CE701199DF997EE.quest_subtitle: "Bauxite, desh, and tharsite on one pallet make the aluminum campaign traceable from mine to Moon and Mars."
	quest.1CE701199DF997EE.title: "Stage Bauxite and Returned Space Metals"
	quest.1CEDA3F1E7E7EBA6.quest_desc: [
		"Place a fusion chamber and complete the fusion reactor assembly."
		"Leave access for plasma handling and isolate the high-field equipment from ordinary traffic."
	]
	quest.1CEDA3F1E7E7EBA6.quest_subtitle: "A chamber and reactor placed together expose the real footprint of confinement, service access, and power routing."
	quest.1CEDA3F1E7E7EBA6.title: "Lay Out the Fusion Core"
	quest.1D1BA37FC9E3CE3F.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Firmalife climate station."
		"Use its readings to plan crops and preservation; it reports conditions but does not protect food by itself."
	]
	quest.1D1BA37FC9E3CE3F.quest_subtitle: "A climate station turns seasons from surprise into information the farm can act on."
	quest.1D1BA37FC9E3CE3F.title: "Survival Economy Online"
	quest.1D359BFF2A2FC900.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one TFC black bear only on prepared ground."
		"Keep food and livestock away from the fight, preserve an escape route, and do not chase into poor visibility."
	]
	quest.1D359BFF2A2FC900.quest_subtitle: "A black bear encounter is survived by distance, visibility, and a retreat chosen before the animal commits."
	quest.1D359BFF2A2FC900.title: "Black Bear Retreat"
	quest.1D65099B5B8053FB.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a TFC Cold Sweat wool chestplate."
		"Wear it before cold travel and still carry shelter fuel; insulation delays exposure but does not erase it."
	]
	quest.1D65099B5B8053FB.quest_subtitle: "Wool workwear turns cold from an immediate retreat into a condition that can be planned around."
	quest.1D65099B5B8053FB.title: "Winter Work Garb"
	quest.1DB8AD4EA3D6812D.quest_desc: ["Use the Watch or Time Wand on an ordinary production process. Both reject Dark Matter Pedestals and the protected Oritech accelerator, reactor and deep-drill controllers. Test other reactors, spatial systems and inventory-heavy machines before scaling their acceleration."]
	quest.1DB8AD4EA3D6812D.quest_subtitle: "Portable ProjectE time control follows OpV and Infinity and shares the temporal blacklist."
	quest.1DB8AD4EA3D6812D.title: "Infinity Time Watch"
	quest.1DB922872A2A8777.quest_desc: ["Build all eight ZPM functional families and verify that each recipe consumes its matching LUV component; this prepares superconductors, fusion, and quantum machinery."]
	quest.1DB922872A2A8777.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Zero Point functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.1DB922872A2A8777.title: "ZPM Component Standard"
	quest.1E51162C2FA371F5.quest_desc: ["Build the rail-qualified engine, reinforced wing set, docking connector, and service stock; fly a useful cargo circuit manually."]
	quest.1E51162C2FA371F5.quest_subtitle: "A stronger aircraft earns real instruments, cargo capacity, and a rail-fed service base."
	quest.1E51162C2FA371F5.title: "Practical Aviation"
	quest.1E5C13466716A5F3.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight barley breads and eight TFC garlic."
		"Rotate the oldest food into short trips and replenish the shelf from current harvests."
	]
	quest.1E5C13466716A5F3.quest_subtitle: "Eight loaves and eight garlic make a modest field reserve without replacing farming or cooking."
	quest.1E5C13466716A5F3.title: "Pack Food and Recovery Stock"
	quest.1E61311DFAD50AFE.quest_desc: [
		"Build another bronze macerator and stock sixteen bronze plates for its upkeep."
		"Connect it only after the boiler and steam distribution can support both machines without starving the original line."
	]
	quest.1E61311DFAD50AFE.quest_subtitle: "A second macerator separates steady ore work from experiments and rush orders."
	quest.1E61311DFAD50AFE.title: "Install a Second Macerator"
	quest.1E62A29D12543CE6.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four MI iridium ingots and form four iridium plates."
		"Begin from current PGM concentrate rather than dismantling stored sensors or claiming rewards."
	]
	quest.1E62A29D12543CE6.quest_subtitle: "Fresh ingots and plates close the chain from harsh-world cargo to hardened control hardware."
	quest.1E62A29D12543CE6.title: "Rebuild Iridium from Concentrate"
	quest.1E8AFB4035F2E1D2.quest_desc: ["Run pickup, delivery, blocked destination, return, and manual recovery; drones do not replace rail or long-distance freight."]
	quest.1E8AFB4035F2E1D2.quest_subtitle: "Discipline mastery — supporting branch; follow the chapter age proof for the main transition."
	quest.1E8AFB4035F2E1D2.title: "Digital Drone Depot"
	quest.1ED16D5A5C1C65D5.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four fission fuel assemblies and eight Electro Energetics heavy wire connectors."
		"Keep the assemblies unloaded and the connectors de-energized until the commissioning checklist is complete."
	]
	quest.1ED16D5A5C1C65D5.quest_subtitle: "Four fuel assemblies and eight heavy connectors make reactor input and output replaceable without claiming rewards."
	quest.1ED16D5A5C1C65D5.title: "Stage Fuel and Grid Connections"
	quest.1EF84B1905C9C942.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Mekanism Geiger counter through its live integrated recipe."
		"It consumes the Mekanism instrument, an MI digital circuit, lead plates, and a Mekanism advanced control circuit; carry it before fuel work begins."
	]
	quest.1EF84B1905C9C942.quest_subtitle: "Radiation that cannot be sensed directly must be measured before the site is treated as ordinary workspace."
	quest.1EF84B1905C9C942.title: "Radiation Instruments"
	quest.1F23B873D8E85661.quest_desc: [
		"Place a fired large vessel and remain nearby long enough for the book to inspect it."
		"Keep a fired jug with the storage area so water is ready before travel or hot work begins."
	]
	quest.1F23B873D8E85661.quest_subtitle: "A camp becomes a workshop when supplies have a place to survive."
	quest.1F23B873D8E85661.title: "Set Down Durable Storage"
	quest.1F3408ABA5096248.quest_desc: [
		"Compress and store four TFMG coal-coke blocks."
		"Keep loose coke for recipes that cannot accept blocks, and record which furnaces consume the bulk reserve."
	]
	quest.1F3408ABA5096248.quest_subtitle: "Four coke blocks make furnace demand visible before the stockyard runs empty."
	quest.1F3408ABA5096248.title: "Stack Coke for Continuous Heat"
	quest.1F3C068997330356.quest_desc: [
		"Research and assemble a Crystal Processor at 4096 EU/t from Crystal SoCs and the advanced cleanroom electronics chain."
		"The first Star Fuel now consumes this Assembly Line output directly."
	]
	quest.1F3C068997330356.quest_subtitle: "A Crystal Processor is explicit proof that researched 4096-EU/t assembly works."
	quest.1F3C068997330356.title: "Crystal Processor"
	quest.1F5AA3ECA2497928.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the Mekanism Solar Neutron Activator after fusion preparation and Moon cargo are available."
		"Separate clean feed, active processing, waste hold-up, monitoring, service access, and outbound material records."
	]
	quest.1F5AA3ECA2497928.quest_subtitle: "A reprocessor connected to lunar logistics shows how fuel work expands from one reactor into a controlled industrial district."
	quest.1F5AA3ECA2497928.title: "Preview the National Fuel Complex"
	quest.1F5BDBCAAEB1012F.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer four thousand millibuckets of helium plasma."
		"Draw from a measured plasma system and restore the turbine and UU-Matter buffers afterward."
	]
	quest.1F5BDBCAAEB1012F.quest_subtitle: "Four buckets of helium plasma keep the final works connected to sustained fusion rather than a symbolic reactor."
	quest.1F5BDBCAAEB1012F.title: "Plasma Tribute Line"
	quest.1F70969F461B95CF.quest_desc: [
		"Fire and hold a large ceramic vessel as a concrete reserve for safe storage and recovery."
		"Keep important tools, food, and pottery away from experiments and other avoidable hazards."
	]
	quest.1F70969F461B95CF.quest_subtitle: "Preparation is what remains after luck stops being kind."
	quest.1F70969F461B95CF.title: "Backups and Safe Ground"
	quest.1F83DF30AD02CA7A.quest_desc: [
		"Sleep in a bed after returning from field work."
		"Use the stop to unload perishables, refill water, and repair the kit."
	]
	quest.1F83DF30AD02CA7A.quest_subtitle: "One safe night is evidence that the route home, the bed, and the shelter all remained usable."
	quest.1F83DF30AD02CA7A.title: "Shelter Memory"
	quest.1FA01E52E967CC6D.quest_desc: [
		"Reach twenty mob kills through ordinary defense and prepared hunts."
		"Keep fights away from animals and storage, and replace food, ammunition, and damaged gear afterward."
	]
	quest.1FA01E52E967CC6D.quest_subtitle: "Twenty hostile encounters show the homestead can be defended without making combat its daily food plan."
	quest.1FA01E52E967CC6D.title: "Predator Tally"
	quest.2000D629B0B8767B.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement EV motors, pumps, robot arms, sensors, emitters, and field generators for vacuum, pressure, and aerospace machinery, then verify the HV line still operates."]
	quest.2000D629B0B8767B.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.2000D629B0B8767B.title: "EV Recovery Proof"
	quest.203AD838B55F2DBE.quest_desc: ["Build all eight HV functional families and verify that each recipe consumes its matching MV component; this prepares the stainless and digital factory."]
	quest.203AD838B55F2DBE.quest_subtitle: "All eight real High Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.203AD838B55F2DBE.title: "HV Component Standard"
	quest.20417C57931939EC.quest_desc: [
		"Build an SGJourney control crystal with the pack recipe."
		"It grows from a crystal base around an AE2 engineering processor and superconductor wire, after the naquadah route is established."
	]
	quest.20417C57931939EC.quest_subtitle: "The control crystal turns a naquadah structure into an addressable machine."
	quest.20417C57931939EC.title: "Build a Stargate Control Crystal"
	quest.204A327EBAD10639.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight barley breads and thirty-two charcoal."
		"Replenish grain and wood after the batch so the reserve represents repeatable work."
	]
	quest.204A327EBAD10639.quest_subtitle: "Eight loaves beside thirty-two charcoal keep cooking and shelter from competing after one long trip."
	quest.204A327EBAD10639.title: "Restock Food and Fuel"
	quest.208A26C7E43B7A45.quest_desc: [
		"After the primary shield branch, place and inspect a second shield generator."
		"Configure targets conservatively, test from safe range, and ensure authorized workers cannot be trapped inside the controlled zone."
	]
	quest.208A26C7E43B7A45.quest_subtitle: "A controlled exclusion field is commissioned only after the passive shield and its power route are understood."
	quest.208A26C7E43B7A45.title: "Controlled Exclusion Field"
	quest.209788A5CC6C6DC6.quest_desc: [
		"Open working barrel storage ten times while processing real food or materials."
		"Arrange barrels so fresh, fermenting, and finished stock cannot be confused."
	]
	quest.209788A5CC6C6DC6.quest_subtitle: "A pantry becomes useful when supplies move through it often enough to reveal bad organization."
	quest.209788A5CC6C6DC6.title: "Work the Pantry Barrels"
	quest.20F4EF68438B138E.quest_desc: ["Earn MI’s analog-circuit advancement through COM-01 and the TFMG/rubber/tin prototype recipe.","Retain the components for another circuit; the same analog controls serve motors, machine hulls, steam generation and the launch complex."]
	quest.20F4EF68438B138E.quest_subtitle: "The first MI control advancement follows the terrestrial analog prototype."
	quest.20F4EF68438B138E.title: "Analog Circuit Proof"
	quest.210738A262D11D51.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect a bronze machine casing and stock sixteen steel large plates."
		"Plan ports, power, fluids, access, containment, expansion, and recovery before placing decorative shells."
	]
	quest.210738A262D11D51.quest_subtitle: "A bronze casing reference and sixteen large plates turn planning into dimensions, loads, and service routes."
	quest.210738A262D11D51.title: "Lay Out the Project Office"
	quest.2108826CC646393D.quest_desc: [
		"Build copper pickaxe head."
		"Pour copper into a fired pickaxe-head mold and let it cool; store the spare head at the mine entrance."
	]
	quest.2108826CC646393D.quest_subtitle: "A spare pickaxe head at the entrance is cheaper than abandoning a deep working."
	quest.2108826CC646393D.title: "Keep a Spare Pickaxe Head"
	quest.2136CD6D3D18274E.quest_desc: [
		"Reach the Rocketnautics lunar maria during the Stellaris-routed Moon expedition."
		"Mark the landing site before ranging outward, and keep oxygen, fuel, and cargo capacity for the return."
	]
	quest.2136CD6D3D18274E.quest_subtitle: "The lunar maria offer long sightlines and very little forgiveness for a forgotten reserve."
	quest.2136CD6D3D18274E.title: "Lunar Maria Landing"
	quest.213FDA8694BDE2F5.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen MI copper wire."
		"Before the wiremill exists, the live Create cutting recipe makes two wire from a copper plate; keep that bootstrap route accessible."
	]
	quest.213FDA8694BDE2F5.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen copper wire lets the first electrical jobs share material without dismantling one another."
	quest.213FDA8694BDE2F5.title: "Cut the Copper Wire Stock"
	quest.21687A405B03F6A8.quest_desc: [
		"Stock 32 flux."
		"Hammer enough fluxstone for the yard reserve and keep it dry beside the welding campaign."
	]
	quest.21687A405B03F6A8.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two flux keeps a welding session from ending halfway through the stock."
	quest.21687A405B03F6A8.title: "Flux Yard Reserve"
	quest.2178203275EFB7AB.quest_desc: [
		"Build four 1k item storage cells and sixteen Fluix glass cables."
		"Assign cell purpose, install them gradually, and verify type use before adding more."
	]
	quest.2178203275EFB7AB.quest_subtitle: "Four 1k cells and sixteen cables expand capacity and channel reach in a controlled, testable batch."
	quest.2178203275EFB7AB.title: "Open a Second Storage Shift"
	quest.21B0307C99614D4D.quest_desc: [
		"Build quern."
		"Mine suitable raw stone with the copper pick, craft the quern, and place it beside covered ore storage."
	]
	quest.21B0307C99614D4D.quest_subtitle: "The quern gives the mining camp a repeatable way to prepare solid materials by hand."
	quest.21B0307C99614D4D.title: "Build the Ore Quern"
	quest.21D3F7925C1B3312.quest_desc: ["Repeat deposit, withdrawal, crafting, smelting, compression, and recycling checks from a clean balance; retain audit stock."]
	quest.21D3F7925C1B3312.quest_subtitle: "The matter economy survives restart with no positive EMC loop."
	quest.21D3F7925C1B3312.title: "Tax and Loop Recovery Audit"
	quest.21D643C45CFBA9C7.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four Mekanism plutonium pellets through the approved nuclear-waste route."
		"Centrifuge waste, combine recovered plutonium with fluorite and water, and preserve spent-waste storage."
	]
	quest.21D643C45CFBA9C7.quest_subtitle: "Four plutonium pellets prove fissile material came from monitored reactor waste, not loot or direct crafting."
	quest.21D643C45CFBA9C7.title: "Recover Plutonium from Waste"
	quest.21D8407F29294CF3.quest_desc: ["Place and operate the base Simulation Chamber with a trained model and a replenished prediction-matrix supply.","Route outputs into explicit storage and document which drops are permitted.","Optional Digital simulation under COM-04. Hostile models and drops do not prove factory control or replace first-resource acquisition."]
	quest.21D8407F29294CF3.quest_subtitle: "The ordinary chamber establishes power, model training, prediction inputs, and bounded outputs before HNI acceleration."
	quest.21D8407F29294CF3.title: "Prove the Base Simulation Chamber"
	quest.21E91F3D5C319BCE.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Neutron Collector on its fourteen-operation extreme-industry line from nuclear, aerospace, Starlight, grid, magnetic-stabilization, and live LUV component systems."
		"Its field generator qualifies an Age 14 extreme-industry machine without pulling UU Matter backward from Quantum."
	]
	quest.21E91F3D5C319BCE.quest_subtitle: "The LUV standard earns its place inside a real neutron-production system."
	quest.21E91F3D5C319BCE.title: "LUV Consumer Proof"
	quest.21F9BC13BD4559B6.quest_desc: [
		"Bring eight legitimate copper indicators and eight cassiterite indicators back through the TFC geology route."
		"These are proof of renewed inputs; process enough real ore to replace what the foundry consumes."
	]
	quest.21F9BC13BD4559B6.quest_subtitle: "Fresh copper and tin close the loop between field geology and another bronze pour."
	quest.21F9BC13BD4559B6.title: "Feed the Foundry from Raw Ore"
	quest.22008BADAC484239.quest_desc: ["Build and inspect the HNI Mono Loot Fabricator.","Assign one permitted prediction route, label its destination, and verify that a full output stops safely.","Optional advanced simulation under RSR-01 Resource Simulation. HNI scales the earlier Digital model loop and shares the discipline of contained quarry-bee renewal; first discovery remains physical."]
	quest.22008BADAC484239.quest_subtitle: "The Mono Loot Fabricator accelerates one bounded product line without becoming a universal resource machine."
	quest.22008BADAC484239.title: "Isolate HNI Loot Fabrication"
	quest.22A53D2C69F4DB3A.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a TFMG steel fluid tank in the refinery storage area."
		"Separate ignition sources, label contents, provide shutoff, and leave access for leak inspection."
	]
	quest.22A53D2C69F4DB3A.quest_subtitle: "A steel fluid tank behind isolation and a firebreak teaches more about fuel safety than unrelated combat."
	quest.22A53D2C69F4DB3A.title: "Inspect Protected Fuel Storage"
	quest.22A6CF8F657A9E97.quest_desc: [
		"Enter a Rocketnautics lunar aged chasm."
		"Leave visible route markers, protect the ascent, and turn back while the independent oxygen reserve is still intact."
	]
	quest.22A6CF8F657A9E97.quest_subtitle: "Descending below the Moon trades landmarks for cover, ore, and a harder route back to the surface."
	quest.22A6CF8F657A9E97.title: "Lunar Chasm Descent"
	quest.22B84332B88B7FCE.quest_desc: ["Run a bounded ordinary-matter production batch and verify the input/output EMC balance remains taxed."]
	quest.22B84332B88B7FCE.quest_subtitle: "Nuclear-grade precision increases throughput without changing exchange authority."
	quest.22B84332B88B7FCE.title: "Energy Condenser MK2"
	quest.22BE6D7B16F9CB58.quest_desc: [
		"Produce one thousand millibuckets of MI UU Matter."
		"The pack Chemical Reactor route consumes helium plasma and deuterium while a singularity and Quantum circuit remain installed as catalysts."
	]
	quest.22BE6D7B16F9CB58.quest_subtitle: "The first bucket of UU Matter proves a controlled singularity can yield a measurable material stream."
	quest.22BE6D7B16F9CB58.title: "Condense the First UU Matter"
	quest.22CB913A3F53DE5C.quest_desc: [
		"Route one AE2 engineering processor through the configured automated inscriber sequence."
		"Replenish diamond, silicon, and redstone inputs after the routed craft completes."
	]
	quest.22CB913A3F53DE5C.quest_subtitle: "One correctly routed engineering processor validates the autocrafting path before throughput scaling."
	quest.22CB913A3F53DE5C.title: "Validate Engineering Processor Autocrafting"
	quest.22EEEC6BB64B443F.quest_desc: ["Pair a shield generator with the commissioned electromagnetic rail ejector before advancing to the final energy network."]
	quest.22EEEC6BB64B443F.quest_subtitle: "Protect the launch complex that feeds the megastructure."
	quest.22EEEC6BB64B443F.title: "Shielded Stellar Launch Complex"
	quest.231AAA8D46F0E522.quest_desc: [
		"Complete the Stellaris Venus-landing advancement."
		"Establish shelter and a return route before moving cargo away from the vehicle."
	]
	quest.231AAA8D46F0E522.quest_subtitle: "Sulfurous volcanic terrain signals chemical potential, but industrial sulfur still requires prospecting and a pressure-safe return."
	quest.231AAA8D46F0E522.title: "Venus Pressure Pilgrimage"
	quest.2392D8E34DF640F2.quest_desc: [
		"Build an AE2 crafting unit and connect it to the commissioned network."
		"Add capacity in response to real jobs, and keep processing machines accessible for manual diagnosis."
	]
	quest.2392D8E34DF640F2.quest_subtitle: "The crafting unit expands computation only after processors, patterns, storage, and machine routes are recoverable."
	quest.2392D8E34DF640F2.title: "Digital Factory Expansion Contract"
	quest.2404D0A02FBD90BF.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect Railcraft coke-oven bricks as part of a complete oven."
		"Give the hot structure clearance, dedicated creosote storage, rail-fuel output, and a firebreak before committing a coal batch."
	]
	quest.2404D0A02FBD90BF.quest_subtitle: "Railcraft owns creosote and rail-fuel coking; it is not a second process-gas plant."
	quest.2404D0A02FBD90BF.title: "Coke Oven Industry"
	quest.240FA442D139566C.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen MI titanium curved plates."
		"Separate tested repair stock from pieces already assigned to new spacecraft construction."
	]
	quest.240FA442D139566C.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen curved plates put a full pressure-hull repair campaign on the rack before damage occurs."
	quest.240FA442D139566C.title: "Fill the Titanium Curved-Plate Rack"
	quest.24379EF26CFEE577.quest_desc: [
		"Let the drop statistic accumulate through ordinary handling, not deliberate spam."
		"Replace unsafe drop points with bounded transport or storage where the process repeats."
	]
	quest.24379EF26CFEE577.quest_subtitle: "Two hundred dropped items expose any process that still depends on loose entities or manual sorting."
	quest.24379EF26CFEE577.title: "Drop Line Record"
	quest.247AB94AFA2BD065.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the fusion reactor and demonstrate one hundred million FE of independent storage."
		"Open the generator connection, confirm controls remain powered, and restore the system without admitting fuel into an unverified field."
	]
	quest.247AB94AFA2BD065.quest_subtitle: "The reactor must remain controllable when the generating side of the plant disappears."
	quest.247AB94AFA2BD065.title: "Run the Fusion Blackout Drill"
	quest.248916BF3AE65CCF.quest_desc: [
		"Accumulate the crouch distance while inspecting real cable runs and confined service spaces."
		"Add lighting, clearance, and isolation points wherever access depends on live equipment."
	]
	quest.248916BF3AE65CCF.quest_subtitle: "A hundred meters of careful cable access reveals routes that are impossible to service during a fault."
	quest.248916BF3AE65CCF.title: "Cable Crawl Record"
	quest.2493CDC631EEC123.quest_desc: [
		"Bake sixteen barley breads from the current food route."
		"Replace seed and grain stock before assigning the bread to long-term storage."
	]
	quest.2493CDC631EEC123.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen new loaves trace the reserve back through harvest, milling, dough, and heat."
	quest.2493CDC631EEC123.title: "Bake from a Fresh Grain Batch"
	quest.24BCE22A95D9278E.quest_desc: [
		"Build one Mekanism hazmat gown."
		"Use MI rubber sheet and lead plate, then complete helmet, leggings, and boots before entering a contaminated area."
	]
	quest.24BCE22A95D9278E.quest_subtitle: "The chest piece establishes the live lead-and-rubber protection route, but one piece is not a complete suit."
	quest.24BCE22A95D9278E.title: "Build Lead-Rubber Chest Protection"
	quest.252EFD4B7FAF18D9.quest_desc: [
		"Store 100,000 FE in the launch complex power system."
		"Isolate this capacity from routine consumers, then restore oxygen and fuel equipment before energizing the pad or station."
	]
	quest.252EFD4B7FAF18D9.quest_subtitle: "A reserved hundred thousand FE can wake controls, pumps, and refinery before normal operations return."
	quest.252EFD4B7FAF18D9.title: "Charge the Launch Black Start"
	quest.253399BD82CFA491.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Mekanism Solar Neutron Activator and two Mekanism radiation-shielding modules."
		"Keep treatment outside the controlled boundary and verify the spent-fuel route without claiming any quest reward."
	]
	quest.253399BD82CFA491.quest_subtitle: "A working reprocessor and two emergency injections close the loop from fuel receipt to controlled recovery from exposure."
	quest.253399BD82CFA491.title: "Nuclear Safety Commissioning Capstone"
	quest.2540155618DF5BC5.quest_desc: ["Stage the listed ZPM reserve for superconductors, fusion, and quantum machinery; keep the batch outside automatic consumption so expansion does not erase repair stock."]
	quest.2540155618DF5BC5.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.2540155618DF5BC5.title: "ZPM Production Cell"
	quest.254BFAE62530F037.quest_desc: [
		"Build vessel, jug, and large vessel."
		"Arrange the complete pottery batch with straw and logs, seal the firing, and let every piece finish before opening it."
	]
	quest.254BFAE62530F037.quest_subtitle: "A complete pottery load proves the kiln can supply travel, storage, and future casting together."
	quest.254BFAE62530F037.title: "Fire a Complete Pottery Batch"
	quest.254C599EED2425EA.quest_desc: ["Stage the listed OPV reserve for the terminal component ladder; keep the batch outside automatic consumption so expansion does not erase repair stock."]
	quest.254C599EED2425EA.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.254C599EED2425EA.title: "OPV Production Cell"
	quest.25532342110CF637.quest_desc: [
		"Build sixteen basic pressurized tubes and keep a chemical washer available."
		"Route dirty and clean slurry on separate labeled networks with water and output buffers already connected."
	]
	quest.25532342110CF637.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen pressure tubes give the washer a dedicated slurry route instead of sharing an ambiguous line."
	quest.25532342110CF637.title: "Pressurized Tube Run"
	quest.256B2F542119A2FD.quest_desc: [
		"Once Tier 9 opens, inspect the Mekanism chemical washer reserved for the national-complex preview."
		"Provide clean water, slurry routing, and separate chemical storage before connecting petrochemical support."
	]
	quest.256B2F542119A2FD.quest_subtitle: "The chemical washer preview shows how refinery products enter Mekanism’s gas and slurry authority without merging their roles."
	quest.256B2F542119A2FD.title: "National Chemical Complex Preview"
	quest.25821E8CB2BAB173.quest_desc: ["Retain an EE accumulator, deliver 250,000 FE into an FTB Quests Task Screen, and perform the cold restart with meters and controls first.","Inspect reserve charge, isolation and the connected load manually; the delivery counter does not certify them."]
	quest.25821E8CB2BAB173.quest_subtitle: "A quarter-megajoule and one battery are enough to practice a small restart without pretending the reserve is limitless."
	quest.25821E8CB2BAB173.title: "Cold Grid Restart"
	quest.25D96D74F667A228.quest_desc: [
		"Cover the walking distance while moving inputs or inspecting the processing route."
		"Automate the repeated transfer, not the one-off detour."
	]
	quest.25D96D74F667A228.quest_subtitle: "Three hundred forty-seven meters of real hauling reveal where raw supply still depends on manual handling."
	quest.25D96D74F667A228.title: "Walk the Raw-Material Route"
	quest.25E1BADE0D414E01.quest_desc: [
		"Build four Rocketnautics copper nozzles from gold, copper, MI titanium plate, and TFMG steel mechanisms."
		"Store them beside flight hardware, not in general copper processing."
	]
	quest.25E1BADE0D414E01.quest_subtitle: "Four copper nozzles keep pressure equipment and early maneuvering hardware off the emergency queue."
	quest.25E1BADE0D414E01.title: "Stock Copper Nozzles"
	quest.25EE87C7D933EB2E.quest_desc: [
		"Reserve 8,000 mB of Stellaris fuel, two oxygen tanks, one Mekanism Geiger counter, and one personal dosimeter."
		"Keep the reserve isolated from automatic launch loading. Radiation begins with the first expedition, so the crew must measure the environment before it can decide whether to continue, shelter, or return."
	]
	quest.25EE87C7D933EB2E.quest_subtitle: "A real abort kit preserves fuel, breathing time, and independent exposure measurement."
	quest.25EE87C7D933EB2E.title: "Hold Fuel, Oxygen, and Dosimetry"
	quest.2647A01497EC1D63.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Astikor Carts oak supply cart."
		"Load a real field order and verify gates, turns, and storage access before taking it far from the yard."
	]
	quest.2647A01497EC1D63.quest_subtitle: "A supply cart keeps field stock together while the draft route carries more than a person should."
	quest.2647A01497EC1D63.title: "Supply Cart Yard"
	quest.264EB1BB7695FED2.quest_desc: ["Push the established nuclear and chemical industries into neutron production and Starlight materials.","Find an Eternal Starlight Portal Ruins structure and speak with its Gatekeeper. Accept and pass the Gatekeeper’s trial to unlock the native portal.","Enter through the ruins portal and secure a return route. Seeking Eyes are not portal keys; they are crafted later for structure and boss navigation.","Secure the native Starlight expedition and return feedstocks to the existing refinery and precision works. The neutron collector uses the Titanium Greate Press, keeping its mechanical commissioning before Quantum research.","Stage replenishable extreme-material supplies for superconductors and fusion preparation. Preserve the earlier nuclear, chemical and mechanical services; the new frontier consumes them instead of replacing them with a single exotic machine."]
	quest.264EB1BB7695FED2.quest_subtitle: "Portal Ruins and the Gatekeeper’s trial—not a Seeking Eye—open the first passage into Eternal Starlight."
	quest.264EB1BB7695FED2.title: "The Gatekeeper’s Starlight Passage"
	quest.267B9C40E63D4C74.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Research Station and its computation, object-holder, and data path around the proven Data Bank."
		"Generate legitimate research data from the specified prerequisite stack; merely seeing an Assembly Line recipe in EMI does not complete its research."
	]
	quest.267B9C40E63D4C74.quest_subtitle: "Research gates the handoff from 2048-EU/t fabrication to 4096-EU/t assembly."
	quest.267B9C40E63D4C74.title: "Research Station"
	quest.269327B384B0D611.quest_desc: [
		"Build the AE2 pattern provider and retain sixteen stainless-steel ingots."
		"Commission at least one real processing pattern; the reward does not supply titanium or a High Pressure machine."
	]
	quest.269327B384B0D611.quest_subtitle: "A pattern provider backed by fresh stainless marks automation built on renewable industry."
	quest.269327B384B0D611.title: "Commission Autocrafting"
	quest.26FFE1882978622D.quest_desc: ["Stock sixteen raw desh from ordinary lunar mining. Use a TFC bronze, wrought-iron or better pickaxe.","Silk Touch ore is an optional 16 EU macerator feed that yields two raw desh per block. Direct smelting remains removed; keep raw desh for the blast-furnace route and Advanced Electric transition."]
	quest.26FFE1882978622D.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen raw desh is enough returned concentrate to plan experiments without exhausting the discovery."
	quest.26FFE1882978622D.title: "Desh Cargo Reserve"
	quest.2713BDAF4934FAE7.quest_desc: ["Assemble the altar, arthana, ritual chalk and attuned stone after the Chemical Age suppliers and attunement research are available.","Earlier botanical observations do not require the complete ritual laboratory. Keep this branch optional until the established final reality-engineering convergence."]
	quest.2713BDAF4934FAE7.quest_subtitle: "Ritual work begins with durable tools and a prepared place."
	quest.2713BDAF4934FAE7.title: "The First Ritual Laboratory"
	quest.2729730E1F39B0E8.quest_desc: [
		"After Eternal Starlight is opened, defeat one Aethersent Golem."
		"Observe its attack pattern on prepared ground and keep the route back to the portal unobstructed."
	]
	quest.2729730E1F39B0E8.quest_subtitle: "The first alien guardian confirms that Eternal Starlight is not an extension of familiar planetary terrain."
	quest.2729730E1F39B0E8.title: "Clear the Aethersent Golem"
	quest.2757259238B5031E.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and hold sixteen charcoal."
		"Keep the pile dry and separated from ordinary fuel so pottery and early metal work have a dependable reserve."
	]
	quest.2757259238B5031E.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen charcoal is enough to prove the fuel route was more than a lucky piece."
	quest.2757259238B5031E.title: "Charcoal for the Next Firing"
	quest.27CEB6182E027462.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger MI’s Quantum-circuit advancement through the live production chain."
		"Retain one traceable circuit while the rest enter hull, bridge, and gate orders."
	]
	quest.27CEB6182E027462.quest_subtitle: "The Quantum-circuit proof records a component line precise enough to support repeated reality engineering."
	quest.27CEB6182E027462.title: "Quantum Circuit Crown"
	quest.27E7327545A3AA37.quest_desc: ["Craft the compact brick chimney used to move furnace exhaust safely above the workshop."]
	quest.27E7327545A3AA37.quest_subtitle: "Give the bronze-age workshop a safe draft path."
	quest.27E7327545A3AA37.title: "Small Brick Chimney"
	quest.27F5CE7E81E3C526.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 15 opens, place and inspect an AE2 Quantum Ring."
		"Pair endpoints, protect local storage, and verify one failed link does not isolate the whole district."
	]
	quest.27F5CE7E81E3C526.quest_subtitle: "A planetary data nexus makes remote storage a public utility whose power and failure domains must remain visible."
	quest.27F5CE7E81E3C526.title: "Planetary Data Nexus"
	quest.2848D9B57B26DB72.quest_desc: [
		"Craft two Infinity Catalysts from active production."
		"Watch the slowest ingredient line and expand that authority rather than masking the shortage with stored quest loot."
	]
	quest.2848D9B57B26DB72.quest_subtitle: "A two-catalyst order is the first scale increase that tests every contributing authority at once."
	quest.2848D9B57B26DB72.title: "Expand Infinity-Catalyst Throughput"
	quest.284E95E09A2F5C5D.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the neutron compressor during a real compression run."
		"Provide enough input for completion and empty output storage without hand-clearing the machine."
	]
	quest.284E95E09A2F5C5D.quest_subtitle: "A compressor under load reveals whether collector output, pile storage, and compressed output can remain clear together."
	quest.284E95E09A2F5C5D.title: "Run the Neutron Compressor Under Load"
	quest.28ACB2E106939126.quest_desc: ["Build the Processing Array after Large Electric processing, ordinary machine shifts, jam recovery and a protected cold-start have been proven. Digital Fabrication research opens its assembly and the mature stainless hull.","Its assembly retains the existing motors, pumps, controls, item hatches, tanks, switchgear and polymers, and consumes two advanced fluid hatches of either direction. The mature hull brings Greate stainless transmission into the same factory backbone.","Install the actual operating machines and native structure hatches using the multiblock preview. The array scales compatible machine recipes; the specialized foundry, refinery, separation tower and cable factory remain separate working districts.","Batteries and boards use lunar monazite and platinum. Macerate the graded monazite ore to crushed monazite, macerate it again to dust, then centrifuge that dust for cadmium. Finish platinum through hot-ingot and vacuum processing, then make plates and fine wire.","Make the first Processing Unit at a crafting table or in a regular assembler. Its Memory Management Unit needs an emerald plate: pan diorite-hosted deposits for rough TFC emerald, polish it with sandpaper, then compress the gem in an MI compressor. Supply the other circuits, RAM, logic, cables and PVC from your established factories."]
	quest.28ACB2E106939126.quest_subtitle: "The array is the capstone of a proven machine floor, not a shortcut around the machines, controls, hatches, and power system it scales."
	quest.28ACB2E106939126.title: "Build the Processing Array"
	quest.28B110DC18EA3D8C.quest_desc: ["Build the wooden Colossal Chest controller, interface, and wall blocks as one expandable storage system."]
	quest.28B110DC18EA3D8C.quest_subtitle: "Turn early logistics into a room-sized inventory."
	quest.28B110DC18EA3D8C.title: "Colossal Wooden Storage"
	quest.28CD20189A4E3F81.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Stellaris rocket engine and oxygen tank."
		"Check fan, motor, pump, steel mechanism, battery, seals, and tank condition before assigning either part to a mission."
	]
	quest.28CD20189A4E3F81.quest_subtitle: "An engine and oxygen tank on the same bench put propulsion and survival under one inspection."
	quest.28CD20189A4E3F81.title: "Rocket Engine Bench"
	quest.28D836770698FB8C.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four MI analog circuits and four motors after stabilizing the grid."
		"Keep their copper, rubber, magnetic steel, and lubricant supply routes renewable; First Space will consume the capacity, not a quest reward."
	]
	quest.28D836770698FB8C.quest_subtitle: "Circuits and motors made in batches show electricity now builds the machines that consume it."
	quest.28D836770698FB8C.title: "Commission the LV Factory"
	quest.28FE788DFAA32EF0.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement HV motors, pumps, robot arms, sensors, emitters, and field generators for the stainless and digital factory, then verify the MV line still operates."]
	quest.28FE788DFAA32EF0.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.28FE788DFAA32EF0.title: "HV Recovery Proof"
	quest.2914934F74DA044D.quest_desc: ["Operate a placer, breaker, and sensor from Electro Energetics-fed infrastructure; test denial of bare-hand trunk harvesting."]
	quest.2914934F74DA044D.quest_subtitle: "Field tools are bounded service equipment, not bulk miners."
	quest.2914934F74DA044D.title: "Field Placer, Breaker, and Sensor"
	quest.291F71D8F72817B0.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight Mekanism fission reactor casings and six Mekanism radiation-shielding modules."
		"Store replacement modules cleanly and never treat equipment as permission to ignore exposure controls."
	]
	quest.291F71D8F72817B0.quest_subtitle: "Eight casings and six shielding modules support one controlled repair shift without stockpiling complete suits as clutter."
	quest.291F71D8F72817B0.title: "Buffer Shielding and Treatment"
	quest.293D94FDFB653C67.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Stellaris oxygen tanks."
		"Check both before departure and keep one untouched until the return leg or a genuine emergency."
	]
	quest.293D94FDFB653C67.quest_subtitle: "Two filled oxygen tanks separate a mission reserve from the tank already in service."
	quest.293D94FDFB653C67.title: "Reserve Breathing Time"
	quest.29492794E40222BF.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 8,000 mB of TFMG lubrication oil."
		"Feed a dedicated maintenance tank; a rail component is no longer used as a proxy for this supply."
	]
	quest.29492794E40222BF.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of lubricant protect sequenced mechanisms and heavy machinery from a dry restart."
	quest.29492794E40222BF.title: "Fill the Lubricant Header"
	quest.299745AA47196BB7.quest_desc: [
		"Store eight thioquartz shards and two crystal-matrix blocks."
		"Quarantine both from unrestricted crafting until the intended analysis or build is assigned."
	]
	quest.299745AA47196BB7.quest_subtitle: "Thioquartz beside crystal matrix lets the laboratory compare alien structure with engineered extreme matter."
	quest.299745AA47196BB7.title: "Thioquartz Sample Tray"
	quest.29A4FE6FE875AE7E.quest_desc: ["After Tier 15 opens, assemble and inspect the SGJourney classic Stargate.","The live pack recipe builds its base, ring, and chevrons from already-mastered late materials; verify dialing and a safe receiving side.","Finish the first Classic Stargate on the Rhodium-Plated Palladium Press. The RPP floor and Quantum Link exist before gate travel. Bring trinium back from Tollan to supply the next Naquadah-alloy machinery tier; do not wait for that tier to build your first gate."]
	quest.29A4FE6FE875AE7E.quest_subtitle: "After Eclipse Alloy, the shipyard integrates real ring, chevron, base, crystal, quantum-link, and control subsystems into a stable gate."
	quest.29A4FE6FE875AE7E.title: "Commission a Classic Stargate"
	quest.29A6426323E82822.quest_desc: [
		"Build thirty-two Modern Dynamics item pipes through the live steel-and-glass recipe."
		"Run one real shipment from vehicle unloading into sorted destination storage with an extractor or other approved transfer point."
	]
	quest.29A6426323E82822.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two Modern Dynamics item pipes carry regional freight into the technical network after early Classic routing has ended."
	quest.29A6426323E82822.title: "Commission Regional Freight"
	quest.29DD5348EB69DEB4.quest_desc: [
		"After the Electronic Circuit Line, build the MI Large Steam Boiler controller and inspect its multiblock with a wrench."
		"Use a heatproof-casing bottom layer, three Bronze Plated Brick layers, two central Bronze Pipe Machine Casings, and bottom-layer hatches. The controller sits on the second layer."
		"At full heat it produces 256 mB/t steam and burns fuel eight times furnace speed; below full output it loses most unused heat, so buffer steam and run it near steady load."
	]
	quest.29DD5348EB69DEB4.quest_subtitle: "Electronic control moves the high-throughput boiler into Low Voltage."
	quest.29DD5348EB69DEB4.title: "Build the Large Steam Boiler"
	quest.29E4896E4BD53833.quest_desc: ["Operate the basic accelerator at its bounded multiplier; verify denial on EMC, reactors, spatial blocks, vehicles, and itself."]
	quest.29E4896E4BD53833.quest_subtitle: "Only fixed low-level acceleration is allowed after accelerator proof."
	quest.29E4896E4BD53833.title: "Stationary Bounded Time Engineering"
	quest.2A035AA4688AC1DC.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the Stellaris launch pad and build one big oxygen tank."
		"Reserve clear approach, propellant storage, oxygen service, cargo staging, and an exit route outside the exhaust zone."
	]
	quest.2A035AA4688AC1DC.quest_subtitle: "An inspected pad and a large oxygen tank define the safety boundaries of the launch yard better than a clipboard token."
	quest.2A035AA4688AC1DC.title: "Lay Out Space Operations"
	quest.2A0EA7058CB094C9.quest_desc: ["Run createch2/watchdog with a wired modem or redstone integrator, trigger one alarm, shut down, and recover manually."]
	quest.2A0EA7058CB094C9.quest_subtitle: "A computer observes real signals and performs bounded shutdowns."
	quest.2A0EA7058CB094C9.title: "Factory Computer and Watchdog"
	quest.2A1C71C4782F2F0F.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight Electro Energetics wire connectors and sixteen wires."
		"Keep the stock by conductor class and inspect damaged circuits before choosing a replacement."
	]
	quest.2A1C71C4782F2F0F.quest_subtitle: "Eight connectors and sixteen wires form a useful repair batch without replacing the next planned circuit."
	quest.2A1C71C4782F2F0F.title: "Stock Conductors and Terminations"
	quest.2A3619EBAF95DD50.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 15 opens, inspect the AE2 Quantum Ring that previews the remote data nexus."
		"Pair the bridge, test channel and power behavior, and keep critical local controls independent."
	]
	quest.2A3619EBAF95DD50.quest_subtitle: "At Quantum, a ring pair makes the data nexus span distance while each endpoint keeps its own power and recovery plan."
	quest.2A3619EBAF95DD50.title: "Planetary Data Nexus Preview"
	quest.2A37B9A54309CB05.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s firepit advancement by building and lighting a working firepit."
		"Keep dry fuel close, but leave enough clear space that the shelter does not become the fuel."
	]
	quest.2A37B9A54309CB05.quest_subtitle: "The firepit is the center of Stone Tier: heat, food, light, and survival."
	quest.2A37B9A54309CB05.title: "Firepit and First Hot Meal"
	quest.2A52FB7A72338821.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the neutron compressor and produce sixteen steel large plates."
		"Keep slow neutron accumulation running while the faster metal line buffers the next build."
	]
	quest.2A52FB7A72338821.quest_subtitle: "A working neutron compressor and sixteen large plates connect extreme matter to ordinary structural throughput."
	quest.2A52FB7A72338821.title: "Run the Megaforge Shift"
	quest.2A5F97ADA7B3186A.quest_desc: [
		"Visit the Rocketnautics Moon dimension and establish a safe return route."
		"Carry independent oxygen and fuel reserves, food, navigation, building blocks, tools, and empty cargo capacity before leaving the launch site."
	]
	quest.2A5F97ADA7B3186A.quest_subtitle: "Reaching the Moon only counts as progress when a separate reserve still points home."
	quest.2A5F97ADA7B3186A.title: "Launch Site Return Plan"
	quest.2A88FF5E5FAF8EE0.quest_desc: [
		"Place the electric compressor with service clearance, isolated input and output, and a documented disconnect."
		"Charge four modular accumulators and eight portable batteries, open the upstream generation breaker, then cold-start the workcell from stored power."
	]
	quest.2A88FF5E5FAF8EE0.quest_subtitle: "Four modular accumulators and eight portable batteries provide enough stored power to prove the floor can restart without an already-running generator train."
	quest.2A88FF5E5FAF8EE0.title: "Cold-Start the Automation Floor"
	quest.2AB885EE7230A012.quest_desc: ["Retain OpV controls, time crystals, Strange Matter, Electro Energetics interfaces, endpoint records, and manual shutdown instructions."]
	quest.2AB885EE7230A012.quest_subtitle: "The accelerator, temporal plant, packed factory, and remote site can all be restarted without duplication."
	quest.2AB885EE7230A012.title: "Reality-System Recovery Stock"
	quest.2AD2F202BF8B9190.quest_desc: [
		"Let the chest statistic accumulate while receiving and dispatching actual freight."
		"If items are hard to find, improve labels and destinations before adding more containers."
	]
	quest.2AD2F202BF8B9190.quest_subtitle: "Fifty chest openings record a warehouse used in real work, not a storage block placed for inspection."
	quest.2AD2F202BF8B9190.title: "Warehouse Habit"
	quest.2ADAFA296AF26A7A.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the fusion reactor, neutron compressor, and Milky Way Stargate, then demonstrate one hundred million FE."
		"Perform the checks from local controls and prove no remote link or claimed reward is required to recover."
	]
	quest.2ADAFA296AF26A7A.quest_subtitle: "The whole factory is restartable when fusion, compression, gate access, and protected power return in a known order."
	quest.2ADAFA296AF26A7A.title: "Prove the Whole Factory Can Restart"
	quest.2AEC09AC926E8471.quest_desc: [
		"Gather four TFC garlic for the food and recovery shelf."
		"Garlic is practical pantry stock, not a claim that it cures injury; rest, warmth, water, and safe retreat still matter."
	]
	quest.2AEC09AC926E8471.quest_subtitle: "Pantry resilience belongs beside the route, not in front of it."
	quest.2AEC09AC926E8471.title: "Stock a Recovery Shelf"
	quest.2B08A1E8B836F320.quest_desc: [
		"Find small cassiterite and small sphalerite."
		"Return with both tin and zinc indicators from documented host rock so bronze and brass geology remain distinct."
	]
	quest.2B08A1E8B836F320.quest_subtitle: "Tin and zinc return to the workshop as two different promises: bronze and brass."
	quest.2B08A1E8B836F320.title: "Bring Back Tin and Zinc"
	quest.2B127FBCA55C1DE5.quest_desc: ["Build the powered forming floor that the next several ages will continue to use.","Craft one four-unit batch of andesite alloy.","The live alloy recipe uses TFC-compatible andesite with copper, tin, and zinc, so both mineral surveys and real metal production must be working first.","Feed copper, tin and zinc from the mining camp into the alloy works. Install a dependable drive, Andesite Alloy Press and material handling; use the same floor for plates, precision parts and the bronze machine bridge.","The payoff is repeatable shaping instead of repeated hand work. Keep the original casting tools and a small stock of shafts and alloy for repairs; rail preparation can grow beside the foundry."]
	quest.2B127FBCA55C1DE5.quest_subtitle: "Andesite alloy is the deliberate bridge from TFC metalwork into Create construction."
	quest.2B127FBCA55C1DE5.title: "Make Andesite Alloy"
	quest.2B18EDAD1B191FEB.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixty-four coal coke and thirty-two fireclay balls."
		"Keep the reserve outside active recipe inputs so automation cannot empty emergency stock."
	]
	quest.2B18EDAD1B191FEB.quest_subtitle: "Sixty-four coke and thirty-two fireclay balls carry the hot works through more than one shift."
	quest.2B18EDAD1B191FEB.title: "Stage Coke and Refractory Reserves"
	quest.2B19894389D72ABC.quest_desc: [
		"Complete MI’s bronze-macerator advancement with the live machine."
		"Run actual ore through it and preserve output space; the block matters because the process now repeats."
	]
	quest.2B19894389D72ABC.quest_subtitle: "The macerator advancement confirms the first steam ore-processing route is truly installed."
	quest.2B19894389D72ABC.title: "Bronze Macerator Rite"
	quest.2B469C0BD7606F4D.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Mekanism’s chemical-tank advancement with the current pack recipe."
		"Leave the tank labeled and usable as part of a real pressure network."
	]
	quest.2B469C0BD7606F4D.quest_subtitle: "The chemical-tank advancement confirms that gas storage is now built into the laboratory instead of improvised."
	quest.2B469C0BD7606F4D.title: "Catalyst Practicum"
	quest.2B4829C9BCB192C1.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a TFMG pumpjack base."
		"Connect bounded crude storage, isolation, and a route that remains accessible during a spill response."
	]
	quest.2B4829C9BCB192C1.quest_subtitle: "A second pumpjack base extends extraction only when the refinery can accept its worst-case flow."
	quest.2B4829C9BCB192C1.title: "Commission the Expansion Well"
	quest.2B955B633D13ECC9.quest_desc: ["Power a metal chimney pump with the electrical network to move emissions through longer industrial exhaust runs."]
	quest.2B955B633D13ECC9.quest_subtitle: "Industrial ventilation belongs on the power budget."
	quest.2B955B633D13ECC9.title: "Powered Metal Chimney Pump"
	quest.2BBFED3DCB268BAA.quest_desc: [
		"Store 1,000,000 FE in the deep-space support grid."
		"Isolate the reserve from ordinary crafting and test the path to oxygen, fuel, communications, and launch control."
	]
	quest.2BBFED3DCB268BAA.quest_subtitle: "One million FE reserved at home can wake tracking, life support, and a recovery launch after the main yard fails."
	quest.2BBFED3DCB268BAA.title: "Charge the Rescue Black Start"
	quest.2BFB03FF3FD4764A.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 4,000 mB of MI polyethylene."
		"Route it to a dedicated vat with spare output capacity and preserve the upstream ethylene supply."
	]
	quest.2BFB03FF3FD4764A.quest_subtitle: "Four buckets of polyethylene make polymer feed a transported industrial fluid, not a handful of pellets."
	quest.2BFB03FF3FD4764A.title: "Polyethylene Feed Vat"
	quest.2C0003571837775D.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Create schedule and program useful stations."
		"Test loading conditions, direction changes, and what happens when a destination cannot accept cargo."
	]
	quest.2C0003571837775D.quest_subtitle: "A schedule turns a train from a vehicle into a service that can repeat stops without supervision."
	quest.2C0003571837775D.title: "Write a Working Schedule"
	quest.2C12DE4579FD8529.quest_desc: ["Build one MK1 and verify MK2, MK3, and the Tome have no acquisition route."]
	quest.2C12DE4579FD8529.quest_subtitle: "Exactly MK1 enters the campaign after quantum zero-EMC proof."
	quest.2C12DE4579FD8529.title: "The Only Passive Collector"
	quest.2C3AEE09F6CC95D8.quest_desc: [
		"Fire a ceramic jug and a ceramic vessel in a later pit-kiln batch."
		"Repeating the firing catches shortages in clay, straw, logs, and safe kiln space before copper work depends on them."
	]
	quest.2C3AEE09F6CC95D8.quest_subtitle: "Repeatable pottery begins when the second load matters as much as the first."
	quest.2C3AEE09F6CC95D8.title: "Fire a Second Pottery Batch"
	quest.2C514B1654C3CD22.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four steel machine casings and thirty-two bronze plates."
		"Keep the reserve labeled by district and outside unrestricted autocrafting."
	]
	quest.2C514B1654C3CD22.quest_subtitle: "Four steel casings and thirty-two bronze plates form rebuild stock without cloning complete factories."
	quest.2C514B1654C3CD22.title: "Stage Three-Shift Structures"
	quest.2C6B145C7F06EA11.quest_desc: ["Store 33,554,432 FE and produce an AE2 Quantum Link to prove the protected launch complex can sustain interdimensional logistics."]
	quest.2C6B145C7F06EA11.quest_subtitle: "Bind massive stored power to the quantum network."
	quest.2C6B145C7F06EA11.title: "Quantum Logistics Reserve"
	quest.2C90687C34370705.quest_desc: ["Build the authored Zero Point consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.2C90687C34370705.quest_subtitle: "The ZPM standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.2C90687C34370705.title: "ZPM Consumer Proof"
	quest.2CA26B11DAB16F59.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s Steel Age advancement through its intended metallurgy."
		"Do not substitute that steel for the TFMG ingot required by this chapter’s industrial chain."
	]
	quest.2CA26B11DAB16F59.quest_subtitle: "TFC steel remains a survival-metallurgy achievement even while TFMG owns industrial steel."
	quest.2CA26B11DAB16F59.title: "TFC Steel Age Reached"
	quest.2CDB9919B8D34D32.quest_desc: [
		"Regather sixteen charcoal and keep a fired ingot mold available."
		"The recovery proof is modest: fuel and pottery are replaceable without relying on a quest reward."
	]
	quest.2CDB9919B8D34D32.quest_subtitle: "Losing one batch should reveal the weak supply, not erase the settlement."
	quest.2CDB9919B8D34D32.title: "Recover After a Failed Firing"
	quest.2CF15A3A85EEDA04.quest_desc: [
		"Extract and transfer sixteen thousand millibuckets of TFMG crude oil."
		"Record the site, isolate the route, and stop extraction before storage becomes the hazard."
	]
	quest.2CF15A3A85EEDA04.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of crude define the scale of a surveyed wound in the ground and the storage it demands."
	quest.2CF15A3A85EEDA04.title: "Crude Wound Survey"
	quest.2D0BDB724C406A86.quest_desc: [
		"Build one Create schedule and thirty-two tracks."
		"Survey the station order, loading rules, turnarounds, and a safe maintenance access path."
	]
	quest.2D0BDB724C406A86.quest_subtitle: "A written train route needs a schedule and enough track to reach a useful destination."
	quest.2D0BDB724C406A86.title: "Train Route Writ"
	quest.2D1FB3254DECE568.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement UHV motors, pumps, robot arms, sensors, emitters, and field generators for ultra-high-energy field systems, then verify the UV line still operates."]
	quest.2D1FB3254DECE568.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.2D1FB3254DECE568.title: "UHV Recovery Proof"
	quest.2D2B6CD394892470.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Stellaris oxygen tanks and hold 8,000 mB of Stellaris fuel."
		"Store the kit away from the primary bank, mark it for emergencies, and include the fittings needed to use it."
	]
	quest.2D2B6CD394892470.quest_subtitle: "Two oxygen tanks and an eight-bucket fuel reserve buy the crew one more decision after the primary system fails."
	quest.2D2B6CD394892470.title: "Assemble the Oxygen Deadman Kit"
	quest.2DAFC88A90626FA9.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight MI titanium curved plates."
		"Keep the matching flat plate stock and forming machine accessible for repairs and alternate hull geometry."
	]
	quest.2DAFC88A90626FA9.quest_subtitle: "Eight curved titanium plates prove the forming line can repeat a pressure boundary."
	quest.2DAFC88A90626FA9.title: "Form a Pressure-Hull Batch"
	quest.2DF621682A59E19E.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger Re:Avaritia’s Infinity Ingot advancement."
		"Preserve the production ledger so the next ingot can be planned rather than guessed."
	]
	quest.2DF621682A59E19E.quest_subtitle: "The ingot advancement confirms convergence has crossed from a catalogue of systems into a new material."
	quest.2DF621682A59E19E.title: "Infinity Ingot Proof"
	quest.2E0AE7FA4DE808F3.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat the Eternal Starlight lunar monstrosity."
		"Bring redundant gear and recovery supplies, then secure the return before processing its branch outputs."
	]
	quest.2E0AE7FA4DE808F3.quest_subtitle: "The lunar monstrosity is a threshold encounter; preparation matters more than making the moment sound grand."
	quest.2E0AE7FA4DE808F3.title: "Lunar Monstrosity Proof"
	quest.2E104D4540FAEEB7.quest_desc: ["Build all eight UV functional families and verify that each recipe consumes its matching ZPM component; this prepares expanded quantum-grade automation."]
	quest.2E104D4540FAEEB7.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Ultimate Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.2E104D4540FAEEB7.title: "UV Component Standard"
	quest.2E15ED45B9D80624.quest_desc: ["Verify machines, proof, fuel, spatial, singularity, and Infinity items remain zero EMC.","Mature encoded transmutation begins in Age 13 under MTR-03. Only explicitly reviewed ordinary matter has EMC; strategic feedstock, machinery and unreviewed forms remain zero."]
	quest.2E15ED45B9D80624.quest_subtitle: "The tablet extends access but does not widen the zero-EMC boundary."
	quest.2E15ED45B9D80624.title: "Portable Learned-Matter Interface"
	quest.2E1C3CDDE978931D.quest_desc: [
		"Produce 64 charcoal."
		"Run a second sealed charcoal burn and move the finished fuel into a dry, labeled yard stock."
	]
	quest.2E1C3CDDE978931D.quest_subtitle: "A full charcoal yard turns the next burn into maintenance instead of rescue."
	quest.2E1C3CDDE978931D.title: "Stock the Charcoal Yard"
	quest.2E386CF02CE83DF0.quest_desc: [
		"Cover the walking distance while surveying or hauling for the megaproject."
		"Correct access bottlenecks before increasing module size or delivery frequency."
	]
	quest.2E386CF02CE83DF0.quest_subtitle: "Three hundred sixty meters of real hauling exposes turns, grades, and crossings that a floor plan misses."
	quest.2E386CF02CE83DF0.title: "Walk the Project Supply Route"
	quest.2E3FC81437EA881A.quest_desc: ["Learn ordinary construction matter, deposit real factory surplus, verify 90% retention, then withdraw one learned ordinary item.","Mature encoded transmutation begins in Age 13 under MTR-03. Only explicitly reviewed ordinary matter has EMC; strategic feedstock, machinery and unreviewed forms remain zero."]
	quest.2E3FC81437EA881A.quest_subtitle: "A visible 10% deposit tax keeps miraculous exchange from becoming free duplication."
	quest.2E3FC81437EA881A.title: "Taxed Transmutation Table"
	quest.2E6926F703F9FE09.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Bronze Water Pump from its bronze tank, casing, pipes, plates, gear, and rotor."
		"Feed it into buffered water storage. Treat a falling buffer as a shutdown condition before returning any boiler to load."
	]
	quest.2E6926F703F9FE09.quest_subtitle: "The Bronze Water Pump is the steam-age feed device; the electric MI pump comes later."
	quest.2E6926F703F9FE09.title: "Protect the Boiler Feed"
	quest.2E79ACCA0B3FAE1D.quest_desc: [
		"Build sixteen fluid pipes for a durable ore-haul connection."
		"Use the line to connect a real mine, settlement, or supply source rather than satisfying an unrelated travel statistic."
	]
	quest.2E79ACCA0B3FAE1D.quest_subtitle: "A boat route turns distant ore into scheduled freight instead of an exhausting detour."
	quest.2E79ACCA0B3FAE1D.title: "Haul Ore by Water"
	quest.2E972E08E5AC8ADB.quest_desc: [
		"Fire a second ceramic vessel for the field kit."
		"Keep the spare empty until it is needed so losing one container does not strand food or ore."
	]
	quest.2E972E08E5AC8ADB.quest_subtitle: "A broken container should be an inconvenience, not the end of the trip."
	quest.2E972E08E5AC8ADB.title: "Pack a Spare Vessel"
	quest.2EA08DCC6E926259.quest_desc: ["Store four steel large plates with sixteen canonical TFC steel ingots.","Use them only after the boiler is cool, empty, and isolated from the shared steam trunk."]
	quest.2EA08DCC6E926259.quest_subtitle: "Large patch plates backed by fresh ingots make boiler repair part of planned maintenance."
	quest.2EA08DCC6E926259.title: "Boiler Patch Plates"
	quest.2EB10036D72C8A2F.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an MI replicator."
		"Give it metered UU Matter, audited patterns, protected power, and output storage that cannot silently consume convergence feed."
	]
	quest.2EB10036D72C8A2F.quest_subtitle: "A universal matter fabricator is anchored by the replicator, not by another neutron compressor wearing a larger title."
	quest.2EB10036D72C8A2F.title: "Universal Matter Fabricator"
	quest.2EB1D671592B0085.quest_desc: [
		"Build the IV Circuit Assembler and IV Laser Engraver and place them in the maintained Cleanroom."
		"These authored 1024-EU/t machines begin the silicon, wafer, chip, and standard SMD chain without reopening native Greg progression."
	]
	quest.2EB1D671592B0085.quest_subtitle: "Two clean IV machines turn the mature MI factory into a precision electronics wing."
	quest.2EB1D671592B0085.title: "IV Precision Machines"
	quest.2EB6619D34A50989.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Re:Avaritia’s crystal-matrix-ingot advancement through the live recipe."
		"Keep every rare ingredient renewable or recoverable before scaling the craft."
	]
	quest.2EB6619D34A50989.quest_subtitle: "The crystal-matrix advancement records the first successful convergence of extreme industry and Starlight evidence."
	quest.2EB6619D34A50989.title: "Matrix Crown"
	quest.2F180B3EECDBB630.quest_desc: [
		"Install and inspect a Electro Energetics grounding rod as part of the live distribution system."
		"Keep the grounding connection visible, dry, accessible, and bonded to the branch it is meant to protect."
	]
	quest.2F180B3EECDBB630.quest_subtitle: "A deliberate fault path matters most on the day current leaves the route you planned."
	quest.2F180B3EECDBB630.title: "Ground the LV Grid"
	quest.2F2A359FCDEB76AD.quest_desc: ["Retain clean disks, a spare computer, wired modems, and a written manual fallback; restore from a deliberate failure."]
	quest.2F2A359FCDEB76AD.quest_subtitle: "A failed computer does not strand the factory, vehicle, freight route, or mission."
	quest.2F2A359FCDEB76AD.title: "Control-System Recovery Stock"
	quest.2F2E51646A322873.quest_desc: [
		"Shape replacement ingot and pickaxe-head molds as one casting-service batch."
		"Dry and fire the replacement molds before the working pair cracks or becomes unavailable."
	]
	quest.2F2E51646A322873.quest_subtitle: "Replacement molds protect copper production from the next cracked firing or bad pour."
	quest.2F2E51646A322873.title: "Fire Replacement Casting Molds"
	quest.2F33DA300848472E.quest_desc: ["Roll the coke-brick, steel-plate, rail, and minecart underframe in Railcraft before moving it to the Create line.","Run the underframe through the eleven deployment steps for the firebox, boiler, steel mechanism, running gear, control circuit, steel plate, tank, pump, controls and pipework. Fill the workpiece with 250 mB of TFMG lubrication oil, then finish it on a Steel Greate Press or higher.","This nonconsuming freight task counts four of the sixteen reserved canonical TFC steel ingots. Keep all sixteen; no additional four-ingot batch is needed.","Mechanical commissioning: finish the locomotive on a Steel Greate Press or higher, supplied by the steel and lubricant district. Commission the loader, unloader and fuel service as part of the freight route.","The manual rolling machine consumes three entry mechanical presses, four heavy bronze gears, one coke oven brick and one andesite casing. An early diagonal pattern of three bronze ingots produces four rebar. Keep the menu open. With only one item per occupied slot, click the recipe preview with an empty cursor to permit the final batch, then collect the completed parts from the output slot. Rail-grade steel rolling still needs its own materials and research.","Build a 3×4×3 Railcraft blast furnace from 34 furnace-brick blocks, leaving air in the center of each of the two middle layers. Nine brick crafts make 36 blocks, leaving two spare. Feed newly produced TFMG steel and ordinary charcoal, and keep both output slots free: one TFC steel ingot yields one TFC steel ingot and one slag. This nonconsuming freight task counts four of the sixteen reserved canonical TFC steel ingots. Keep all sixteen; no additional four-ingot batch is needed.","For the selected locomotive and terminal parts, plan four plate batches (16 MI steel plates), one standard-rail batch (16 rails) and one track-part batch (three parts: two for the rails, one for the locomotive). The plate and rail rolls use 22 rail-grade steel ingots. The underframe takes two coke-oven bricks, two plates, two standard rails and a minecart. Pack that cart in the MI steam packer from one large steel plate (four new canonical steel plates) and one ordinary Minecraft rail, using 200 mB steam. Use TFMG nuggets for track parts. The crowbar takes three more TFC steel ingots and four red dyes; process one extra normal hematite with the hammer, sluice, quern and sluice again for enough clean pigment.","Before bulk TFMG steel production, cast the current ingot and empty the primary steel tank. Then connect a separate, initially blank MI pipe network from the output block to a newly built ordinary Create fluid tank, so it selects molten slag. Keep this network separate from steel. Forty steel batches make 5,760 mB slag, which fits one 8,000 mB tank; without extraction, the furnace's slag tank blocks batch 28.","Use the Greate andesite-alloy mechanical pump for the pump deployment. The pack’s shared entry-pump tag accepts it. Build one pump from three of the six retained andesite shafts, nine new andesite alloy, one new oak log, four new oak lumber, three new TFC copper ingots and one fresh basin foundry lid. Press two copper ingots into plates; the third ingot, both plates and lid make four fluid pipes. Use one pipe for the pump and keep three. One alloy, one shaft and the plank make its cog; eight alloy and the log make its casing. Three retained shafts remain. Use fresh materials for this bill; keep the drive intact.","The pump bill keeps five precision mechanisms, eight steel mechanisms, sixteen objective TFC steel ingots and the additional MI casing. Controls still need one precision mechanism, a lever and a railway casing. That casing uses a brass casing and a sturdy sheet; fund the obsidian powder, lava and pressing sequence for the sheet. The firebox, boiler, tank, cast-iron pipe and 250 mB oil delivery also need their own inputs. This nonconsuming freight task counts four of the sixteen reserved canonical TFC steel ingots. Keep all sixteen; no additional four-ingot batch is needed.","TFC’s native lava springs provide a terrestrial source: underground placements sample Y −64 to 63, and surface placements Y 64 to 220. Search the native rock terrain for an actual source block; placement attempts do not guarantee a spring. A flowing lava stream alone is not a valid pump intake. Establish the pump drive, intake and fluid receiver before counting collected lava. The heated Rubberworks obsidian craft takes 1000 mB, and the sturdy-sheet route uses another 500 mB. Keep this lava handling separate from the oil district.","After stopping the drive and emptying the intake buffers and pipes, use the retained Create wrench to recover the andesite-alloy shaft, small cog and mechanical pump. Sneak-right-click returns the corresponding part in normal survival; keep room in your inventory. Reuse these parts at the next source or recover the pump for locomotive assembly. Leave filled lava receivers in place: recovering the kinetic parts does not carry hot tank contents with them.","For two separate lava receivers, add 3 andesite alloy, 2 foundry lids, 46 oak lumber and 4 TFC copper ingots; press the copper into four plates on the existing steel press. Craft eight shafts, one water wheel, one small cog and two tanks. Keep the three older shafts. At each isolated source use the paid pump and two retained fluid pipes. With all axes X, place the wheel at (-5,1,0), four shafts through (-1,1,0), cog at (0,1,0), pump facing EAST at (0,0,0), intake pipe at (-1,0,0), source at (-2,0,0), output pipe at (1,0,0) and tank at (2,0,0). Translate the whole layout to the site. A sustained contained freshwater current drives only this rig; keep it away from lava. Wait for 1000 mB in tank A and an empty intake, stop and recover the rig, then repeat at source B with its own tank. Leave both tanks placed. Recover the pump for the locomotive; six new shafts and all three pipes remain. No obsidian or sturdy sheet is made yet.","For obsidian at receiver A, add 16 andesite alloy, one foundry lid, 28 oak lumber and one oak log. Combine the three older and six recently recovered andesite shafts with one new eight-shaft batch; make five new small cogs, two large cogs and one depot. After the earlier jobs finish, stop and wrench the empty Rubberworks compressor and the captured burner after its old fuel expires. Keep tank A at (2,0,0), put the pump facing EAST at (3,0,0), and the compressor facing EAST at (4,0,0). Extend the capture wheel’s axis-X drive to seven shafts and a cog above the pump. Keep the compressor unpowered while the pump transfers all 1000 mB into its west inlet. Stop and recover the feed drive and pump before compression.","Use the recovered wheel with two small-to-large gear reductions and an axis-Z shaft drive to run only the compressor at 2 RPM, using all 8 SU. Put the captured burner directly below it, a depot forward and one block lower, and keep the forward cell clear. Prepare the lava, drive and collector before spending one charcoal for KINDLED heat; passive fire is insufficient. Collect the obsidian and carry it as an item to the bronze macerator; clear its input and output slots first: 200 mB steam guarantees one powdered obsidian. Do not budget the optional 75% obsidian return. Return the empty compressor and cooled burner to their earlier stations. Keep receiver B’s 1000 mB reserved. After recovering the wheel, shafts and small cogs, hold twelve andesite shafts, two small cogs, one wheel, one pump and three pipes; leave the two large cogs and empty new depot at A. Macerator steam falls from 800 to 600 mB, and the 190 charcoal reserve falls to 189 before other heat uses.","For the sturdy sheet, recover the earlier empty oil spout and its empty depot with the wrench; first clear their items and confirm the oil tank, pipes and spout are empty. At receiver B, keep the tank at (2,0,0), face the pump EAST at (3,0,0), and put the spout at (4,0,0) with its depot at (4,-2,0). Reuse the wheel, cog and seven-shaft X drive. Transfer all 1000 mB into the spout, then stop the pump. Place one powdered obsidian on the depot and wait for its 500 mB filling to complete. Empty-hand use on the depot’s top collects the same marked workpiece. Isolate the drive, re-place the empty pump facing WEST, and return the remaining 500 mB to receiver B. Stop and recover the rig only after the spout is empty; return the empty earlier spout and depot to their factory positions.","Carry the same marked workpiece to the existing supported steel press and complete two pressings at 1 RPM. Keep its sequence component intact between operations; an unmarked transitional item cannot replace it. This native sequence has one loop: one powder, one 500 mB filling and two pressings produce one sturdy sheet. Reserve that sheet for the railway casing and controls. Wrench the now-empty receiver A and reserve its Create fluid tank for the locomotive. Keep receiver B placed with 500 mB lava. After recovery retain twelve andesite shafts, two small cogs, one wheel, one pump and all three pipes. This step needs no further steam, charcoal or raw-material crafting; the earlier spout, depot and steel press remain available at the factory.","Make the controls lever with fresh terrestrial materials: arrange four loose granite rocks in a 2x2 square to craft one TFC granite cobblestone, then put one oak twig above that cobblestone in the player crafting grid. The recipe accepts normal TFC cobblestones and twigs, along with ordinary Minecraft cobblestone and stick, and produces one lever. Reserve the lever for controls. These two crafts use no machine, steam, fuel or tool and leave the sturdy sheet, empty locomotive tank, pump and five precision mechanisms untouched. The foundry-brass casing and its recovery still need to be supplied before assembling controls.","For the controls, finish Brass Engineering and bring six new cold TFC copper ingots, one TFC zinc ingot, two Create andesite alloy, four TFC fire-brick blocks and one actual oak log. Use the earlier 3x3 crafting service: three copper across the top, alloy on both sides of one masonry block in the middle, and three masonry blocks across the bottom make one new foundry lid. Reuse the existing heated andesite mixer, basin and captured burner with its supported 8 RPM drive, 4 SU load and 8 SU capacity; leave the portable rig reserved. Keep the basin facing DOWN, empty its input/output slots and disconnect external item extraction. Drop the remaining three copper ingots, zinc ingot and new lid into the basin and check that all five items entered. When the inputs, fresh-water drive and mixer are ready, feed one retained charcoal to the burner. This batch makes four Create brass ingots and returns the lid. Stop the drive after the batch; collect both output stacks with an empty hand and leave the basin empty. The charcoal reserve falls from 189 to 188 before other open uses; do not count leftover burner heat as fresh fuel.","Place the new oak log and strip it with the retained sedimentary axe, reducing its remaining uses from 18 to 17. Apply one of the four Create brass ingots to that stripped log for a placed brass casing, then apply the paid sturdy sheet to the same casing for a placed railway casing. Keep inventory space and sneak-use the paid wrench to recover this final casing where block breaking is allowed. In the earlier 3x3 crafting table, put the paid lever above the railway casing and one of the five held precision mechanisms below it. Reserve the resulting controls for the locomotive. The sheet, lever and railway casing are consumed; retain four precision mechanisms, three brass ingots and the returned new lid. Keep the empty locomotive tank, pump, portable rig, eight steel mechanisms, sixteen separate objective TFC steel ingots, additional MI casing and earlier steam reservations untouched. The locomotive still needs its remaining parts, 250 mB oil and final assembly.","For one locomotive firebox, collect eleven new whole granite blocks and three new oak twigs. Whole granite requires clearing all six neighboring collision faces and letting isolation release the block; ordinary direct mining gives loose rocks instead. Find one saltpeter ore in chalk at Y40–100 and one sulfur ore in tuff at Y40–200, using a bronze pickaxe or better. Suitable regional rock, access and additional excavation/tool wear still need to be supplied. Bring back seven additional whole netherrack through the same isolation method and an alive Nether return. Craft a new furnace from eight granite, a new handstone from the other three granite and one twig, and a new firestarter from the other two twigs. Keep this new furnace held for the firebox; use the earlier placed furnace and quern as processing services, preserving their existing tools and other reserved locomotive stock.","Insert the new handstone into the existing manual quern. Grind the saltpeter ore, sulfur ore and one retained charcoal separately; turn the handle and collect each batch of four powder before loading the next. Remove the new handstone afterwards with 247 uses left. Craft two saltpeter powder, one sulfur powder and one charcoal powder into four gunpowder. One gunpowder, one further charcoal and the entire new firestarter make one fire charge; this craft consumes the firestarter, so do not spend the workshop ignition tool. Load all seven netherrack into the empty earlier furnace and use one further charcoal to smelt seven nether bricks, keeping output room clear. On the 3x3 table, put three bricks across the top, brick/charge/brick in the middle and brick/new furnace/brick at the bottom. Reserve the resulting firebox. The three charcoal uses reduce the reserve from 188 to 185 before other open uses; retain three gunpowder, two saltpeter powder, three sulfur powder, three charcoal powder and the new handstone. Controls, empty tank, pump, precision and steel reservations stay intact. The boiler, cast-iron pipe, oil and final locomotive assembly remain.","Make the locomotive boiler’s four copper rings from four additional cold TFC copper ingots. Reuse the retained press above its empty depot on the supported 1 RPM drive, with 6 SU load under 8 SU capacity, and disconnect external item extraction. Load one ingot, press it into a flat Create copper sheet and collect it. Reinsert that sheet, press it into an MI copper curved plate and collect it. Reinsert the curved plate, press it into one copper ring and collect it. After each completed pressing, sneak-use the paid wrench to recover the existing press-side input shaft and pause the drive. Transfer the item, then replace that same shaft; keep the depot clear between items. Repeat for all four ingots: twelve single-item pressings make four rings, with one copper ingot spent per ring and no flat or curved plates left over. Reserve all four rings for the new bronze tank used in the locomotive boiler. This work uses no steam, fuel or tool wear; retain 185 charcoal before other open uses, 600 mB macerator steam, the firebox, controls, empty locomotive tank, pump and earlier steel/component stocks. The boiler’s other parts still need their own supplies.","Supply four TFC brass sheets for the spare boiler’s glass apparatus. Add six cold TFC copper ingots, two zinc ingots, thirteen oak twigs, three loose limestone and three loose granite. Use the returned lid in two further heated brass batches on the existing mixer: spend one charcoal per batch and collect eight new Create brass ingots plus the returned lid. Preserve the three older brass ingots and four copper rings. Knap a new sedimentary knife and two intrusive stone hammers; each knap needs at least two loose rocks and consumes one. Use the two remaining limestone in two hammer crafts for four flux. The thirteen twigs cover the knife, two hammers, four wooden tongs and one new firestarter. Craft the tongs with the new knife; keep the workshop tools intact.","Process four separate pairs in the earlier sheltered gold forge beside the Copper anvil. Each pair gets exactly two charcoal: warm the empty forge for 1500 ticks, then heat the two ingots for 1200 ticks. Keep fresh wooden tongs held throughout the hot transfer; move both ingots into the anvil and sneak-use a hammer to weld them with one flux within 80 player ticks of the first pickup. Complete the sheet plan within 120 ticks, matching its target and ending with three light hits; every target has a sequence of at most twelve steps. Leave the sheet in the anvil for 7000 player ticks before cold pickup. Let the forge burn out and cool between pairs. Four successful first-attempt relights use four firestarter charges; failed attempts need extra tool allocation. Both mixes and four forge pairs spend ten charcoal, leaving 175 before other open uses. Reserve all four sheets for the glass apparatus; the glass, boiler and remaining locomotive work are still unfinished.","For the glass batch, bring 32 new cold recovered oak logs, eight straw, ten clay balls, two loose limestone, two oak twigs and one white sand. Knap a new sedimentary axe; one limestone and one twig make its head and handle. Strip and recover 24 placed logs with this axe, spending 48 uses; keep eight logs for a pit kiln. Use the existing upward andesite saw alone on its independent 8 RPM/8 SU drive, with empty fluid tank and output filter. Feed one stripped log at a time, collect every completed job and stop when three oak supports appear; cannon moulds can precede them. Cut two supports into eight lumber. Four lumber make one plank; the other four and one twig make a paddle. The four reserved TFC brass sheets, plank and hammer make eight brass blocks: five for an air-centered basin, one isolated pouring table and two spares. Hammer the remaining limestone into two flux. Knap two unfired ceramic pipes from the ten clay balls; fire both pipes and one flux together in the eight-log/eight-straw pit kiln, then recover two bare pipes and one lime.","Combine one retained saltpeter powder, the lime and white sand into four silica glass batches. Load two separate ceramic pipes and retain two batches. In the cold sheltered forge, use one charcoal: warm the empty forge for 800 ticks, then heat both loaded pipes in separate slots for 310 ticks. Keep the glass tool held throughout each transfer and pour, allowing at most 80 player ticks including use. Pour the first pipe into the brass basin, wait 102 cooling ticks and recover one glass block. Keep the second pipe heating during that wait; then table-pour it, flatten immediately with the paddle and wait 62 cooling ticks before ordinary recovery of one glass pane. Both pipes may break after successful pours; their return is not needed. Let the forge burn out and cool. Reserve both glass outputs for the separate boiler bill; retain 174 charcoal before other open uses, one saltpeter powder, one flux, two spare brass blocks, one support and the paddle. The new axe retains at least two uses, the first sheet hammer 32 and the sheet firestarter two after successful first-attempt kiln/forge ignitions. Other reserved stock stays intact; the boiler, oil, cast-iron pipe and final locomotive assembly still need completion.","For the separate locomotive boiler, bring 37 new cold TFC copper ingots, five tin ingots, eight whole granite, eight clay balls and one recovered oak log. Reuse the earlier bronze-only foundry line in place, including its lid, basin, two MI pipes, caster, chute and captured burner. Run five batches of three copper plus one tin: one charcoal per batch melts 360 mB bronze for four cold CBC ingots. Clear each batch and let the burner expire before starting the next. Press the twenty ingots into twenty MI bronze plates; turn six plates into six bronze curved plates. Six other copper ingots supply six flat sheets and then six MI copper curved plates; press two curves into two new rings. Use the existing paused 1 RPM/6 SU press under 8 SU capacity: forty single-item pressings in total, pausing the input shaft with the paid wrench before each collection as above. On the independent upward saw with empty tank and filter, feed single copper ingots until you collect a copper rod, at most eleven jobs in the reviewed cycle. Set the output filter with that actual rod and process five further ingots, then clear the filter with an empty hand. The rod used as the ordinary selector remains yours. Use four copper curves and two rods for eight blades, and cut the other four rods into eight bolts. The blades, bolts and two new rings make two rotors; keep the four older rings for the tank.","Six bronze curves, the two new rotors and the reserved pane make twelve MI fluid pipes. Use two in the boiler and retain ten. Four bronze plates, the four older rings and the reserved glass block make its new tank. Strip the new log with the glass-batch axe, apply one of the three held Create brass ingots, then sneak-wrench the brass casing into inventory where breaking is allowed and space is clear. Use it with eight bronze plates for the new bronze machine casing. In the old empty furnace, smelt four clay balls into four ordinary bricks with one charcoal and let that fuel burn out. Two unheated mixer batches, each with two bricks and two further clay balls, make eight fire-clay dust. Load all eight dust and one fresh charcoal together into the old furnace; its automatic batch makes eight fire-clay bricks. Craft two blocks from four bricks each. Craft a new furnace from the eight whole granite and keep it for the boiler. Combine the two remaining bronze plates, tank, two new MI pipes, two fire-clay blocks, new furnace and new casing into one additional bronze boiler. The seven charcoal for this whole bill leave 167 before other open uses; retain two Create brass, ten MI pipes and at least one use on the glass-batch axe. The working steam plant, controls, firebox, empty locomotive tank, pump, steel and other reserves stay intact. The cast-iron pipe, oil and final locomotive assembly remain.","For the separate cast-iron pipe batch, bring three additional cold TFC cast-iron ingots. On the retained steel press over its empty depot, use the same 1 RPM/6 SU drive under 8 SU capacity. Press two ingots separately into two TFMG cast-iron sheets. Pause the input shaft with the paid wrench before each collection and keep external extraction disconnected. TFC anvil cast-iron sheets do not fit this recipe. Craft the two new TFMG sheets with the third cast-iron ingot into four cast-iron pipes, using either the horizontal or vertical recipe. Hold all four: reserve one for the locomotive and leave three spare. This batch uses no charcoal or steam; keep 167 charcoal before other open uses, the additional bronze boiler, ten MI pipes and all other reserved components. The locomotive still needs its oil, remaining assembly inputs and locomotive-systems research.","After both earlier nonconsuming oil-bucket objectives have registered, reuse one of the two filled TFMG oil buckets. The six litres used for steel mechanisms are already spent. At the existing oil station, use the paid wrench to remove one input shaft from the bridge mixer’s drive where breaking is allowed; keep the shaft and stop the mixer. Keep the basin facing down and begin with its input/output tanks, buffer, all transfer pipes and spout empty. Close both endpoints of the lubricant feed, basin extraction and tank-to-spout branches. With room in inventory, normally use one held filled oil bucket on the basin. The complete 1,000 mB enters the basin and the empty vanilla bucket returns to you. Direct bucket use on the spout is not needed.","Open only the existing basin-to-buffer branch. Wait until both basin storages and its two MI pipe buffers are empty and the ordinary buffer holds all 1,000 mB of TFMG oil; close that branch. Open only the buffer-to-spout branch, wait for the buffer and both pipes to empty into the spout, then close both endpoints. Replace the retained mixer shaft. Hold 1,000 mB in the spout, one filled oil bucket and three empty vanilla buckets. Reserve 250 mB for the correctly marked locomotive frame at its later filling step after locomotive-systems research; that future fill leaves 750 mB. This handoff needs no new pump, pipes, tank, fuel or steam. Keep the additional boiler, four cast-iron pipes, ten MI pipes, 167 charcoal before other open uses and all other components reserved. Check the earlier reserved frame, rail, circuit, plate and track part before completing the final sequence.","Once Locomotive Systems is unlocked and the nonconsuming eight-steel-mechanism objective has registered, use the five parts reserved by the rail-terminal bill: one frame, standard rail, controller circuit, steel plate and track part. Use the existing downward USE deployer, spout, depots and steel press on the 1 RPM/6 SU forming drive under 8 SU capacity. Process one frame at a time and load one real component for each deployment. Apply these eleven parts in order: solid-fueled firebox, additional held bronze boiler, steel mechanism, standard rail, controller circuit, reserved steel plate, track part, empty Create fluid tank, paid Greate andesite pump, controls and cast-iron pipe. Use the actual reserved MI or Railcraft steel plate. Keep the same partially assembled frame and its progress through every move; pause the input shaft with the paid wrench before collecting it.","After all eleven deployments, put that marked frame under the isolated oil spout for one 250 mB fill. Its 1,000 mB falls to 750 mB. Then perform one tier-one pressing on the existing steel press. This completes the single thirteen-action loop and gives one finished steam locomotive with no unfinished-sequence marker. Keep it in inventory for detection. The bill consumes the five named rail reservations, the additional boiler and other deployed parts, one of eight mechanisms, one of four cast-iron pipes and 250 mB oil. Retain seven mechanisms, three cast-iron pipes, ten MI pipes, one filled oil bucket, three empty buckets, 167 charcoal before other open uses and sixteen separate objective TFC steel ingots. Keep the working steam plant placed. No new fuel, steam or hardware is needed for this assembly. This nonconsuming freight task counts four of the sixteen reserved canonical TFC steel ingots. Keep all sixteen; no additional four-ingot batch is needed.","The TFMG casting line and the Railcraft furnace deliver canonical TFC steel. Independent nonconsuming objectives may count the same sixteen held ingots, including the four-ingot freight task; detection spends none.","Before registering freight, confirm both parent milestones: sixteen canonical MI steel plates were held before spending them on rail parts, and eight steel mechanisms were detected before one entered the locomotive. The seven remaining mechanisms cannot complete the eight-item parent retroactively.","Close the manual rolling-machine menu while alive with room for its returned inputs and real output. Preserve those leftovers, then recover the empty machine with an ordinary empty-hand survival break where breaking and drops are allowed. Hold that one machine, the finished unmarked locomotive and all sixteen TFC ingots in main inventory, with an empty cursor. Wait for actual quest detection, then place the same machine back to restore rolling service. Recovery and replacement create no extra machine and spend no steel, fuel, steam or mining-tool durability."]
	quest.2F33DA300848472E.quest_subtitle: "Railcraft rolls the chassis; MI and TFMG supply the steam and drive systems; Create performs final integration."
	quest.2F33DA300848472E.title: "Assemble the Steam Locomotive"
	quest.2F6C649F9DB8E177.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight shafts and eight cogwheels beside the kinetic line."
		"Keep the repair crate off the moving belt so a jam cannot block access to the parts needed to clear it."
	]
	quest.2F6C649F9DB8E177.quest_subtitle: "Eight shafts and cogwheels turn a broken transmission into a short maintenance stop."
	quest.2F6C649F9DB8E177.title: "Stock Kinetic Repair Parts"
	quest.2F702B914A1F1C04.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight thousand millibuckets of TFMG lubrication oil and inspect the coke oven."
		"Use current feed and restore the oil reserve after the proof."
		"The quest submission consumes the fluid; refill the working buffer afterward. Its reward is a reusable recovery tool, not replacement components."
	]
	quest.2F702B914A1F1C04.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of fresh lubrication oil beside an inspected coke oven trace maintenance supply back to working industry."
	quest.2F702B914A1F1C04.title: "Rebuild Lubricant from Feed"
	quest.2F84C1B218A8FE89.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight Quantum circuits and sixteen superconductor ingots."
		"Refill from raw and expedition inputs after staging the reserve so the active line remains ready."
	]
	quest.2F84C1B218A8FE89.quest_subtitle: "Eight circuits and sixteen superconductors support remote-network, Stargate, fusion, and machine-hull repairs without stripping the first installation."
	quest.2F84C1B218A8FE89.title: "Stage Three Quantum Builds"
	quest.2F993FA875D8F832.quest_desc: [
		"Observe the MI vacuum freezer through another real recipe."
		"Buffer hot ingots, confirm power remains stable, and provide finished-titanium storage before loading the batch."
	]
	quest.2F993FA875D8F832.quest_subtitle: "A second cooling campaign proves the cold line can accept hot titanium without manual clearing."
	quest.2F993FA875D8F832.title: "Run the Vacuum Freezer Again"
	quest.2FAD2B64497B9589.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Mekanism hazmat mask and gown before authorizing reactor operation."
		"Complete the set, keep independent meters and medicine nearby, and use PPE only for short controlled access."
	]
	quest.2FAD2B64497B9589.quest_subtitle: "Isotope PPE is staged before operation because the first exposure is the worst time to discover a missing piece."
	quest.2FAD2B64497B9589.title: "Prepare Isotope-Handling PPE"
	quest.2FB54C1F480EB542.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight MI steel gears through an installed material route."
		"Replenish the ingot and shaped-part buffer afterward so the gear batch does not empty casing stock."
	]
	quest.2FB54C1F480EB542.quest_subtitle: "Eight consistent gears show the new steel stream can become moving machinery."
	quest.2FB54C1F480EB542.title: "Standardize Steel Gears"
	quest.300A457DBD9146B1.quest_desc: [
		"Demonstrate an independent 100,000,000 FE black-start reserve for the project office."
		"Restart communications and routing first, then inspect each district before admitting bulk inputs."
	]
	quest.300A457DBD9146B1.quest_subtitle: "One hundred million stored FE brings control, records, and freight back before the major process units."
	quest.300A457DBD9146B1.title: "Cold-Restart the Project Office"
	quest.302AA41FFD730056.quest_desc: [
		"Build copper propick."
		"Pour the copper prospector head in its fired mold, cool it fully, and haft the finished tool for field use."
	]
	quest.302AA41FFD730056.quest_subtitle: "The prospector’s pick replaces hopeful digging with evidence from the rock."
	quest.302AA41FFD730056.title: "Make the Copper Prospector Pick"
	quest.3056C9234C434D61.quest_desc: [
		"Shape and pit-fire a ceramic vessel."
		"Carry it when prospecting or gathering food, then unload it into safer storage at camp."
	]
	quest.3056C9234C434D61.quest_subtitle: "A small fired vessel keeps fragile supplies together on the road."
	quest.3056C9234C434D61.title: "Fire a Travel Vessel"
	quest.3080D7B57660A29D.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen MI aluminum plates and inspect the metallurgic infuser."
		"Protect the plate bay from unrestricted crafting; casings, rotors, pumps, and later machines all draw from it."
	]
	quest.3080D7B57660A29D.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen aluminum plates beside a working infuser connect structural growth to chemical control."
	quest.3080D7B57660A29D.title: "Aluminum Plate Bay"
	quest.30959F0D874AB7C5.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Mekanism’s waste-removal advancement through the installed barrel route."
		"Inspect capacity and transfer logic before increasing burn rate; a full barrel is a shutdown condition."
	]
	quest.30959F0D874AB7C5.quest_subtitle: "Waste removal counts only when radioactive output reaches monitored storage with room for the next cycle."
	quest.30959F0D874AB7C5.title: "Waste Barrel Watch"
	quest.309DEB6DDC7C9348.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect a Cargo Boats dock and retain a motorboat."
		"Leave shoreline room for turning, dry unloading, cart access, and later belt or rail transfer."
	]
	quest.309DEB6DDC7C9348.quest_subtitle: "A dock and motorboat establish where water cargo changes hands before rails and pipes are added."
	quest.309DEB6DDC7C9348.title: "Lay Out the Freight Interchange"
	quest.30A278E397F291AA.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Mekanism fission reactor port in the assembled facility."
		"Assign each port a documented role and keep pipe access clear enough to isolate it without entering the hot zone."
	]
	quest.30A278E397F291AA.quest_subtitle: "A fission port is the controlled opening through which fuel, coolant, waste, and instrumentation must pass."
	quest.30A278E397F291AA.title: "Fuel and Coolant Supply Run"
	quest.30A58683165B9B5E.quest_desc: [
		"Build four CROWNS heat exchangers."
		"Confirm placement rules and total heat balance for the exact CROWNS reactor design before activation."
	]
	quest.30A58683165B9B5E.quest_subtitle: "Four water heat sinks are a real cooling batch, not evidence that any reactor geometry is automatically safe."
	quest.30A58683165B9B5E.title: "Prepare the Heat-Sink Set"
	quest.30F22008F933612B.quest_desc: ["Perform the formal Vampirism research experiment using a naturally acquired fang.","Support hunter and neutral-study play, and complete the garlic cure without requiring permanent vampirism.","This is an optional discipline at this age; the canonical factory proofs govern normal progression."]
	quest.30F22008F933612B.quest_subtitle: "Understanding a faction is not the same as joining it."
	quest.30F22008F933612B.title: "Vampirism Research and Cure"
	quest.3103A0638044C9DC.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four RCS thrusters and two iridium ingots."
		"Replenish corronium, titanium plate, digital circuits, and PGM feed before releasing the batch."
	]
	quest.3103A0638044C9DC.quest_subtitle: "Four more RCS thrusters and iridium stock prove fine control can be rebuilt after a mission."
	quest.3103A0638044C9DC.title: "Repeat Attitude-Control Hardware"
	quest.3111E47A631230AE.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen neutron piles and two crystal-matrix blocks."
		"Protect the matrix from general crafting and keep collector output moving while the compressor is occupied."
	]
	quest.3111E47A631230AE.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen neutron piles and two matrix blocks give both slow lines room to continue during an experiment."
	quest.3111E47A631230AE.title: "Buffer Neutron and Matrix Stock"
	quest.3134FD4BAD8FC1B3.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 16,000 mB of MI hydrochloric acid."
		"Use compatible fixed storage and preserve emergency transfer capacity away from the reactor building."
	]
	quest.3134FD4BAD8FC1B3.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of hydrochloric acid give fuel chemistry a buffered scrub stream with a known endpoint."
	quest.3134FD4BAD8FC1B3.title: "Fill the Acid-Scrubbing Reserve"
	quest.31728F122222FA9D.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a fired large vessel and a fired vessel in reserve."
		"Use the larger vessel for protected stock and the smaller one for the next field route."
	]
	quest.31728F122222FA9D.quest_subtitle: "Extra fired containers buy time when travel, decay, or breakage interrupts the plan."
	quest.31728F122222FA9D.title: "Stage Spare Pottery"
	quest.318614FCD25B22E2.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s clay-knapping advancement by shaping a valid clay form."
		"Learn the patterns you use often, but let the interface guide unfamiliar molds instead of guessing."
	]
	quest.318614FCD25B22E2.quest_subtitle: "Clay knapping turns storage and casting into shapes you can reproduce."
	quest.318614FCD25B22E2.title: "Learn Clay Knapping"
	quest.31CFBADC9B1297D7.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 14 opens, place and inspect an Eternal Starlight starcore block."
		"Keep a reference sample, quarantine storage, expedition records, and a controlled path into industrial research."
	]
	quest.31CFBADC9B1297D7.quest_subtitle: "An astral institute exists to preserve alien samples, context, and containment instead of reducing discovery to ingredients."
	quest.31CFBADC9B1297D7.title: "Astral Research Institute"
	quest.31F406ADABBB7F0F.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen bronze bolts using an installed MI forge-hammer, cutting, or crafting route."
		"Keep them beside casings and pipes; fasteners are maintenance stock, not a reason to halt production."
	]
	quest.31F406ADABBB7F0F.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen bolts keep ordinary steam repairs from waiting on a fresh forming job."
	quest.31F406ADABBB7F0F.title: "Stock Bronze Fasteners"
	quest.31FAB95D65AA76CD.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect a TFMG steel distillation controller during a real batch."
		"Watch all outputs, close the crude feed before overflow, and verify restart from a known state."
	]
	quest.31FAB95D65AA76CD.quest_subtitle: "The distillation tower can run unattended only while every product tank has capacity and the crude feed can stop."
	quest.31FAB95D65AA76CD.title: "Oil and Fuel Works Unattended Run"
	quest.321F85460635DA9B.quest_desc: ["At a Malum Spirit Altar, infuse a normal book with one Enchanted Ritual Chalk, two Refined Soulstone, and one Ender Pearl.","Supply 8 Arcane, 6 Eldritch, and 4 Aerial spirits. The pack recipe produces the Foliot Binding Book directly; no dictionary item or separate reading step is required.","This is an optional discipline at this age; the canonical factory proofs govern normal progression."]
	quest.321F85460635DA9B.quest_subtitle: "The quest supplies the discovery procedure; the output is a functional binding book."
	quest.321F85460635DA9B.title: "Discover and Bind a Foliot"
	quest.3288265373F0F72C.quest_desc: ["Build all eight OPV functional families and verify that each recipe consumes its matching UXV component; this prepares the terminal component ladder."]
	quest.3288265373F0F72C.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Overpowered Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.3288265373F0F72C.title: "OPV Component Standard"
	quest.328A892AF322CA12.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 15 opens, place and inspect a QuarryPlus marker."
		"Mark the full footprint, check protected routes and structures, and provide storage before activating a quarry."
	]
	quest.328A892AF322CA12.quest_subtitle: "Quarry markers turn excavation into a bounded contract whose edges can be inspected before anything is removed."
	quest.328A892AF322CA12.title: "Quarry Boundary Stakes"
	quest.3293D0D833DADCEB.quest_desc: [
		"Produce a full sixteen-wafer batch and four each of the five standard SMD components."
		"Keep wafers, chips, SMD parts, solder, and cleanroom maintenance supplied as repeatable lines rather than hand-crafted samples."
	]
	quest.3293D0D833DADCEB.quest_subtitle: "A stocked cleanroom proves that 1024-EU/t semiconductor work is sustainable."
	quest.3293D0D833DADCEB.title: "Wafers and Standard SMD"
	quest.32C29FF492CF742E.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four Mekanism uranium hexafluoride buckets through the installed Nuclear-age recipe."
		"Isolate the feedstock, label the batch, and keep its hydrochloric acid, chlorine, fluorine, iridium, and filter inputs traceable."
	]
	quest.32C29FF492CF742E.quest_subtitle: "Four uranium-hexafluoride buckets make the live enrichment feed visible before it enters the centrifuge cascade."
	quest.32C29FF492CF742E.title: "Lock Down Uranium Hexafluoride"
	quest.3302EED8D7D31254.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Mekanism’s chemical-transport advancement through installed tubes and tanks."
		"Trace the route from source to destination and keep incompatible networks physically distinct."
	]
	quest.3302EED8D7D31254.quest_subtitle: "The transport advancement marks the point where gases can move without losing their identity between machines."
	quest.3302EED8D7D31254.title: "Alchemical Practicum"
	quest.330A7790A680897D.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 13 opens, place and inspect a Mekanism Solar Neutron Activator."
		"Separate incoming material, active processing, finished fuel, radiation access, and waste storage."
	]
	quest.330A7790A680897D.quest_subtitle: "A nuclear fuel complex keeps preparation and reprocessing physically accountable before either reaches the reactor district."
	quest.330A7790A680897D.title: "National Nuclear Fuel Complex"
	quest.332A4A2C514A3588.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four MI mixed iridium ingots from current concentrate."
		"Verify acid, centrifuge, packing, heat, and output storage before returning the line to continuous work."
	]
	quest.332A4A2C514A3588.quest_subtitle: "Four mixed iridium ingots made again prove the PGM line can recover after shutdown."
	quest.332A4A2C514A3588.title: "Restart Iridium Separation"
	quest.33535E22F65A1FA2.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a CROWNS fuel assembly."
		"The live recipe combines a certified CROWNS fuel rod with Mekanism fuel and control assemblies; do not load fuel into an unbalanced design."
	]
	quest.33535E22F65A1FA2.quest_subtitle: "The first solid fuel cell turns the reactor drawing into a heat-producing system that demands accounting."
	quest.33535E22F65A1FA2.title: "Install the Solid Fuel Cell"
	quest.335B6598C7C558E9.quest_desc: [
		"Let the statistic accumulate through genuine component work."
		"Identify the most repeated stable recipe and move that work into an established machine or crafter line."
	]
	quest.335B6598C7C558E9.quest_subtitle: "One hundred crafting-table interactions record the manual work that automation should reduce, not celebrate forever."
	quest.335B6598C7C558E9.title: "Bench Fatigue Ledger"
	quest.336A05BFCC2EE5D7.quest_desc: [
		"Build an AE2 energy cell and stock sixteen Fluix glass cables."
		"Keep recovery tools and essential records outside network-only storage."
	]
	quest.336A05BFCC2EE5D7.quest_subtitle: "An AE2 energy cell and sixteen cables let the network recover locally after its main feed disappears."
	quest.336A05BFCC2EE5D7.title: "Prepare for a Network Outage"
	quest.33940FD2E5E96A41.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect a Electro Energetics device connector and the connected Mekanism metallurgic infuser."
		"Verify isolation, stable power, and separate infusion-material handling before leaving the machine ready for automation."
	]
	quest.33940FD2E5E96A41.quest_subtitle: "A device connector and live infuser prove the first chemical load is attached through intentional infrastructure."
	quest.33940FD2E5E96A41.title: "Test the Infuser Connection"
	quest.341CB893F9CBC439.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 9 opens, produce eight thousand millibuckets of MI sulfuric acid."
		"Use compatible storage, clear routing, and an output plan before starting the acid line."
	]
	quest.341CB893F9CBC439.quest_subtitle: "At Chemical and Arcane, eight buckets of sulfuric acid make catalyst work a contained production stream."
	quest.341CB893F9CBC439.title: "Acids and Catalysts"
	quest.3423607BB6D25891.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Electro Energetics fuse holder on a real branch."
		"Choose protection for the conductor and load, then isolate the circuit before servicing it. A fuse limits fault consequences; it does not make an overloaded branch correctly rated."
	]
	quest.3423607BB6D25891.quest_subtitle: "Electro Energetics holders, EE fuses, and grounding give a fault a deliberate weak point before insulation or machinery becomes one."
	quest.3423607BB6D25891.title: "Install Branch-Circuit Protection"
	quest.34AB575C259881E8.quest_desc: ["Add a Prismatic Focus Lens, Soulbinding Brazier, and Rite Anchor to the laboratory.","These durable stations support repeatable research; none is meant to be destroyed by a discovery.","Optional during normal age progression. Esoteric evidence becomes required only at final Reality Engineering through ESO-04 to FRN-06."]
	quest.34AB575C259881E8.quest_subtitle: "Low-voltage control makes focused, bound, and anchored experiments possible."
	quest.34AB575C259881E8.title: "Industrial Spirit Research"
	quest.34D2D71AD9CFA7D8.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 15 opens, build a Mining Gadgets mining gadget."
		"Power it, configure a controlled work area, and avoid extracting faster than geology records and processing allow."
	]
	quest.34D2D71AD9CFA7D8.quest_subtitle: "At Stainless and Digital, a powered mining tool increases extraction only after processing and storage can absorb it."
	quest.34D2D71AD9CFA7D8.title: "Powered Mining Tool"
	quest.350A8D21355E26C3.quest_desc: [
		"Build an AE2 Quantum Ring and demonstrate two hundred fifty million FE."
		"Power endpoints independently and test which records remain local when the remote link falls."
	]
	quest.350A8D21355E26C3.quest_subtitle: "A Quantum Ring beside two hundred fifty million FE makes the data nexus resilient to distance and local brownout."
	quest.350A8D21355E26C3.title: "Data Nexus Brownout Table"
	quest.3515E0ECE61EC314.quest_desc: [
		"Build a fusion chamber and three superconductor ingots."
		"Reserve the ingots for replacement field hardware and keep chamber access clear after assembly."
	]
	quest.3515E0ECE61EC314.quest_subtitle: "A chamber stack and additional superconductors turn one fusion vessel into maintainable infrastructure."
	quest.3515E0ECE61EC314.title: "Fusion Chamber Stack"
	quest.3551397B1C0A7A92.quest_desc: ["Fabricate the magnetic gun and survival structure tool as controlled field-engineering equipment."]
	quest.3551397B1C0A7A92.quest_subtitle: "Portable engineering without creative-mode shortcuts."
	quest.3551397B1C0A7A92.title: "Magnetic Field Engineering"
	quest.357BB56305199A19.quest_desc: [
		"Use precise storage and threshold devices where a normal AE2 bus or level emitter cannot express the required boundary."
		"Document the item, quantity, destination, and safe behavior when storage is full."
	]
	quest.357BB56305199A19.quest_subtitle: "Precision logistics is an explicit exception for a measured factory problem."
	quest.357BB56305199A19.title: "ExtendedAE — Precise Boundaries"
	quest.35A02BE5F2ED7511.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight AE2 fluix crystals in a later batch."
		"Replenish certus and redstone afterward and assign the batch before cable, controller, and crafting demand compete for it."
	]
	quest.35A02BE5F2ED7511.quest_subtitle: "Eight more fluix crystals show charged input and transformation can keep pace with network growth."
	quest.35A02BE5F2ED7511.title: "Prepare a Second Fluix Shift"
	quest.35E51DBA15585575.quest_desc: [
		"Produce an MI singularity for the convergence ledger."
		"Keep its source material line active and record the rate instead of treating the first result as an isolated collectible."
	]
	quest.35E51DBA15585575.quest_subtitle: "A controlled singularity is a unit of production now, but each one still represents an entire running plant."
	quest.35E51DBA15585575.title: "Count the First Convergence Stock"
	quest.363156E2781C7254.quest_desc: [
		"Build two AE2 Quantum Rings and four superconductor ingots."
		"Stage one ring at each endpoint and keep their power and chunk-loading behavior under observation before moving critical storage."
	]
	quest.363156E2781C7254.quest_subtitle: "Two Quantum Rings and spare superconductor stock keep a remote AE2 link recoverable from either side."
	quest.363156E2781C7254.title: "Quantum Ring Spare"
	quest.364BA8FBDE902C63.quest_desc: ["Produce an Infinity Catalyst as the planning proof that specialized machines can share services, logistics, maintenance, and recoverable district boundaries."]
	quest.364BA8FBDE902C63.quest_subtitle: "Discipline mastery — supporting branch; follow the chapter age proof for the main transition."
	quest.364BA8FBDE902C63.title: "Megastructure Planning Mastered"
	quest.364BD12BAA4FB37C.quest_desc: [
		"Find the Stellaris Mars Rocky Plains biome."
		"Mark the landing route, oxygen refuge, sample boundary, and a fuel-safe path back to the rocket."
	]
	quest.364BD12BAA4FB37C.quest_subtitle: "The rocky plains offer room to work, but every survey step increases the distance from shelter and return fuel."
	quest.364BD12BAA4FB37C.title: "Mars Rocky Plains Survey"
	quest.36B517428853015E.quest_desc: ["Stabilization uses the mature mechatronics and sensor suppliers of Deep Space. Keep manual control and override available before automated routing."]
	quest.36B517428853015E.quest_subtitle: "Sensors, digital control, and stepper actuation separate a stabilized aircraft from a manually balanced experiment."
	quest.36B517428853015E.title: "Stabilized Flight Control"
	quest.36D81E9159116003.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four MI singularities and four neutron ingots."
		"Record their source lines and keep the holding room isolated from unrestricted final crafting."
	]
	quest.36D81E9159116003.quest_subtitle: "Four singularities and four neutron ingots turn abstract convergence into stock that can be counted and protected."
	quest.36D81E9159116003.title: "Singularity Counting Room"
	quest.36E4A378A4274CAD.quest_desc: [
		"Build the installed Stellaris oil finder used by this branch."
		"Survey away from finished builds and mark pump location, pipe route, storage, and safe access before drilling."
	]
	quest.36E4A378A4274CAD.quest_subtitle: "An oil finder turns an invisible deposit into a surveyed site whose extraction route can be planned."
	quest.36E4A378A4274CAD.title: "Oil Finder"
	quest.36E7D3E69013CD25.quest_desc: [
		"Build a TFMG oil can from the live brass-sheet and tin-plate recipe."
		"Store it empty beside the sampling point so it does not become an unidentified container of mixed fluid."
	]
	quest.36E7D3E69013CD25.quest_subtitle: "A dedicated oil can makes fluid checks possible without opening the main tank farm."
	quest.36E7D3E69013CD25.title: "Keep an Oil Sampling Can"
	quest.37047374E1A3C4CE.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen certus quartz dust and four MI digital circuit boards."
		"Keep the shelf physically accessible and replenish both before authorizing another drive-bay expansion."
	]
	quest.37047374E1A3C4CE.quest_subtitle: "Certus dust and digital boards on one shelf prepare both network materials and the electronics controlling them."
	quest.37047374E1A3C4CE.title: "Certus Dust Bin"
	quest.373D506E9AF5C66D.quest_desc: [
		"Build copper pickaxe."
		"Pour copper into a fired pickaxe-head mold, let it cool, then attach the head to a stick."
	]
	quest.373D506E9AF5C66D.quest_subtitle: "A copper pickaxe opens the rock; it does not make an unsupported tunnel safe."
	quest.373D506E9AF5C66D.title: "First Copper Pickaxe"
	quest.3770C8E57AAFCF47.quest_desc: ["Run the authored MI batch, retain biomass, and route wood-ash byproduct instead of deleting it."]
	quest.3770C8E57AAFCF47.quest_subtitle: "Centrifugation, water control, and retained seals standardize biomass."
	quest.3770C8E57AAFCF47.title: "Industrial Biology — MI Sterilization"
	quest.377A5013538B6EAB.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a bronze machine casing at the expansion site."
		"Verify input, output, power, safety, and replacement access against the existing district."
	]
	quest.377A5013538B6EAB.quest_subtitle: "A bronze casing placed on the new footprint checks access and interfaces before the expansion consumes rare structure."
	quest.377A5013538B6EAB.title: "Commission an Expansion Module"
	quest.37956FF2E3F6CA3B.quest_desc: [
		"Buffer sixteen thousand millibuckets of crude oil and twenty-seven Railcraft coke-oven bricks."
		"Keep the rebuild material dry and the crude isolated from hot work."
	]
	quest.37956FF2E3F6CA3B.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of crude and twenty-seven coke-oven bricks preserve feed and a complete oven rebuild."
	quest.37956FF2E3F6CA3B.title: "Stage Three-Shift Crude and Coke"
	quest.37CDD207B3578251.quest_desc: [
		"Buffer eight buckets of Cryofluid, then use part of that reserve to finish an eight-ingot titanium batch."
		"This is the explicit Quantum retrofit for titanium; High Pressure remains complete through the original coolant-free freezer route."
	]
	quest.37CDD207B3578251.quest_subtitle: "Cryofluid now supports both superconductor work and the explicit Quantum titanium retrofit."
	quest.37CDD207B3578251.title: "Buffer the Cryogenic Loop"
	quest.37D714556899CBFF.quest_desc: [
		"Build and stock eight Electro Energetics wire connectors."
		"Lay out accessible junctions between MV generation, storage, MI machines, and the first chemical load."
	]
	quest.37D714556899CBFF.quest_subtitle: "Eight Electro Energetics connectors keep the new floor physically connected without raiding LV repairs."
	quest.37D714556899CBFF.title: "Stock MV Connectors"
	quest.380E2171E6D881E8.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen MI bronze plates from certified CBC bronze."
		"Use the pack’s early forming routes and reserve the plates beside boiler-feed components rather than consuming every plate on expansion."
	]
	quest.380E2171E6D881E8.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen bronze plates make tank and casing repairs possible before pressure falls."
	quest.380E2171E6D881E8.title: "Plate the Boiler Feed Spares"
	quest.381107F257E77DF5.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and store sixteen MI titanium plates."
		"Maintain rutile, chloride chemistry, hot-ingot, vacuum-freezing, and plate-forming capacity behind the stock."
	]
	quest.381107F257E77DF5.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen titanium plates make pressure and aerospace work possible without emptying the first vacuum batch."
	quest.381107F257E77DF5.title: "Stock Titanium Plate"
	quest.381A964854A069FC.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare eight TFC Items leather sheets."
		"Store them with plant fiber and the tools used for pack and strap repairs."
	]
	quest.381A964854A069FC.quest_subtitle: "Eight leather sheets repair carrying gear without requiring two finished belts to sit unused."
	quest.381A964854A069FC.title: "Stock Leather for Repairs"
	quest.382186E1F4A9D617.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 8,000 mB of MI oxygen."
		"Use a dedicated clean tank and line; confirm oxygen production and container filling before assigning tanks to the mission."
	]
	quest.382186E1F4A9D617.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of oxygen let life-support plumbing be purged, filled, and tested before departure."
	quest.382186E1F4A9D617.title: "Oxygen Purge Rack"
	quest.38240647EC719970.quest_desc: ["Build a Deep Learner and prepare a Blank Data Model for a mob whose drops justify sustained simulation.","Train the model through Hostile Neural Networks before scaling to powered chambers; this contract establishes the equipment and model stock.","Optional Digital simulation under COM-04. Hostile models and drops do not prove factory control or replace first-resource acquisition."]
	quest.38240647EC719970.quest_subtitle: "A learner and blank model turn field encounters into a repeatable prediction program."
	quest.38240647EC719970.title: "Prepare the First Data Models"
	quest.384364A3675AB271.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement frame, acceptor, core, processing addon, and control parts."]
	quest.384364A3675AB271.quest_subtitle: "The expandable hall restarts from staged parts and a Electro Energetics black-start reserve."
	quest.384364A3675AB271.title: "Machine-Cell Recovery Stock"
	quest.3850D9F3338D416E.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight MI steel rings."
		"Keep them with the pump and pipe tools where a failed seal cannot cut off access."
	]
	quest.3850D9F3338D416E.quest_subtitle: "Eight steel rings make a water-side restart possible before the steam line cools completely."
	quest.3850D9F3338D416E.title: "Stage Steel Pump Seals"
	quest.38665588DCF9F600.quest_desc: [
		"Bring a cast-iron fluid tank, coal coke, and a TFMG oil can to the heavy-industry site."
		"The oil can uses brass sheet and tin plate in the live recipe; the tank must be cast iron here, not later steel."
	]
	quest.38665588DCF9F600.quest_subtitle: "Coke, a cast-iron tank, and an oil can tie geology to the first refinery survey."
	quest.38665588DCF9F600.title: "Heavy Industry Resource Survey"
	quest.38719DF87C5C3E1D.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger AE2’s Quantum Network Bridge advancement."
		"Power both endpoints, test link loss, and retain local recovery access."
	]
	quest.38719DF87C5C3E1D.quest_subtitle: "The Quantum Network Bridge advancement belongs after the Tier 15 ring, when remote networking is actually available."
	quest.38719DF87C5C3E1D.title: "Quantum Link Proof"
	quest.3880BFE832E921CB.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one TFC crocodile on ground where retreat is possible."
		"Avoid deep water, keep the far bank visible, and recover without abandoning the field kit."
	]
	quest.3880BFE832E921CB.quest_subtitle: "A crocodile turns a familiar river crossing into terrain that must be read from the bank."
	quest.3880BFE832E921CB.title: "Crocodile River Crossing"
	quest.38A46C29E6B8C326.quest_desc: [
		"Shape a large clay vessel and fire it in a covered pit kiln."
		"Use it for durable bulk storage; unfired pottery is only a promise until the kiln survives the night."
	]
	quest.38A46C29E6B8C326.quest_subtitle: "Fired storage turns gathered food and ore into supplies you can protect."
	quest.38A46C29E6B8C326.title: "Fire a Large Storage Vessel"
	quest.38B253E7DD415551.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Stellaris rover through the live LV supply chain."
		"Carry repair blocks, oxygen, food, navigation, and a walking reserve; a vehicle is not a substitute for a return plan."
	]
	quest.38B253E7DD415551.quest_subtitle: "A rover extends the safe working radius only if its power and route home remain known."
	quest.38B253E7DD415551.title: "Rover Recovery Plan"
	quest.38C158FA58C71044.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four Infinity nuggets and four neutron ingots."
		"Protect them from general crafting and assign the reserve only to damaged convergence equipment or a documented rebuild."
	]
	quest.38C158FA58C71044.quest_subtitle: "Four Infinity nuggets and four neutron ingots keep final fabrication repairable without dismantling a finished artifact."
	quest.38C158FA58C71044.title: "Stock a Convergence Repair Set"
	quest.38DAC06BF649159C.quest_desc: [
		"Reproduce one Infinity nugget after commissioning the Universal Matter Fabricator."
		"Trace every consumed catalyst and singular input, then restore the line before scaling."
	]
	quest.38DAC06BF649159C.quest_subtitle: "A reproduced Infinity nugget proves the commissioned fabricator can close the convergence route again."
	quest.38DAC06BF649159C.title: "Reproduce an Infinity Nugget after Fabricator Commissioning"
	quest.3900F7C76B6102F8.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Eternal Starlight seeking eyes."
		"Carry one and keep one at the recovery base with route coordinates and replacement gear."
	]
	quest.3900F7C76B6102F8.quest_subtitle: "Two seeking eyes give navigation a spare when one route ends farther from home than expected."
	quest.3900F7C76B6102F8.title: "Astral Navigation Proof"
	quest.391356CCEE6C5B8A.quest_desc: ["Charge an Attuned Stone at a functioning Enchanted Altar.","This proves a real native ritual workflow instead of another possession token.","This is an optional discipline at this age; the canonical factory proofs govern normal progression."]
	quest.391356CCEE6C5B8A.quest_subtitle: "A charged stone is evidence that the laboratory can sustain useful rites."
	quest.391356CCEE6C5B8A.title: "Perform a Useful Rite"
	quest.39244DA3A33C848A.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Alchemistry combiner and complete a useful installed recipe."
		"Use known inputs from the dissolver route and prevent the branch from bypassing undiscovered progression materials."
	]
	quest.39244DA3A33C848A.quest_subtitle: "The combiner earns its bench by reconstructing a documented material from elements already produced."
	quest.39244DA3A33C848A.title: "Combiner Bench"
	quest.392B60A220C4B629.quest_desc: [
		"Build sedimentary stone knife and sedimentary stone axe."
		"Knap and haft the replacement stone heads as a field kit, keeping one unused head for the return trip."
	]
	quest.392B60A220C4B629.quest_subtitle: "Spare stone tools keep ordinary work from consuming the last daylight."
	quest.392B60A220C4B629.title: "Replaceable Stone Tool Kit"
	quest.395C953C30A53C29.quest_desc: [
		"Produce a fired jug and a fired large vessel from your current clay supply."
		"This branch checks the full pottery route, not items handed out by the book."
	]
	quest.395C953C30A53C29.quest_subtitle: "A jug and large vessel show the whole clay route can be repeated on demand."
	quest.395C953C30A53C29.title: "Clay to Fired Infrastructure"
	quest.398051EEB67E214A.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s Copper Age advancement through the intended metallurgy route."
		"Keep the known ore source, charcoal supply, molds, and hauling path intact; the ingot is only the visible proof."
	]
	quest.398051EEB67E214A.quest_subtitle: "Copper has become a replaceable tool material rather than a lucky first casting."
	quest.398051EEB67E214A.title: "Copper Age Established"
	quest.39888D8269DA0427.quest_desc: [
		"Complete 500 metres of swimming through genuine crossings or a prepared training course while carrying the pressure hardware."
		"Treat cold, air, and depth as environmental limits: keep the exit visible, descend in stages, and turn back before the measured route exceeds the hull or crew plan."
		"Ballast controls descent and ascent; the pressurizer and instruments do not grant unlimited depth or replace a clear recovery route."
	]
	quest.39888D8269DA0427.quest_subtitle: "A fathometer, rated hull, and ballast plan turn deep water from a blind swim into a measured engineering route."
	quest.39888D8269DA0427.title: "Cold Water Crossing"
	quest.39B3CF6E67F49D0C.quest_desc: ["Build the authored Insane Voltage consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.39B3CF6E67F49D0C.quest_subtitle: "The IV standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.39B3CF6E67F49D0C.title: "IV Consumer Proof"
	quest.39E6E46769DBE39D.quest_desc: ["Run beam packages through the Create sequenced line to finish two structural beams.","Finish beams on a Darmstadtium Greate Press or higher. Return monazite to the centrifuge for neodymium, fuse it with tin, and make the first Darmstadtium stock on the Naquadah tools. The existing cleanroom and Assembly Line supply UV crystal mainframes. Keep titanium, iridium, superconductors and the earlier electronics line feeding the beam packages."]
	quest.39E6E46769DBE39D.quest_subtitle: "Convert the packaged frame into flight-ready stellar structure."
	quest.39E6E46769DBE39D.title: "Dyson Structural Beams"
	quest.3A0C05506AFA7DD9.quest_desc: [
		"Demonstrate 100,000,000 FE of connected reserve dedicated to megaproject recovery."
		"Separate the recovery bus from production loads and test it with the main source open."
	]
	quest.3A0C05506AFA7DD9.quest_subtitle: "One hundred million stored FE lets controls and routing recover without asking a stalled megaproject to power itself."
	quest.3A0C05506AFA7DD9.title: "Reserve Project Recovery Power"
	quest.3A2264BC544654D7.quest_desc: ["Pack only an allowed empty test structure, unpack it once, verify blacklisted inventories remain denied, and test flight recovery."]
	quest.3A2264BC544654D7.quest_subtitle: "Final mobility rewards remain constrained by inventory and temporal safety."
	quest.3A2264BC544654D7.title: "Factory Packer and Creative Flight"
	quest.3A5FC21E18B47F33.quest_desc: ["Use the gem finder to survey Eternal Starlight deposits before scaling their extraction."]
	quest.3A5FC21E18B47F33.quest_subtitle: "Map the rare crystals of the Starlight frontier."
	quest.3A5FC21E18B47F33.title: "Starlight Gem Finder"
	quest.3A8DF225636E8786.quest_desc: [
		"Produce one AE2 engineering processor through the full manual inscriber sequence."
		"Keep the engineering and silicon presses accessible outside the network and preserve a manual redstone supply."
	]
	quest.3A8DF225636E8786.quest_subtitle: "The first engineering processor proves the complete printed-circuit sequence before network scaling."
	quest.3A8DF225636E8786.title: "Produce the First Engineering Processor"
	quest.3A9307368862BF6F.quest_desc: [
		"Knapp a stone axe, attach a stick, and fell a tree through TFC’s native logging mechanic."
		"Clear the fall path and retain at least eight logs for the first pit kiln."
	]
	quest.3A9307368862BF6F.quest_subtitle: "Logs supply fuel, charcoal, shelter, and the first pit kiln."
	quest.3A9307368862BF6F.title: "Fell the First Tree"
	quest.3ABCE5F82A286363.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one Stellaris alien and secure the immediate area."
		"Repair any breach, recheck oxygen and fuel equipment, and do not resume launch operations until the perimeter is clear."
	]
	quest.3ABCE5F82A286363.quest_subtitle: "An alien inside the work zone turns hull security into part of mission engineering."
	quest.3ABCE5F82A286363.title: "Alien Hull Breach"
	quest.3AE26018A1D09C5E.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the shield generator assigned to the primary containment reserve."
		"Verify its feed, buffer, access, and behavior after the normal electrical supply is opened."
	]
	quest.3AE26018A1D09C5E.quest_subtitle: "A protected shield feed keeps containment from vanishing with the ordinary factory bus."
	quest.3AE26018A1D09C5E.title: "Shield Reserve Feed"
	quest.3B082930B3B08F61.quest_desc: ["Stock eight Greate rubber belt connectors and sixteen wrought-iron ingots.","Store them at the interchange with tools and route-isolation markers; local machine belts and regional rail solve different transport jobs."]
	quest.3B082930B3B08F61.quest_subtitle: "Eight belt connectors and sixteen wrought-iron ingots keep transfers repairable without cannibalizing the route."
	quest.3B082930B3B08F61.title: "Stock Belt and Rail Repairs"
	quest.3B35B9234CB6A36F.quest_desc: [
		"Integrate a ground computer, monitor, radar receiver, preflight checklist, weather/environment observation where available, abort procedure, and retained recovery stock."
		"Complete one supervised mission and rejoin the Age 12 capstone."
	]
	quest.3B35B9234CB6A36F.quest_subtitle: "Required discipline mastery — contributes to the canonical age proof."
	quest.3B35B9234CB6A36F.title: "Mission Operations"
	quest.3B6F943E44931767.quest_desc: [
		"Run an established prime mover into the Electro Energetics generator clutch, then meter the protected output with a Power Gauge."
		"Observe battery charge, switching, overload response, and behavior when mechanical input or electrical demand changes."
	]
	quest.3B6F943E44931767.quest_subtitle: "A measured interface keeps the prime mover distinct while Electro Energetics owns generation and distribution architecture."
	quest.3B6F943E44931767.title: "Generator Interface Watch"
	quest.3B80A3C53444F973.quest_desc: [
		"Build an AE2 1k item storage cell and install it in a drive."
		"Test insertion and extraction, then avoid filling it with many tiny item types."
	]
	quest.3B80A3C53444F973.quest_subtitle: "A 1k storage cell teaches types, bytes, and the fact that digital storage still has a finite shape."
	quest.3B80A3C53444F973.title: "Storage Cell Basics"
	quest.3B8B93CEB040A794.quest_desc: [
		"Demonstrate one hundred million FE of connected reserve."
		"Keep controls, item routing, and fluid recovery on the protected bus, then test them with the main generating connection open."
	]
	quest.3B8B93CEB040A794.quest_subtitle: "A deadlock is recoverable only while the plant retains power that none of its own outputs must first create."
	quest.3B8B93CEB040A794.title: "Prove the Convergence Reserve"
	quest.3BC92151AAAEBAB3.quest_desc: ["Use an advanced item loader to prove carts, rail, pipes, airships, and gates meet at controlled freight-transfer points."]
	quest.3BC92151AAAEBAB3.quest_subtitle: "Discipline mastery — supporting branch; follow the chapter age proof for the main transition."
	quest.3BC92151AAAEBAB3.title: "Freight Logistics Mastered"
	quest.3BD8AAA53AF7205D.quest_desc: [
		"Place and run the steel compressor while the quest observes it."
		"Use a needed forming recipe and route its output away before loading the next batch."
	]
	quest.3BD8AAA53AF7205D.quest_subtitle: "The steel compressor makes dense plates and machine parts routine instead of ceremonial."
	quest.3BD8AAA53AF7205D.title: "Run the Steel Compressor"
	quest.3C0119E15CADA2FA.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four crystal-matrix ingots and two crystal-matrix blocks."
		"Replenish diamond lattice, platinum, nuclear alloy, atomic alloy, starcore, and catalyst inputs afterward."
	]
	quest.3C0119E15CADA2FA.quest_subtitle: "Four ingots and two matrix blocks prove the exotic and nuclear supply chains can meet more than once."
	quest.3C0119E15CADA2FA.title: "Repeat Crystal Matrix Production"
	quest.3C708E4E73306D79.quest_desc: ["Construct the Dyson ray receiver only after the quantum logistics reserve is complete."]
	quest.3C708E4E73306D79.quest_subtitle: "Receive the stellar output your launch network made possible."
	quest.3C708E4E73306D79.title: "Dyson Ray Receiver"
	quest.3CB9158B471E813E.quest_desc: [
		"Build sixteen Stellaris tier-one pipes used by this branch."
		"Label the carried fluid, provide isolation, and avoid joining incompatible products to one unlabeled main."
	]
	quest.3CB9158B471E813E.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen tier-one pipes provide a serviceable local run with enough spare length for rerouting."
	quest.3CB9158B471E813E.title: "Stock the Petrochemical Pipe Rack"
	quest.3CFC05A8BA10EE44.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen Create cogwheels."
		"Keep small gears for direction changes and reserve large gears for speed changes that the stress budget can support."
	]
	quest.3CFC05A8BA10EE44.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen cogwheels make a transmission rebuild possible without scavenging another machine."
	quest.3CFC05A8BA10EE44.title: "Fill the Cogwheel Rack"
	quest.3D09A6327BF6A676.quest_desc: [
		"Stock coal coke block and fireclay ball."
		"Follow the TFMG recipe in EMI and provide safe fluid storage before starting the machine."
	]
	quest.3D09A6327BF6A676.quest_subtitle: "Coke blocks and fireclay on the same pallet prepare heat and the structure that contains it."
	quest.3D09A6327BF6A676.title: "Coke Block Reserve"
	quest.3D43E5213326E101.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four Electro Energetics batteries and four wire connectors."
		"Arrange protection and isolation before joining batteries into a shared circuit."
	]
	quest.3D43E5213326E101.quest_subtitle: "Four batteries and four connectors make a modest bank whose fault current deserves its own enclosure."
	quest.3D43E5213326E101.title: "Conductors and Storage Shift Buffer"
	quest.3D60CBD5DAC37151.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four Rocketnautics titanium alloy and eight MI titanium ingots."
		"Replenish the vacuum and alloy lines after assigning any part to flight hardware."
	]
	quest.3D60CBD5DAC37151.quest_subtitle: "Four alloy pieces and eight ingots protect spacecraft work from consuming the pressure-repair reserve."
	quest.3D60CBD5DAC37151.title: "Buffer Titanium Aerospace Stock"
	quest.3D86B0A7989A8F2F.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the MI MV steam turbine and keep an advanced machine hull ready."
		"Reserve steam, cable, storage, maintenance access, and clean material routes before filling the floor with consumers."
	]
	quest.3D86B0A7989A8F2F.quest_subtitle: "An MV turbine beside an advanced hull makes generation and machine expansion part of the same plan."
	quest.3D86B0A7989A8F2F.title: "Lay Out the MV Floor"
	quest.3DAC55744EAAED81.quest_desc: [
		"Visit the Eternal Starlight dimension and return safely."
		"Leave the outpost supplied for another mission and bring home only cargo that does not displace the recovery kit."
	]
	quest.3DAC55744EAAED81.quest_subtitle: "Entering Starlight and returning with the route intact is stronger proof than arrival alone."
	quest.3DAC55744EAAED81.title: "Enter Starlight and Return"
	quest.3DDDBD64278F32D7.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s Bronze Age advancement with the intended primitive metallurgy."
		"Keep that material distinct from CBC bronze, which the pack uses as the certified bridge into MI machinery."
	]
	quest.3DDDBD64278F32D7.quest_subtitle: "Primitive bronze proves survival metallurgy; the foundry route proves factory bronze."
	quest.3DDDBD64278F32D7.title: "Enter the Bronze Tier"
	quest.3E1525CC9326D617.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a wool chestplate and thirty-two charcoal ready."
		"Dress before the trip, stage fuel at shelter, and turn back while water and visibility remain manageable."
	]
	quest.3E1525CC9326D617.quest_subtitle: "Warm clothing and dry fuel buy the time needed to retreat before weather becomes an emergency."
	quest.3E1525CC9326D617.title: "Prepare for Cold Exposure"
	quest.3E1FF7B9A87E4826.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one TFC direwolf during normal defense or a prepared hunt."
		"Do not draw the animal through livestock, storage, or the only safe doorway."
	]
	quest.3E1FF7B9A87E4826.quest_subtitle: "A direwolf at night tests whether the settlement has light, perimeter, and a route indoors."
	quest.3E1FF7B9A87E4826.title: "Direwolf Night Watch"
	quest.3E25D970EFCB6A8F.quest_desc: [
		"Build the bronze water pump from rotors, gear, plates, casing, pipes, and a bronze tank."
		"Connect it through buffered storage and verify the pump can keep pace before leaving the boiler unattended."
	]
	quest.3E25D970EFCB6A8F.quest_subtitle: "Automatic water feed turns boiler attention from constant carrying into monitored infrastructure."
	quest.3E25D970EFCB6A8F.title: "Add an Automatic Water Pump"
	quest.3E27886653053060.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one Stellaris pygro brute away from vulnerable cargo and machinery."
		"Use prepared cover and recheck the perimeter before resuming loading work."
	]
	quest.3E27886653053060.quest_subtitle: "A pygro brute is a perimeter threat that rewards distance, cover, and a route the freight crew can hold."
	quest.3E27886653053060.title: "Pygro Brute Breaker"
	quest.3E3054C45B8078A7.quest_desc: [
		"Install and inspect a Electro Energetics LV switch and fuse holder on an accessible distribution branch."
		"Use the switch to isolate a consumer before service; the test now checks real safety hardware instead of spare parts."
	]
	quest.3E3054C45B8078A7.quest_subtitle: "A switch and fuse holder let one failed branch go dark without silencing the entire plant."
	quest.3E3054C45B8078A7.title: "Install LV Isolation"
	quest.3E3266AF76DD3ED6.quest_desc: ["Stage the listed HV reserve for the stainless and digital factory; keep the batch outside automatic consumption so expansion does not erase repair stock."]
	quest.3E3266AF76DD3ED6.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.3E3266AF76DD3ED6.title: "HV Production Cell"
	quest.3E47A95F4DB0740A.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an Extended Industrialization large steam macerator."
		"Supply steam, bulk input, bounded output, and access for clearing a stopped line."
	]
	quest.3E47A95F4DB0740A.quest_subtitle: "The large steam macerator replaces repeated hand batches with a machine whose feed and output must keep moving."
	quest.3E47A95F4DB0740A.title: "Bronze Macerator Line"
	quest.3E7BCC4A50B3502A.quest_desc: [
		"Build two chemical infusers and hold eight HDPE sheets."
		"Assign gas pairs deliberately and isolate the machines before changing a recipe or attached tank."
	]
	quest.3E7BCC4A50B3502A.quest_subtitle: "Two infusers and a sheet batch let gas combinations change without clearing the only machine."
	quest.3E7BCC4A50B3502A.title: "Prepare a Second Chemistry Shift"
	quest.3E92AD8940B7C89D.quest_desc: ["Build the authored Extreme Voltage consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.3E92AD8940B7C89D.quest_subtitle: "The EV standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.3E92AD8940B7C89D.title: "EV Consumer Proof"
	quest.3E99264967FB729F.quest_desc: [
		"Build one Stellaris fuel module and stock eight finished desh ingots."
		"Keep seals, ordinary fasteners, and tools nearby, but reserve the desh for confirmed flight-hardware damage."
	]
	quest.3E99264967FB729F.quest_subtitle: "A spare fuel module and eight desh ingots cover a real repair without becoming a duplicate vehicle cache."
	quest.3E99264967FB729F.title: "Stock the Flight Repair Shelf"
	quest.3ECCBE14F9213837.quest_desc: [
		"Store four RCS thrusters and four MI mixed iridium ingots."
		"Keep them at the home launch base so a lost mission does not carry away its own recovery parts."
	]
	quest.3ECCBE14F9213837.quest_subtitle: "Four RCS thrusters and mixed iridium put control and contact repairs on the same shelf."
	quest.3ECCBE14F9213837.title: "Stock Guidance Repairs"
	quest.3EDAD3C9A686C7AF.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect another MI advanced machine hull in the expansion bay."
		"Connect generation and material buffers before assigning it to a machine rather than moving the original hull for the check."
	]
	quest.3EDAD3C9A686C7AF.quest_subtitle: "A second advanced hull proves the factory can reproduce its MV frame after the first line is occupied."
	quest.3EDAD3C9A686C7AF.title: "Commission a Second Advanced Hull"
	quest.3EF63F460CD85E45.quest_desc: ["Operate advanced and extended stationary systems within the shared blacklist; then test the portable wand on an allowed target."]
	quest.3EF63F460CD85E45.quest_subtitle: "Required discipline mastery — contributes to the canonical age proof."
	quest.3EF63F460CD85E45.title: "Reality Infrastructure Mastered"
	quest.3F20B9EFB67E80BD.quest_desc: ["Recover a failed route without teleportation or chunkloading."]
	quest.3F20B9EFB67E80BD.quest_subtitle: "A digital field site retains batteries, controls, endpoint records, and manual freight."
	quest.3F20B9EFB67E80BD.title: "Drone and Field-Site Recovery"
	quest.3F46C281C95CF4BD.quest_desc: ["Build a Create mechanical crafter and include it in a powered array after Precision Mechanisms research.","The bulk steam furnace controller is a visible five-by-three assembly: two ordinary bronze furnaces, the native bronze stock and refractory, plus Greate steel ventilation and extra fireproof bricks. The early bronze furnaces remain useful suppliers and small process cells.","Align the pattern, leave its empty positions clear, provide enough stress and collect the completed controller. Inspect the native furnace multiblock before supplying steam and feedstock."]
	quest.3F46C281C95CF4BD.quest_subtitle: "Mechanical crafters make a large recipe visible across a grid of moving parts and synchronized power."
	quest.3F46C281C95CF4BD.title: "Create Mechanical Line"
	quest.3F5BBCBCFE359F78.quest_desc: ["After Space Aluminum research, build the advanced item input hatch from the existing hull, pipe, motor, circuit and insulation lines plus a Greate aluminum gearbox.","Connect it to buffered supply and inspect the next waiting batch. Input and output hatches can be converted one-for-one when the plant layout changes. Build the hatches installed in the structure separately from the parts consumed by a controller assembly."]
	quest.3F5BBCBCFE359F78.quest_subtitle: "An advanced input hatch turns a batch into a quantity the multiblock can receive without hand feeding."
	quest.3F5BBCBCFE359F78.title: "Factory Batch Thinking"
	quest.3F5BC03DC2295AF8.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer sixteen thousand millibuckets of MI lubricant."
		"Route it to a bounded service tank and protect the reserve from ordinary fluid requests."
	]
	quest.3F5BC03DC2295AF8.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of lubricant turn maintenance supply into infrastructure instead of scattered containers."
	quest.3F5BC03DC2295AF8.title: "Megastructure Lubricant Main"
	quest.3F91EB9125AD8445.quest_desc: [
		"After the shutdown test, inspect the Mekanism fission logic adapter and carry a Mekanism dosimeter."
		"Begin from a cold, safe state; restore monitoring and coolant before fuel or output systems."
	]
	quest.3F91EB9125AD8445.quest_subtitle: "The logic adapter and dosimeter make restart conditional on both machine state and measured exposure."
	quest.3F91EB9125AD8445.title: "Practice a Cold Reactor Restart"
	quest.3FD8C0105928E723.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Philosopher's Stone from the established Age 9 chemical and precision route."
		"Demonstrate one permitted conversion of ordinary learned matter, compare its real production cost, and keep engineering components outside the exchange catalog."
	]
	quest.3FD8C0105928E723.quest_subtitle: "The Stone solves material mismatch only after chemistry has made transmutation accountable."
	quest.3FD8C0105928E723.title: "Philosopher's Stone Practicum"
	quest.3FDF27CBF403FFED.quest_desc: [
		"Find 12 small native copper."
		"Survey exposed matching rock for native-copper pieces, then narrow the vein with deliberate readings."
	]
	quest.3FDF27CBF403FFED.quest_subtitle: "Twelve surface samples justify a mapped copper route instead of another wandering search."
	quest.3FDF27CBF403FFED.title: "Native Copper Survey"
	quest.3FDFB82BD98A4BAC.quest_desc: ["Smelt and retain four copper ingots to prove the settlement’s food, water, shelter, pottery, charcoal, and first metal route can sustain the next age.", "Fire, ceramics and charcoal establish a survivable TFC settlement and first copper."]
	quest.3FDFB82BD98A4BAC.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 0 PROOF — Stone"
	quest.3FDFB82BD98A4BAC.title: "Stone Settlement Proven"
	quest.3FE945A52A72194C.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect Create track made with the live bulk recipe."
		"Survey curves and grades before committing scarce sheets and andesite alloy to a long route."
	]
	quest.3FE945A52A72194C.quest_subtitle: "The first track segment is useful only when it points toward a station, a load, and a return path."
	quest.3FE945A52A72194C.title: "Rail Yard Starter"
	quest.3FF743E4040C35FE.quest_desc: ["Produce the Encyclopedia Arcana through the existing ritual-chemistry recipe once its Chemical Age research is available.","The book teaches the spirit branch; its existing final convergence dependency remains, while earlier mainline ages remain independent."]
	quest.3FF743E4040C35FE.quest_subtitle: "Folk observation becomes formal spirit research."
	quest.3FF743E4040C35FE.title: "Spirit Research and Ritual Chemistry"
	quest.3FFD4B5CAFF374A4.quest_desc: [
		"Stock thirty-two MI steel plates and eight steel gears."
		"Record the minimum ingot and forming capacity needed to refill the yard after a major build."
	]
	quest.3FFD4B5CAFF374A4.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two plates and eight gears make structural growth independent from the next steel pour."
	quest.3FFD4B5CAFF374A4.title: "Steel Plate Stockyard"
	quest.40269A1545BEA1FB.quest_desc: [
		"Stage neutron accumulation, matrix metal, one Crystal Processor, one LuV Field Generator, and exactly two Star Fuel before catalyst production."
		"Infinity is not completed by gathering materials alone. Each Star Fuel consumes a whole-factory 9x9 load and proves research-gated 4096-EU/t precision assembly alongside superconducting, aerospace, nuclear, UU, Stargate, and control output."
	]
	quest.40269A1545BEA1FB.quest_subtitle: "Two Star Fuel carry the whole factory and its earned Greg manufacturing wing into final convergence."
	quest.40269A1545BEA1FB.title: "Stage Star Fuel and Precision Proof"
	quest.40273796085D55DA.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect a large electric macerator and stock thirty-two bronze plates."
		"Complete a useful batch, route all outputs, and restore the input reserve."
	]
	quest.40273796085D55DA.quest_subtitle: "The large electric macerator and thirty-two maintenance plates mark bulk processing that can survive ordinary wear."
	quest.40273796085D55DA.title: "Commission Mass Processing"
	quest.40717E38D7706861.quest_desc: ["Produce Uranite downstream of LEU-235, build the controller, route cooling/shielding, and connect through a protected grid interface."]
	quest.40717E38D7706861.quest_subtitle: "Oritech consumes Mekanism/CROWNS fuel and safety proof without becoming nuclear authority."
	quest.40717E38D7706861.title: "Experimental Reactor Support"
	quest.408FCBE8C6059DC5.quest_desc: ["Commission EE generation, metering, protection, a converter and a real MI load, with the LV turbine providing industrial steam power.","Tasks record equipment and delivered FE. Inspect wiring, fault trips, isolation and the cold restart separately."]
	quest.408FCBE8C6059DC5.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 6 PROOF — Low Voltage"
	quest.408FCBE8C6059DC5.title: "Low-Voltage Grid Proven"
	quest.40B9F21964564F18.quest_desc: ["Build an advanced machine hull to show aluminum reduction, MV power, distribution, motors, pumps, and infusion now support one maintainable production floor.", "MAT-03 unlocks the aluminum mechanical envelope. Retain the steel predecessor, supply the advanced motor/hull, and use the mixer for industrial batches; individual gears are supporting parts."]
	quest.40B9F21964564F18.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 8 PROOF — Advanced Electric"
	quest.40B9F21964564F18.title: "Advanced Electric Floor Proven"
	quest.40DF3B168E2E7674.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Mekanism chemical dissolution chamber and prepare its sulfuric-acid supply."
		"Use dedicated tanks and tubes for each slurry, and provide output capacity before exposing valuable ore to the process."
	]
	quest.40DF3B168E2E7674.quest_subtitle: "The dissolution chamber begins the slurry route where ore processing and aggressive chemistry become inseparable."
	quest.40DF3B168E2E7674.title: "Add a Dissolution Chamber"
	quest.40F4C53741584D48.quest_desc: ["Demonstrate repeatable production by staging eight beam packages and eight solar-sail packages."]
	quest.40F4C53741584D48.quest_subtitle: "A megastructure needs a production line, not a prototype."
	quest.40F4C53741584D48.title: "Dyson Package Production"
	quest.410B3170D752F441.quest_desc: ["Produce a real TFC copper batch from graded geology and retain both shaped metal and recovery stock."]
	quest.410B3170D752F441.quest_subtitle: "Discovery, extraction, shaping, and recovery begin as physical work."
	quest.410B3170D752F441.title: "Material Epoch I — Physical Metallurgy"
	quest.41272B79024518C6.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one Eternal Starlight Yeti."
		"Carry cold-weather support, choose ground with a visible exit, and avoid drawing the fight into the portal camp."
	]
	quest.41272B79024518C6.quest_subtitle: "Cold, terrain, and a territorial Yeti make retreat planning part of the encounter."
	quest.41272B79024518C6.title: "Cross the Yeti Cold Route"
	quest.413BAF736F4CC6C9.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and store eight MI platinum plates."
		"Keep aqua-regia separation and metal forming available to replace them."
	]
	quest.413BAF736F4CC6C9.quest_subtitle: "Eight platinum plates provide durable contacts for deep-space control without spending the last PGM batch."
	quest.413BAF736F4CC6C9.title: "Stock Platinum Contact Plate"
	quest.4149EA2F03FF155B.quest_desc: ["Make two Infinity Catalysts from replenished inputs; the second batch proves convergence is repeatable rather than a one-time inventory accident."]
	quest.4149EA2F03FF155B.quest_subtitle: "Required discipline mastery — contributes to the canonical age proof."
	quest.4149EA2F03FF155B.title: "Complete a Second Catalyst Batch"
	quest.41581E9BAEBECB0A.quest_desc: [
		"Restore 250,000 FE to a connected storage system during a cold restart."
		"Bring up generation, protection, distribution, and one verified load in order; the task records energy, not combat damage."
	]
	quest.41581E9BAEBECB0A.quest_subtitle: "A quarter-million FE available after isolation lets the MV floor restart controls before returning every process to service."
	quest.41581E9BAEBECB0A.title: "Advanced Electric Floor Cold Restart"
	quest.416C17169F652E52.quest_desc: [
		"Transfer 8,000 mB of MI cryofluid into the protected Infinity-feed buffer."
		"Supply the convergence line from its own dewar and leave the fusion restart reserve untouched."
	]
	quest.416C17169F652E52.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of cryofluid protect the superconducting route while the final works draw at full scale."
	quest.416C17169F652E52.title: "Cryogenic Infinity Feed"
	quest.4174C755B09212CA.quest_desc: [
		"Produce thirty-two MI bronze plates."
		"Use them where structure clarifies the district and retain access to the actual machines inside."
	]
	quest.4174C755B09212CA.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two bronze plates establish a passive casing batch large enough to reveal the cost of every decorative ring."
	quest.4174C755B09212CA.title: "Passive Casing Ring"
	quest.417D98259AB0DEB3.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 4,000 mB of MI deuterium."
		"Keep the tank cold, labeled, isolated, and outside routine reactor coolant plumbing."
	]
	quest.417D98259AB0DEB3.quest_subtitle: "Four buckets of deuterium are a cold fusion-preparation reserve, not permission to skip fission discipline."
	quest.417D98259AB0DEB3.title: "Deuterium Cold Reserve"
	quest.4191A385B80AC69C.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an AE2 pattern provider on a real workcell."
		"Queue a bounded craft, watch ingredient return and output delivery, then test a full destination."
	]
	quest.4191A385B80AC69C.quest_subtitle: "An unattended pattern provider is safe only when the attached machine cannot consume or block beyond its assigned order."
	quest.4191A385B80AC69C.title: "AE2 Factory Unattended Run"
	quest.41D24CF3072C15E7.quest_desc: [
		"Place a Farmer’s Delight cooking pot at the homestead."
		"Give it heat, serving containers, and nearby ingredient storage, then cook from food you gathered normally."
	]
	quest.41D24CF3072C15E7.quest_subtitle: "A cooking pot turns separate harvests into meals worth planning a pantry around."
	quest.41D24CF3072C15E7.title: "Cooking Station"
	quest.41D86FBA15EC20A9.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare a fired large vessel and a Tool Belt pouch."
		"Stage heavy stock at home and carry only the tools and route supplies needed for the trip."
	]
	quest.41D86FBA15EC20A9.quest_subtitle: "A fired vessel and small pouch make the first freight system: supplies sorted before anyone starts walking."
	quest.41D86FBA15EC20A9.title: "Inventory Is Tier Zero Logistics"
	quest.41F95A6E5A884B05.quest_desc: ["Collect eight finished TFMG steel mechanisms together before spending them on later builds. Each attempt starts with one heavy plate. On the same workpiece, apply a steel casing, fill with 250 mB TFMG lubrication oil, apply a nickel plate, apply a lead plate, then press at tier 1 or higher. Repeat this five-step loop three times while preserving the sequence marker. A complete attempt consumes three casings, three nickel plates, three lead plates and 750 mB oil, with nine deployments, three fillings and three pressings.","The completed attempt selects one result with weights 120 for a mechanism, 4 for a heavy plate and 2 for a steel ingot. The mechanism has a nominal 20-in-21 share; it is not guaranteed. Failed attempts still consume all deployed parts and oil. Returned plate or ingot does not refund them. Keep supplying attempts until eight mechanisms are collected; eight attempts are only enough if all eight succeed. The later batch recipe needs an existing mechanism as its retained catalyst and cannot create the first one.","The native heavy-plate sequence starts with one steel ingot and performs three ordinary pressing steps; its omitted loop count defaults to one. Greate presses accept these Create sequence steps, while the mechanism’s final step still requires tier 1. One independent 8 RPM, 8 SU source with three small-to-large cog reductions gives 1 RPM: the steel press and deployer together use 6 SU, leaving 2 SU spare under the andesite limit. Use a downward-facing deployer in USE mode and depots two blocks below the processors; move the marked workpiece between depots in order. All hardware and extra input stocks still need to be made.","Lead for eight successful attempts follows the graded galena line: 108 additional normal ores -> 216 crushed raw lead -> 216 guaranteed MI tiny dust -> 24 dust -> 24 smelted ingots -> 24 MI lead plates. Use the existing tier-0 paired crushing wheels, then wash on a depot one block ahead and one below an andesite fan; keep the air in front clear and choose rotation that blows toward the depot. Fill the fan’s internal tank with ordinary water and select circuit 0. Native washing spends 1 mB per item: 216 mB for this branch; a 1000 mB charge leaves 784 mB. At 8 RPM the fan loads 4 SU on its own 8 SU source. Supply the additional ore, fan parts, water, furnace fuel and 9600 mB compressor steam. Optional silver is extra; failed mechanism attempts require replacement parts and oil.","For this 24-plate batch, add 20 andesite alloy, two foundry lids, 32 oak lumber and one TFC tin ingot. Use the two spare full-oak-wood blocks from the detector batch for two casings; stripping is unnecessary. Make eight planks and eight shafts: the wheel, cog and fan consume four shafts, leaving four to install. Make the fan tin plate first in the bronze compressor. Borrow one of the two empty buckets, fill the fan with one ordinary water source and recover the bucket; keep both oil buckets untouched. Place one spare terminal chest and reserve 24 slots. Smelt one lead dust at a time in the existing empty furnace with four charcoal from the additional steel batch; collect and reload within 60 furnace ticks after each completion, or supply more fuel. From the compressor’s separate 400 mB reserve, spend 200 on tin, add 7600, compress 19 lead ingots, add 2000 and compress five more: 200 mB remains. The new 9600 mB steam needs at least 600 mB additional boiler water plus heating fuel; keep it separate from the fan water and other machines’ reserves. Hold all 24 lead plates. The earlier workshop inputs, boiler operation, nickel, oil and remaining forming hardware still need provisioning.","For nickel, hammer 96 additional normal garnierite ores, then use the existing TFC sluice, quern and sluice again to obtain 480 clean powders. Supply one new hammer, two handstones and a bellows. Make 24 fresh ingot molds from 60 clay balls; six kiln loads of four molds consume 48 logs and 48 straw. Let the fired pottery cool before pickup. Build an eight-charcoal forge pile with stone insulation on four sides and below; keep air and sky above. Put the bellows one block above and beside the forge, facing toward it. Plain charcoal reaches only 1350°C; bellows are required for nickel’s 1453°C melt. Use six groups of four molds in the forge’s mold output slots. Per group, supply 19 charcoal, warm for 1000 forge ticks, then heat sixteen five-powder loads for up to 1000 ticks each while pumping every 40 game ticks. Stop fueling and pumping, leave the four full molds in the unheated output slots for 4000 player ticks, then collect them below 300°C; TFCHotOrNot can eject hotter items. Reserve 119 fuel charcoal plus eight for construction; the selected schedule burns 114 fuel items and leaves five spares, with more needed for delays. Assume every mold breaks after extraction. Use the second spare terminal chest and keep the 24 lead plates untouched. Compress the 24 nickel ingots with 9600 mB of new steam: add 7600 to the old 200 reserve, run 19 jobs, add 2000 and run five; 200 remains. Supply at least 600 mB of additional boiler water and heating fuel. Oil and the remaining forming equipment are still required. For the corrected earlier tool budget, this nickel batch uses 36 of the old hammer’s 37 uses, 59 on its new 60-use hammer and one on the steel workshop’s retained 25-use fourth hammer. They retain 1/1/24 uses; the other three one-use steel hammers remain untouched.","For an additional 6000 mB oil, reuse the separate earlier oil station and its 17 pipes. Preserve the two filled oil buckets and two empty buckets. Supply 24 new oak logs and 12 redstone: the Railcraft coke oven makes 6000 mB creosote and 24 charcoal; collect each charcoal output and hold it unallocated. Twelve bronze-mixer jobs consume the creosote and make 6000 mB MI lubricant. Spend the oil circuit’s old 1200 mB steam once on the first six jobs, then supply 1200 mB new steam for the other six. The new steam needs at least 75 mB additional boiler water plus heating fuel and actual delivery. Preserve the separate compressor 200, macerator 2800 and textile mixer 1800 mB reserves, and all reserved steel, planks, shafts and plates.","Clear the old depot and close the tank-to-spout line during production. Keep basin extraction closed while feeding only two mixer jobs per batch. Wait until their full 1000 mB lubricant reaches basin input and the mixer output and feed pipes are empty. Run the existing ambient bridge once; only after basin input is empty, extract the TFMG oil and drain both output pipes completely into the 8 L tank. Repeat six times, holding all 6000 mB in the tank with process pipes and spout empty. Reopening the two-pipe spout line can leave oil in the pipes; count tank, pipes and spout together. Twenty-four matching 250 mB mechanism fillings can then consume the 6000 mB, conditional on the remaining hardware and marked workpieces. Eight successful attempts, extra stocks for failures and the earlier aggregate workshop supply still need qualification.","For the steel press, use the separately reserved 37 TFC steel ingots, 25 hardened planks and two steel shafts. After Precision Mechanisms and Steel Mechanisms research, keep the early andesite press working long enough to make four canonical steel plates and eight heavy plates; the heavy plates need 24 pressing steps in total. One more steel ingot and one hardened plank make the press casing. Add four new andesite alloy, one foundry lid and eight lumber: make two planks, one eight-shaft batch and two new small andesite cogs. With the one shaft spare left after the wrench, seven andesite shafts remain. Upgrade these two new cogs using the two reserved STEEL shafts and two of the four plates. The two remaining plates, casing, earlier andesite press and one successful precision mechanism craft the steel press. This leaves 24 steel ingots and 24 hardened planks for the remaining mechanism casings; the eight heavy plates are held separately. Preserve the sixteen objective ingots, lead, nickel and oil reserves.","Prepare and collect all pressed parts before dismantling the early press. A failed precision attempt supplies no precision mechanism: retain the early press and prepared construction parts, and fund another attempt. The wrench used the three spare gold ingots; after collecting any byproduct, replenish each missing gold sheet, cog and nugget for the next attempt. Keep the three installed drive cogs and the attempt cogs separate from these two new press cogs. Before spending one precision mechanism on the press, hold eight finished mechanisms together for the earlier precision objective. Only after collecting a finished precision mechanism, clear the workstation, recover the empty andesite press with the retained wrench and craft its steel replacement. Install it at the same X-axis position in the forming layout: press plus downward USE deployer use 6 SU at 1 RPM. Eight later steel-mechanism attempts still require eight successful rolls; failures need additional parts and oil.","After the eight-precision objective and the steel-press craft, turn the remaining 24 reserved steel ingots and 24 hardened planks into 24 steel casings. Together with eight heavy plates, 24 nickel plates, 24 lead plates and the separate 6000 mB oil reserve, these supply eight complete attempts: 72 deployments, 24 fillings and 24 tier-1 pressings. Count oil across the tank, pipes and spout; the same 6000 mB redistributes through the existing circuit and is spent by twenty-four 250 mB fillings. If all eight rolls succeed, hold the eight finished mechanisms together for this non-consuming objective before later builds. One failed roll leaves only seven after these eight attempts. A returned heavy plate can start another attempt; a returned steel ingot first needs the native three-press heavy-plate sequence. Neither refunds deployed parts or oil. A ninth attempt still needs three more casings, three nickel plates, three lead plates and 750 mB oil, which require additional supplies. Preserve the sixteen separate TFMG objective ingots and the other workshop reserves."]
	quest.41F95A6E5A884B05.quest_subtitle: "Eight mechanisms prove the lubricated sequenced-assembly line can support more than one machine."
	quest.41F95A6E5A884B05.title: "Crate Steel Mechanisms for Expansion"
	quest.41F9C6DA45533FA3.quest_desc: ["Commission the chemical washer as proof that gases, acids, polymers, slurries, occult reagents, and containment can share a disciplined laboratory.", "Keep the petroleum district supplying the chemical plant: lubricant and polymers feed motors and electronics; controlled reagents supply titanium and the nuclear fuel cycle."]
	quest.41F9C6DA45533FA3.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 9 PROOF — Chemical and Arcane Chemistry"
	quest.41F9C6DA45533FA3.title: "Chemical Laboratory Proven"
	quest.420635CAA0586410.quest_desc: [
		"Use a stone knife to break grass or another plant-like block until you collect straw."
		"Four straw make one permeable thatch block, and one thatch block can be crafted back into four straw."
	]
	quest.420635CAA0586410.quest_subtitle: "Straw is the first shelter, kindling, and pottery-firing material."
	quest.420635CAA0586410.title: "Harvest Straw with a Knife"
	quest.42181B18A078F951.quest_desc: [
		"Reach a Stellaris Mercury Fire Land biome."
		"Carry redundant protection, navigation, and return fuel, and keep cargo from displacing emergency supplies."
	]
	quest.42181B18A078F951.quest_subtitle: "Mercury fire land leaves almost no margin between exploration, heat exposure, and the route back to the vehicle."
	quest.42181B18A078F951.title: "Mercury Fire Land Claim"
	quest.4226AA7820EB34D5.quest_desc: [
		"Build 32 ladder."
		"Reserve enough ladders to reopen a second exit after a cave-in without dismantling the working access route."
	]
	quest.4226AA7820EB34D5.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two ladders are an exit plan waiting on the shelf instead of inside a cave-in."
	quest.4226AA7820EB34D5.title: "Stock Ladders for a Cave-In"
	quest.42323F7E3D4245AA.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight bronze rings using an installed MI forming route."
		"Keep them with pump and pipe spares where water loss cannot block access to the repair shelf."
	]
	quest.42323F7E3D4245AA.quest_subtitle: "Eight bronze rings turn a leaking feed line into a repair instead of a shutdown crisis."
	quest.42323F7E3D4245AA.title: "Stage Pump Seals"
	quest.4260E2DE21783527.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Assembly Line controller with four authored casings and four gratings after research infrastructure is operational."
		"The Assembly Line is the final 4096-EU/t production institution: its recipes consume products from MI, AE2, Electro Energetics, nuclear, Starlight, Superconductors, and Stargate production."
	]
	quest.4260E2DE21783527.quest_subtitle: "Research-gated LuV assembly is the final manufacturing method, not an optional side route."
	quest.4260E2DE21783527.title: "Assembly Line"
	quest.428B1174FE95E4BA.quest_desc: [
		"After Advanced Electric opens, build a Electro Energetics battery and Generator Clutch."
		"Connect an established mechanical prime mover through visible generation, metering, switching, and protection infrastructure."
	]
	quest.428B1174FE95E4BA.quest_subtitle: "Electro Energetics owns routine generators; established prime movers enter through a visible electrical interface."
	quest.428B1174FE95E4BA.title: "Commission a Generator Interface"
	quest.428CDDD722FE3A29.quest_desc: [
		"Have a fired large vessel and a fired ingot mold ready together."
		"This does not produce copper; it proves the pottery side of the first casting route is prepared."
	]
	quest.428CDDD722FE3A29.quest_subtitle: "Storage and an ingot mold make the first metal attempt recoverable."
	quest.428CDDD722FE3A29.title: "Pottery Ready for Copper"
	quest.42CF86E177E62652.quest_desc: [
		"Build eight blank AE2 patterns for the offline recovery vault."
		"Encode recovery-critical recipes first and keep a written list outside the network."
	]
	quest.42CF86E177E62652.quest_subtitle: "Eight blank patterns form an offline vault that can rebuild essential crafts after the network is restored."
	quest.42CF86E177E62652.title: "Offline Pattern Vault"
	quest.42D28CFB07C5D125.quest_desc: [
		"Fire another ceramic jug for travel beyond the first camp."
		"Stage it with food and a marked return route before extending a mine or prospecting circuit."
	]
	quest.42D28CFB07C5D125.quest_subtitle: "A second filled jug turns a risky detour into planned travel."
	quest.42D28CFB07C5D125.title: "Extend the Water Route"
	quest.42EE9DF885DA5F3D.quest_desc: [
		"Cook 8 cooked chicken."
		"Cook the emergency food before packing it and include more than one food group for delayed travel."
	]
	quest.42EE9DF885DA5F3D.quest_subtitle: "Eight cooked portions are a journey’s buffer, not permanent food security."
	quest.42EE9DF885DA5F3D.title: "Pack Emergency Food"
	quest.43101E11DE8DF64D.quest_desc: ["Stage the listed LUV reserve for the neutron and Starlight works; keep the batch outside automatic consumption so expansion does not erase repair stock."]
	quest.43101E11DE8DF64D.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.43101E11DE8DF64D.title: "LUV Production Cell"
	quest.433256F1CB8907BC.quest_desc: ["This is a mature LV/MV component standard: its silicone and control suppliers follow Chemical Industry. Machine voltage labels do not make it a pre-space bootstrap requirement."]
	quest.433256F1CB8907BC.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.433256F1CB8907BC.title: "MV Recovery Proof"
	quest.4353BD7BCDC95B4E.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen MI copper wire and convert eight of it into Electro Energetics insulated wire."
		"Reserve bare conductor for coils and components; route insulated wire where the built grid must cross occupied space."
	]
	quest.4353BD7BCDC95B4E.quest_subtitle: "Bare and insulated copper together establish the two forms every physical distribution run needs."
	quest.4353BD7BCDC95B4E.title: "Copper Wire Harness"
	quest.43860A50366C0686.quest_desc: ["Place an Energy Condenser MK1 as a physical endpoint on a real factory network and assign it one ordinary, already-learned bulk input.","Feed it with sacrificed industrial surplus under measured CC:Tweaked supervision. It may correct shortages; it may not output machines, proof items, fuels, singularities, Stargate parts, or Infinity materials.","Mature encoded transmutation begins in Age 13 under MTR-03. Only explicitly reviewed ordinary matter has EMC; strategic feedstock, machinery and unreviewed forms remain zero."]
	quest.43860A50366C0686.quest_subtitle: "The condenser belongs at the end of a working supply line, not in place of one."
	quest.43860A50366C0686.title: "Condenser-Supplied Factory Input"
	quest.43B718A034CF42A5.quest_desc: [
		"Run an MI Distillery recipe to completion after checking the exact feed, voltage, and product in EMI."
		"Give the selected output a dedicated destination before starting; the single-block Distillery produces one chosen fraction."
	]
	quest.43B718A034CF42A5.quest_subtitle: "The advancement records an LV Distillery completing a real process."
	quest.43B718A034CF42A5.title: "Commission the Distillery"
	quest.43BBCCBA296E7F07.quest_desc: [
		"Place an Extreme Crafting Table and stock four crystal-matrix ingots."
		"Leave space for audited inputs, quarantine storage, and visible output before routing the first automated order."
	]
	quest.43BBCCBA296E7F07.quest_subtitle: "An extreme crafting table and four matrix ingots define a hall built around provenance, not a clipboard."
	quest.43BBCCBA296E7F07.title: "Lay Out the Convergence Hall"
	quest.43CFAC01785FB9BF.quest_desc: ["Commission the large diesel generator only after storage, conductors, grounding, protection, and black-start procedures make its output accountable."]
	quest.43CFAC01785FB9BF.quest_subtitle: "Required discipline mastery — contributes to the canonical age proof."
	quest.43CFAC01785FB9BF.title: "Power Distribution Mastered"
	quest.440239E49DD1C5DB.quest_desc: ["Scram, isolate, inspect with independent meters, replace damaged controls, and prove cold restart."]
	quest.440239E49DD1C5DB.quest_subtitle: "Radiation, heat, and electrical failure remain separate recovery problems."
	quest.440239E49DD1C5DB.title: "Experimental Reactor Scram and Recovery"
	quest.4410F206DA2357AB.quest_desc: ["Complete the first catalyst from UXV, then retain the physical stock needed to restart the factory."]
	quest.4410F206DA2357AB.quest_subtitle: "Required discipline mastery — contributes to the canonical age proof."
	quest.4410F206DA2357AB.title: "Material Epoch VIII — Non-Circular Matter Engineering"
	quest.443A711F1C47F019.quest_desc: [
		"Complete MI’s stainless-steel-ingot advancement through the live production route."
		"Keep the alloy and heat process renewable rather than treating one ingot as the end of the material line."
	]
	quest.443A711F1C47F019.quest_subtitle: "The stainless advancement records a clean alloy line that can now support every digital enclosure around it."
	quest.443A711F1C47F019.title: "Stainless Threshold"
	quest.443C6880E0E4D452.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger MI’s Large Steam Turbine advancement through real operation."
		"Verify water replacement, steam feed, storage, exhaust policy, and electrical output remain stable through a sustained interval."
	]
	quest.443C6880E0E4D452.quest_subtitle: "A completed operating cycle proves the controller is connected to a sustainable plant."
	quest.443C6880E0E4D452.title: "Prove Large Steam Generation"
	quest.444586D2ECF70FCB.quest_desc: [
		"Build one Cargo Boats motorboat and one Astikor Carts oak seed drill."
		"Supply both from current wood, metal, and mechanical production rather than claimed components."
	]
	quest.444586D2ECF70FCB.quest_subtitle: "A motorboat and seed drill connect bulk transport to work that actually consumes the delivery."
	quest.444586D2ECF70FCB.title: "Build Field Freight from Stock"
	quest.449BECC83295F832.quest_desc: [
		"Build the retained ExtendedAE drive, interface, and pattern-provider specialists after the base AE2 factory is proven."
		"Each block solves a capacity or interface problem; none replaces AE2 channels, processors, or network power."
	]
	quest.449BECC83295F832.quest_subtitle: "ExtendedAE begins as a titanium-qualified extension of a working AE2 factory."
	quest.449BECC83295F832.title: "ExtendedAE — Specialist Capacity"
	quest.45191B308E69316A.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Stellaris rocket station and return eight raw desh ingots through MI maceration."
		"The controlled reward celebrates the route; Advanced Electric still requires real planetary processing and power infrastructure."
	]
	quest.45191B308E69316A.quest_subtitle: "A station backed by returned raw desh marks the first complete exchange between factory and Moon."
	quest.45191B308E69316A.title: "Commission the Orbital Route"
	quest.455B78A66D896CC7.quest_desc: ["Route a working kiln or furnace through a brick chimney and verify its outlet is unobstructed."]
	quest.455B78A66D896CC7.quest_subtitle: "Early heat is visible, local, and personally hazardous."
	quest.455B78A66D896CC7.title: "Local Smoke and Draft"
	quest.4576968D6C0E5F17.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement IV motors, pumps, robot arms, sensors, emitters, and field generators for reactor control and turbine operations, then verify the EV line still operates."]
	quest.4576968D6C0E5F17.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.4576968D6C0E5F17.title: "IV Recovery Proof"
	quest.459D569656BBDD64.quest_desc: [
		"Build four MI advanced motors and sixteen aluminum wires."
		"Store them together only after the wire route and motor inputs can be replenished from current production."
	]
	quest.459D569656BBDD64.quest_subtitle: "Four advanced motors and sixteen aluminum wires make a traceable electromechanical rack for the next grid expansion."
	quest.459D569656BBDD64.title: "Advanced Motor Rack"
	quest.45A0E9B35836528D.quest_desc: ["Assemble the Infinity Totem from fully traceable materials; it is the final proof that every impossible input can be reproduced through the established systems.", "Full completion deliberately converges ESO-04 Occult Synthesis through FRN-06 Reality Engineering, alongside stellar power, matter systems and a recoverable production chain. Arcane study is a branch for most of the campaign and becomes required here. Optional weapon, blade and trophy achievements remain optional."]
	quest.45A0E9B35836528D.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 16 PROOF — Infinity and Final Ascension"
	quest.45A0E9B35836528D.title: "Infinity Systems Mastered"
	quest.45CED160C5AAD7E9.quest_desc: [
		"At Tier 15, inspect the Classic Stargate assigned to the interplanetary logistics nexus."
		"Commission address control, power, cargo buffering, and recovery before scheduling freight."
	]
	quest.45CED160C5AAD7E9.quest_subtitle: "The commissioned gate gains a DHD, quantum-network link, supervised routing, quarantine, and an independent return plan—without asking for a duplicate gate."
	quest.45CED160C5AAD7E9.title: "Interplanetary Logistics Nexus"
	quest.45F2EED8520DC677.quest_desc: [
		"Build four AE2 drives and stock sixteen MI stainless-steel plates."
		"Install only the bays the network can power and service; keep bulk stone, ore, logs, and fluids in suitable physical systems."
	]
	quest.45F2EED8520DC677.quest_subtitle: "Four drives and sixteen stainless plates make a useful storage expansion without turning hardware into a stockpile grind."
	quest.45F2EED8520DC677.title: "Drive Bay Batch"
	quest.46338255C3AFC8B8.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen MI copper wires and sixteen Electro Energetics wires."
		"Keep the authorities separate: MI wire belongs inside its industrial ladder; Electro Energetics owns visible distribution."
	]
	quest.46338255C3AFC8B8.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen MI copper wires and sixteen grid conductors let both machine internals and visible distribution be repaired honestly."
	quest.46338255C3AFC8B8.title: "Stage a Conductor Blackout Kit"
	quest.465FBE95E0BE7F38.quest_desc: [
		"Locate a Stellaris Meteor structure and return safely."
		"Secure the area, inspect before mining, and leave enough propulsion and storage margin for recovered mass."
	]
	quest.465FBE95E0BE7F38.quest_subtitle: "A meteor is salvage only after approach hazards, cargo mass, and the route back are under control."
	quest.465FBE95E0BE7F38.title: "Meteor Salvage Claim"
	quest.4661E86013D4C432.quest_desc: [
		"Build an oak hand cart and a Cargo Boats motorboat after opening the dock route."
		"Move real cargo over each mode and identify the transfer point between them."
	]
	quest.4661E86013D4C432.quest_subtitle: "A hand cart and motorboat give one shipment a useful alternative when road or water is blocked."
	quest.4661E86013D4C432.title: "Prove Two Freight Modes"
	quest.468DC34B071A3DDC.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the electric compressor and stock sixteen bronze plates."
		"Run a useful forming batch and clear outputs without hand moving every intermediate."
	]
	quest.468DC34B071A3DDC.quest_subtitle: "A working electric compressor and sixteen plates prove the forming cell can operate and maintain itself."
	quest.468DC34B071A3DDC.title: "Run the Compressor Shift"
	quest.469CFA1185CB3E29.quest_desc: [
		"Produce 16,000 mB of Stellaris fuel from current TFMG kerosene, gasoline, or diesel."
		"Move it through the live mixing bridge into launch storage without relying on loose buckets or quest rewards."
	]
	quest.469CFA1185CB3E29.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets made again from refinery feed close the launch complex supply loop."
	quest.469CFA1185CB3E29.title: "Refill Launch Fuel from TFMG Feed"
	quest.46C327B4CF07B725.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger MI’s replicator advancement with the completed machine."
		"Keep its UU Matter draw metered so convenience cannot silently consume the reserve for required Quantum equipment."
	]
	quest.46C327B4CF07B725.quest_subtitle: "A replicator is useful only after UU Matter has become a budgeted factory resource."
	quest.46C327B4CF07B725.title: "Replicator Mouth"
	quest.46F7529D4A6574CB.quest_desc: ["Stock thirty-two Create tracks and sixteen wrought-iron ingots.","Keep them at the yard where a maintenance cart can reach either end of the line.","For wrought iron, hammer normal hematite into rocky chunks, sluice them into chunks, quern those into dirty dust, then sluice again for clean hematite powder. Feed the upper sluice inlet with the shallow flow seven horizontal steps from a fresh-water source; keep the lower outlet clear.","Four normal ores give twenty clean powders. Craft five pellets, turn four into one briquet, and charge the formed bloomery with that briquet, the spare pellet and one stack of two charcoal. Ignite, close and wait for the bloom. This batch supplies one ingot; repeat sixteen times for this stock.","Build a bronze anvil before forging the bronze sheets for the bloomery. On that anvil, hammer the hot raw bloom into a refined bloom, then into wrought iron. Keep the chamber insulated and the blooms hot enough to work."]
	quest.46F7529D4A6574CB.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two tracks and sixteen wrought-iron ingots cover a modest extension plus ordinary repair loss."
	quest.46F7529D4A6574CB.title: "Buffer Track and Iron"
	quest.4706501CE5F475DF.quest_desc: [
		"Hold 16,000 mB of TFMG diesel in the commissioned tank-farm branch."
		"Provide separated storage, shutoff, fire protection, and a measured dispatch line."
	]
	quest.4706501CE5F475DF.quest_subtitle: "A sixteen-bucket diesel batch belongs in a labeled tank farm, not as a bucket placed for an impossible block observation."
	quest.4706501CE5F475DF.title: "Diesel Tank Farm"
	quest.470BF65C633E1E8C.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen Mekanism substrate and sixteen HDPE sheets."
		"Balance intermediate storage so sheet production cannot consume every substrate needed for later recipes."
	]
	quest.470BF65C633E1E8C.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen substrate and sheets show the polymer chain can sustain both feedstock and finished construction stock."
	quest.470BF65C633E1E8C.title: "Substrate Batch"
	quest.4732F1A4B2DFC17C.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Cargo Boats dock."
		"Provide dry storage, a safe approach, and enough room to unload without blocking departure."
	]
	quest.4732F1A4B2DFC17C.quest_subtitle: "A dock gives river freight a fixed transfer point instead of an improvised landing every trip."
	quest.4732F1A4B2DFC17C.title: "Cargo Boat Dock"
	quest.477DE948B749CE2E.quest_desc: [
		"Locate a Stellaris Mars Temple and return safely."
		"Mark the vehicle, preserve oxygen and return fuel, and clear an escape route before searching deeper."
	]
	quest.477DE948B749CE2E.quest_subtitle: "The Mars temple turns a cargo expedition into reconnaissance with uncertain exits and hostile ground."
	quest.477DE948B749CE2E.title: "Mars Temple Recon"
	quest.4796EB630BDEDD27.quest_desc: ["This is a mature LV/MV component standard: its silicone and control suppliers follow Chemical Industry. Machine voltage labels do not make it a pre-space bootstrap requirement."]
	quest.4796EB630BDEDD27.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.4796EB630BDEDD27.title: "MV Production Cell"
	quest.479F3961D01126A2.quest_desc: [
		"Build one MI advanced motor and demonstrate 250,000 FE of connected storage."
		"Run a useful MV load during the check and confirm the motor batch does not empty aluminum or magnetic-alloy buffers."
	]
	quest.479F3961D01126A2.quest_subtitle: "An advanced motor built while 250,000 FE remains available proves fabrication and reserve can coexist under load."
	quest.479F3961D01126A2.title: "Advanced Motor Load"
	quest.47DB1F84DBC6CFD6.quest_desc: [
		"Stock two titanium casings and two MI iridium ingots."
		"Keep PGM chemistry and titanium forming active after the batch is assigned."
	]
	quest.47DB1F84DBC6CFD6.quest_subtitle: "Two casings and iridium ingots connect return cargo processing to replaceable spacecraft structure."
	quest.47DB1F84DBC6CFD6.title: "Buffer Casings and Iridium"
	quest.480E915B9E2D9D6C.quest_desc: [
		"After waste and reprocessing open, produce and transfer 2,000 mB of MI tritium."
		"The installed centrifuge trial yields 250 mB per batch from deuterium, uranium-238, plutonium, and catalyst media."
	]
	quest.480E915B9E2D9D6C.quest_subtitle: "Two buckets of tritium represent eight breeding trials and deserve a dedicated, audited buffer."
	quest.480E915B9E2D9D6C.title: "Tritium Lockbox"
	quest.481EF4F8B031E0FA.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Mekanism dosimeter and a Mekanism Geiger counter."
		"Carry independent meters before entering fuel, reactor, waste, or reprocessing areas and stage replacements outside."
	]
	quest.481EF4F8B031E0FA.quest_subtitle: "A dosimeter and Geiger counter should disagree rarely; carrying both makes a failed instrument visible."
	quest.481EF4F8B031E0FA.title: "Carry Independent Radiation Meters"
	quest.4823A50A7A6B2AD6.quest_desc: [
		"After Stargate Reconstruction research, infuse a Crystal Base with a Dimensional Matrix, Archeologist Notebook, Starcore and Quantum Link using Malum spirits to make the first Variant Crystal."
		"Keep one crystal as the reusable template for industrial batches of four; the assembler still consumes its normal materials, energy and UU-Matter."
	]
	quest.4823A50A7A6B2AD6.quest_subtitle: "Every route must prove both discovery research and native dimensional mastery."
	quest.4823A50A7A6B2AD6.title: "Age 15 — Perfected Dimensional Research"
	quest.4836B24A128CD260.quest_desc: [
		"Build a TFMG steel distillation controller and sixteen cured natural-rubber sheets."
		"Commission crude feed, every product outlet, overflow response, fire separation, and maintenance stock."
	]
	quest.4836B24A128CD260.quest_subtitle: "A steel distillation controller and sixteen rubber sheets establish separation, storage, and maintainable seals."
	quest.4836B24A128CD260.title: "Commission the Oil Industry"
	quest.484FD164C287954C.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s metal-anvil advancement with the copper anvil route."
		"Arrange forge, flux, tools, and cooling space together so hot work does not cross ordinary storage."
	]
	quest.484FD164C287954C.quest_subtitle: "A metal anvil makes the settlement capable of plans that casting alone cannot finish."
	quest.484FD164C287954C.title: "First Anvil Proof"
	quest.48BC476A8330C289.quest_desc: ["Commission the rocket station only after launch, survival, cargo, return, and recovery steps can be repeated as one route.", "Steel, freight, petroleum and electricity launch an expedition that returns useful cargo to Terra."]
	quest.48BC476A8330C289.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 7 PROOF — First Space"
	quest.48BC476A8330C289.title: "Launch Complex Proven"
	quest.48C597FF52069314.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Mekanism’s basic-control-circuit advancement through the live infuser route."
		"Keep redstone infusion stock separated from later enrichment materials so the next batch starts cleanly."
	]
	quest.48C597FF52069314.quest_subtitle: "The control-circuit advancement confirms redstone infusion is now an operating production step."
	quest.48C597FF52069314.title: "Control Circuit Mark"
	quest.48D6B9E825B938DD.quest_desc: ["Build the authored Ultra Extreme Voltage consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.48D6B9E825B938DD.quest_subtitle: "The UXV standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.48D6B9E825B938DD.title: "UXV Consumer Proof"
	quest.493FC9A9C805A96A.quest_desc: [
		"Build an MI Quantum circuit board."
		"Keep its clean-room inputs and high-tier parts traceable; this board is a component, not a reward shortcut."
	]
	quest.493FC9A9C805A96A.quest_subtitle: "The Quantum circuit board is the final proof that ignition control can be reproduced, not merely repaired."
	quest.493FC9A9C805A96A.title: "Fusion Ignition Proof"
	quest.495374F0D381C033.quest_desc: [
		"Build unfired jug."
		"Shape clay in the knapping interface. Fire the result in a covered pit kiln before trying to use it."
	]
	quest.495374F0D381C033.quest_subtitle: "Wet clay holds the idea of a jug; firing decides whether it can hold water."
	quest.495374F0D381C033.title: "Shape a Water Jug"
	quest.4987FD2C8412115E.quest_desc: [
		"Let the barrel statistic accumulate while handling real grid supplies."
		"Separate fuels, acids, lubricants, and ordinary parts so a rushed restart cannot select the wrong stock."
	]
	quest.4987FD2C8412115E.quest_subtitle: "Fifty barrel openings record fuel and maintenance stores that the grid yard actually uses."
	quest.4987FD2C8412115E.title: "Barrel Ledger"
	quest.4989AB604DFE5BB8.quest_desc: [
		"Hold a foundry-batched brass ingot and a completed precision mechanism together."
		"The decorative reward marks the working branch; Bronze Steam still requires its own casings, tanks, and boiler."
	]
	quest.4989AB604DFE5BB8.quest_subtitle: "Brass and a precision mechanism prove the foundry can make controlled machinery."
	quest.4989AB604DFE5BB8.title: "Kinetic Foundry Online"
	quest.49B7D2652BAD0ADC.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the fuel refinery and keep a Stellaris big oxygen tank ready."
		"Restart the refinery on an isolated power branch, verify the oxygen reserve, then reconnect station and pad loads."
	]
	quest.49B7D2652BAD0ADC.quest_subtitle: "After a blackout, fuel processing and stored oxygen return before anyone approaches the rocket."
	quest.49B7D2652BAD0ADC.title: "Restore Fuel and Life Support"
	quest.49E216A9E87A2295.quest_desc: [
		"Complete the Stellaris rocket-station advancement by building the current station."
		"Connect cable, pad access, cargo, and recovery routes so the station has a real operating context."
	]
	quest.49E216A9E87A2295.quest_subtitle: "The station advancement confirms that launch control now survives outside the workshop floor."
	quest.49E216A9E87A2295.title: "Station Cold Wake"
	quest.4A281F81BE31D3B6.quest_desc: ["Fire jars through TFC heat and construct the Witch Oven, Kettle, Distillery, and Spinning Wheel.","These machines use clay, lumber, glass, cloth, and early metals rather than advanced magic.","This is an optional discipline at this age; the canonical factory proofs govern normal progression."]
	quest.4A281F81BE31D3B6.quest_subtitle: "A working cottage laboratory turns local materials into fumes, fibers, and brews."
	quest.4A281F81BE31D3B6.title: "Enchanted Apparatus"
	quest.4A29644B5ECA6601.quest_desc: ["Run createch2/preflight, createch2/telemetry, and createch2/flight_control; abort safely when fuel, oxygen, or return reserve fails."]
	quest.4A29644B5ECA6601.quest_subtitle: "Required discipline mastery — contributes to the canonical age proof."
	quest.4A29644B5ECA6601.title: "Verified Rocket Flight Computer"
	quest.4A298C69045864C2.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer sixteen thousand millibuckets of Stellaris fuel."
		"Load from a bounded tank, keep the return reserve separate, and replenish the diesel feed after conversion."
	]
	quest.4A298C69045864C2.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of Stellaris fuel prove diesel conversion can support a launch without the quest handing over a filled bucket."
	quest.4A298C69045864C2.title: "Rocket Fuel Loadout"
	quest.4A3EB104C7D9DD45.quest_desc: [
		"The native Cracker is an optional refinery-expansion facility. TFMG and MI still own first oil, hydrogen, naphtha, fuels, and polymers; Greg only scales an established heavy fraction."
		"Stage the controller, nineteen Clean Machine Casings, sixteen Kanthal Coils, IV energy, item input, fluid input/output, maintenance, and an IV Muffler Hatch. Its native recipe map has no item-output ability, so an output bus is neither required nor valid."
		"Commission the authored 1,024-EU/t route with 4,000 mB heavy oil and 2,000 mB hydrogen. It returns only 2,000 mB naphtha plus 1,000 mB liquid asphalt, so it cannot close a positive fuel loop."
	]
	quest.4A3EB104C7D9DD45.quest_subtitle: "Hydrogen-assisted fraction upgrading after the petroleum civilization already exists."
	quest.4A3EB104C7D9DD45.title: "Cracker"
	quest.4A60314F8873A316.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 8,000 mB of naphtha."
		"Send 8,000 mB of the naphtha cut from the distillation line into its own labeled buffer."
	]
	quest.4A60314F8873A316.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of naphtha make a real feed stream for later chemical cuts."
	quest.4A60314F8873A316.title: "Naphtha Cut Line"
	quest.4AB6927961AB4F2E.quest_desc: [
		"Complete MI’s bronze-compressor advancement by building the machine through its current recipe."
		"Give compressed output its own storage so plates and dense forms remain available to the next construction job."
	]
	quest.4AB6927961AB4F2E.quest_subtitle: "The compressor extends the hall from processing ore to forming standardized material stock."
	quest.4AB6927961AB4F2E.title: "Commission the Bronze Compressor"
	quest.4AE5F9C445FFDFBD.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer sixteen thousand millibuckets of TFMG diesel."
		"Feed only approved generation or transport loads and retain isolation, overflow, and fire separation."
	]
	quest.4AE5F9C445FFDFBD.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of diesel prove the megaproject fuel main is a production line, not a sprint statistic."
	quest.4AE5F9C445FFDFBD.title: "Megastructure Fuel Main"
	quest.4B4FF0417DFF552B.quest_desc: [
		"Store eight Electro Energetics insulated copper wire and sixteen MI copper wire."
		"Keep both away from general crafting so a damaged branch can be isolated and rewired before production resumes."
	]
	quest.4B4FF0417DFF552B.quest_subtitle: "Insulated and bare copper on the same shelf shorten the distance from fault to recovery."
	quest.4B4FF0417DFF552B.title: "Stock Grid Repairs"
	quest.4B7729800DEBB41C.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the Stellaris Rocket Station in its operating position; it owns structural airframe construction, not final propulsion and fueling."
		"Provide a transfer path from its incomplete airframe output to the Create deployment, spouting, and pressing line."
	]
	quest.4B7729800DEBB41C.quest_subtitle: "The station is commissioned when power, loading, fuel, and a safe approach all reach the same block."
	quest.4B7729800DEBB41C.title: "Commission the Rocket Station"
	quest.4BE8AFD293F3CA0E.quest_desc: [
		"Stage sixty-four TFC charcoal and sixteen MI fire-clay bricks."
		"Mix fire-clay dust from fired bricks and clay through the live Create recipe, then fire the result before boiler work consumes it."
	]
	quest.4BE8AFD293F3CA0E.quest_subtitle: "Fuel and fireclay are the two reserves a bronze boiler cannot improvise."
	quest.4BE8AFD293F3CA0E.title: "Stock Boiler Fuel and Fireclay"
	quest.4C18CCACBD77978D.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Rocketnautics rocket thrusters and retain eight Stellaris desh ingots."
		"Finish from current production after the Stargate and orbital route are open; no reward supplies either requirement."
	]
	quest.4C18CCACBD77978D.quest_subtitle: "A matched thruster pair beside eight returned desh ingots marks a space program able to replace what it launches."
	quest.4C18CCACBD77978D.title: "Space Program Commissioning Capstone"
	quest.4C60F145E73E1AD1.quest_desc: ["Build the authored Ultimate Voltage consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.4C60F145E73E1AD1.quest_subtitle: "The UV standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.4C60F145E73E1AD1.title: "UV Consumer Proof"
	quest.4C62F67891F6E24E.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a replacement bronze boiler and sixteen bronze plates available."
		"Shut down the failed feed, repair water and steam paths, then restart with the load disconnected until pressure is stable."
	]
	quest.4C62F67891F6E24E.quest_subtitle: "A replacement boiler and plate reserve prove a water failure is recoverable."
	quest.4C62F67891F6E24E.title: "Rebuild the Boiler Feed"
	quest.4C6FD6ECD0FC4D50.quest_desc: ["Produce the first TFC steel ingot through the industrial-blasting and casting route.","TFMG replaces TFC's blast furnace and the retired MI steam furnace. Supply coke-dust fuel, TFC flux and hot air; handle slag and furnace gas.","The same plant supplies TFC pig iron for native forging. MI's later electric blast furnace remains in progression.","Stack four blast-stove blocks vertically. Each batch combines 50 mB of air and 10 mB of fuel into 50 mB of hot air and 50 mB of carbon dioxide. Start with Railcraft creosote: 44 fuel oak logs yield 11 L for 1,100 batches and 55 L of each output; construction wood is additional. Insert air horizontally at the base and fuel through the top; extract hot air from below and CO2 horizontally. Keep the networks separate and set MI inputs to insert, outputs to extract. For each output, retain the stove’s 32 L storage plus three separate 8 L Create tanks. Furnace gas can fuel the stove after the furnace starts.","For the early intake and stove, make cast-iron fluid tanks with empty wooden barrels, including TFC oak barrels, and the same two cast-iron plates. Craft the stonecutter with three stone blocks, including raw TFC quartzite, and one ordinary iron ingot; use it for the intake’s andesite bars and industrial iron block.","Use a normal three-layer furnace with a side tuyere and top hatch. Drop one iron dust, one TFC flux and three fresh coke dust into an open chute above the top hatch. Draw gas from a side of the hatch so the drop column stays clear. One steel batch consumes 54.4 L of hot air and produces 136 L of furnace gas: reserve eighteen separate 8 L tanks for gas. The CO2 exhaust cannot vent it. Keep 144 mB of slag separate while casting the 144 mB of steel.","Drive one diameter-1 air intake from behind at 64 RPM: an 8-RPM water wheel and three large-to-small cog stages (8 -> 16 -> 32 -> 64), joined by andesite-alloy shafts. At steady speed it produces air in 1 mB increments into its 8 L tank. Extract air for the stove; 50 mB feeds one hot-blast batch, while first steel needs the full hot-air budget above.","The TFMG casting line and the Railcraft furnace deliver canonical TFC steel. Independent nonconsuming objectives may count the same sixteen held ingots, including the four-ingot freight task; detection spends none."]
	quest.4C6FD6ECD0FC4D50.quest_subtitle: "The first cast steel ingot proves the TFMG furnace, hot air and output handling work together."
	quest.4C6FD6ECD0FC4D50.title: "Cast the First Industrial Steel"
	quest.4C7F00AE817953FC.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen MI copper wire and four motors."
		"Count only replaceable factory output; leave copper plates, rubber, cord, coils, and magnetic rods ready to replenish the spool."
	]
	quest.4C7F00AE817953FC.quest_subtitle: "A full spool of wire and four motors put ordinary electrical expansion within reach."
	quest.4C7F00AE817953FC.title: "Copper Wire Spool"
	quest.4C89B1BE1956FCAE.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Mega Cells 1M item storage cell."
		"Use it for a known bulk set and retain recovery access outside the network."
	]
	quest.4C89B1BE1956FCAE.quest_subtitle: "A 1M cell solves capacity only after item types, backups, and network power are already disciplined."
	quest.4C89B1BE1956FCAE.title: "Mega Cells Scale"
	quest.4C8D0B99CFB007BA.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the safety-office shield generator and issue one Mekanism dosimeter."
		"Give instruments, treatment, clean clothing, records, alarms, and emergency controls locations reachable without entering the reactor room."
	]
	quest.4C8D0B99CFB007BA.quest_subtitle: "A shield generator and dosimeter put the controlled boundary and the exposure record in the same operational plan."
	quest.4C8D0B99CFB007BA.title: "Lay Out the Safety Office"
	quest.4C99C86636F7F9A0.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an MI Quantum machine hull."
		"Provide high-tier power, service clearance, and segregated inputs before installing its final machine function."
	]
	quest.4C99C86636F7F9A0.quest_subtitle: "A placed Quantum hull marks the point where this machine floor is built for replication and fusion by default."
	quest.4C99C86636F7F9A0.title: "Expand the Quantum Machine Floor"
	quest.4CBDE6AE37B6FEFA.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the second matched pair of Rocketnautics booster thrusters for the late propulsion branch."
		"Use matched parts and confirm both mechanical-crafting runs consumed the intended titanium, iridium, pump, and control inputs."
	]
	quest.4CBDE6AE37B6FEFA.quest_subtitle: "A booster pair is the smallest useful high-thrust reserve for a balanced craft."
	quest.4CBDE6AE37B6FEFA.title: "Build the Second Booster Thruster Pair"
	quest.4CC251B961F3DA6F.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four thousand millibuckets of MI UU Matter after the first condensate."
		"Measure helium plasma and deuterium use, then restore both buffers before committing the batch to replication."
	]
	quest.4CC251B961F3DA6F.quest_subtitle: "Four buckets of UU Matter show the singularity process can run repeatedly without consuming its catalysts."
	quest.4CC251B961F3DA6F.title: "Run a Full UU-Matter Batch"
	quest.4CEDD69D95922752.quest_desc: ["Monitor a gold-filter line with a CC computer using only real redstone or modem signals; trigger and recover one shutdown."]
	quest.4CEDD69D95922752.quest_subtitle: "CC monitoring, filtration stock, and shutdown authority become factory operations."
	quest.4CEDD69D95922752.title: "Environmental Control Department"
	quest.4D1BF79714293B68.quest_desc: ["Retain nuclear alloy and Starlight material together, then use them in an actual late consumer."]
	quest.4D1BF79714293B68.quest_subtitle: "Nuclear-grade, extreme-alloy, and Starlight inputs become one qualified supply chain."
	quest.4D1BF79714293B68.title: "Material Epoch VII — Nuclear and Starlight Convergence"
	quest.4D38F4D5DF1E18E5.quest_desc: ["Build all eight UXV functional families and verify that each recipe consumes its matching UIV component; this prepares extreme system-scale machinery."]
	quest.4D38F4D5DF1E18E5.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Ultra Extreme Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.4D38F4D5DF1E18E5.title: "UXV Component Standard"
	quest.4D515BC3F0AB3A28.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the Stellaris rocket station after the repeat-production run."
		"Check pad clearance, fuel isolation, oxygen access, emergency egress, and the order used to cancel a launch."
	]
	quest.4D515BC3F0AB3A28.quest_subtitle: "A rocket station deserves a deliberate inspection before a failure asks the crew to improvise."
	quest.4D515BC3F0AB3A28.title: "Inspect the Abort System"
	quest.4D698F2852F180A9.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Large Circuit Assembler and Large Assembler after the IV component chain is stable."
		"These 2048-EU/t institutions prepare advanced fabrication and the infrastructure required for research."
	]
	quest.4D698F2852F180A9.quest_subtitle: "Large precision machines convert component success into research-scale manufacturing."
	quest.4D698F2852F180A9.title: "Large Fabricators"
	quest.4D77F6CCE36ECF3C.quest_desc: [
		"After the first assembly is understood, build four CROWNS fuel assemblies and one Mekanism dosimeter."
		"Keep fuel assemblies unloaded until their position, cooling contribution, and shutdown response are reviewed."
	]
	quest.4D77F6CCE36ECF3C.quest_subtitle: "Four fuel cells and a personal dosimeter equip another shift with hardware and measurement, not paperwork tokens."
	quest.4D77F6CCE36ECF3C.title: "Equip the Second Reactor Shift"
	quest.4D7B8DF288B3AE1E.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen MI steel large plates and thirty-two bronze plates."
		"Keep structural material separate from machine internals and replenish the forming lines after issue."
	]
	quest.4D7B8DF288B3AE1E.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen steel large plates and thirty-two bronze plates are credible construction stock without hoarding progression controllers."
	quest.4D7B8DF288B3AE1E.title: "Stock District Structural Modules"
	quest.4DA65DD9E621FE07.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Electro Energetics multimeter."
		"Measure before touching a circuit, isolate the source, and verify zero again before treating the line as safe; energized EE conductors remain an electrocution hazard."
	]
	quest.4DA65DD9E621FE07.quest_subtitle: "Electro Energetics and EE meters expose voltage and current before an energized conductor is touched."
	quest.4DA65DD9E621FE07.title: "Electro Energetics Metering"
	quest.4DA8A9525ABF3127.quest_desc: [
		"Place the MI electric macerator and run a useful ore or material recipe."
		"Route its output before starting and watch grid storage through the cycle to establish the machine’s real load."
	]
	quest.4DA8A9525ABF3127.quest_subtitle: "The electric macerator moves ore preparation onto power that can be measured and buffered."
	quest.4DA8A9525ABF3127.title: "Run the Electric Macerator"
	quest.4DB5E6AA7AD016ED.quest_desc: [
		"After the Mars survey, locate the Stellaris Mercury Factory structure."
		"Approach with environmental supplies, record the route, and preserve an untouched return reserve."
	]
	quest.4DB5E6AA7AD016ED.quest_subtitle: "A factory on Mercury is useful intelligence only if the expedition can leave it again."
	quest.4DB5E6AA7AD016ED.title: "Investigate the Mercury Factory"
	quest.4DCA0AD97DEE9338.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen barley breads and one Farmer’s Delight cooking pot."
		"Keep the spare pot with fuel, containers, and a planned site rather than loose in general storage."
	]
	quest.4DCA0AD97DEE9338.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen loaves and a cooking pot support several shifts while leaving farming as the real source."
	quest.4DCA0AD97DEE9338.title: "Stage the Long-Stay Pantry"
	quest.4DF362D04F6B76FE.quest_desc: [
		"Build four CROWNS fuel assemblies and one Mekanism Solar Neutron Activator."
		"Begin from current uranium processing, processors, shielding, waste storage, and radiation supplies; restore every consumed reserve."
	]
	quest.4DF362D04F6B76FE.quest_subtitle: "Four solid fuel cells and a new reprocessor prove the controlled route can be rebuilt without a Quantum-only fusion machine."
	quest.4DF362D04F6B76FE.title: "Rebuild the Fuel Line from Stock"
	quest.4DF84094860334C1.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight aethersent ingots through the live post-discovery route."
		"Use a legitimate Starlight sample as intended and replenish nuclear-supported reagents afterward."
	]
	quest.4DF84094860334C1.quest_subtitle: "Eight aethersent ingots made from current inputs prove the exotic line begins with discovery and continues through industry."
	quest.4DF84094860334C1.title: "Scale Aethersent from a Real Sample"
	quest.4DFD86B65DEAB54C.quest_desc: [
		"After the fuel-cell route opens, produce four MI uranium-235 dust."
		"Use the installed uranium oxide, hexafluoride, centrifuge, and tiny-dust packing chain; record feed, product, and depleted fraction."
	]
	quest.4DFD86B65DEAB54C.quest_subtitle: "Four uranium-235 dusts make the enrichment ledger a physical, traceable fuel batch rather than a walking counter."
	quest.4DFD86B65DEAB54C.title: "Record the Enriched Uranium Batch"
	quest.4E0AF8B19BBD94C4.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and quarantine sixteen MI uranium dust."
		"Label it, restrict automation, and keep oxide, hexafluoride, enrichment, cladding, and waste routes physically traceable."
	]
	quest.4E0AF8B19BBD94C4.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen uranium dust creates one accountable fuel batch without scattering radioactive feed through storage."
	quest.4E0AF8B19BBD94C4.title: "Buffer Uranium Feed"
	quest.4E13EAE9192BD82B.quest_desc: [
		"Drop one log and three sticks on the same block. Add up to five straw, paper, leaves, or pinecones to improve the lighting chance."
		"Hold Use with the Firestarter on that pile. Feed fuel from the top slot after the Firepit forms."
	]
	quest.4E13EAE9192BD82B.quest_subtitle: "One log, three sticks, and optional kindling turn ignition into a workstation."
	quest.4E13EAE9192BD82B.title: "Light the First Firepit"
	quest.4E2D0A85974DA997.quest_desc: [
		"Store sixteen advanced pressurized tubes and eight titanium curved plates."
		"Isolate and depressurize a damaged branch before replacement; spare material does not make a live line safe to open."
	]
	quest.4E2D0A85974DA997.quest_subtitle: "Pressure-loss preparation means replacement tube and curved hull stock exist before a seal fails."
	quest.4E2D0A85974DA997.title: "Pressure Loss Safety Test"
	quest.4E3E05F63682F1EA.quest_desc: [
		"Store sixteen thioquartz shards and four crystal-matrix ingots."
		"Keep reference samples outside autocrafting and document which batch is cleared for consumption."
	]
	quest.4E3E05F63682F1EA.quest_subtitle: "Thioquartz and crystal-matrix stock keep alien evidence and engineered matter available for the next Quantum study."
	quest.4E3E05F63682F1EA.title: "Thioquartz Reserve"
	quest.4E7AE214EA025873.quest_desc: [
		"Build four MI advanced motors and inspect the Mekanism metallurgic infuser."
		"Assign the motor batch to documented expansion or repair work and leave the infuser empty of the wrong infusion material."
	]
	quest.4E7AE214EA025873.quest_subtitle: "Four advanced motors beside the working infuser give a third shift replacement capacity and a known chemical load."
	quest.4E7AE214EA025873.title: "Stage the Third MV Shift"
	quest.4E88BDDCAF6CCF3B.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a bronze boiler and sixteen bronze bolts as a rebuild kit."
		"Store the kit cold and disconnected; use it only after the water fault that damaged the old line is understood."
	]
	quest.4E88BDDCAF6CCF3B.quest_subtitle: "A spare boiler with sixteen fasteners makes the largest early failure replaceable."
	quest.4E88BDDCAF6CCF3B.title: "Boiler Rebuild Kit"
	quest.4E8D5C81980C9DFC.quest_desc: ["Run the heated Create feedstock batch and move it physically to the electric line."]
	quest.4E8D5C81980C9DFC.quest_subtitle: "Visible cutting, mixing, and handling prepare a repeatable organic batch."
	quest.4E8D5C81980C9DFC.title: "Industrial Biology — Create Preparation"
	quest.4EE28C4DCD988F85.quest_desc: [
		"Place the stabilizer as the freight yard’s fixed reference, then stage four Vector Thrusters."
		"The vector batch repeats the native Rocketnautics component bill at higher power without charging redundant stabilizers."
	]
	quest.4EE28C4DCD988F85.quest_subtitle: "A placed stabilizer and four Vector Thrusters turn the freight yard into a mature navigation and propulsion depot."
	quest.4EE28C4DCD988F85.title: "Deep-Space Freight Yard Expansion Contract"
	quest.4F0A04160A028947.quest_desc: [
		"Hold a lubrication-oil bucket and a cured natural-rubber sheet after commissioning distillation."
		"The milestone reward is decorative; approved steel still requires its own live production route."
	]
	quest.4F0A04160A028947.quest_subtitle: "Lubricant and rubber show the district can turn crude feed into materials that keep machines alive."
	quest.4F0A04160A028947.title: "Heavy Industry District Online"
	quest.4F0BCB44E1B87E3A.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and buffer 16,000 mB of TFMG diesel for the next refinery shift."
		"Stage it after separation and restore the crude and outlet buffers afterward."
	]
	quest.4F0BCB44E1B87E3A.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of diesel are enough to prove the refinery supports a working load without demanding a tank farm for its own sake."
	quest.4F0BCB44E1B87E3A.title: "Buffer a Diesel Shift"
	quest.4F413A45A85355A2.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Stellaris big oxygen tanks."
		"Practice bringing one bank online, checking connections, then admitting the second without hiding a leak."
	]
	quest.4F413A45A85355A2.quest_subtitle: "Two large tanks let oxygen service return with one bank isolated and one bank supplying the yard."
	quest.4F413A45A85355A2.title: "Cold-Restart Oxygen Service"
	quest.4F4A1AA52C626C32.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen MI Quantum circuits."
		"Run the circuit chain from replenished inputs and reserve the lot for final recipes."
	]
	quest.4F4A1AA52C626C32.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen Quantum circuits give convergence a controlled electronics lot instead of competing with gate maintenance."
	quest.4F4A1AA52C626C32.title: "Stock Quantum Circuits for Convergence"
	quest.4F4B304C7B802AC7.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen neutron piles and one neutron collector."
		"Keep the replacement machine unplaced and protect its Starlight and nuclear ingredients."
	]
	quest.4F4B304C7B802AC7.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen neutron piles and a spare collector make the slowest industrial branch recoverable after loss."
	quest.4F4B304C7B802AC7.title: "Neutron Pile Reserve"
	quest.4F849CB77549B587.quest_desc: ["Retain a control rod assembly from the operating nuclear works to prove fuel geometry, coolant, turbines, meters, waste, backup power, and shutdown all belong to one facility.", "The proof now joins prepared fuel, coolant supply, turbine energy, control, independent radiation instruments, waste infrastructure and restart stock. Keep radiation release as a failure to prevent; the optional exposure achievement is never required. Multiblock operation, actual waste processing and safe shutdown still need a witnessed run."]
	quest.4F849CB77549B587.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 13 PROOF — Nuclear Civilization"
	quest.4F849CB77549B587.title: "Nuclear Complex Proven"
	quest.5037787688C33B78.quest_desc: [
		"Craft an Infinity Catalyst and demonstrate five hundred million FE after its milestone opens."
		"Run the order from audited inputs and keep enough reserve to shut every contributing district down safely."
	]
	quest.5037787688C33B78.quest_subtitle: "An Infinity Catalyst beside half a billion FE is a controlled final load, not a claim that power alone creates matter."
	quest.5037787688C33B78.title: "Universal Fabricator Load"
	quest.504FBB71486CD983.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect working hoppers during production, then walk the Large Steam and Large Electric Macerator service sides."
		"Correct access, labels, and isolation points wherever a full inventory or failed component cannot be reached safely."
	]
	quest.504FBB71486CD983.quest_subtitle: "Twenty hopper inspections plus both scaled macerator walkdowns expose filters, blocked faces, and cells that cannot be repaired without dismantling the line."
	quest.504FBB71486CD983.title: "Inspect Service Access"
	quest.5055E5BF6BA5CB2C.quest_desc: [
		"Build and reserve eight Mekanism fission reactor casings."
		"Keep them outside the controlled boundary with compatible tools and never repair an active or unsafe reactor."
	]
	quest.5055E5BF6BA5CB2C.quest_subtitle: "Eight spare casings can close a controlled repair without requiring a dangerous fabrication delay."
	quest.5055E5BF6BA5CB2C.title: "Stock the Containment Repair Shelf"
	quest.50662CAE4D21CDDD.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Rocketnautics thruster mounts."
		"Use the current late-flight recipe and keep the pair available for the propulsion work that follows."
	]
	quest.50662CAE4D21CDDD.quest_subtitle: "A matched pair of mounts gives the propulsion branch a real structure to carry and service."
	quest.50662CAE4D21CDDD.title: "Build the Thruster Mounts"
	quest.5078B54ABCE38E17.quest_desc: [
		"Build the large water wheel from the live pack recipe and place it on a suitable flow."
		"Measure the new stress capacity before attaching more machines, and keep the smaller wheel available during the changeover."
	]
	quest.5078B54ABCE38E17.quest_subtitle: "A larger wheel adds useful capacity only when the rest of the shaft line can carry it."
	quest.5078B54ABCE38E17.title: "Expand Water Power"
	quest.508DDE3C5248B0A2.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Applied Mekanistics 1k chemical storage cell."
		"Partition or label it, keep external emergency storage, and do not hide hazardous chemistry behind a terminal."
	]
	quest.508DDE3C5248B0A2.quest_subtitle: "A chemical storage cell bridges Mekanism gases into AE2 without changing who owns their production and safety."
	quest.508DDE3C5248B0A2.title: "Chemical Storage Bridge"
	quest.50B077819ACC1E13.quest_desc: ["Milestone 4: connect powered comb processing to buffers and the digital factory. Keep the manual Create centrifuge as a recovery route.","Milestone 5 adds planetary heated processing only after Venus/Mercury samples exist. Supply chemicals, power and proper bees before expecting mature throughput."]
	quest.50B077819ACC1E13.quest_subtitle: "A centrifuge is the point where the apiary becomes a processing branch instead of a collection of hives."
	quest.50B077819ACC1E13.title: "Comb Processing Floor"
	quest.50B8AEE55C40EE5D.quest_desc: [
		"Craft sixteen AE2 fluix glass cable."
		"Route channels deliberately, color or label major branches, and keep spare cable outside the live network."
	]
	quest.50B8AEE55C40EE5D.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen fluix glass cable gives the controller a compact, inspectable first set of branches."
	quest.50B8AEE55C40EE5D.title: "Cable the First Network"
	quest.5149E7E61C281720.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Stellaris fuel module and inspect the commissioned classic Stargate."
		"This branch waits for the Tier 15 gate; verify the receiving side before treating it as an abort path."
	]
	quest.5149E7E61C281720.quest_subtitle: "A fuel module and an operating Stargate join local launch shutdown to a Quantum-era evacuation route."
	quest.5149E7E61C281720.title: "Link the Fuel Abort Route"
	quest.519966F77BB9EA1B.quest_desc: ["Place and inspect the Large Simulation Chamber after the ordinary Hostile Neural Networks loop is proven.","Feed trained models, protected power, and bounded outputs so parallel simulation accelerates an understood process instead of bypassing it.","Optional advanced simulation under RSR-01 Resource Simulation. HNI scales the earlier Digital model loop and shares the discipline of contained quarry-bee renewal; first discovery remains physical."]
	quest.519966F77BB9EA1B.quest_subtitle: "The large chamber is the scaled simulation step for a mature Stainless and Digital factory."
	quest.519966F77BB9EA1B.title: "Scale Hostile Simulation"
	quest.52378D06A8137FFF.quest_desc: [
		"Complete a 2,000-metre conditioning route on safe terrain while carrying the fathometer and hull barometer."
		"Record a shallow-water baseline, rehearse the abort signal and ascent route, and stop the drill when exposure, air, or equipment condition becomes the greater hazard."
		"Field readiness keeps the crew alive; measured depth, rated structure, ballast, and decompression procedure make the later pressure work engineering."
	]
	quest.52378D06A8137FFF.quest_subtitle: "Condition the crew, establish instrument baselines, and rehearse the abort before committing a hull to depth."
	quest.52378D06A8137FFF.title: "Complete the Pressure Sprint"
	quest.524C268B696B048B.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a fusion chamber with access around it."
		"Route cryogenic and power services outside the removal path so one chamber can be replaced without dismantling the plant."
	]
	quest.524C268B696B048B.quest_subtitle: "A serviceable chamber ring leaves room to reach the boundary that contains the plasma."
	quest.524C268B696B048B.title: "Fusion Chamber Service Ring"
	quest.527B26255E4012DF.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen Electro Energetics insulated copper wire and inspect an installed wire connector."
		"Plan the branch before unspooling it, and keep enough slack and access for isolation or rerouting."
	]
	quest.527B26255E4012DF.quest_subtitle: "Insulated wire becomes a distribution drum only when connectors are already placed to receive it."
	quest.527B26255E4012DF.title: "Insulated Copper Wire Drum"
	quest.5280203F62DF8082.quest_desc: [
		"Build 4 copper sheet."
		"Heat a double ingot to working temperature, then complete the sheet plan on the anvil."
	]
	quest.5280203F62DF8082.quest_subtitle: "Copper sheet proves the anvil can hold a plan through several precise strikes."
	quest.5280203F62DF8082.title: "Work Copper Sheets"
	quest.52A60C3B07D989F3.quest_desc: [
		"Store eight bronze rings and eight bronze plates for maintenance."
		"Do not count parts already committed to the next machine; repair stock should remain available when production stops."
	]
	quest.52A60C3B07D989F3.quest_subtitle: "Rings and plates cover the ordinary failures that slowly empty a steam hall."
	quest.52A60C3B07D989F3.title: "Stock Pipe and Pump Repairs"
	quest.52ACC76D70A4A578.quest_desc: [
		"Build two AE2 Quantum Rings and inspect the fusion reactor."
		"Power the endpoints separately and test link recovery after one side is deliberately disconnected."
	]
	quest.52ACC76D70A4A578.quest_subtitle: "A ring at each endpoint and an inspected reactor connect remote data without hiding the power that sustains it."
	quest.52ACC76D70A4A578.title: "Quantum Ring Pairing"
	quest.52B3D43AA2989D75.quest_desc: [
		"Place an Advanced CC:Tweaked Computer after wired supervision, early AE2 storage, and Processing Unit production are available."
		"Program monitoring, alarms, interlocks, and operating logic; leave physical item and fluid movement to the installed logistics chain, storage to AE2, and machine-scale execution to industrial equipment."
	]
	quest.52B3D43AA2989D75.quest_subtitle: "CC:Tweaked supervises physical machines rather than becoming another interchangeable routing block."
	quest.52B3D43AA2989D75.title: "Program Factory Supervision"
	quest.52BB0CEF01AF4365.quest_desc: [
		"Preassemble the Electro Energetics housing, induction rotor, and conductive casing in the MI Assembler with lubricant."
		"On the Create line, install the MI motor core, copper cord, and device connector before the final press operation."
	]
	quest.52BB0CEF01AF4365.quest_subtitle: "The Electro Energetics electric motor is the required electromechanical bridge into trusted LV generation."
	quest.52BB0CEF01AF4365.title: "Assemble the Electric Motor"
	quest.52ED0CF0F7572134.quest_desc: ["Commission a large stack and inspect the surrounding soil, water, crops, animals, and settlement exposure."]
	quest.52ED0CF0F7572134.quest_subtitle: "Coke, blasting, and heavy heat require a district exhaust plan."
	quest.52ED0CF0F7572134.title: "Dirty Industry Becomes Geographic"
	quest.52F8B4EB40801EDA.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one Stellaris alien zombie during off-world exploration."
		"Choose open ground, keep the fight away from the rocket and oxygen equipment, and preserve a retreat line to shelter."
	]
	quest.52F8B4EB40801EDA.quest_subtitle: "The first alien contact proves the landing zone is not empty merely because it is quiet."
	quest.52F8B4EB40801EDA.title: "Alien Zombie Contact"
	quest.5304DDF3269944EA.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer sixteen thousand millibuckets of TFMG naphtha."
		"Use a labeled source, pipe, buffer, and shutoff; keep it away from incompatible services."
	]
	quest.5304DDF3269944EA.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of naphtha justify a dedicated main whose capacity and isolation match the consuming district."
	quest.5304DDF3269944EA.title: "Megastructure Naphtha Main"
	quest.5305FA53CCDE90F4.quest_desc: [
		"Build an MI LV diesel generator."
		"Supply fuel already produced by the pack’s oil authority and connect it only to a correctly tiered circuit."
	]
	quest.5305FA53CCDE90F4.quest_subtitle: "An LV diesel generator makes liquid fuel a dispatchable source for loads steam cannot follow quickly."
	quest.5305FA53CCDE90F4.title: "Diesel Generation"
	quest.531ABE4F2C304C28.quest_desc: [
		"Craft four Infinity Catalysts."
		"Record the limiting ingredient and repair that production line before converting the audit batch."
	]
	quest.531ABE4F2C304C28.quest_subtitle: "Four catalysts expose whether every contributing system can answer the same production order repeatedly."
	quest.531ABE4F2C304C28.title: "Account for Four Infinity Catalysts"
	quest.5333883A51E440D6.quest_desc: [
		"After the refinery branch, extract and transfer eight thousand millibuckets of TFMG crude oil."
		"Start storage and routing first, then the pumpjack, and stop before the receiving tank fills."
		"The quest submission consumes the fluid; refill the working buffer afterward. Its reward is a reusable recovery tool, not replacement components."
	]
	quest.5333883A51E440D6.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of new crude prove the well, pump, route, and receiving tank returned in the right order."
	quest.5333883A51E440D6.title: "Cold-Restart Crude Extraction"
	quest.534F09A28C8C26BE.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four basic control circuits and eight Electro Energetics wire connectors."
		"Run the infuser from stable generation and leave both part bins ready for another chemical-machine order."
	]
	quest.534F09A28C8C26BE.quest_subtitle: "Circuits and connectors made together show control logic and physical distribution can scale at the same pace."
	quest.534F09A28C8C26BE.title: "Repeat Control and Distribution"
	quest.538C46DE51C50C79.quest_desc: [
		"Craft and stage sixteen fluid pipes for the first routed workshop line."
		"Run the pipes along the supported ore-haul corridor and leave accessible turns, shutoffs, and unloading points."
	]
	quest.538C46DE51C50C79.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen staged pipes make the ore-haul corridor a serviceable fluid route with visible access and shutoffs."
	quest.538C46DE51C50C79.title: "Pipe the Ore Haul Route"
	quest.53949CE0FA440225.quest_desc: ["Connect a CC computer through a verified redstone relay to steering or throttle hardware and test a manual override."]
	quest.53949CE0FA440225.quest_subtitle: "Digital control assists a pilot but never deletes manual controls."
	quest.53949CE0FA440225.title: "Drive-by-Wire"
	quest.53EDE1E846A4ACFA.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen MI titanium plates and sixteen titanium ingots."
		"Keep these outside general autocrafting and preserve every upstream chemical and thermal buffer."
	]
	quest.53EDE1E846A4ACFA.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen plates and ingots give pressure work room to repair and expand across several jobs."
	quest.53EDE1E846A4ACFA.title: "Stage Three-Shift Titanium"
	quest.543EE7788A12E303.quest_desc: ["Integrate completed Dyson hardware with quantum links, fusion power, and Stargate engineering to commission the electromagnetic rail ejector."]
	quest.543EE7788A12E303.quest_subtitle: "Fusion, Stargate, particle-accelerator, AE2 Quantum, Starlight, and precision subassemblies converge in a distributed stellar megaproject line."
	quest.543EE7788A12E303.title: "Electromagnetic Rail Ejector"
	quest.544F5EC2B79B9229.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Create track signal and install it on a real block boundary."
		"Test both directions and keep the protected section shorter than the stopping distance."
	]
	quest.544F5EC2B79B9229.quest_subtitle: "Signals turn shared rail from a collision risk into infrastructure several trains can understand."
	quest.544F5EC2B79B9229.title: "Signals and Schedules"
	quest.54C4A694879E33E0.quest_desc: [
		"Research Rotational Mechanics, then build a parachute from TFC cloth, lumber, leather, cordage, and bronze fittings."
		"Equip it through the equipment screen or by using it in your hand. While airborne, use the configured Deploy / cut away parachute key to open it; pressing again cuts it away. Allow time for inflation and slow down before deploying at extreme speed."
		"The canopy controls descent, not powered flight; it needs atmosphere and wears on landing. Hard unprotected landings can trigger a ragdoll. Once the body settles it releases you automatically, or you can use the native dismount control after a short delay."
	]
	quest.54C4A694879E33E0.quest_subtitle: "Earn personal exploration without turning early air movement into powered flight."
	quest.54C4A694879E33E0.title: "Parachute Preparation"
	quest.54F5FF606687D81F.quest_desc: [
		"The native Pyrolyse Oven is an optional late bulk-carbonization institution. TFC still owns first charcoal, and Railcraft still owns first coal coke and creosote; this facility only batches their already-established route."
		"Stage the controller, ten ULV Machine Casings, sixteen Kanthal Coils, IV energy, item input/output, fluid input/output, maintenance, and an IV Muffler Hatch. Use the native multiblock preview for orientation."
		"Commission it with the authored 16-coal batch: sixteen Coal Coke and 8,000 mB of Railcraft Creosote at 1,024 EU/t. The native Pyrolyse map is otherwise disabled."
	]
	quest.54F5FF606687D81F.quest_subtitle: "Late coke-and-creosote batching without replacing the charcoal yard or Railcraft."
	quest.54F5FF606687D81F.title: "Pyrolyse Oven"
	quest.54FDA5E59836E28A.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Mekanism Solar Neutron Activator through the live pack recipe."
		"It requires the isotopic centrifuge, elite control circuits, radioactive-waste storage, fuel handling, instruments, and replacement shielding."
	]
	quest.54FDA5E59836E28A.quest_subtitle: "Spent fuel remains a controlled material after power production stops; reprocessing is part of the reactor, not an afterthought."
	quest.54FDA5E59836E28A.title: "Waste and Reprocessing"
	quest.551A7F4395805BB4.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the neutron collector and stage two crystal-matrix blocks."
		"Separate collector output, compressor input, catalysts, starcores, nuclear support, and maintenance access."
	]
	quest.551A7F4395805BB4.quest_subtitle: "A collector and matrix reserve define where slow input, compressed output, and rare catalysts can be secured."
	quest.551A7F4395805BB4.title: "Lay Out Neutron and Matrix Service"
	quest.553146DC8E54F423.quest_desc: [
		"Complete MI’s bronze-mixer advancement with the installed machine."
		"Use a recipe needed by the pack and buffer its inputs instead of feeding unrelated dusts into the same chest."
	]
	quest.553146DC8E54F423.quest_subtitle: "The mixer becomes infrastructure when balanced recipes leave it ready for the next batch."
	quest.553146DC8E54F423.title: "Commission the Bronze Mixer"
	quest.55642E443C71B2BA.quest_desc: ["Operate one gantry/forestry system and one JDT biological consumer without bypassing TFC climate or discovery."]
	quest.55642E443C71B2BA.quest_subtitle: "Gantries, crop filters, forestry, and JDT biology consume the retained products."
	quest.55642E443C71B2BA.title: "Industrial Biology — Real Consumer"
	quest.55661DEFE02FB94F.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one Eternal Starlight nightfall spider on prepared ground."
		"Keep the encounter away from the outpost’s only return point and preserve medicine for the trip home."
	]
	quest.55661DEFE02FB94F.quest_subtitle: "A nightfall spider makes darkness and terrain part of the fight long before its drop becomes useful."
	quest.55661DEFE02FB94F.title: "Nightfall Spider Sweep"
	quest.55682C62847131B4.quest_desc: ["Build two advanced item output hatches using the same aluminum transmission shop and existing electrical components as the input hatches.","Assign separate products and overflow destinations. Reuse surplus input hatches through the reversible one-for-one direction recipe; keep the receiving vault capacity visible during operation."]
	quest.55682C62847131B4.quest_subtitle: "Two advanced output hatches make a batch vault responsible for receiving products instead of storing unrelated circuits."
	quest.55682C62847131B4.title: "Batch Output Vault"
	quest.557C03B422A6383A.quest_desc: [
		"Build one Stellaris pumpjack and eight cured natural-rubber sheets."
		"Survey the next site, protect the transport route, and do not outpace refinery storage."
	]
	quest.557C03B422A6383A.quest_subtitle: "A spare pumpjack and eight rubber sheets make expansion possible only after the first well route works."
	quest.557C03B422A6383A.title: "Open a Second Extraction Shift"
	quest.558215D3F5280010.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen bronze bolts and eight bronze gears."
		"Choose the installed material routes your current machines can sustain, then keep the parts out of general auto-consumption."
	]
	quest.558215D3F5280010.quest_subtitle: "A drawer of bolts and gears keeps routine machine work off the emergency schedule."
	quest.558215D3F5280010.title: "Bronze Bolt Drawer"
	quest.558876074C30DD9B.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen MI steel large plates."
		"Run from current steel supply, inspect forming capacity, and replace the batch before the next expansion."
	]
	quest.558876074C30DD9B.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen steel large plates prove the structural line can answer a megaproject order repeatedly."
	quest.558876074C30DD9B.title: "Structural Modules Supply Run"
	quest.55AF35DE3CC8C10D.quest_desc: ["Run a solar-sail package through the Create sequenced line to tension and finish the sail.","Finish sails on a Darmstadtium Greate Press or higher. Retain the quartz-fiber, iridium, superconductor and Starlight lines that supply the laminate. Install the first press over a depot, then use the chemical plant to supply 864 mB PBI per belt connector. Keep a separate restart-power reserve while scaling the stellar array."]
	quest.55AF35DE3CC8C10D.quest_subtitle: "Turn the packaged laminate into a deployable collector."
	quest.55AF35DE3CC8C10D.title: "Dyson Solar Sail"
	quest.55B8AEEB7ACA1E4E.quest_desc: ["Keep the MI steel machine casing and all sixteen canonical TFC steel ingots available. The nonconsuming four-ingot freight task may count the same held ingots.","The selected continuation adds 53 TFC steel ingots after the 45 already allocated: reserve 16 for this objective and 37 for the press and eight successful steel-mechanism attempts. Reserve two of the five spare steel shafts for press cogs; leave three free. Mechanism failures spend more components and oil, so this allocation never guarantees eight finished mechanisms.","Before continuing, stop furnace input, cast the steel output and disable the slag source port. Place one fresh empty ordinary Create tank directly below the existing slag tank. Let the two-block tank form, confirm the original 6480 mB slag is retained and capacity is 16000 mB, refresh the existing pipe connection, then resume extraction. Keep its typed network separate from steel. After 98 total batches, retain 14112 mB slag.","First close the hot-blast stove input and use the existing spout/depot to harden 25 plank blocks with 6250 mB creosote from 25 new oak logs. Hold the hardened planks, close the spout input and reopen the stove. The selected further fuel bill is 2306 oak logs plus the old 160 mB creosote. Load 63 coke dust before steel batch 46 and 57 after batch 71. New input stock also includes 212 normal hematite, 53 flux, 107 oak lumber and two copper ingots for the added tank. Boiler heat/fuel, earlier construction, mining/forestry wear, nickel, lead, oil and other mechanism hardware remain additional.","A 100-unit wrought bloom needs one 80-unit hematite briquet and one separate 20-unit pellet: 20 clean powders in total. The five-ingot terminal extension therefore needs 20 normal hematite, 100 powders and 25 pellets, arranged as five briquets plus five pellets. Its circuit-packet hammer and handstone retain 37 and 129 uses. The later 53-ingot batch needs 212 normal hematite, 1060 powders and 265 pellets, arranged as 53 briquets plus 53 pellets. Supply four fresh hammers and four fresh handstones, four new loose granite, twelve raw granite and two new oak twigs alongside the six retained handles. The hammers spend 59/59/59/35 uses and retain 1/1/1/25. The old handstone spends 83 uses and retains 46; the four new ones spend 249/249/249/230 and retain 1/1/1/20. These corrected inputs preserve the 98-ingot production schedule.","After the mechanism milestone, fund this additional casing with five NEW steel ingots: press four into plates and apply the fifth to one newly hardened plank, then recover the placed TFMG casing with your bronze pickaxe. Add two of the seven retained precision mechanisms and two fresh TFC nickel ingots. A four-ingot nickel batch leaves two spare. Keep the sixteen objective steel ingots and all eight steel mechanisms. This later batch does not supply the earlier first-bucket workshop inputs.","The additional bill is 20 normal hematite, 16 normal garnierite, five flux, eleven bituminous coal, 219 coking oak logs and four oak lumber. Make one fresh hammer and handstone from two loose granite, three raw granite and two twigs; 36 hammer uses and 180 quern uses leave 24 and 70. Fire four new ingot molds from ten clay with eight kiln logs and eight straw, and cool pottery before pickup. Reuse the insulated forge and manual bellows; nineteen new charcoal fuel a single cold-handled nickel group. Cool full molds in the unheated outputs before extraction. The five steel jobs spend 2000 of the retained 2800 mB macerator steam; slag reaches 14832 mB in the existing 16000 mB tank. Heat, ignition, earlier workshop supplies and mining/forestry wear remain additional."]
	quest.55B8AEEB7ACA1E4E.quest_subtitle: "A casing and sixteen approved ingots make a damaged steam machine replaceable."
	quest.55B8AEEB7ACA1E4E.title: "Prepare a Hot-Line Rebuild"
	quest.55D3554604CCB0B8.quest_desc: [
		"Locate the Stellaris Venus Crash Site structure and return safely."
		"Stage survival supplies before entry and leave enough carrying capacity for recovered material."
	]
	quest.55D3554604CCB0B8.quest_subtitle: "A crash site is both evidence and warning: learn from it without making the recovery crew the next wreck."
	quest.55D3554604CCB0B8.title: "Recover the Venus Crash Site"
	quest.5632115808CB509C.quest_desc: [
		"Cook 4 cooked chicken."
		"Cook the raw food on a firepit or grill. Pack more than one food group before a long trip."
	]
	quest.5632115808CB509C.quest_subtitle: "Hot food buys time to explore without turning hunger into the route home."
	quest.5632115808CB509C.title: "Cook Food Before Exploring"
	quest.567EB99FE065A2F0.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger Create’s train advancement by assembling a train."
		"Give it a station, controls, and a useful first route before adding automated schedules."
	]
	quest.567EB99FE065A2F0.quest_subtitle: "The train advancement confirms the rail route has become a vehicle rather than a line on the ground."
	quest.567EB99FE065A2F0.title: "Assemble a Working Train"
	quest.56931A84BFCB7810.quest_desc: [
		"Build firestarter and torch."
		"Craft sticks into a firestarter. Keep dry logs and spare tinder beside the shelter."
	]
	quest.56931A84BFCB7810.quest_subtitle: "A dry firestarter and a spare torch are cheap until night makes them priceless."
	quest.56931A84BFCB7810.title: "Nightfall Fire Kit"
	quest.56C7F7EB5F26F0E5.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight titanium ingots, four titanium-alloy pieces, and sixteen advanced pressure tubes."
		"Commission the pressure works only after its hull stock, life support, propulsion, isolation valves, and emergency drain path can each be serviced without opening another live system."
	]
	quest.56C7F7EB5F26F0E5.quest_subtitle: "Titanium, aerospace alloy, and advanced tubing now leave one coordinated vacuum-and-pressure factory."
	quest.56C7F7EB5F26F0E5.title: "Commission the High-Pressure Works"
	quest.56DB8EFB259EC6A9.quest_desc: [
		"Build sixteen Mekanism fission reactor casings and four reactor glass blocks."
		"Keep the shell batch unloaded and inspect the final geometry, ports, and service access before any fuel is introduced."
	]
	quest.56DB8EFB259EC6A9.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen casings and four reactor-glass blocks stage a containment expansion whose ports and service clearances can be inspected before fueling."
	quest.56DB8EFB259EC6A9.title: "Containment Shell Stock"
	quest.56FE4D0B39EB1F04.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one Eternal Starlight starlight golem."
		"Choose open ground, keep a retreat path, and inspect equipment before traveling farther."
	]
	quest.56FE4D0B39EB1F04.quest_subtitle: "The Starlight golem tests whether expedition gear can survive a deliberate fight without sacrificing the cargo route."
	quest.56FE4D0B39EB1F04.title: "Starlight Golem Trial"
	quest.56FEFA53979F1086.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Cargo Boats motorboat with the pack’s copper, wood, barrel, and furnace recipe."
		"Run a useful cargo leg and verify the destination has a safe landing."
	]
	quest.56FEFA53979F1086.quest_subtitle: "Copper-age motor freight makes the river a road whose grade is always level."
	quest.56FEFA53979F1086.title: "Motorboat Freight"
	quest.56FF748DF9A41817.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen AE2 printed silicon."
		"Keep them beside the inscriber presses and replenish raw silicon after issue."
	]
	quest.56FF748DF9A41817.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen printed silicon pieces repair several processor orders without storing complete progression devices."
	quest.56FF748DF9A41817.title: "Stock Printed Silicon"
	quest.570B2A572D09FF2F.quest_desc: ["Install an iron filter frame, collect a full service batch, replace its media, and route the spent material."]
	quest.570B2A572D09FF2F.quest_subtitle: "Captured pollution becomes maintenance stock instead of vanishing."
	quest.570B2A572D09FF2F.title: "First Active Filtration"
	quest.571B539C77835381.quest_desc: [
		"Bring the working power system to 500,000 FE and keep a Electro Energetics wire connector available."
		"Test with an actual MV load; storage that only fills while every machine is off does not prove distribution capacity."
	]
	quest.571B539C77835381.quest_subtitle: "Half a million FE behind a serviceable connector gives the MV floor room for real production spikes."
	quest.571B539C77835381.title: "Grid Connector Trial"
	quest.571F65D53337F015.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen reactor glass and eight heavy wire connectors."
		"Keep structural and electrical spares outside the hot zone and isolate power before boundary work."
	]
	quest.571F65D53337F015.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen glass blocks and heavy connectors prepare a visible barrier and the power route behind its instruments."
	quest.571F65D53337F015.title: "Reactor Glass Barrier"
	quest.5773684BCF80CF2C.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the coke oven while keeping a sample of coal coke on site."
		"Reserve separate loading and unloading space, then route liquid byproducts away from hot solids."
	]
	quest.5773684BCF80CF2C.quest_subtitle: "The oven needs freight lanes, byproduct storage, and safe distance from ordinary work."
	quest.5773684BCF80CF2C.title: "Lay Out the Coke Yard"
	quest.57C47EFD2C9FF226.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Data Bank and connect its data hatches to the advanced computer-casing network."
		"Research is an enforced production dependency: EMI may show that a recipe requires completed research data before the Assembly Line can run it."
	]
	quest.57C47EFD2C9FF226.quest_subtitle: "The Data Bank turns recipes into controlled industrial knowledge."
	quest.57C47EFD2C9FF226.title: "Research Data Bank"
	quest.57D3A8EFB1884828.quest_desc: [
		"Keep an oxygen tank and 8,000 mB of Stellaris fuel available for relaunch."
		"Store the fuel in a fixed labeled buffer and leave the return allocation untouched until the mission is safely back."
	]
	quest.57D3A8EFB1884828.quest_subtitle: "A fueled tank and eight-bucket reserve make relaunch possible without borrowing the trip home."
	quest.57D3A8EFB1884828.title: "Reserve Oxygen and Fuel for Relaunch"
	quest.57FF21534B33B517.quest_desc: [
		"Research and assemble the LuV Robot Arm, Sensor, Emitter, and Field Generator component chain."
		"The LuV Field Generator and Crystal Processor are both mandatory inputs to Star Fuel; Infinity cannot be completed by gathering materials alone."
	]
	quest.57FF21534B33B517.quest_subtitle: "The completed LuV component family proves the factory can sustain final 4096-EU/t precision assembly."
	quest.57FF21534B33B517.title: "LuV Final Manufacturing Proof"
	quest.580704E8A469E350.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Electro Energetics portable battery and stock sixteen wires."
		"Store them on the control side of the main disconnect with protected leads and a tested procedure."
	]
	quest.580704E8A469E350.quest_subtitle: "A portable battery with sixteen spare wires can restore instruments and controls before the main source returns."
	quest.580704E8A469E350.title: "Black-Start Battery"
	quest.582F72F1FC70DA88.quest_desc: [
		"Forge the exact titanium pickaxe used by the Maintenance Hatch, then stage eight Filter Casings, sixty-four Cleanroom Glass, and the Cleanroom controller. Use the multiblock preview to finish the floor, ceiling, hatches, and exact room dimensions."
		"The Cleanroom is a maintained Greg production environment for the authored wafer, SMD, and processor machines; it does not enclose arbitrary MI machines."
	]
	quest.582F72F1FC70DA88.quest_subtitle: "Clean precision work begins with reachable maintenance and a controlled room."
	quest.582F72F1FC70DA88.title: "Maintenance and Cleanroom"
	quest.583E29E844D34FD3.quest_desc: [
		"Produce thirty-two MI steel large plates."
		"Keep the forming equipment supplied and record which district has claimed the batch."
	]
	quest.583E29E844D34FD3.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two steel large plates support another work shift without storing spare progression machines."
	quest.583E29E844D34FD3.title: "Buffer Heavy Structural Plate"
	quest.58B0FD3F7DF517E2.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Create Crafts & Additions modular accumulator."
		"Connect it through protection and test both charging and a controlled discharge into a useful load."
	]
	quest.58B0FD3F7DF517E2.quest_subtitle: "A modular accumulator proves storage can remain connected without hiding charge, transfer limits, or isolation."
	quest.58B0FD3F7DF517E2.title: "Grid Engineering Yard Unattended Run"
	quest.58BE1F187A8AE805.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Mekanism’s plutonium advancement through approved nuclear waste processing."
		"Keep fissile output, spent waste, fluorite, and water routes contained and accountable."
	]
	quest.58BE1F187A8AE805.quest_subtitle: "The plutonium advancement confirms reactor waste has entered a controlled reprocessing chain."
	quest.58BE1F187A8AE805.title: "Plutonium Writ"
	quest.58C02952D731A986.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 8,000 mB of heavy oil and 8,000 mB of lubrication oil."
		"Use fixed tanks and pipes; loose buckets are not the intended proof for this bulk reserve."
	]
	quest.58C02952D731A986.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets each of heavy oil and lubricant prove storage can serve both production and maintenance."
	quest.58C02952D731A986.title: "Refinery Fluid Reserves"
	quest.58C6D5DAA7A63734.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 8,000 mB of MI sulfuric acid into compatible fixed storage."
		"Use labeled pipes and reserve an empty containment tank; a bucket in inventory is not the intended proof."
	]
	quest.58C6D5DAA7A63734.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of sulfuric acid make dissolution a supplied process rather than a dangerous experiment."
	quest.58C6D5DAA7A63734.title: "Sulfuric Acid Wash"
	quest.58D79D41B9F95039.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect coke-oven bricks and retain a TFMG steel fluid tank."
		"Plan hot work, crude intake, product tanks, flare or shutdown response, and maintenance access."
	]
	quest.58D79D41B9F95039.quest_subtitle: "A coke-oven reference and steel tank define heat separation, fluid storage, and the service paths between them."
	quest.58D79D41B9F95039.title: "Lay Out the Oil Works"
	quest.58D7E0124B12DF11.quest_desc: ["Build all eight EV functional families and verify that each recipe consumes its matching HV component; this prepares vacuum, pressure, and aerospace machinery."]
	quest.58D7E0124B12DF11.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Extreme Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.58D7E0124B12DF11.title: "EV Component Standard"
	quest.58E7155D16BCBB6D.quest_desc: ["Qualify two Dark Matter and two Red Matter through the existing Quantum-era manufacturing suppliers.","Keep the earlier nuclear, Starlight and precision industries available. These mature matter stocks support later projects without granting an early industrial bypass."]
	quest.58E7155D16BCBB6D.quest_subtitle: "Starlight, LuV precision, and UU qualify late transmutation material."
	quest.58E7155D16BCBB6D.title: "Dark and Red Matter Qualification"
	quest.5901D481B2DAFB49.quest_desc: [
		"Build the chemical washer and retain eight HDPE sheets after operating the core lines."
		"The capstone reward is controlled; stainless steel, AE2, and later chemistry still require their own production."
	]
	quest.5901D481B2DAFB49.quest_subtitle: "A working washer and polymer stock show pressure chemistry can clean, transform, and contain its products."
	quest.5901D481B2DAFB49.title: "Commission the Chemistry Complex"
	quest.59407412C8F87592.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the placed starcore block after following the cold-restart procedure."
		"Verify containment, records, power, and output storage before resuming any seeded process."
	]
	quest.59407412C8F87592.quest_subtitle: "A restarted starcore workcell proves the alien sample can return to controlled service after isolation."
	quest.59407412C8F87592.title: "Prove the Starcore Workcell Can Restart"
	quest.5959C8A0F2C54056.quest_desc: [
		"Complete MI’s steel-machine-casing advancement with the live pack recipe."
		"Keep the TFMG casting line active; a casing obtained elsewhere does not establish renewable steel."
	]
	quest.5959C8A0F2C54056.quest_subtitle: "The casing advancement confirms MI machinery now rests on the approved steel bridge."
	quest.5959C8A0F2C54056.title: "Commission the Steel Casing"
	quest.5964B1E0F47261AB.quest_desc: [
		"Build and store four MI advanced motors."
		"Keep their electrum, annealed copper, aluminum, and magnetic-alloy inputs renewable instead of consuming the final upstream stock."
	]
	quest.5964B1E0F47261AB.quest_subtitle: "Four spare advanced motors cover a real replacement batch after the plate and connector reserve is established."
	quest.5964B1E0F47261AB.title: "Stock Spare Advanced Motors"
	quest.596FDB1756F3A775.quest_desc: ["Place and inspect the Large Loot Fabricator only after both the Large Simulation Chamber and Mono Loot Fabricator are proven.","Route products into explicit storage and preserve all geology, chemistry, nuclear, and progression authorities.","Optional advanced simulation under RSR-01 Resource Simulation. HNI scales the earlier Digital model loop and shares the discipline of contained quarry-bee renewal; first discovery remains physical."]
	quest.596FDB1756F3A775.quest_subtitle: "The large fabricator closes the accelerated neural loop without turning predictions into unrestricted progression materials."
	quest.596FDB1756F3A775.title: "Scale Prediction Fabrication"
	quest.59B4135BF5B6003B.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight AE2 Certus quartz crystals."
		"Keep charged, uncharged, and Fluix materials separated by their next use."
	]
	quest.59B4135BF5B6003B.quest_subtitle: "Eight Certus crystals support ordinary expansion while leaving a traceable reserve for repairs."
	quest.59B4135BF5B6003B.title: "Stock Certus for Network Work"
	quest.59B66BAB8353746A.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one Stellaris martian raptor on prepared ground."
		"Keep the fight away from fuel and oxygen equipment, and retain a clear retreat to shelter."
	]
	quest.59B66BAB8353746A.quest_subtitle: "A Martian raptor tests whether the cargo route can defend itself without endangering the vehicle."
	quest.59B66BAB8353746A.title: "Martian Raptor Line"
	quest.59F3F05ADF536763.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen cabbages and a Farmer’s Delight cooking pot."
		"Cook or preserve the oldest food first and keep new harvests in separate storage."
	]
	quest.59F3F05ADF536763.quest_subtitle: "A sixteen-cabbage batch beside a cooking pot makes spoilage visible before the whole harvest is committed."
	quest.59F3F05ADF536763.title: "Ration Spoilage Ledger"
	quest.5A2A4E409C2F6F47.quest_desc: [
		"Stock thirty-two machine-grade CBC bronze ingots."
		"Maintain the three-copper-to-one-tin input ratio and preserve enough fuel to repeat the heated casts."
	]
	quest.5A2A4E409C2F6F47.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two CBC bronze ingots make the steam transition a production order, not a trophy craft."
	quest.5A2A4E409C2F6F47.title: "Build a Bronze Working Reserve"
	quest.5A2EB6CD6F6FA582.quest_desc: ["Use a sharp knife to cut TFC Bluegrass for Belladonna and Mandrake seeds, Orchard Grass for Wolfsbane and Enchanted Garlic, and Timothy Grass for Snowbell seeds. These are rare additional drops; retain the first seed stock.","Water Artichoke seeds come from TFC Cordgrass. Search cold, wet shores and shallow coastal water with provisions and a boat. Each grass keeps its native climate and growing conditions.","Renew the collected stock through the displayed bone-meal crafting recipes. Grind bones in a TFC quern with a handstone; Belladonna seeds and bone meal make flowers for the first handwritten Esoteric Records. Keep seed stock while making the research samples.","This is an optional discipline at this age; the canonical factory proofs govern normal progression. Its later occult synthesis remains part of the established final convergence."]
	quest.5A2EB6CD6F6FA582.quest_subtitle: "Natural reagents make magic part of the world before formal apparatus exists."
	quest.5A2EB6CD6F6FA582.title: "TFC Folk Magic — Witch Plant Ecology"
	quest.5A33146AF171CBC4.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement ZPM motors, pumps, robot arms, sensors, emitters, and field generators for superconductors, fusion, and quantum machinery, then verify the LUV line still operates."]
	quest.5A33146AF171CBC4.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.5A33146AF171CBC4.title: "ZPM Recovery Proof"
	quest.5A46D3F5DE411C46.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen neutron piles and two crystalborn catalysts."
		"Keep catalyst provenance recorded and do not let automation consume the final reference sample."
	]
	quest.5A46D3F5DE411C46.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen neutron piles and two catalysts make slow production and rare evidence independently buffered."
	quest.5A46D3F5DE411C46.title: "Stage Three-Shift Astral Stock"
	quest.5A481A4B9180CB79.quest_desc: [
		"Stock thirty-two Electro Energetics wires and retain an MI large steam boiler."
		"Route conductors clear of heat and leave space to isolate turbine, boiler, and grid independently."
	]
	quest.5A481A4B9180CB79.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two wires beside the large boiler keep steam generation and electrical repair visibly connected but mechanically separate."
	quest.5A481A4B9180CB79.title: "Stock the Boiler-Grid Interface"
	quest.5A910FB4E59F90F7.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen advanced pressurized tubes and eight MI titanium ingots."
		"Keep the pressure upgrade materials and full titanium chain available to replace both batches."
	]
	quest.5A910FB4E59F90F7.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen advanced tubes and eight ingots give the pressure works an honest expansion reserve."
	quest.5A910FB4E59F90F7.title: "Buffer Pressure and Titanium Parts"
	quest.5AA41D0617CBBBE9.quest_desc: [
		"Build an AE2 Controller and place it in the production network."
		"Map channel demand, protect power, and confirm automation can fail without trapping every stored part."
	]
	quest.5AA41D0617CBBBE9.quest_subtitle: "The AE2 Controller completes a network whose channels, power, storage, and crafting have already been tested."
	quest.5AA41D0617CBBBE9.title: "Commission the Digital Factory"
	quest.5AEC2B2E137549DE.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Rocketnautics thruster mounts and produce eight Stellaris desh ingots."
		"Run Moon ore through MI maceration and the coke-fed blast furnace, then replenish the returned stock."
	]
	quest.5AEC2B2E137549DE.quest_subtitle: "Two mounts and eight finished desh ingots show the aerospace line can repeat after the first discovery batch."
	quest.5AEC2B2E137549DE.title: "Repeat the Return-Metal Line"
	quest.5B23332B2C0F9C87.quest_desc: ["Stage a Create steam engine at the dock, commission the powered service boat, move a bulk manifest, unload it, and retain black-start fuel and repair stock."]
	quest.5B23332B2C0F9C87.quest_subtitle: "The Bronze Steam works now powers a real bulk-water service route."
	quest.5B23332B2C0F9C87.title: "Steam on Water"
	quest.5B6DB28CBE032422.quest_desc: [
		"Craft and store eight AE2 blank patterns."
		"Keep a written or physical record of critical processing routes so a corrupted pattern is not the only copy of factory knowledge."
	]
	quest.5B6DB28CBE032422.quest_subtitle: "Eight blank patterns let lost or changed recipes be rebuilt without depending on the network that failed."
	quest.5B6DB28CBE032422.title: "Keep Blank Recovery Patterns"
	quest.5BA9C03408072793.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Electro Energetics fuse holder after the fault-protection branch."
		"Confirm the cause is removed, replace protection with the correct rating, and re-energize one branch at a time."
		"Use the meter to verify isolation before repair and expected voltage after the controlled restart."
	]
	quest.5BA9C03408072793.quest_subtitle: "A correctly rated fuse, a repaired load, and verified isolation make the branch safe to energize again."
	quest.5BA9C03408072793.title: "Verify Protection After an Outage"
	quest.5BB000DBC5E608BE.quest_desc: [
		"Locate an Eternal Starlight Golem Forge and return safely."
		"Prepare for hostile contact and keep enough storage to recover a starcore or other legitimate sample."
	]
	quest.5BB000DBC5E608BE.quest_subtitle: "The Golem Forge is a research site only after its approaches, exits, and cargo route are secure."
	quest.5BB000DBC5E608BE.title: "Golem Forge Recon"
	quest.5BD282C09664750D.quest_desc: [
		"Produce Medium Covalence Dust through the established reclamation chain and reserve it for repair rather than ordinary bulk production."
		"Close the experiment by accounting for every input, useful output, and loss; repeated direct factory production must remain more efficient than conversion."
	]
	quest.5BD282C09664750D.quest_subtitle: "A closed exchange loop is measured by what it loses as well as what it recovers."
	quest.5BD282C09664750D.title: "Close the Matter-Exchange Loop"
	quest.5BE4A562ABFBD6D3.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four MI singularities and four crystal-matrix ingots."
		"Keep both batches labeled by source and outside any recipe that has not been deliberately queued."
	]
	quest.5BE4A562ABFBD6D3.quest_subtitle: "Four singularities and four matrix ingots form a recoverable holding set for the convergence table."
	quest.5BE4A562ABFBD6D3.title: "Singularity Holding Cell"
	quest.5BE6ABA8A135CE85.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement UXV motors, pumps, robot arms, sensors, emitters, and field generators for extreme system-scale machinery, then verify the UIV line still operates."]
	quest.5BE6ABA8A135CE85.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.5BE6ABA8A135CE85.title: "UXV Recovery Proof"
	quest.5BEBDB186267F183.quest_desc: [
		"Store eight Electro Energetics wire connectors with eight MI aluminum ingots."
		"Keep them near the expansion route while preserving separate emergency connector stock."
	]
	quest.5BEBDB186267F183.quest_subtitle: "Eight connectors and aluminum ingots make one documented expansion drum for the next MV branch."
	quest.5BEBDB186267F183.title: "Grid Connector Drum"
	quest.5BEC7BB0801E27B3.quest_desc: [
		"Shape and pit-fire the vessel assigned to bulk carrying work."
		"Use it to separate food or field supplies, and avoid carrying more than you can return with safely."
	]
	quest.5BEC7BB0801E27B3.quest_subtitle: "A fired vessel protects a small supply; an unfired one is still only shaped clay."
	quest.5BEC7BB0801E27B3.title: "Fire a Carrying Vessel"
	quest.5C137E3D516892C6.quest_desc: [
		"Observe the placed bronze mixer through another production cycle."
		"Load a balanced recipe, provide output storage, and confirm steam remains stable through the whole run."
	]
	quest.5C137E3D516892C6.quest_subtitle: "A mixer earns floor space by completing a useful batch without hand-clearing its output."
	quest.5C137E3D516892C6.title: "Watch the Bronze Mixer Run"
	quest.5C175EFA0D60C2A6.quest_desc: [
		"Build and place an AE2 energy acceptor."
		"Connect a protected power source and confirm devices remain available under normal factory load."
	]
	quest.5C175EFA0D60C2A6.quest_subtitle: "An energy acceptor makes the network responsible to the factory grid before terminals and automation depend on it."
	quest.5C175EFA0D60C2A6.title: "Power the First Network"
	quest.5C4EFD1F1012406C.quest_desc: [
		"Build and stage a Mekanism hazmat gown."
		"Pair it with meters, the rest of the PPE set, medicine, a short access plan, and a retreat route; shut down first."
	]
	quest.5C4EFD1F1012406C.quest_subtitle: "A hazmat chestplate is part of emergency access, not permission to remain beside a failing reactor."
	quest.5C4EFD1F1012406C.title: "Decay-Heat Emergency Safety Test"
	quest.5C5A4F2552C56231.quest_desc: [
		"Complete MI’s LV steam-turbine advancement with the live Electro Energetics-integrated recipe."
		"Connect the turbine to steam, storage, and a useful LV load so possession matches actual commissioning."
	]
	quest.5C5A4F2552C56231.quest_subtitle: "The turbine advancement records the moment steam generation becomes an installed electrical system."
	quest.5C5A4F2552C56231.title: "LV Turbine Black Start"
	quest.5C7D89A29C0FA9AF.quest_desc: [
		"Build the first matched pair of Rocketnautics booster thrusters."
		"Mechanical crafting consumes large titanium plate, digital control, casing, rocket upgrade, nozzle, pump, iridium, and elite control; stage every input first."
	]
	quest.5C7D89A29C0FA9AF.quest_subtitle: "A matched booster pair turns high thrust into controllable spacecraft hardware."
	quest.5C7D89A29C0FA9AF.title: "Build the First Booster Thruster Pair"
	quest.5CF5229278545894.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare four TFC Items leather sheets and sixteen plant fibers when the required animals and plants are available."
		"Keep the fiber dry and reserve the sheets for equipment repair rather than treating this side contract as main progression."
	]
	quest.5CF5229278545894.quest_subtitle: "A repair shelf is useful, but it is not a First Shift progression gate."
	quest.5CF5229278545894.title: "Leather and Fiber Stock"
	quest.5D2466F7486AD9EC.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight copper nozzles and four mixed iridium ingots."
		"Keep the crate at the freight yard and document which parts are flight-ready or still awaiting separation."
	]
	quest.5D2466F7486AD9EC.quest_subtitle: "Eight copper nozzles and mixed iridium make a practical crate for propulsion service and sensor contacts."
	quest.5D2466F7486AD9EC.title: "Copper Nozzle Crate"
	quest.5D335A7E21B7C901.quest_desc: [
		"Pressure is an environmental hazard before it becomes a high-pressure factory discipline."
		"Carry a fathometer, test a copper pressurizer, and plumb a ballast tank before taking a work crew below the bright-water limit."
		"Descend in stages, watch the depth reading, keep a clear ascent route, and surface before hull damage or exhausted air turns the return into an emergency."
	]
	quest.5D335A7E21B7C901.quest_subtitle: "Measure depth, rate the hull, and plan ballast and ascent before the first working dive."
	quest.5D335A7E21B7C901.title: "Survey the Safe Depth"
	quest.5D3CBC6B00B0C010.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an MI steel machine casing."
		"Measure service clearance around it and make sure adjacent routes do not require dismantling the district."
	]
	quest.5D3CBC6B00B0C010.quest_subtitle: "A placed steel casing gives the office a real module size for access aisles and replacement paths."
	quest.5D3CBC6B00B0C010.title: "Megaproject Office Unattended Run"
	quest.5D5DA5F5BCE83015.quest_desc: ["Stage the listed UHV reserve for ultra-high-energy field systems; keep the batch outside automatic consumption so expansion does not erase repair stock."]
	quest.5D5DA5F5BCE83015.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.5D5DA5F5BCE83015.title: "UHV Production Cell"
	quest.5D76028168F81D74.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer two thousand millibuckets of MI helium plasma."
		"Buffer it after the plasma turbine branch; UU Matter and naquadah synthesis both require a reliable draw."
	]
	quest.5D76028168F81D74.quest_subtitle: "Helium plasma is both fusion exhaust and a reagent for controlled matter engineering."
	quest.5D76028168F81D74.title: "Helium Plasma Throat"
	quest.5D7D800EE61CDEA7.quest_desc: [
		"Build a road vehicle from a portable engine, steering/control hardware, cargo body, and serviceable wheels."
		"Drive it manually, carry a useful load, stop safely, repair it, and recover it without command movement."
	]
	quest.5D7D800EE61CDEA7.quest_subtitle: "Heavy-industry road transport is a maintained physical contraption."
	quest.5D7D800EE61CDEA7.title: "The Motor Car"
	quest.5D81E2680262C989.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger Re:Avaritia’s Infinity Sword advancement."
		"Test it away from fragile builds and remember that completion no longer requires proving power on everything nearby."
	]
	quest.5D81E2680262C989.quest_subtitle: "The blade pilgrimage is a final craft followed by a choice of where such power should be carried."
	quest.5D81E2680262C989.title: "Infinity Blade Pilgrimage"
	quest.5DDEFF9C97845043.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen basic pressurized tubes and keep the electrolytic separator ready."
		"Build short labeled runs and avoid placing unrelated hydrogen, oxygen, or slurry on one network."
	]
	quest.5DDEFF9C97845043.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen tubes between storage and separation establish a pressure route that can be followed by eye."
	quest.5DDEFF9C97845043.title: "Pressurized Tube Spool"
	quest.5DEA47ABCA50B93A.quest_desc: [
		"Observe the fuel refinery while it completes a real conversion cycle."
		"Start with labeled TFMG fuel, provide empty Stellaris-fuel storage, and confirm LV power remains stable until output stops."
	]
	quest.5DEA47ABCA50B93A.quest_subtitle: "A complete refining cycle proves the launch tank can be filled again after the rocket leaves."
	quest.5DEA47ABCA50B93A.title: "Run a Full Fuel-Refining Cycle"
	quest.5E1702E434DCC9BB.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four AE2 logic processors with the pack’s inscriber recipes."
		"Keep the logic and silicon presses installed, supply redstone, and route printed parts without mixing processor stages."
	]
	quest.5E1702E434DCC9BB.quest_subtitle: "Four logic processors prove the inscriber can repeat every printed and final pressing step."
	quest.5E1702E434DCC9BB.title: "Press Logic Processors"
	quest.5E3F772C7739928D.quest_desc: ["Build a Stellaris rocket through the current pack recipe.","Do not load it until launch fuel, oxygen, destination supplies, and a return reserve are separate and accounted for.","Mechanical commissioning: the final rocket press operation requires Steel Greate or higher. The terrestrial foundry can finish the first rocket before any returned-space aluminum machinery exists."]
	quest.5E3F772C7739928D.quest_subtitle: "The first complete rocket makes distance a planning problem rather than an edge of the map."
	quest.5E3F772C7739928D.title: "Assemble the Rocket"
	quest.5E5E16BD637676D3.quest_desc: ["Build eight Greate andesite-alloy cogwheels and use them in a working transmission.","The lowest-capacity connected Greate part limits the whole network. Andesite supports 8 SU, steel 32 SU, and aluminum 128 SU. Use independently driven workshop cells; upgrade the shafts and machines of a shared line together as it grows. Watch rotation, stress, direction, and shutdown before coupling electrical generation."]
	quest.5E5E16BD637676D3.quest_subtitle: "Eight cogwheels make mechanical power visible enough to measure before electricity is asked to carry it elsewhere."
	quest.5E5E16BD637676D3.title: "Mechanical Power First"
	quest.5E770C329769B278.quest_desc: [
		"Build 16 oak support."
		"Saw the lumber and brace the active copper workings before following the vein beyond supported ground."
	]
	quest.5E770C329769B278.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen supports mean the next tunnel can be braced before the ceiling complains."
	quest.5E770C329769B278.title: "Support the Copper Workings"
	quest.5E86A579AC795C89.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer four thousand millibuckets of UU Matter."
		"Meter the singularity process and isolate this tank from optional replicator orders."
	]
	quest.5E86A579AC795C89.quest_subtitle: "Four buckets of UU Matter make replication a scheduled input to convergence, not an invisible convenience."
	quest.5E86A579AC795C89.title: "UU Matter Intake"
	quest.5EB8ABD694C9AFE7.quest_desc: [
		"Hold four cured Rubberworks sheets in protected maintenance stock."
		"Replace the resin and raw rubber used so this reserve does not mark an empty plantation line."
	]
	quest.5EB8ABD694C9AFE7.quest_subtitle: "Four rubber sheets are a modest seal reserve after the production line has already been proven."
	quest.5EB8ABD694C9AFE7.title: "Rubber Sheet Reserve"
	quest.5EC0A201D5233C26.quest_desc: [
		"Retain sixteen stainless-steel ingots and eight Digital Circuits from the live Age 10 factory."
		"Titanium remains reserved for the chloride, vacuum, and high-pressure campaign in Age 11."
	]
	quest.5EC0A201D5233C26.quest_subtitle: "Stainless metallurgy and digital batches qualify the Age 10 factory without leaking titanium backward."
	quest.5EC0A201D5233C26.title: "Material Epoch V — Chemical and Digital Qualification"
	quest.5EEBD2C60D7D028F.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and hold 16,000 mB of Stellaris fuel."
		"The live bridge accepts established TFMG kerosene, gasoline, or diesel; store the result in a labeled tank rather than loose buckets."
	]
	quest.5EEBD2C60D7D028F.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of propellant provide a measured reserve for launch, correction, and return."
	quest.5EEBD2C60D7D028F.title: "Fuel Reserve"
	quest.5EF4C0F6DCF7ED00.quest_desc: ["Calibrate four Machine Chainer Relays against a built Chainer using the existing circuit, motor, sensor and cable lines plus a Greate aluminum gearbox. The calibration Chainer is retained.","Place relays at serviceable boundaries between machine banks. Keep local isolation, labeled buffers and manual restart access as the coordinated floor expands."]
	quest.5EF4C0F6DCF7ED00.quest_subtitle: "Relays extend a chainer across a real factory floor while preserving visible, serviceable machine cells."
	quest.5EF4C0F6DCF7ED00.title: "Lay Out Chainer Relays"
	quest.5F00CA539F005BF4.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger AE2’s Controller advancement through the installed network."
		"Inspect channel use under real load and leave room for a serviceable controller shape."
	]
	quest.5F00CA539F005BF4.quest_subtitle: "The Controller advancement records a channel-managed network rather than a block held for the capstone."
	quest.5F00CA539F005BF4.title: "Controller Choir"
	quest.5F235D88F7CE1D48.quest_desc: [
		"Build and reserve two Stellaris big oxygen tanks."
		"Keep them full, independent from routine use, and stored with a repair kit and return fuel."
	]
	quest.5F235D88F7CE1D48.quest_subtitle: "Two large oxygen tanks turn a stranded mission from a countdown into a rescue window."
	quest.5F235D88F7CE1D48.title: "Stranded Mission Safety Test"
	quest.5F29DDC0BCB7DDB7.quest_desc: [
		"After the abort inspection, stock two Stellaris oxygen tanks and eight desh ingots."
		"Simulate loss of station power and identify what remains reachable without powered doors, pumps, or network storage."
	]
	quest.5F29DDC0BCB7DDB7.quest_subtitle: "Two oxygen tanks and eight desh ingots preserve breathing time and critical repair metal when station power goes dark."
	quest.5F29DDC0BCB7DDB7.title: "Run the Blackout Drill"
	quest.5F310679FC0FC1DA.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight platinum plates and retain three iridium ingots."
		"Store the metals by function and preserve mixed concentrate for the next separation campaign."
	]
	quest.5F310679FC0FC1DA.quest_subtitle: "Platinum plate and iridium stock turn PGM chemistry into durable electrical contacts for several systems."
	quest.5F310679FC0FC1DA.title: "Platinum Contact Stock"
	quest.5F536BC6E2BC2F1B.quest_desc: [
		"Build another advanced pump and keep eight Electro Energetics wire connectors."
		"Replenish aluminum rotors, bolts, motor parts, pipes, tharsite, and lubricant after the batch."
	]
	quest.5F536BC6E2BC2F1B.quest_subtitle: "A replacement pump and connector set let chemistry expand without consuming the recovery shelf."
	quest.5F536BC6E2BC2F1B.title: "Prepare the Second MV Shift"
	quest.5F55C63D125EE1C9.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Electro Energetics battery through its sequenced live recipe."
		"Install protection close to storage and include the battery in every shutdown procedure."
	]
	quest.5F55C63D125EE1C9.quest_subtitle: "A battery smooths supply, but it also keeps a fault energized after the generator is silent."
	quest.5F55C63D125EE1C9.title: "Batteries and Buffers"
	quest.5F76C355880F605C.quest_desc: ["Build the steel upgrade from the approved steel chain; it confirms steam machinery, rail stock, mechanisms, maintenance, and locomotive work share one replaceable supply.", "Durable steel machinery and serviced freight terminals turn small hauling into repeatable bulk transport."]
	quest.5F76C355880F605C.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 5 PROOF — Steel Steam"
	quest.5F76C355880F605C.title: "Steel and Railway Works Proven"
	quest.5F836AC2A24B786A.quest_desc: [
		"Restore the fuel shelf to at least sixteen charcoal."
		"If the first pit barely met the target, expand wood gathering before metal and steam work increase demand."
	]
	quest.5F836AC2A24B786A.quest_subtitle: "A reserve only counts if you know how to replace what the last job consumed."
	quest.5F836AC2A24B786A.title: "Rebuild the Charcoal Stock"
	quest.5F90907F5AA36853.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger Create’s track-signal advancement through an installed signal."
		"Test the protected section with real movement and inspect both approaches."
	]
	quest.5F90907F5AA36853.quest_subtitle: "Signal certification proves the route has at least one block boundary trains can obey."
	quest.5F90907F5AA36853.title: "Signal Certification"
	quest.5F9A23F6C80701FB.quest_desc: ["This is a mature LV/MV component standard: its silicone and control suppliers follow Chemical Industry. Machine voltage labels do not make it a pre-space bootstrap requirement."]
	quest.5F9A23F6C80701FB.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.5F9A23F6C80701FB.title: "LV Recovery Proof"
	quest.5FA54C671621A36D.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 10 opens, build sixteen CC:Tweaked network cables."
		"Lay them along serviceable paths and label the computers, wired modems, sensors, and controlled faces they connect."
	]
	quest.5FA54C671621A36D.quest_subtitle: "CC networking and Synaxis control cable carry bounded commands without becoming an item-transport shortcut."
	quest.5FA54C671621A36D.title: "Stock Networking and Control Cable"
	quest.5FCF62A158490A1A.quest_desc: [
		"Complete the Stellaris Moon-landing advancement through an actual launch."
		"Before exploring, mark the vehicle, check oxygen and return fuel, and reserve cargo space for planetary ore."
	]
	quest.5FCF62A158490A1A.quest_subtitle: "The first footprint on Moon dust is a beginning; the return manifest decides whether it changed the factory."
	quest.5FCF62A158490A1A.title: "Moon Dust Claim"
	quest.5FE2FB7C29E62744.quest_desc: [
		"Fire two TFC large vessels."
		"Label or position them by use so preserved food, seed, and emergency stock remain distinct."
	]
	quest.5FE2FB7C29E62744.quest_subtitle: "Two large vessels let the pantry rotate fresh stock without mixing it into the oldest batch."
	quest.5FE2FB7C29E62744.title: "Large Vessel Pantry"
	quest.5FE8E914F9F49D37.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Alchemistry dissolver and run an appropriate installed recipe."
		"Provide output storage for every element produced and keep the machine on the optional laboratory branch."
	]
	quest.5FE8E914F9F49D37.quest_subtitle: "The dissolver breaks a known material into controlled element output instead of pretending transmutation is free."
	quest.5FE8E914F9F49D37.title: "Dissolver Bench"
	quest.5FE988C5C16F8E24.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the Stellaris pumpjack at a surveyed deposit."
		"Provide power, crude transport, shutoff, and enough buffer to stop extraction before overflow."
	]
	quest.5FE988C5C16F8E24.quest_subtitle: "A pumpjack is useful only when crude leaves the well through a bounded route to protected storage."
	quest.5FE988C5C16F8E24.title: "Pumpjack Route"
	quest.5FF3ADE6863D1D7B.quest_desc: [
		"Stage four Stellaris rocket fins and eight raw desh ingots."
		"Inspect every fin after landing and keep raw planetary material labeled until its MI processing route is ready."
	]
	quest.5FF3ADE6863D1D7B.quest_subtitle: "Four aligned fins and returned concentrate prepare the rocket without consuming the repair reserve."
	quest.5FF3ADE6863D1D7B.title: "Fin Alignment Rack"
	quest.604CF5DB4D097AAB.quest_desc: [
		"Build another Stellaris rocket engine from its live LV components."
		"The engine consumes MI motor and pump work, a TFMG steel mechanism and heavy plates, Stellaris fans and battery; replenish each source afterward."
	]
	quest.604CF5DB4D097AAB.quest_subtitle: "A second engine means the launch schedule can survive one damaged machine."
	quest.604CF5DB4D097AAB.title: "Build a Replacement Engine"
	quest.6072DCC0BCE6508E.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Water Flasks leather flask for the recovery cache."
		"Store it filled beside route notes, food, and replacement clothing."
	]
	quest.6072DCC0BCE6508E.quest_subtitle: "A spare flask is the smallest field recovery kit that still addresses the most immediate travel risk."
	quest.6072DCC0BCE6508E.title: "Field Recovery Kit"
	quest.6099F0FF13DACA8E.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen MI steel plates and eight bronze gears."
		"Assign the parts to documented failure modes and replenish them after a repair."
	]
	quest.6099F0FF13DACA8E.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen steel plates and eight bronze gears repair ordinary modules without warehousing an entire chemical machine."
	quest.6099F0FF13DACA8E.title: "Stock Structural Repair Parts"
	quest.60DFC6D2D8E9A9B3.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four 1k cell components and sixteen Fluix glass cables."
		"Install only after reviewing type pressure, channel use, and backup access."
	]
	quest.60DFC6D2D8E9A9B3.quest_subtitle: "Four cell components and sixteen cables keep basic storage expansion grounded in visible parts and routes."
	quest.60DFC6D2D8E9A9B3.title: "Cell Component Bin"
	quest.60FBA06283CBA3FC.quest_desc: [
		"Craft Supplementaries rope."
		"Store enough near the freight yard for barriers, access, or replacement rigging."
	]
	quest.60FBA06283CBA3FC.quest_subtitle: "Spare rope belongs where carts, docks, and vertical routes can all reach it during repair."
	quest.60FBA06283CBA3FC.title: "Rope and Pulley Stores"
	quest.614EAE44EB28E3D1.quest_desc: ["Process and reserve a standardized aluminum batch and keep the predecessor line available for black start."]
	quest.614EAE44EB28E3D1.quest_subtitle: "Electric machines improve automation, recovery, and consistency together."
	quest.614EAE44EB28E3D1.title: "Material Epoch IV — Standard Electric Processing"
	quest.615E2BC37267A6CD.quest_desc: ["Build an Arcana Pylon and keep expanding the laboratory.","The pylon is evidence of mature research infrastructure, not a consumable token.","Optional during normal age progression. Esoteric evidence becomes required only at final Reality Engineering through ESO-04 to FRN-06."]
	quest.615E2BC37267A6CD.quest_subtitle: "Advanced focusing keeps Malum relevant as technology accelerates."
	quest.615E2BC37267A6CD.title: "Advanced Spirit Focusing"
	quest.6176537D8499A14D.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen Stellaris tier-one pipes and sixteen cured natural-rubber sheets."
		"Isolate and drain the line before replacement, then correct support or pressure conditions that caused the leak."
	]
	quest.6176537D8499A14D.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen pipes and sixteen rubber sheets make a leak patrol capable of replacing a full short run and its seals."
	quest.6176537D8499A14D.title: "Pipe Leak Patrol"
	quest.6182F31656AEB322.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s welding advancement with heated metal and flux at the anvil."
		"Stage the flux first so both workpieces reach the weld before either drops below working temperature."
	]
	quest.6182F31656AEB322.quest_subtitle: "A sound weld is the moment separate castings become workshop-scale material."
	quest.6182F31656AEB322.title: "Prove Copper Welding"
	quest.61B7F588D897BF10.quest_desc: [
		"Stock two advanced item input hatches, two advanced item output hatches, and four servos after the Large Electric Macerator is operating."
		"Keep this reserve outside the active cell so a failed hatch can be isolated and replaced without cannibalizing the only scaled line."
	]
	quest.61B7F588D897BF10.quest_subtitle: "Four staged hatches let a mass-processing cell be repaired or expanded without cannibalizing the only working line."
	quest.61B7F588D897BF10.title: "Stage Array Input and Output"
	quest.61E5A29E21AE2F0A.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen AE2 logic processors."
		"Run silicon, logic print, and redstone assembly from replenished inputs."
	]
	quest.61E5A29E21AE2F0A.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen logic processors are enough for a real network build and expose whether the inscriber can sustain component demand."
	quest.61E5A29E21AE2F0A.title: "Logic Processor Batch"
	quest.61E5F9125B8ACB81.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen bronze rings and sixteen bronze bolts together."
		"Keep the bin beside pumps and pipe junctions, but outside the boiler’s hot work zone."
	]
	quest.61E5F9125B8ACB81.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen rings and bolts put common steam repairs within one inventory reach."
	quest.61E5F9125B8ACB81.title: "Seal and Fastener Bin"
	quest.62180C64B706A3B7.quest_desc: [
		"Build a second basin and mechanical press for parallel work."
		"Feed it from the same power network only after confirming the combined stress demand stays below capacity."
	]
	quest.62180C64B706A3B7.quest_subtitle: "A duplicate press station separates ordinary forming from the foundry’s bottleneck."
	quest.62180C64B706A3B7.title: "Duplicate the Pressing Line"
	quest.62195E9FD974083C.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight MI aluminum plates and eight Electro Energetics wire connectors."
		"Keep the matched batch beside the planned branch while preserving separate stock for existing LV and MV repairs."
	]
	quest.62195E9FD974083C.quest_subtitle: "Eight aluminum plates and eight connectors form a compact reserve for one serviceable MV branch."
	quest.62195E9FD974083C.title: "Aluminum Plate Reserve"
	quest.62213B4CE40ABCD5.quest_desc: [
		"Converge native Tarot, ProjectE, Psi, and Occultism progress in a high-cost Malum experiment."
		"The Paracausal Flame represents both branch mastery and quantum-era research."
	]
	quest.62213B4CE40ABCD5.quest_subtitle: "Mind and matter yield only when independent disciplines meet advanced spirit study."
	quest.62213B4CE40ABCD5.title: "Age 15 — Perfected Mind and Matter"
	quest.626EE136BB994131.quest_desc: [
		"Build Parcool zipline rope."
		"Choose solid anchors, clear both approaches, and keep a walking route available if the line cannot be used."
	]
	quest.626EE136BB994131.quest_subtitle: "A zipline route trades a steep climb for a line whose anchors and landing must be trusted."
	quest.626EE136BB994131.title: "Rope Route Across the Scar"
	quest.629913687BB9B536.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare thirty-two TFMG fireclay balls through the installed recipe."
		"Dry and store them before assembling the structure that will consume them."
	]
	quest.629913687BB9B536.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two dried fireclay forms a deliberate working batch for the next refractory job."
	quest.629913687BB9B536.title: "Dry a Fireclay Working Batch"
	quest.629FCA4E4944846C.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare eight Low Covalence Dust as a bounded reclamation experiment using matter already established by the factory."
		"Record the sacrificed inputs and recovered value. This preview teaches repair and material mismatch; it does not authorize passive EMC generation or machine transmutation."
	]
	quest.629FCA4E4944846C.quest_subtitle: "Covalence begins as accountable reclamation, not free matter."
	quest.629FCA4E4944846C.title: "Covalence Reclamation Experiment"
	quest.62B9EF167A006F54.quest_desc: ["Stage the listed IV reserve for reactor control and turbine operations; keep the batch outside automatic consumption so expansion does not erase repair stock."]
	quest.62B9EF167A006F54.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.62B9EF167A006F54.title: "IV Production Cell"
	quest.62D0478F27C15E4D.quest_desc: [
		"Harvest and hold eight Farmer’s Delight cabbages."
		"Leave seed and planting capacity for the next season before cooking the batch."
	]
	quest.62D0478F27C15E4D.quest_subtitle: "Eight cabbages prove the garden can supply a meal line rather than one demonstration crop."
	quest.62D0478F27C15E4D.title: "Harvest a Cabbage Batch"
	quest.62EF95F0665FE5FC.quest_desc: [
		"Build eight Cargo Boats buoys."
		"Space them by navigation need and confirm the chain remains visible in poor conditions."
	]
	quest.62EF95F0665FE5FC.quest_subtitle: "Eight buoys can mark a channel from open water through hazards to the unloading face."
	quest.62EF95F0665FE5FC.title: "Buoy Chain Reserve"
	quest.62F8AD59DE2C5D34.quest_desc: [
		"Build an MI LV diesel generator and stock sixteen Electro Energetics wires."
		"Connect a protected working load and observe the system during start, steady operation, and shutdown."
	]
	quest.62F8AD59DE2C5D34.quest_subtitle: "An LV diesel generator and sixteen wires demonstrate fuel, generation, distribution, and load as one circuit."
	quest.62F8AD59DE2C5D34.title: "Run Diesel Through the Yard"
	quest.63625CA3D276D45B.quest_desc: [
		"Demonstrate fifty million FE of connected storage."
		"Place isolation and shutdown controls where a failing reactor circuit cannot also remove the reserve that keeps it safe."
	]
	quest.63625CA3D276D45B.quest_subtitle: "A fusion safety plan begins with enough stored energy to hold control while generation is unavailable."
	quest.63625CA3D276D45B.title: "Reserve Confinement Power"
	quest.6372E877D111F349.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Firmalife climate station and stock thirty-two charcoal."
		"Use the readings to schedule fields, preserve food, and maintain a warm recovery shelter."
	]
	quest.6372E877D111F349.quest_subtitle: "Climate records and replaceable fuel make the settlement answer weather with preparation instead of luck."
	quest.6372E877D111F349.title: "Commission the Seasonal Homestead"
	quest.63847E2A36130A85.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the Mekanism Fission Reactor Logic Adapter and build four CROWNS heat exchangers."
		"Use a validated geometry, watch heat and radiation, preserve shutdown access, and stop before any limit is approached."
	]
	quest.63847E2A36130A85.quest_subtitle: "An inspected controller and a four-sink cooling batch turn continuous operation into something that can be checked and repeated."
	quest.63847E2A36130A85.title: "Observe a Sustained Fission Run"
	quest.6391FE6B21D318A1.quest_desc: ["Produce a real low-covalence batch from established matter; keep source stock for recovery."]
	quest.6391FE6B21D318A1.quest_subtitle: "Transmutation begins only after electrical standardization."
	quest.6391FE6B21D318A1.title: "Covalence I — Accountable Matter"
	quest.63D75FA324FEE136.quest_desc: [
		"Run the seeded Naquadah Assembler batch, then scale Crystal Bases and Control Crystals."
		"The mature Naquadah line keeps Superconductor, Thioquartz, Soul Dew, helium plasma, acid, and a retained refined seed; its advantage is yield and automation rather than reagent recovery."
	]
	quest.63D75FA324FEE136.quest_subtitle: "Refined Naquadah, Crystal Bases, and control crystals prove a repeatable gate-component shop."
	quest.63D75FA324FEE136.title: "Scale Naquadah and Gate Crystals"
	quest.63DB67C204E66B16.quest_desc: ["Build the authored Ultra Immense Voltage consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.63DB67C204E66B16.quest_subtitle: "The UIV standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.63DB67C204E66B16.title: "UIV Consumer Proof"
	quest.63F0807B067C45F3.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 8,000 mB of MI hydrochloric acid."
		"Keep its tank and piping separate from other acids and provide a controlled destination before production begins."
	]
	quest.63F0807B067C45F3.quest_subtitle: "A buffered hydrochloric-acid bath prepares cleaning and synthesis without borrowing the sulfuric line."
	quest.63F0807B067C45F3.title: "Hydrochloric Acid Bath"
	quest.640AAE45E0A63A60.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare thirty-two CBC casting sand through the installed recipe."
		"Keep it beside the casting area and away from ordinary building sand so mold repair stays predictable."
	]
	quest.640AAE45E0A63A60.quest_subtitle: "Casting sand is cheap only when the mold floor never runs out mid-pour."
	quest.640AAE45E0A63A60.title: "Fill the Casting-Sand Bin"
	quest.642DCD7C4C3B1A3D.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one Eternal Starlight Seeker."
		"Secure the immediate area, retain a retreat route, and treat the kill as hazard knowledge rather than routine hunting."
	]
	quest.642DCD7C4C3B1A3D.quest_subtitle: "A Seeker punishes attention fixed on the horizon; alien fieldwork needs security in every direction."
	quest.642DCD7C4C3B1A3D.title: "Survive the Seeker Ambush"
	quest.6440091BAEB4298E.quest_desc: ["Build all eight UHV functional families and verify that each recipe consumes its matching UV component; this prepares ultra-high-energy field systems."]
	quest.6440091BAEB4298E.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Ultra High Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.6440091BAEB4298E.title: "UHV Component Standard"
	quest.646C5F4F3861467B.quest_desc: ["Produce Ferricore through controlled alloying and retain a replacement batch."]
	quest.646C5F4F3861467B.quest_subtitle: "JDT begins as low-voltage field engineering, not a new power network."
	quest.646C5F4F3861467B.title: "Ferricore Field Standard"
	quest.647DF447D714E4E6.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Mekanism basic chemical tanks from the live Advanced Electric parts."
		"Label the intended gas and keep at least one tank empty enough to receive material from an isolated machine."
	]
	quest.647DF447D714E4E6.quest_subtitle: "Two empty chemical tanks give gases a safe transfer path during shutdown or recipe changeover."
	quest.647DF447D714E4E6.title: "Stock Chemical Tanks"
	quest.6496D9C84603B12F.quest_desc: [
		"Build copper chisel."
		"Cast the copper chisel head, let it cool, and mount it before testing stone-shaping work."
	]
	quest.6496D9C84603B12F.quest_subtitle: "A copper chisel lets finished stone join timber and ore as planned infrastructure."
	quest.6496D9C84603B12F.title: "Make a Copper Chisel"
	quest.64EE64F3756F90D5.quest_desc: [
		"Keep an MI vacuum freezer and eight titanium ingots as rebuild stock."
		"Warm, isolate, and inspect the failed line before swapping equipment, then restart with empty outputs."
	]
	quest.64EE64F3756F90D5.quest_subtitle: "A spare freezer and eight ingots make cold processing recoverable after a power or seal failure."
	quest.64EE64F3756F90D5.title: "Stage a Vacuum-Line Rebuild"
	quest.65009054BCFD0049.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 14 opens, produce an aethersent ingot through the live seeded route."
		"Preserve the source sample and separate expedition intake from scaled processing."
	]
	quest.65009054BCFD0049.quest_subtitle: "Aethersent extraction becomes a complex when every industrial batch still traces back to a legitimate Starlight discovery."
	quest.65009054BCFD0049.title: "Dimensional Extraction Complex"
	quest.6500CB38EE19DEA1.quest_desc: [
		"Stock two Stellaris oxygen tanks and sixteen raw desh ingots."
		"Keep life-support supplies separate from cargo processing, and do not commit every returned concentrate to the first Advanced Electric recipe."
	]
	quest.6500CB38EE19DEA1.quest_subtitle: "Two oxygen tanks and a raw-desh batch keep the next departure from consuming the last return."
	quest.6500CB38EE19DEA1.title: "Buffer Oxygen and Moon Cargo"
	quest.650A9FC066A0DFF2.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the expansion modular accumulator."
		"Test charge sharing, disconnect each unit in turn, and confirm protected loads remain recoverable."
	]
	quest.650A9FC066A0DFF2.quest_subtitle: "A second accumulator adds resilience only when either unit can be isolated without darkening the controls."
	quest.650A9FC066A0DFF2.title: "Commission the Expanded Storage Bus"
	quest.65160A8144996DE7.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Quantum machine hull and demonstrate one hundred million FE of connected capacity."
		"Shed nonessential loads first and verify the hull’s controls remain on the protected bus."
	]
	quest.65160A8144996DE7.quest_subtitle: "The Quantum floor should survive a brownout without losing the machine that coordinates its recovery."
	quest.65160A8144996DE7.title: "Reality Brownout Drill"
	quest.6545D3E91186EABA.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s pit-kiln advancement by building and firing a proper covered kiln."
		"Do not open the site early; prepare another task while the pottery finishes."
	]
	quest.6545D3E91186EABA.quest_subtitle: "Covering the kiln commits the whole clay batch to heat and patience."
	quest.6545D3E91186EABA.title: "Pit Kiln Rite"
	quest.654E8F3824653BFD.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen Quantum circuits and four crystal-matrix ingots."
		"Replenish the Starlight and circuit chains before releasing this audited lot."
	]
	quest.654E8F3824653BFD.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen Quantum circuits and four matrix ingots keep the final table supplied with precision and structure in equal measure."
	quest.654E8F3824653BFD.title: "Quantum Circuit Reliquary"
	quest.656DE99456CFF645.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four superconductor ingots plus eight buckets each of deuterium and tritium."
		"Keep isotope tanks distinct and verify the Starlight-backed alloy line can replace the ingots consumed by maintenance."
	]
	quest.656DE99456CFF645.quest_subtitle: "Fusion feedstock is ready only when isotopes, superconductors, and their replacement routes are buffered together."
	quest.656DE99456CFF645.title: "Stage Fusion Feedstock from Raw Inputs"
	quest.657F39DC958873DC.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Stellaris fuel module and produce 16,000 mB of Stellaris fuel."
		"Start from the TFMG refinery output already mastered and refill the source-fluid reserve afterward."
		"The quest submission consumes the fuel; refill the working buffer afterward. Its reward is a reusable recovery tool, not replacement components."
	]
	quest.657F39DC958873DC.quest_subtitle: "A fresh fuel module beside 16,000 mB of converted propellant proves the route begins at established petroleum, not reward buckets."
	quest.657F39DC958873DC.title: "Rebuild Fuel Systems from Feedstock"
	quest.6596BA0439C1B1C1.quest_desc: [
		"After the steelworks opens, build an advanced item loader."
		"Align it with a real cart stop, filter the intended cargo, and provide overflow storage."
	]
	quest.6596BA0439C1B1C1.quest_subtitle: "A Railcraft loader makes the station responsible for transfer instead of the driver."
	quest.6596BA0439C1B1C1.title: "Freight Loaders"
	quest.65B755165CC6BAE9.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen CC:Tweaked cables and thirty-two MI bronze plates for a second supervised workcell."
		"Copy the proven alarm and interlock pattern, assign a distinct network identity, and replenish both material lines before expansion consumes the reserve."
	]
	quest.65B755165CC6BAE9.quest_subtitle: "The second cell proves supervision can be repeated without confusing control with transport."
	quest.65B755165CC6BAE9.title: "Second Supervised Workcell"
	quest.65BEF939B50516BD.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the Stellaris rocket station after all three readiness branches are complete."
		"Trace fuel, oxygen, cargo, pad access, and emergency shutdown from one end of the yard to the other."
	]
	quest.65BEF939B50516BD.quest_subtitle: "The expanded rocket station now rests on proven restart, blackout, and reserve procedures."
	quest.65BEF939B50516BD.title: "Commission the Expanded Shipyard"
	quest.65BF748E23159DE8.quest_desc: ["Retain Ferricore, four analog circuits and the Electro Energetics converters for a terrestrial restart kit."]
	quest.65BF748E23159DE8.quest_subtitle: "Ferricore, analog controls and converters form an LV recovery reserve."
	quest.65BF748E23159DE8.title: "Ferricore Recovery Kit"
	quest.65C742774D5BE2B7.quest_desc: ["Stock thirty-two canonical TFC steel ingots and thirty-two MI steel plates.","Maintain the coke, iron, hot-air, casting, and forming inputs that can replace this reserve."]
	quest.65C742774D5BE2B7.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two ingots and plates give the steelworks room to repair, expand, and begin LV preparation."
	quest.65C742774D5BE2B7.title: "Stage a Full Steel Reserve"
	quest.65C9BF96426F1AE1.quest_desc: [
		"Use a Stargate and trigger SGJourney’s crossing advancement."
		"Dial a verified destination, carry independent return supplies, and confirm the far-side gate can be powered."
	]
	quest.65C9BF96426F1AE1.quest_subtitle: "Crossing a manufactured Stargate makes the return address more important than the distance removed."
	quest.65C9BF96426F1AE1.title: "Stargate Crossing"
	quest.65E891D36C209DB6.quest_desc: ["Build and place an Electric Simulation Chamber after the base Hostile Neural Networks route is established.","Provide stable power, prediction-matrix input, and output space before treating the chamber as a production service.","Optional advanced simulation under RSR-01 Resource Simulation. HNI scales the earlier Digital model loop and shares the discipline of contained quarry-bee renewal; first discovery remains physical."]
	quest.65E891D36C209DB6.quest_subtitle: "Powered simulation moves prediction work from hand-carried trials into the automation floor."
	quest.65E891D36C209DB6.title: "Electrify Hostile Simulation"
	quest.65EA4531B2CA6376.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the fission reactor casing while the reactor runs at a deliberately low useful rate."
		"Stand at a safe control point and stop the run if any buffer trends toward exhaustion."
	]
	quest.65EA4531B2CA6376.quest_subtitle: "Inspection under load means watching burn rate, temperature, coolant, steam, waste, and turbine margin together."
	quest.65EA4531B2CA6376.title: "Inspect the Reactor Under Load"
	quest.65F2B32C49A15B81.quest_desc: ["Stage the listed UXV reserve for extreme system-scale machinery; keep the batch outside automatic consumption so expansion does not erase repair stock."]
	quest.65F2B32C49A15B81.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.65F2B32C49A15B81.title: "UXV Production Cell"
	quest.66197D8CF37A3640.quest_desc: [
		"Build an AE2 Spatial IO Port and a 128³ Spatial Cell Component after computerized navigation and returned deep-space samples are established."
		"Map containment boundaries, power loss, recovery, and destination authority. This is spatial theory, not permission to skip first physical arrival."
	]
	quest.66197D8CF37A3640.quest_subtitle: "Spatial storage becomes navigation theory only when containment and return remain physical responsibilities."
	quest.66197D8CF37A3640.title: "Age 11 — Spatial Navigation Theory"
	quest.66210706B4540F10.quest_desc: [
		"Complete the Stellaris Mars-landing advancement through an actual mission."
		"Secure a landing zone and reserve the return supplies before pursuing temple or resource objectives."
	]
	quest.66210706B4540F10.quest_subtitle: "The Mars landing advancement records a route that must still be fueled, supplied, and reversed."
	quest.66210706B4540F10.title: "Mars Red Route"
	quest.66394C6E15E905BA.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Parcool iron zipline hook."
		"Test the line without cargo first, then keep fragile freight off any route with a dangerous landing."
	]
	quest.66394C6E15E905BA.quest_subtitle: "The iron hook turns the rope span into transit only after both ends are safe to mount and leave."
	quest.66394C6E15E905BA.title: "Iron Hook Transit"
	quest.666D3FFD0EBE98F6.quest_desc: [
		"After the Machine Chainer and its relays are proven, place and inspect the full-block AE2 pattern provider."
		"Its recipe consumes Processing control and a calibrated relay; attach it to one known workcell, verify direction and blocking behavior, and keep the physical route visible."
	]
	quest.666D3FFD0EBE98F6.quest_subtitle: "A pattern provider is a promise to deliver ingredients and receive results, not permission to ignore machine access."
	quest.666D3FFD0EBE98F6.title: "Pattern Provider Discipline"
	quest.66DF7791F814FCC2.quest_desc: ["Produce eight medium covalence dust after the Chemical Age theory and material suppliers are available.","This prepares later encoded transmutation; it does not grant first discovery or replace mining and freight."]
	quest.66DF7791F814FCC2.quest_subtitle: "Steel, precision mechanisms, and the grid qualify the medium dust."
	quest.66DF7791F814FCC2.title: "Covalence II — Industrial Matter"
	quest.66F218F5467FCB96.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Mekanism’s advanced-control-circuit advancement through normal infusion."
		"Keep a replacement batch ready before consuming every circuit on expansion."
	]
	quest.66F218F5467FCB96.quest_subtitle: "The advanced-circuit advancement certifies control parts for the more demanding chemical machines ahead."
	quest.66F218F5467FCB96.title: "Advanced Circuit Seal"
	quest.670272AA70F4B077.quest_desc: [
		"Complete MI’s vacuum-freezer advancement with the bootstrap recipe."
		"Run an actual hot-ingot cooling cycle and preserve a replacement route for the freezer."
	]
	quest.670272AA70F4B077.quest_subtitle: "The vacuum-freezer advancement records the machine that makes hot titanium usable without a shortcut."
	quest.670272AA70F4B077.title: "Vacuum Freezer Rite"
	quest.6704D1FB271B4BC4.quest_desc: ["Use a Spirit Infusion experiment to discover the native Tarot deck.","Once found, Tarot proceeds through its own readings and mechanics.","This is an optional discipline at this age; the canonical factory proofs govern normal progression."]
	quest.6704D1FB271B4BC4.quest_subtitle: "An early discovery proves that spirit patterns can reveal another discipline."
	quest.6704D1FB271B4BC4.title: "Discover Tarot"
	quest.670878FB96191C10.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 11 opens, build and inspect an MI Large Diesel Generator multiblock."
		"Give it measured bulk fuel, isolated output, exhaust clearance, metering, and a separate source capable of black-starting its controls."
	]
	quest.670878FB96191C10.quest_subtitle: "Processing units, highly advanced hulls, and titanium make the 16,384 EU/t plant legitimate."
	quest.670878FB96191C10.title: "Build the Large Diesel Plant"
	quest.67111C0686283295.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixty-four Create tracks."
		"Keep the reserve at the yard and replenish iron sheets and andesite alloy after it is used."
	]
	quest.67111C0686283295.quest_subtitle: "A stack of track can bridge a washed-out section or extend a siding without an arbitrary climbing exercise."
	quest.67111C0686283295.title: "Stage a Track Reserve"
	quest.6732A626779A066A.quest_desc: ["Build the authored Ultra Excessive Voltage consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.6732A626779A066A.quest_subtitle: "The UEV standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.6732A626779A066A.title: "UEV Consumer Proof"
	quest.6744FD0F568AB412.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a bronze tank while keeping a bronze boiler available in the hall."
		"Separate water storage, hot steam, fuel, item input, and product output so maintenance never requires guessing through pipes."
	]
	quest.6744FD0F568AB412.quest_subtitle: "A placed tank and boiler make the steam hall’s inputs and hazards visible."
	quest.6744FD0F568AB412.title: "Lay Out Water, Steam, and Ore"
	quest.6745F495E7DE3ACC.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a basic chemical tank and chemical infuser in the contained laboratory zone."
		"Label their current contents, provide shutoff access, and never connect an unknown tank to the main tube network."
	]
	quest.6745F495E7DE3ACC.quest_subtitle: "A tank in quarantine is useful because it can be isolated before anyone needs to identify a leak."
	quest.6745F495E7DE3ACC.title: "Chemical Tank Quarantine"
	quest.67734FFD6C565083.quest_desc: ["Build the metal finder for focused prospecting across the stainless and digital resource network."]
	quest.67734FFD6C565083.quest_subtitle: "Follow calibrated signals instead of blind tunnels."
	quest.67734FFD6C565083.title: "Metal Finder"
	quest.677DBBBFEA49913C.quest_desc: ["Produce four titanium-alloy units to prove rutile chemistry, vacuum cooling, pressure-hull work, bulk power, and aerospace recovery operate as one works.", "MAT-05 supplies titanium mechanics. Large electric processing and the Processing Array reward established grid/control service; retain specialist foundry, refinery and separation lines."]
	quest.677DBBBFEA49913C.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 11 PROOF — High Pressure Aerospace"
	quest.677DBBBFEA49913C.title: "Vacuum Aerospace Works Proven"
	quest.678E9F3F707CE00E.quest_desc: [
		"Demonstrate ten million FE in connected storage."
		"Test transfer into the fusion controls and keep a separate margin for pumps, cooling, and safe shutdown."
	]
	quest.678E9F3F707CE00E.quest_subtitle: "Ten million stored FE is the first credible ignition bank, not yet a promise of continuous operation."
	quest.678E9F3F707CE00E.title: "Fusion Ignition Bank"
	quest.678FCAF3D3C05B41.quest_desc: [
		"Stock two Create track signals and sixteen wrought-iron ingots."
		"Reserve them for junction protection and urgent track repairs."
	]
	quest.678FCAF3D3C05B41.quest_subtitle: "Two signals and sixteen wrought-iron ingots support a route extension without dismantling the working line."
	quest.678FCAF3D3C05B41.title: "Stock Signals and Rail Iron"
	quest.67C59FD4AC12D59A.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect a Mekanism chemical washer and stock sixteen steel large plates."
		"Verify its gas, slurry, clean-water, output, and maintenance interfaces against the district plan."
	]
	quest.67C59FD4AC12D59A.quest_subtitle: "A chemical washer observed beside sixteen large plates links the process anchor to the structure that supports it."
	quest.67C59FD4AC12D59A.title: "Controller Witness"
	quest.682B5B91DA4B2490.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an MI electric compressor."
		"Provide correct voltage, input buffering, output clearance, and a route that does not mix products."
	]
	quest.682B5B91DA4B2490.quest_subtitle: "The compressor turns powder and plate demand into a scheduled workcell instead of a sequence of manual visits."
	quest.682B5B91DA4B2490.title: "Commission the Electric Compressor"
	quest.6855DB5A9ACE4A1B.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect Mekanism reactor glass as part of the planned shell."
		"Use it only where structure rules allow and keep replacement blocks outside the reactor room."
	]
	quest.6855DB5A9ACE4A1B.quest_subtitle: "Reactor glass makes the pressure boundary visible without making radiation or heat harmless."
	quest.6855DB5A9ACE4A1B.title: "Inspect the Reactor Boundary"
	quest.6861BC3B123CFE8C.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an MI bronze machine casing in the steam area."
		"Plan shared services around several bronze machines rather than wrapping each one in isolated storage."
	]
	quest.6861BC3B123CFE8C.quest_subtitle: "The bronze steam room becomes a district when boiler water, fuel, steam, condensate, and repair access each have their own route."
	quest.6861BC3B123CFE8C.title: "Bronze Steam Room"
	quest.686364804E127E6C.quest_desc: [
		"Travel five hundred blocks while locating water, clay, wood, food, or ore indicators."
		"Bring water and enough food for the route instead of circling the quest screen to fill the statistic."
	]
	quest.686364804E127E6C.quest_subtitle: "Walk a useful five-hundred-block survey with food, water, and a marked return route."
	quest.686364804E127E6C.title: "First Field Watch"
	quest.68682E651913F10C.quest_desc: [
		"Build eight Mekanism control-rod assemblies."
		"Match them to the planned fuel-assembly layout and keep logic adapters and manual access available."
	]
	quest.68682E651913F10C.quest_subtitle: "Eight control-rod assemblies let reactor geometry grow without reducing the authority to shut it down."
	quest.68682E651913F10C.title: "Expand Reactor Control Authority"
	quest.686C0F12B0859788.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect a basic chemical tank and keep the electrolytic separator ready in the laboratory."
		"Reserve labeled tube corridors, water access, gas buffers, ventilation choices, and clear maintenance space."
	]
	quest.686C0F12B0859788.quest_subtitle: "A quarantine tank and separator define where gases are made, stored, vented, and serviced."
	quest.686C0F12B0859788.title: "Lay Out Containment and Separation"
	quest.687964B67ED5D432.quest_desc: ["Build a Create basin with room for heat below, a Greate mixer or press two blocks above, and separate input and output routes.","Choose the recipe and machine tier before placing the line. Stage its full item and fluid charge, keep heat and by-product storage accessible, and retain this process cell as a supplier when the plant expands."]
	quest.687964B67ED5D432.quest_subtitle: "The basin is where separate inputs begin behaving like one controlled process."
	quest.687964B67ED5D432.title: "Build the Mixing Basin"
	quest.68A6CDB0993D2252.quest_desc: [
		"Demonstrate fifty million FE in connected storage."
		"Serve a project load and verify the reserve remains isolated from temporary construction equipment."
	]
	quest.68A6CDB0993D2252.quest_subtitle: "Fifty million stored FE keeps design controls, logistics, and inspection available during heavy construction."
	quest.68A6CDB0993D2252.title: "Power the Second Project Shift"
	quest.68A7B225E6CD77CD.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four Electro Energetics batteries and sixteen insulated copper wires."
		"Plan spacing, protection, and service isolation before connecting them."
	]
	quest.68A7B225E6CD77CD.quest_subtitle: "Four batteries and sixteen insulated wires form a bank that can be assembled without borrowing the active grid."
	quest.68A7B225E6CD77CD.title: "Battery Bank Reserve"
	quest.68E88A51AECA2FD8.quest_desc: [
		"Generate or store 100,000 FE in the working MV power system."
		"Connect generation, protected storage, a device connector, and one real load so the capacity represents usable infrastructure."
	]
	quest.68E88A51AECA2FD8.quest_subtitle: "The first 100,000 FE reserve gives the MV floor enough stored time to test distribution before chemistry depends on it."
	quest.68E88A51AECA2FD8.title: "MV Battery Wake"
	quest.68ED82590BD84DF2.quest_desc: [
		"Visit both Stellaris dimensions: Venus supplies Corronium and Mercury supplies Solerium. Return with raw material from each and a secure route home."
		"The High Pressure mixed-concentrate recipe consumes both metals to start the platinum and iridium line. This is a required supply chain, not an informational side trip."
	]
	quest.68ED82590BD84DF2.quest_subtitle: "Corronium from Venus and Solerium from Mercury are both mandatory inputs to High Pressure metallurgy."
	quest.68ED82590BD84DF2.title: "Establish Venus and Mercury Supply Lines"
	quest.691CC9FE7464B575.quest_desc: ["Build an AppMek chemical storage cell to show AE2 can coordinate chemical inventory with power, channels, processors, patterns, crafting, and remote links."]
	quest.691CC9FE7464B575.quest_subtitle: "Discipline mastery — supporting branch; follow the chapter age proof for the main transition."
	quest.691CC9FE7464B575.title: "Digital Logistics Mastered"
	quest.694BFD179A123373.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen turbine blades and sixteen Electro Energetics heavy wire connectors."
		"Keep both de-energized and outside the turbine hall until a full maintenance isolation is confirmed."
	]
	quest.694BFD179A123373.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen turbine blades and heavy connectors put mechanical and electrical recovery on one documented reserve."
	quest.694BFD179A123373.title: "Turbine Blade Reserve"
	quest.696D34A8AB6D9BAA.quest_desc: ["Commission the bronze macerator as proof that water, fuel, steam, pipes, machines, and repair stock operate as one maintained hall.", "MEC-02/MEC-03 machinery extends the earlier kinetic district. The foundry supplies plates and mechanisms to the steam hall; steam processing gives that foundry repeatable prepared feedstock."]
	quest.696D34A8AB6D9BAA.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 3 PROOF — Bronze Steam"
	quest.696D34A8AB6D9BAA.title: "Bronze Steam Hall Proven"
	quest.6971D4009FA025B2.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four MI steel large plates through the current forming route."
		"Store them flat beside boiler and casing spares, outside general construction inventory."
	]
	quest.6971D4009FA025B2.quest_subtitle: "Four large plates cover failures that cannot be patched with ordinary sheet stock."
	quest.6971D4009FA025B2.title: "Form Large Repair Plates"
	quest.697284576D20534E.quest_desc: [
		"Store sixteen fluix glass cable and four MI digital circuit boards outside the network."
		"Label the kit and keep tools, power access, and a controller route beside it."
	]
	quest.697284576D20534E.quest_subtitle: "Cable and digital boards stored physically keep the first repair independent from AE2 access."
	quest.697284576D20534E.title: "Prepare the Network Blackout Kit"
	quest.697FAEB2168AB975.quest_desc: ["Build the authored Ultra High Voltage consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.697FAEB2168AB975.quest_subtitle: "The UHV standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.697FAEB2168AB975.title: "UHV Consumer Proof"
	quest.69812E5A1A677E70.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an MI fusion chamber."
		"Its live recipe joins superconductor coils, nuclear-alloy plates, plasma casing, and the large heat exchanger."
	]
	quest.69812E5A1A677E70.quest_subtitle: "A fusion chamber is the durable boundary between the field, the fuel, and everything outside it."
	quest.69812E5A1A677E70.title: "Operate a Fusion Chamber"
	quest.69A7245BF499285A.quest_desc: [
		"After the late-industry gate opens, place and inspect the Mekanism fusion reactor controller."
		"Treat this as preparation: verify the installed deuterium and tritium routes before planning a sustained plasma system."
	]
	quest.69A7245BF499285A.quest_subtitle: "Fusion changes the fuel cycle, but it does not remove the need for containment, instrumentation, or an orderly shutdown."
	quest.69A7245BF499285A.title: "Fusion Preparation"
	quest.69D7976C0B6B5B0D.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 15 opens, place and inspect an MI Quantum machine hull."
		"Plan matter feed, high-tier power, clean components, and isolation from ordinary factory traffic."
	]
	quest.69D7976C0B6B5B0D.quest_subtitle: "Reality engineering becomes a complex when Quantum machines, singularities, gates, and sample containment share accountable interfaces."
	quest.69D7976C0B6B5B0D.title: "Reality Engineering Complex"
	quest.6A07A3475120D3A7.quest_desc: ["Run the five independent accelerator-component lines for controller, rings, motors, sensors, and collectors; each integrates ZPM precision, Eclipse Alloy, Starlight, nuclear structure, AE2 Quantum, UU Matter, and closure before the authored collision.","Operate the physical accelerator under CC monitoring and route its specialized energy interface through Electro Energetics.","Finish all five accelerator component sequences on a Naquadah Alloy Press or higher. Tollan trinium, the synthetic Naquadah route and the PGM refinery supply the alloy. Make its first plates and shafts on the RPP floor. The shared GT campus builds ZPM mainframes from LuV computers; established MI-qualified ZPM components continue supplying the machine parts."]
	quest.6A07A3475120D3A7.quest_subtitle: "Discipline mastery — supporting branch; follow the chapter age proof for the main transition."
	quest.6A07A3475120D3A7.title: "Particle Accelerator Proven"
	quest.6A0D13F0A6E8B4C2.quest_desc: [
		"Mercury is the first high-radiation universe survey tied directly to the mature nuclear program."
		"Enter with Cosmonautics/Stellaris life support, Mekanism instruments and shielding, then return with a documented sample instead of treating the planet as a replacement quarry."
	]
	quest.6A0D13F0A6E8B4C2.quest_subtitle: "A hostile planet is an expedition and operations problem, not a replacement mining dimension."
	quest.6A0D13F0A6E8B4C2.title: "The Ordeal: Mercury Radiation Survey"
	quest.6A3F28AD80E34E46.quest_desc: [
		"Craft one full live-recipe batch each of MI item pipe and fluid pipe."
		"Use item pipe for solids and fluid pipe for water or steam; label crossings before the hall becomes difficult to trace."
	]
	quest.6A3F28AD80E34E46.quest_subtitle: "Twelve item pipes and twelve fluid pipes give steam, water, and material deliberate routes."
	quest.6A3F28AD80E34E46.title: "Pipe the Steam Hall"
	quest.6AAB05DE2ECA0C5B.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 6 opens, place and inspect an MI electric macerator."
		"Feed a useful ore batch and confirm output storage can accept every product."
	]
	quest.6AAB05DE2ECA0C5B.quest_subtitle: "At Low Voltage, the electric macerator trades steam plumbing for a tiered circuit and steadier control."
	quest.6AAB05DE2ECA0C5B.title: "Electric Macerator Line"
	quest.6AD7B6898F2C1EBB.quest_desc: [
		"Let the damage statistic accumulate through normal play rather than deliberate injury."
		"Review which hazards caused it and improve shelter, route, clothing, or retreat timing."
	]
	quest.6AD7B6898F2C1EBB.quest_subtitle: "Damage accumulates quietly; the useful lesson is recognizing when the trip should have ended sooner."
	quest.6AD7B6898F2C1EBB.title: "Scar Ledger"
	quest.6ADE5EF256DECCE9.quest_desc: [
		"Demonstrate 500,000 FE of connected reserve and inspect the Mekanism metallurgic infuser."
		"Open the normal feed under controlled conditions, restore the grid, verify the connector, then run one bounded infusion order."
	]
	quest.6ADE5EF256DECCE9.quest_subtitle: "Half a million FE and an inspected infuser test whether the expanded floor can recover after its normal supply disappears."
	quest.6ADE5EF256DECCE9.title: "Overload Blackout Drill"
	quest.6AF258C35F948253.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger MI’s fusion-reactor advancement by operating the completed system."
		"Use the advancement details for the runtime trigger, then leave the reactor in a controlled state."
	]
	quest.6AF258C35F948253.quest_subtitle: "Fusion ignition is recorded only after the reactor does more than occupy a floor plan."
	quest.6AF258C35F948253.title: "Fusion Sun Proof"
	quest.6B01C56711AE6B5D.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Farmer’s Delight cooking pot as the recovery kitchen."
		"Reestablish heat, water, food storage, and serving containers from ordinary supplies."
	]
	quest.6B01C56711AE6B5D.quest_subtitle: "After loss, a working cooking pot restores useful meals before convenience equipment is replaced."
	quest.6B01C56711AE6B5D.title: "Restart the Homestead Kitchen"
	quest.6B7FC76B4CCC51B9.quest_desc: [
		"Reach an Eternal Starlight Starlight Forest biome."
		"Mark the route to the outpost and preserve return supplies before collecting unfamiliar materials."
	]
	quest.6B7FC76B4CCC51B9.quest_subtitle: "The Starlight forest is the first landscape that makes the new dimension feel inhabited rather than merely distant."
	quest.6B7FC76B4CCC51B9.title: "Starlight Forest Entry"
	quest.6B8B8DEA90332214.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare a Cargo Boats capacity upgrade and oak hand cart."
		"Practice unloading priority cargo into the cart without blocking the dock."
	]
	quest.6B8B8DEA90332214.quest_subtitle: "A capacity upgrade and hand cart make the smallest useful bypass between water and land freight."
	quest.6B8B8DEA90332214.title: "Freight Bypass Kit"
	quest.6B9628300B7A3B88.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the Mekanism Solar Neutron Activator in its working area."
		"Verify bounded inputs, waste capacity, power-loss behavior, shielding, monitoring, and a manual isolation route before leaving it."
	]
	quest.6B9628300B7A3B88.quest_subtitle: "A reprocessor may run without an operator only when every input, output, and failure state remains contained."
	quest.6B9628300B7A3B88.title: "Audit Unattended Reprocessing"
	quest.6B973FB7A893F65F.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight Mekanism radiation-shielding modules."
		"Keep them with independent meters and emergency instructions; use distance, time, containment, and shutdown as primary protection."
	]
	quest.6B973FB7A893F65F.quest_subtitle: "Eight replacement shielding modules belong in a labeled cabinet; equipment never replaces containment, shutdown, or evacuation."
	quest.6B973FB7A893F65F.title: "Shielding Module Reserve"
	quest.6B9BEF3691B13A14.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Mekanism fission reactor casing as a transitional support architecture."
		"Use it to prove chemical fuel handling, logic, and waste interfaces, then carry those lessons into the principal Mekanism reactor district and its CROWNS thermal wing."
	]
	quest.6B9BEF3691B13A14.quest_subtitle: "A bounded support reactor is an engineering experiment, not the pack's final nuclear destination."
	quest.6B9BEF3691B13A14.title: "Mekanism Support Experiment"
	quest.6BC6A5F6DDF1390C.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen MI aluminum plates."
		"Begin with aluminum reduced through the live bauxite, coke, desh, and tharsite route, then keep the batch clear of unrestricted autocrafting."
	]
	quest.6BC6A5F6DDF1390C.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen aluminum plates give the MV floor a structural reserve without consuming the first reduction batch one part at a time."
	quest.6BC6A5F6DDF1390C.title: "Stock the First Aluminum Plate Bay"
	quest.6BDB298464AD49A7.quest_desc: [
		"Run the MI Large Diesel Generator until its native advancement completes."
		"Start from a measured fuel buffer, observe a real protected load, and stop with enough supply for another controlled black start."
	]
	quest.6BDB298464AD49A7.quest_subtitle: "The advancement proves the late diesel reserve can answer a real load."
	quest.6BDB298464AD49A7.title: "Prove Large Diesel Generation"
	quest.6BE1617D8EC9805C.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an MI steel tank while keeping a steel machine casing ready."
		"Leave a clear water header, steam trunk, maintenance aisle, and room for output buffers before adding more machines."
	]
	quest.6BE1617D8EC9805C.quest_subtitle: "A placed tank and steel casing define where water, steam, and machine service will live."
	quest.6BE1617D8EC9805C.title: "Lay Out the Steel Steam Hall"
	quest.6BF0E7D18F1E27C4.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixty-four TFMG coal coke."
		"Store the reserve on a nonflammable pad separated from timber, fuel lines, and Create machinery; keep the aisle clear for the extinguisher."
		"Mount the smoke detector over the hot-work boundary, inspect the extinguisher before each coke-oven run, and stop fuel feed before attacking a fire."
	]
	quest.6BF0E7D18F1E27C4.quest_subtitle: "A clear firebreak, early smoke detection, fuel isolation, and an accessible extinguisher contain hot-work failures before they reach the factory."
	quest.6BF0E7D18F1E27C4.title: "Coke Firebreak"
	quest.6C2CF9385D6A496E.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the expansion AE2 pattern provider."
		"Give it a bounded set of patterns and test concurrent crafts without shared-output deadlock."
	]
	quest.6C2CF9385D6A496E.quest_subtitle: "A second pattern provider adds throughput only after its channels and machine face are unambiguous."
	quest.6C2CF9385D6A496E.title: "Commission a Second Provider"
	quest.6C41191086C4A980.quest_desc: [
		"The Alloy Blast Smelter is an optional high-temperature convergence hall after the Large Fabricators. The established Stargate recipe remains first access to Naquadah Alloy; this facility only performs an exact eight-item specialist batch."
		"Stage the controller, thirty-five High-Temperature Smelting Casings, twenty-four Kanthal Coils, twelve Heat Vents, IV energy, item and fluid input, item output, maintenance, and an IV Muffler Hatch."
		"Commission the authored 4,096-EU/t, 2,700 K route with eight each of titanium, platinum, Aethersent, and refined naquadah, then retain all eight Naquadah Alloy as proof."
	]
	quest.6C41191086C4A980.quest_subtitle: "Extreme Stargate-alloy batching without a parallel early smelting ladder."
	quest.6C41191086C4A980.title: "Alloy Blast Smelter"
	quest.6C5C4C513A1DAC2C.quest_desc: [
		"Bake four TFC barley breads from grain you processed."
		"Pack them with water and keep the freshest food for the longest trip."
	]
	quest.6C5C4C513A1DAC2C.quest_subtitle: "Four loaves turn a lucky meal into food that can support a real route away from camp."
	quest.6C5C4C513A1DAC2C.title: "Field Rations"
	quest.6CB7853B2709EBB9.quest_desc: [
		"Craft one Infinity Upgrade and retain one Infinity Ingot."
		"The upgrade is a final-use component; build it only after the catalyst and ingot lines can be replenished."
	]
	quest.6CB7853B2709EBB9.quest_subtitle: "An Infinity Upgrade beside an ingot marks a factory whose last transformation can be repeated by choice."
	quest.6CB7853B2709EBB9.title: "Commission Final Ascension"
	quest.6D0D82E0E44EB0CD.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight neutron piles and eight blue Starlight crystal shards."
		"Record which supply is renewable at home and which still depends on the outpost."
	]
	quest.6D0D82E0E44EB0CD.quest_subtitle: "Eight neutron piles and blue shards put industrial and expedition evidence on the same accountable ledger."
	quest.6D0D82E0E44EB0CD.title: "Neutron Pile Ledger"
	quest.6D35BF597D49EA38.quest_desc: [
		"Complete the Eternal Starlight crystalborn-catalyst advancement."
		"Preserve a reference catalyst for matrix and occult research before scaling consumption."
	]
	quest.6D35BF597D49EA38.quest_subtitle: "The crystalborn-catalyst advancement proves an alien sample can be recognized without reducing it to generic loot."
	quest.6D35BF597D49EA38.title: "Crystalborn Relic"
	quest.6D68FBB746A0DCCD.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 4,000 mB of MI sulfuric acid."
		"Label the compatible drum, keep neutral transfer capacity nearby, and do not route it through ordinary fluid storage."
	]
	quest.6D68FBB746A0DCCD.quest_subtitle: "Four buckets in fixed storage define an acid standard without elevating a loose Chemlib bucket into authority."
	quest.6D68FBB746A0DCCD.title: "Fill the Sulfuric Acid Drum"
	quest.6D78A5B4DD4E9EAE.quest_desc: [
		"Build copper shield."
		"Work the required copper parts at the anvil, then assemble the shield and keep it with the mine kit."
	]
	quest.6D78A5B4DD4E9EAE.quest_subtitle: "A worked copper shield is protection earned from the same shop that keeps the mine open."
	quest.6D78A5B4DD4E9EAE.title: "Forge a Copper Shield"
	quest.6D848EF0D74DE7F6.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement LUV motors, pumps, robot arms, sensors, emitters, and field generators for the neutron and Starlight works, then verify the IV line still operates."]
	quest.6D848EF0D74DE7F6.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.6D848EF0D74DE7F6.title: "LUV Recovery Proof"
	quest.6D8EE28E14590C42.quest_desc: ["Stage thirty-two ordinary MI iron dust and thirty-two TFMG coal coke.","Prepare the dust from earned TFC wrought-iron ingots in the MI macerator under Industrial Heat research. The handoff keeps one ingot per dust and the native processing cost.","Use the retained iron-dust industrial-blasting route with flux and its required hot-air supply. Provide empty storage for molten slag and furnace gas before starting."]
	quest.6D8EE28E14590C42.quest_subtitle: "Prepare canonical iron dust, coke fuel and the blast-furnace supply lines."
	quest.6D8EE28E14590C42.title: "Stage Iron and Coke for Steel"
	quest.6DF54BD53EAC4EFE.quest_desc: ["After Digital Circuits and Advanced Separations research, assemble the distillation tower from its two distilleries, turbo hull and four advanced pumps, plus Greate stainless pumps, refinery outlets and chemical seals.", "Inspect the native shape with a wrench. A size-two tower exposes the first output; each added layer exposes another. Expand the tower and its tank yard together while the earlier refinery keeps delivering fuel and cracked naphtha supplies methane and chemical feedstocks."]
	quest.6DF54BD53EAC4EFE.quest_subtitle: "Digital circuits unlock the multiblock that separates one output per built layer."
	quest.6DF54BD53EAC4EFE.title: "Commission the Distillation Tower"
	quest.6E1EA6986E9B62DA.quest_desc: ["Prove both endpoints physically, send real cargo, interrupt the destination, and recover without duplication."]
	quest.6E1EA6986E9B62DA.quest_subtitle: "Cross-dimensional logistics requires fixed endpoints and recovery infrastructure."
	quest.6E1EA6986E9B62DA.title: "Proven-Endpoint Cross-Dimensional Drone"
	quest.6E294440E1BE97FD.quest_desc: [
		"Fabricate the titanium and corronium shield body around a working GT LV Field Generator and protected energy store."
		"Combine the shared GT LV Field Generator, titanium shell, advanced machine hull, and protected energy storage, then test the native shield generator under load."
	]
	quest.6E294440E1BE97FD.quest_subtitle: "The shield generator gives the protected reserve a defined boundary that can be inspected, powered down, and approached safely."
	quest.6E294440E1BE97FD.title: "Assemble the Shield Generator"
	quest.6E338F41663D7933.quest_desc: [
		"Make eight Electro Energetics insulated copper wire."
		"The live recipe combines pairs of MI copper wire with a rubber plate; this is Electro Energetics distribution stock, not an MI cable substitute."
	]
	quest.6E338F41663D7933.quest_subtitle: "Electro Energetics and EE insulation turn loose copper into rated infrastructure while overload remains a real failure."
	quest.6E338F41663D7933.title: "Insulate the First Wire Run"
	quest.6E3E8AC457D0AC6E.quest_desc: ["Return a planetary sample, process it at the permanent outpost, and retain replacement vacuum hardware."]
	quest.6E3E8AC457D0AC6E.quest_subtitle: "Returned samples and extreme conditions now qualify materials that local smelting cannot."
	quest.6E3E8AC457D0AC6E.title: "Material Epoch VI — Pressure, Vacuum, and Planetary Proof"
	quest.6E47499369D61F86.quest_desc: [
		"Place the advanced machine hull in the operating MV area and let the quest inspect it."
		"Use it as part of a real build plan with stable power, accessible cable, and buffered inputs rather than an isolated display block."
	]
	quest.6E47499369D61F86.quest_subtitle: "The new hull earns its place when the connected line can finish work without manual rescue."
	quest.6E47499369D61F86.title: "Hold the Advanced Hull Under Load"
	quest.6E4E3EDB1D124E1D.quest_desc: [
		"Build sedimentary stone javelin."
		"Knap the matching stone tool head, then combine it with a stick. Carry a spare head before traveling."
	]
	quest.6E4E3EDB1D124E1D.quest_subtitle: "A javelin gives distance when the night refuses to stay outside the shelter."
	quest.6E4E3EDB1D124E1D.title: "Stone Javelin for Predators"
	quest.6E81145C1B79511D.quest_desc: [
		"Complete MI’s titanium-ingot advancement through the installed route."
		"Keep rutile, chemicals, hot processing, and vacuum cooling ready for another ingot."
	]
	quest.6E81145C1B79511D.quest_subtitle: "The titanium advancement confirms chemistry, high heat, and vacuum have all succeeded in sequence."
	quest.6E81145C1B79511D.title: "Titanium Claim"
	quest.6E96CB6D2CAE323D.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Rocketnautics engine nozzles and retain eight titanium ingots."
		"Test away from storage and occupied work, then quarantine any nozzle that shows abnormal wear."
	]
	quest.6E96CB6D2CAE323D.quest_subtitle: "Two engine nozzles backed by titanium stock make a burn test repeatable instead of destructive."
	quest.6E96CB6D2CAE323D.title: "Nozzle Burn Test"
	quest.6EA1990C3A362FF6.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight HDPE sheets and eight basic pressurized tubes."
		"Keep polymer feed, aluminum, tanks, and heavy connectors available to replenish both parts."
	]
	quest.6EA1990C3A362FF6.quest_subtitle: "Eight HDPE sheets and pressure tubes keep expansion from consuming the recovery shelf."
	quest.6EA1990C3A362FF6.title: "Buffer Polymer and Tubing"
	quest.6EB03CF566178A0E.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen TFMG fireclay balls."
		"Store the workable feed beside the refractory area, not in the finished-brick output."
	]
	quest.6EB03CF566178A0E.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen fireclay balls keep refractory work from interrupting the refinery build."
	quest.6EB03CF566178A0E.title: "Stage the Fireclay Feed"
	quest.6EB24DB178B647C9.quest_desc: [
		"Construct an AE2 Quantum Link after spatial theory, computerized navigation, and the deep-space engineering proof converge."
		"Demonstrate that both endpoints have independent power and a documented recovery route. This proves interworld-link theory; the first fixed Stargate still belongs to Age 15 engineering."
	]
	quest.6EB24DB178B647C9.quest_subtitle: "A powered quantum endpoint proves link theory without replacing first arrival or the later Stargate network."
	quest.6EB24DB178B647C9.title: "Age 12 — Interworld Link Theory Proven"
	quest.6EDA5D14095E5827.quest_desc: ["Complete a precision mechanism to prove water power, alloy reserves, repair stock, and sequenced assembly now form a dependable foundry.","Produce track and reserve wrought iron for the route. The Foundry proof needs water-powered forming, mixing and precision assembly. Schedules and an assembled train remain required by the later serviced freight terminal after Bronze Steam suppliers become available."]
	quest.6EDA5D14095E5827.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 2 PROOF — Alloy Foundry"
	quest.6EDA5D14095E5827.title: "Kinetic Foundry Proven"
	quest.6F35541A6AE49D6F.quest_desc: [
		"Build two booster thrusters and stock four iridium plates."
		"Reserve matched control hardware and inspect both thrusters before the next deep-space departure."
	]
	quest.6F35541A6AE49D6F.quest_subtitle: "A booster pair and iridium plates put thrust and hardened guidance on the same mission rack."
	quest.6F35541A6AE49D6F.title: "Booster Thruster Rack"
	quest.6F607C6089E0E378.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the Mekanism fission reactor logic adapter."
		"Wire and test the chosen shutdown condition with the reactor unfueled or otherwise safe; confirm the controller state after signal loss."
	]
	quest.6F607C6089E0E378.quest_subtitle: "A logic adapter matters only when its failure signal produces a known safe state without depending on player reflexes."
	quest.6F607C6089E0E378.title: "Verify Automatic Shutdown Logic"
	quest.6F6243D7B266520A.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four 1k item storage cells and sixteen printed silicon."
		"Keep one cell empty for recovery and protect the stock from autocrafting."
	]
	quest.6F6243D7B266520A.quest_subtitle: "Four 1k cells and sixteen printed silicon cover storage and processor recovery without hoarding larger cells."
	quest.6F6243D7B266520A.title: "Stage Three-Shift Cell Repairs"
	quest.6F707C5B16133FFD.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a fired TFC large vessel in the homestead storage area."
		"Keep clean food, emergency supplies, and gathered materials separated by purpose."
	]
	quest.6F707C5B16133FFD.quest_subtitle: "A placed large vessel marks where field supplies return, get sorted, and become the next trip’s kit."
	quest.6F707C5B16133FFD.title: "Lay Out the Homestead Stores"
	quest.6F8B6903E83C0883.quest_desc: [
		"Bring the working system to 5,000,000 FE with a turbine casing available."
		"Test under real conversion load and keep reactor burn rate below coolant, turbine, and waste capacity."
	]
	quest.6F8B6903E83C0883.quest_subtitle: "Five million FE under a turbine load reveals whether steam conversion and electrical export agree on scale."
	quest.6F8B6903E83C0883.title: "Turbine Synchronization"
	quest.6FF097761CD92588.quest_desc: [
		"The native Large Chemical Reactor is an optional multi-input institution after the Large Fabricators. MI still owns first PGM concentration and the downstream centrifuge separation; Mekanism keeps gas-network authority."
		"Stage the controller, eighteen Inert Machine Casings, one PTFE Pipe Casing, one Kanthal Coil adjacent to that pipe, IV energy, item input/output, fluid input/output, and maintenance. This pattern does not accept a muffler."
		"Commission its authored 2,048-EU/t aqua-regia batch to make four already-established Mixed Iridium Ingots. All other native Large Chemical Reactor recipes are disabled."
	]
	quest.6FF097761CD92588.quest_subtitle: "Complex PGM feed preparation at campus scale, with MI retaining separation authority."
	quest.6FF097761CD92588.title: "Large Chemical Reactor"
	quest.7010E0E2E7924D9C.quest_desc: [
		"Enter the Eternal Starlight dimension and establish a safe outpost route."
		"Carry a return method, coordinates, spare gear, food, medicine, ranged defense, storage, and repair materials."
	]
	quest.7010E0E2E7924D9C.quest_subtitle: "Starlight is an outpost problem: unfamiliar terrain, hostile recovery distance, and samples that matter only if they return."
	quest.7010E0E2E7924D9C.title: "Starlight Outpost Route"
	quest.7059B85C9A1082CF.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 15 opens, place and inspect a Classic Stargate."
		"Treat the gate as transport infrastructure: verify address, power, security, and an independent return method."
	]
	quest.7059B85C9A1082CF.quest_subtitle: "At Quantum, a Stargate extends the freight map only after the far side can receive and return cargo safely."
	quest.7059B85C9A1082CF.title: "Interplanetary Logistics Preview"
	quest.707309F2FD43021B.quest_desc: ["Build the Mekanism metallurgic infuser and inspect its Electro Energetics device connector.","Use the aluminum-and-MI Infuser recipe, keep energy and infusion inputs separate, and complete a useful circuit batch. Each unupgraded infusion consumes10000J; one Redstone Dust in the energy slot supplies that amount."]
	quest.707309F2FD43021B.quest_subtitle: "A completed infuser beside an installed device connector marks the controlled handoff from MV infrastructure to chemistry."
	quest.707309F2FD43021B.title: "Advanced Electric Factory Commissioning Capstone"
	quest.70B9B71E2690EED0.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the steel water pump on the live boiler-feed system."
		"Verify its source and buffer can supply the worst combined boiler load before walking away."
	]
	quest.70B9B71E2690EED0.quest_subtitle: "The steel water pump makes higher steam demand sustainable instead of merely impressive."
	quest.70B9B71E2690EED0.title: "Add a Steel Water Pump"
	quest.70C8512A7E97AEF6.quest_desc: [
		"Build an AE2 drive and connect it to the controller network."
		"Start with small cells and attach high-volume stock through storage buses instead of hiding every block inside digital storage."
	]
	quest.70C8512A7E97AEF6.quest_subtitle: "The drive bay gives storage cells a powered home while bulk materials remain in physical warehouses."
	quest.70C8512A7E97AEF6.title: "Drive Bay Frame"
	quest.70EA2DE834941114.quest_desc: [
		"Build the automated airship station and ship transponder after AE2 requested production, CC:Tweaked supervision, Modern Dynamics routing, GregTech sensors, and the Railcraft freight terminal are operational."
		"Run a real departure, destination, return, blocked-destination, and manual-recovery test before trusting unattended cargo."
	]
	quest.70EA2DE834941114.quest_subtitle: "Autonomous flight is a digital logistics service layered on top of a maintained rail-and-air freight network."
	quest.70EA2DE834941114.title: "Autonomous Air Logistics"
	quest.70ECC0747160D60E.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight Modern Industrialization titanium ingots after High Pressure opens."
		"Rocketnautics native titanium smelting is removed; follow the installed MI authority route."
	]
	quest.70ECC0747160D60E.quest_subtitle: "Eight MI titanium ingots establish the structural metal that late flight hardware actually consumes."
	quest.70ECC0747160D60E.title: "Adopt the Titanium Standard"
	quest.7103C2FC832DF6EB.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four copper nozzles and two iridium ingots."
		"Keep the two material streams separated until a documented spacecraft assembly calls for both."
	]
	quest.7103C2FC832DF6EB.quest_subtitle: "Four copper nozzles and two iridium ingots prepare both low-cost flow hardware and hardened contacts."
	quest.7103C2FC832DF6EB.title: "Copper Nozzle Bin"
	quest.712795EF63FB096F.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a Backpacked backpack."
		"Carry water, food, spare pottery, and route markers first; empty gathered cargo before the return kit is displaced."
	]
	quest.712795EF63FB096F.quest_subtitle: "A backpack extends a trip only when its extra space is not filled with things that belong at home."
	quest.712795EF63FB096F.title: "Backpack Route"
	quest.716C59275E68C468.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement UIV motors, pumps, robot arms, sensors, emitters, and field generators for shared-service megastructures, then verify the UEV line still operates."]
	quest.716C59275E68C468.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.716C59275E68C468.title: "UIV Recovery Proof"
	quest.717E8527B8A693E9.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 13 opens, place and inspect a Mekanism chemical washer."
		"Treat it as one anchor in a contained chain with labeled inputs, clean-water supply, and bounded outputs."
	]
	quest.717E8527B8A693E9.quest_subtitle: "A national chemical complex replaces scattered reactions with separated gas, slurry, wash, storage, and waste corridors."
	quest.717E8527B8A693E9.title: "National Chemical Complex"
	quest.7185EAC32461C0B1.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Mekanism fission reactor logic adapter."
		"Configure safe status and shutdown behavior, then verify controls from outside the reactor room before loading fuel."
	]
	quest.7185EAC32461C0B1.quest_subtitle: "The logic adapter turns criticality control into a signal the facility can monitor without removing manual authority."
	quest.7185EAC32461C0B1.title: "Criticality Control Certification"
	quest.7189E799D55C5132.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger AE2’s Pattern Encoding Terminal advancement."
		"Encode a stable craft and verify its ingredients and output before expanding the library."
	]
	quest.7189E799D55C5132.quest_subtitle: "The pattern-terminal advancement confirms recipes can be encoded where their physical dependencies are already known."
	quest.7189E799D55C5132.title: "Pattern Liturgy"
	quest.719B384A75DF7245.quest_desc: [
		"Use the live mechanical-crafting pattern once to produce its pair of Rocketnautics rocket thrusters."
		"The recipe produces a pair and requires titanium structures, a digital circuit, advanced pump, iridium, and an elite control circuit."
	]
	quest.719B384A75DF7245.quest_subtitle: "Two matched rocket thrusters are enough to prove the digital, titanium, iridium, and Mekanism supply lines converge."
	quest.719B384A75DF7245.title: "Build the Orbital Thrusters"
	quest.71A1C0F5DB5A1ABE.quest_desc: ["Retrofit one dirty district with diamond filtration, collect its residual pollution, route byproducts, and prove a clean restart."]
	quest.71A1C0F5DB5A1ABE.quest_subtitle: "Required discipline mastery — contributes to the canonical age proof."
	quest.71A1C0F5DB5A1ABE.title: "Closed-Loop Environmental Recovery"
	quest.71A6D59766E18690.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Mekanism’s environmental-radiation advancement only through controlled nuclear operation."
		"Stop the source, check meters, restrict access, and follow the facility recovery plan before continuing."
	]
	quest.71A6D59766E18690.quest_subtitle: "The radiation advancement is an alarm to investigate and contain, never a production target to farm."
	quest.71A6D59766E18690.title: "Radiation Bell"
	quest.71ABB3C300134014.quest_desc: [
		"Build four Stellaris rocket fins through the live LV-gated recipe."
		"Keep the fin set together and preserve the same material supply for replacements after landing damage."
	]
	quest.71ABB3C300134014.quest_subtitle: "Four fins turn the steel, heavy plate, and rubber lines into one flight-ready assembly."
	quest.71ABB3C300134014.title: "Fit a Complete Fin Set"
	quest.71B7BE8590A5D63F.quest_desc: [
		"Demonstrate one hundred million FE of independent reserve."
		"Restart storage, routing, cooling, and fabrication in that order; admit rare inputs only after every output path is clear."
	]
	quest.71B7BE8590A5D63F.quest_subtitle: "One hundred million stored FE lets controls return before any singular process is asked to feed itself."
	quest.71B7BE8590A5D63F.title: "Cold-Restart the Convergence Works"
	quest.71D7705EE25FFE16.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four neutron ingots and two crystal-matrix blocks."
		"The capstone celebrates repeatability; Quantum still requires superconductor, fusion preparation, singularities, and astral inputs."
	]
	quest.71D7705EE25FFE16.quest_subtitle: "Neutron ingots and crystal matrix now leave two slow, renewable systems instead of a reward table."
	quest.71D7705EE25FFE16.title: "Commission Extreme Industry"
	quest.71DDBBF3B76EF96E.quest_desc: ["Run createch2/telemetry and createch2/flight_control through physical sensors/actuators; prove manual override."]
	quest.71DDBBF3B76EF96E.quest_subtitle: "A CC computer issues bounded commands through Synaxis seating and actuators without inventing a shortcut vehicle API."
	quest.71DDBBF3B76EF96E.title: "Drive-by-Wire Control Computer"
	quest.721D9CC6A2ED56E0.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the placed water wheel after deliberately disconnecting or stopping its output."
		"Trace the shaft line and stress load before restarting; adding speed does not create missing capacity."
	]
	quest.721D9CC6A2ED56E0.quest_subtitle: "A stopped wheel is a lesson in water access, shaft alignment, and overloaded stress."
	quest.721D9CC6A2ED56E0.title: "Inspect a Stalled Water Wheel"
	quest.722119609CAAC37F.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight AE2 engineering processors and sixteen certus quartz crystals."
		"Preserve the press sequence, redstone, silicon, and crystal supply that can refill the tray."
	]
	quest.722119609CAAC37F.quest_subtitle: "Eight engineering processors and sixteen certus crystals make the next storage or crafting build a planned job."
	quest.722119609CAAC37F.title: "Engineering Processor Tray"
	quest.7235A3B8D080D73D.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and store sixteen bronze rings."
		"Use the current forge-hammer, compressor, or crafting route that fits the hall, and leave enough bronze for plates."
	]
	quest.7235A3B8D080D73D.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen bronze rings cover seals, rotors, tanks, and the repairs between them."
	quest.7235A3B8D080D73D.title: "Stock Bronze Seal Rings"
	quest.725FBC5CE04051F8.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 10 opens, install a CC:Tweaked computer, eight network cables, and a full-block wired modem at a documented machine cell."
		"Read one real operating state and drive one bounded control output. The program supervises visible machinery; it does not replace the physical route, grid protection, or safe manual stop."
	]
	quest.725FBC5CE04051F8.quest_subtitle: "A wired computer becomes factory control only when its sensors, outputs, and fallback are explicit."
	quest.725FBC5CE04051F8.title: "Wired Factory-Control Computer"
	quest.726E70BD8B31C231.quest_desc: [
		"Build four Electro Energetics batteries through their live sequenced-assembly route."
		"Each battery depends on conductive casing, battery-alloy parts, and acid; keep them wired as deliberate storage, not loose trophies."
	]
	quest.726E70BD8B31C231.quest_subtitle: "Four batteries give the grid time to separate a short interruption from a full shutdown."
	quest.726E70BD8B31C231.title: "Stage Battery Reserve"
	quest.7280FA4CD14A565F.quest_desc: ["Build the authored Medium Voltage consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.7280FA4CD14A565F.quest_subtitle: "The MV standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.7280FA4CD14A565F.title: "MV Consumer Proof"
	quest.728B2E2AB28A5C4E.quest_desc: [
		"Complete the Stellaris Mercury-landing advancement."
		"Keep thermal protection, oxygen, return fuel, and navigation independent from the expedition cargo."
	]
	quest.728B2E2AB28A5C4E.quest_subtitle: "The Mercury landing advancement marks the harshest short route as something the launch base can repeat."
	quest.728B2E2AB28A5C4E.title: "Mercury Furnace March"
	quest.729DF2B0F63284CD.quest_desc: ["Stop a batch, isolate inputs, clear contaminated buffers, restart from known compost, and verify no positive EMC loop."]
	quest.729DF2B0F63284CD.quest_subtitle: "Waste, contamination, and power loss have explicit recovery stock."
	quest.729DF2B0F63284CD.title: "Industrial Biology — Failure and Restart"
	quest.72DCA202D92A74E0.quest_desc: ["Build the Machine Chainer after the Processing Array, CC:Tweaked control computer, route walk and jam recovery are complete. Its assembly opens with Digital Fabrication and uses two Greate stainless gearboxes with the existing mature hulls, sensors, switchgear, cabling and controls.","Coordinate established machine banks while the mechanical workshop continues supplying transmission and service stock. CC:Tweaked supervises, Modern Dynamics routes, and AE2 owns storage and requested production."]
	quest.72DCA202D92A74E0.quest_subtitle: "The chainer coordinates established machines; CC:Tweaked owns programmable supervision, Modern Dynamics routes, and AE2 owns networked storage and autocrafting."
	quest.72DCA202D92A74E0.title: "Coordinate the Factory Floor"
	quest.72E7F709D1ADB228.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer four thousand millibuckets of MI cryofluid."
		"Store it beside the vacuum-freezer loop without letting fusion maintenance consume the final batch."
	]
	quest.72E7F709D1ADB228.quest_subtitle: "Cryofluid is cold infrastructure: every superconducting line depends on its clean production and insulated reserve."
	quest.72E7F709D1ADB228.title: "Cryofluid Dewar"
	quest.72F93E292C594FB1.quest_desc: [
		"Stock two bronze rotors and four bronze gears as drive spares."
		"Store them near the machines they fit, not in the mixed ore output where a routing filter might export them."
	]
	quest.72F93E292C594FB1.quest_subtitle: "Two rotors and four gears keep one damaged drive from idling every downstream machine."
	quest.72F93E292C594FB1.title: "Rotor Repair Crate"
	quest.72FE5FB900814DC9.quest_desc: ["Stock eight Create electron tubes and sixteen copper wire for repeatable analog-control production.","Keep this reserve outside unrestricted automation so the control line can restart when powered assembly stops."]
	quest.72FE5FB900814DC9.quest_subtitle: "A transistor and conductor reserve keeps the LV control line recoverable."
	quest.72FE5FB900814DC9.title: "Fill the Control Drawer"
	quest.73247B95B5E00487.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 16,000 mB of heavy oil."
		"Use a real source, pipe, and buffer; a container held in your inventory is not the intended proof."
	]
	quest.73247B95B5E00487.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of heavy oil justify a sump with a planned outlet and overflow margin."
	quest.73247B95B5E00487.title: "Heavy Oil Sump"
	quest.73672BD67231F47C.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixty-four CC:Tweaked cables, eight Electro Energetics device connectors, and thirty-two bronze plates beside the documented workcell."
		"Record each withdrawal and replenish the shelf before the next operating shift."
	]
	quest.73672BD67231F47C.quest_subtitle: "Multi-shift control stays trustworthy only when network and grid repairs do not cannibalize another live cell."
	quest.73672BD67231F47C.title: "Multi-Shift Control-System Repair Stock"
	quest.737FFDF52AD1457B.quest_desc: [
		"Build four Mekanism control rod assemblies."
		"The live recipe combines boron, iridium, fuel hardware, and radiation instrumentation; verify control behavior in the exact reactor design."
	]
	quest.737FFDF52AD1457B.quest_subtitle: "Four control rod assemblies prove deliberate neutron control without relying on a second reactor system."
	quest.737FFDF52AD1457B.title: "Stage the Boron Heat-Sink Reserve"
	quest.738C2C3AB4A0B067.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger MI’s plasma-turbine advancement through real operation."
		"Verify plasma input, electrical output, and safe behavior when either side pauses."
	]
	quest.738C2C3AB4A0B067.quest_subtitle: "The plasma-turbine proof closes the loop between confined fusion and usable grid power."
	quest.738C2C3AB4A0B067.title: "Plasma Turbine Load"
	quest.73B7963EFEF231FD.quest_desc: [
		"Stock thirty-two Electro Energetics wires."
		"Find the overload, abrasion, bad termination, or wrong protection before installing the replacement."
	]
	quest.73B7963EFEF231FD.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two wires replace a damaged run without splicing around the fault that caused it."
	quest.73B7963EFEF231FD.title: "Stock a Full Wire Repair"
	quest.73CEF161E64AB23E.quest_desc: [
		"Produce a Quantum Processor in the maintained Cleanroom after scanning the Nano Processor prerequisite."
		"It joins MI Quantum Circuits, advanced Greg components, and research into the control core for the final production institution."
	]
	quest.73CEF161E64AB23E.quest_subtitle: "The Quantum Processor is the researched control bridge into Assembly Line construction."
	quest.73CEF161E64AB23E.title: "Quantum Processor"
	quest.73D78C6CF64BCF93.quest_desc: ["Commission a Spirit Crucible and Spirit Catalyzer.","Age 5 experiments now combine measured energy, steel-era components, and larger spirit requirements.","Optional during normal age progression. Esoteric evidence becomes required only at final Reality Engineering through ESO-04 to FRN-06."]
	quest.73D78C6CF64BCF93.quest_subtitle: "Spirit energetics becomes an industrial laboratory practice."
	quest.73D78C6CF64BCF93.title: "Spirit Energetics"
	quest.742FAE8C207E014F.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight AE2 logic processors and sixteen stainless-steel ingots."
		"Keep printed silicon, printed logic, redstone, and stainless feedstock available to reproduce the batch."
	]
	quest.742FAE8C207E014F.quest_subtitle: "Eight logic processors and sixteen stainless ingots give routine crafting room without consuming outage reserves."
	quest.742FAE8C207E014F.title: "Stage Three-Shift Digital Stock"
	quest.743B77F90D03EDF7.quest_desc: [
		"Accumulate four Re:Avaritia neutron piles."
		"Keep the collector continuously supplied and record the time needed to replace the batch."
	]
	quest.743B77F90D03EDF7.quest_subtitle: "Four neutron piles make collector timing visible without pretending the first output is a production line."
	quest.743B77F90D03EDF7.title: "Collect the First Neutron Piles"
	quest.7489D8F7F34227D4.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer eight thousand millibuckets of TFMG naphtha."
		"Keep each distillation product in labeled storage and verify no full outlet blocks the entire tower."
	]
	quest.7489D8F7F34227D4.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets of naphtha prove the TFMG refinery is separating crude rather than merely storing a tower controller."
	quest.7489D8F7F34227D4.title: "Separate the First Naphtha Batch"
	quest.74A38055C1A9013C.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 16,000 mB of Stellaris fuel."
		"Convert a live TFMG fuel through Create mixing and keep bowser storage isolated from ordinary fluid consumers."
	]
	quest.74A38055C1A9013C.quest_subtitle: "The bowser holds enough converted fuel to load a rocket without draining its return reserve."
	quest.74A38055C1A9013C.title: "Launch Fuel Bowser"
	quest.74A82D693AB26B9D.quest_desc: [
		"Stock sixteen Create chutes and thirty-two bronze plates beside the processing floor."
		"Keep clearing tools and route notes with the kit. Isolate a blocked chute branch, correct the storage cause, and only then restart."
	]
	quest.74A82D693AB26B9D.quest_subtitle: "Create keeps the first factory repairable with visible, local gravity routing."
	quest.74A82D693AB26B9D.title: "Create Logistics Repair Kit"
	quest.74C303EF74DB3A84.quest_desc: [
		"Build one Stellaris big oxygen tank and hold 16,000 mB of Stellaris fuel."
		"Complete this branch after the main fuel reserve and label which volume is available to the second shift."
	]
	quest.74C303EF74DB3A84.quest_subtitle: "A large oxygen tank and sixteen buckets of fuel let a second crew inherit capacity rather than empty gauges."
	quest.74C303EF74DB3A84.title: "Open the Second Launch Shift"
	quest.74CEEA5EED3C8A97.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four fission fuel assemblies and inspect the chemical washer."
		"Keep fuel, slurry, acids, and cleaned output in separately labeled containment."
	]
	quest.74CEEA5EED3C8A97.quest_subtitle: "Four unloaded assemblies and an operating washer prepare fuel work without storing danger inside the reactor."
	quest.74CEEA5EED3C8A97.title: "Stage Three-Shift Fuel Handling"
	quest.74D72636703F7DCB.quest_desc: [
		"Return with sixteen blue Starlight crystal shards."
		"Label biome and source, then keep the samples out of generic gem automation."
	]
	quest.74D72636703F7DCB.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen blue crystal shards make the Starlight sample shelf useful without erasing the need for further expeditions."
	quest.74D72636703F7DCB.title: "Exotic Samples Supply Run"
	quest.74F00AE5D2E9D7AB.quest_desc: ["This is a mature LV/MV component standard: its silicone and control suppliers follow Chemical Industry. Machine voltage labels do not make it a pre-space bootstrap requirement."]
	quest.74F00AE5D2E9D7AB.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Medium Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.74F00AE5D2E9D7AB.title: "MV Component Standard"
	quest.74F7C07ACEF2F804.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the steel distillation controller and produce eight cured natural-rubber sheets."
		"Run enough crude to populate the product tanks, then clear every outlet and replenish seals."
	]
	quest.74F7C07ACEF2F804.quest_subtitle: "An operating TFMG controller and eight rubber sheets prove separation and maintenance supplies can coexist."
	quest.74F7C07ACEF2F804.title: "Run the Distillation Shift"
	quest.74FA21F67BB06A5D.quest_desc: ["Build frame, core, acceptor, extender, addon, assembler, and the controlled Oritech processing-unit recipe.","Mechanical commissioning: finish Machine Core 1 on an Aluminum Greate Press or higher. The returned-space aluminum line supplies its hull and drive; keep that same floor available for expansion cores and repair stock."]
	quest.74FA21F67BB06A5D.quest_subtitle: "Discipline mastery — supporting branch; follow the chapter age proof for the main transition."
	quest.74FA21F67BB06A5D.title: "Modular Machine Cell"
	quest.750BF6A224A124BB.quest_desc: ["Fabricate one beam package and one solar-sail package in the MI Assembler. These native packages are the exclusive workpieces for final Create assembly."]
	quest.750BF6A224A124BB.quest_subtitle: "Stage stellar hardware before final mechanical integration."
	quest.750BF6A224A124BB.title: "Dyson Assembly Packages"
	quest.751A5CBE912F3939.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Applied Flux energy processor through its installed recipe."
		"Keep processor fabrication supplied and connect later devices to a measured external grid."
	]
	quest.751A5CBE912F3939.quest_subtitle: "The Applied Flux energy processor brings FE accounting into AE2 without pretending storage is generation."
	quest.751A5CBE912F3939.title: "Energy Processor Line"
	quest.755B62D9C5A5894E.quest_desc: [
		"Build one MI Quantum upgrade and one replicator."
		"Both consume controlled singularity products; supply UU Matter from the live singularity process rather than from quest rewards."
	]
	quest.755B62D9C5A5894E.quest_subtitle: "The first Quantum upgrade and replicator make matter itself an accountable factory input."
	quest.755B62D9C5A5894E.title: "Commission Matter Replication"
	quest.757A5A9D2DD7BA36.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and store sixteen MI steel plates from approved TFMG steel."
		"Use a current forming route and keep the plates out of recipes that can consume substitute steel indiscriminately."
	]
	quest.757A5A9D2DD7BA36.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen plates give casing and boiler work a real structural reserve."
	quest.757A5A9D2DD7BA36.title: "Stock Structural Steel Plate"
	quest.75A26851CCA32314.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 16,000 mB of lubrication oil."
		"Pipe 8,000 mB of lubrication oil into a day tank that cannot be mistaken for fuel storage."
	]
	quest.75A26851CCA32314.quest_subtitle: "A day tank of lubricant makes maintenance independent from the next distillation run."
	quest.75A26851CCA32314.title: "Lubricant Day Tank"
	quest.75D6F232A1EB12EC.quest_desc: [
		"Walk the required distance while laying out real project intake."
		"Separate incompatible fluids and hazards, keep crossings accessible, and allow for future parallel lines."
	]
	quest.75D6F232A1EB12EC.quest_subtitle: "The input trench is a service route whose length matters because every material, pipe, and worker must traverse it."
	quest.75D6F232A1EB12EC.title: "Input Port Trench"
	quest.75ED33867CE210F6.quest_desc: [
		"Locate a Stellaris Venus Outpost and return safely."
		"Approach from prepared shelter, preserve oxygen and cooling reserves, and leave enough capacity to recover useful material."
	]
	quest.75ED33867CE210F6.quest_subtitle: "A Venus outpost is a valuable breach only after its perimeter, exits, and return cargo are secured."
	quest.75ED33867CE210F6.title: "Venus Outpost Breach Map"
	quest.75ED4F2F7CFFA8A2.quest_desc: [
		"Reinspect the established Stellaris launch pad as a launch-site survey."
		"Verify the approach, station clearance, exhaust space, and protection for nearby storage."
	]
	quest.75ED4F2F7CFFA8A2.quest_subtitle: "A second site survey proves the installed pad remains a safe operational launch area."
	quest.75ED4F2F7CFFA8A2.title: "Survey the Operational Launch Site"
	quest.7618141B2BA7FC02.quest_desc: ["Stage the listed UV reserve for expanded quantum-grade automation; keep the batch outside automatic consumption so expansion does not erase repair stock."]
	quest.7618141B2BA7FC02.quest_subtitle: "A reserve batch turns a standard into dependable factory capacity."
	quest.7618141B2BA7FC02.title: "UV Production Cell"
	quest.762AEA107E4C095D.quest_desc: [
		"Buffer eight buckets of UU Matter and four buckets of helium plasma."
		"Use separate, labeled tanks and restore both stocks after the next convergence batch."
	]
	quest.762AEA107E4C095D.quest_subtitle: "UU Matter and helium plasma keep convergence tied to the fusion and singularity systems that made it possible."
	quest.762AEA107E4C095D.title: "Buffer UU Matter and Helium Plasma"
	quest.764FD52CDBFE613F.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the magnetic stabilizer and stage two Rocketnautics rocket thrusters."
		"Leave clear cargo lanes, protected life support, accessible power, and a recovery vehicle path."
	]
	quest.764FD52CDBFE613F.quest_subtitle: "A stabilizer and matched rocket thrusters define where navigation, propulsion, cargo, and service meet."
	quest.764FD52CDBFE613F.title: "Lay Out the Deep-Space Yard"
	quest.7656C8DECF6EDABB.quest_desc: ["Record a departure, destination, failed delivery, return, and manual recovery for rail or airship freight."]
	quest.7656C8DECF6EDABB.quest_subtitle: "Computers schedule physical cargo; they do not teleport it."
	quest.7656C8DECF6EDABB.title: "Route-Recorded Freight Supervisor"
	quest.767549982DA5DAC1.quest_desc: ["Perform the Werewolves discovery experiment and build its native Stone Altar.","Complete the native cure route; transformation remains optional.","This is an optional discipline at this age; the canonical factory proofs govern normal progression."]
	quest.767549982DA5DAC1.quest_subtitle: "Wolfsbane, silver, and field evidence support study without compulsory lycanthropy."
	quest.767549982DA5DAC1.title: "Werewolf Research and Cure"
	quest.769FA85044CD698B.quest_desc: [
		"Build one shield generator through the High Pressure authority recipe."
		"Connect it to protected power, then confirm stored energy and crystal burn before adding field loads."
	]
	quest.769FA85044CD698B.quest_subtitle: "A dedicated shield room separates field loads from the ordinary factory bus and reactor cooling."
	quest.769FA85044CD698B.title: "Shield Generator Room"
	quest.76CFB32025BCFCA4.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a neutron collector and two crystal-matrix blocks as rebuild stock."
		"Isolate the failed workcell and recover samples before installing replacement machinery."
	]
	quest.76CFB32025BCFCA4.quest_subtitle: "A spare neutron collector and two matrix blocks keep containment loss from ending extreme production."
	quest.76CFB32025BCFCA4.title: "Stage an Astral-Line Rebuild"
	quest.76E18603E4688CED.quest_desc: [
		"Build a TFMG cast-iron fluid tank for oil or refinery products."
		"Place it in a contained tank area with a labeled inlet, outlet, and enough spare capacity for shutdown transfers."
	]
	quest.76E18603E4688CED.quest_subtitle: "Cast-iron storage belongs here; steel tanks wait for the steel authority that follows."
	quest.76E18603E4688CED.title: "Install Cast-Iron Fluid Storage"
	quest.7700469EC431D438.quest_desc: ["Retain replacement UV motors, pumps, robot arms, sensors, emitters, and field generators for expanded quantum-grade automation, then verify the ZPM line still operates."]
	quest.7700469EC431D438.quest_subtitle: "The line can replace consumed parts after a failure without dismantling its only consumer."
	quest.7700469EC431D438.title: "UV Recovery Proof"
	quest.7727CEC258BAA527.quest_desc: ["Supply four analog circuits and 100,000 FE to prepare the next LV workcell.","Use the meters to check generation and storage under load. The delivery task records supplied energy; inspect the operating circuit before declaring a brownout test passed."]
	quest.7727CEC258BAA527.quest_subtitle: "Deliver energy to the test-cell task; use meters to inspect operating behavior."
	quest.7727CEC258BAA527.title: "Power the LV Test Cell"
	quest.774F57B2421E8879.quest_desc: [
		"Keep two superconductor coils and demonstrate fifty million FE of connected reserve."
		"Restart cooling and controls first, then admit fuel only after the field and plasma outlets are verified."
	]
	quest.774F57B2421E8879.quest_subtitle: "Spare field coils and an independent energy bank make a controlled restart possible after a full shutdown."
	quest.774F57B2421E8879.title: "Prepare a Fusion Cold Restart"
	quest.776B592B51403BAF.quest_desc: [
		"Build and store thirty-two Mekanism reactor-glass blocks."
		"Keep the pallet outside the controlled area and verify replacement rules before opening any reactor structure."
	]
	quest.776B592B51403BAF.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two reactor-glass blocks make a damaged boundary repairable without borrowing from the live shell."
	quest.776B592B51403BAF.title: "Stock Reactor-Glass Replacements"
	quest.7793F286E36BA3D0.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a Tool Belt belt through its installed recipe."
		"Load only the tools needed for the job and leave food, water, and recovery supplies in proper storage."
	]
	quest.7793F286E36BA3D0.quest_subtitle: "A tool belt keeps the working tool reachable without pretending it replaces a full supply pack."
	quest.7793F286E36BA3D0.title: "Tool Belt Ready"
	quest.77CE6D94F2134283.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four Stellaris desh plating blocks and eight desh ingots."
		"Produce them through the live Moon-ore, macerator, coke, and blast-furnace route."
	]
	quest.77CE6D94F2134283.quest_subtitle: "Four plating blocks and eight desh ingots prevent one fabrication order from consuming the last returned metal."
	quest.77CE6D94F2134283.title: "Buffer the Return-Metal Shift"
	quest.77D439E8930367B0.quest_desc: [
		"Keep eight pressurized tubes and a chemical infuser ready for recovery."
		"Drain or quarantine the damaged line, identify every chemical, then rebuild before reconnecting shared storage."
	]
	quest.77D439E8930367B0.quest_subtitle: "Spare tubing and an infuser make one isolated chemical branch replaceable after containment loss."
	quest.77D439E8930367B0.title: "Rebuild the Pressure Branch"
	quest.77E74DB4F30E0730.quest_desc: ["Retain the LV turbine and deliver 50,000 FE into an FTB Quests Task Screen through the converter boundary.","Inspect the steam supply and an MI load during the trial. The item and FE counters do not measure turbine throughput."]
	quest.77E74DB4F30E0730.quest_subtitle: "Fifty thousand FE under a real turbine load reveals weak steam feed before production depends on it."
	quest.77E74DB4F30E0730.title: "Stage the Turbine Load Test"
	quest.77E9569D1D0BA674.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and transfer 16,000 mB of MI oxygen."
		"Use a dedicated buffer and verify the exact live recipe requiring it before connecting the header."
	]
	quest.77E9569D1D0BA674.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen buckets of oxygen support controlled chemistry only while every outlet and material compatibility is known."
	quest.77E9569D1D0BA674.title: "Oxygen Coolant Header"
	quest.77EF266EBF4F170C.quest_desc: ["Fire four Enchanted clay jars after establishing Copper-era empirical and botanical observation.","This optional botanical branch is separate from Stone survival. Its later occult synthesis remains part of the established final convergence."]
	quest.77EF266EBF4F170C.quest_subtitle: "Four fired jars replace a guide item with the first reusable laboratory vessels."
	quest.77EF266EBF4F170C.title: "TFC Folk Magic — Fire Witchcraft Jars"
	quest.781B84CA4BF0B0F6.quest_desc: ["Deliver 25,000 FE into an FTB Quests Task Screen from the commissioned EE service. This task consumes delivered energy and does not measure a stored black-start reserve.","Craft the native Task Screen from eight stone-tag blocks and a book. Use its configurator as your own team to select this FE task after its prerequisites, then feed the screen from the FE-facing side of the powered EE converter. The screen consumes delivered energy; it does not generate or store a reusable energy balance."]
	quest.781B84CA4BF0B0F6.quest_subtitle: "A small charged cell is enough to wake controls before the steam turbine carries the full plant."
	quest.781B84CA4BF0B0F6.title: "Commission the First FE Cell"
	quest.783D1AE7F056B8EE.quest_desc: ["Build the authored High Voltage consumer and document which component families it consumes."]
	quest.783D1AE7F056B8EE.quest_subtitle: "The HV standard earns its place by operating a real integrated system."
	quest.783D1AE7F056B8EE.title: "HV Consumer Proof"
	quest.78470B17585DF4D0.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 8 opens, build and inspect the Physics Assembler."
		"Use it for physical vehicle construction and keep manual controls, propulsion, stabilization, and route automation as separate later systems."
	]
	quest.78470B17585DF4D0.quest_subtitle: "A construction bay makes an experimental vehicle possible; it does not make the vehicle stable or autonomous."
	quest.78470B17585DF4D0.title: "Vehicle Construction Bay"
	quest.784D0217780D9ADE.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger Re:Avaritia’s Eternal Singularity advancement."
		"Keep the singularity ledger current so missing production remains visible after the first success."
	]
	quest.784D0217780D9ADE.quest_subtitle: "The Eternal Singularity advancement records a factory capable of naming every material it has compressed."
	quest.784D0217780D9ADE.title: "Eternal Singularity Crown"
	quest.786438808FFAEF7E.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a replacement coke oven and eight rubber sheets available."
		"Isolate hot material and empty connected fluid paths before swapping equipment or restarting the batch."
	]
	quest.786438808FFAEF7E.quest_subtitle: "A replacement oven and fresh seals prove a fuel-side failure will not end the district."
	quest.786438808FFAEF7E.title: "Recover the Coke Line"
	quest.788179FC1E88E035.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s mold advancement while preparing raw clay for a pit firing."
		"Arrange straw and logs before ignition, and keep replacement clay nearby in case the first batch is incomplete."
	]
	quest.788179FC1E88E035.quest_subtitle: "A pit kiln is the first place where careful preparation survives an unseen process."
	quest.788179FC1E88E035.title: "Build a Pit Kiln from Raw Clay"
	quest.789912B7C2CACFE1.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the fusion reactor during a controlled operating interval."
		"Watch the supply and output systems rather than judging stability from sound alone."
	]
	quest.789912B7C2CACFE1.quest_subtitle: "Stable confinement is quiet work: field power, fuel flow, and plasma output remain within their planned ranges."
	quest.789912B7C2CACFE1.title: "Hold Plasma Confinement"
	quest.78B03D44BEC85E33.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 6 opens, place and inspect an MI assembler."
		"Choose one recurring component and automate its inputs, output, and overflow before adding more recipes."
	]
	quest.78B03D44BEC85E33.quest_subtitle: "An assembler workcell makes repeated components predictable only when every ingredient arrives in the right quantity."
	quest.78B03D44BEC85E33.title: "Assembler Workcell"
	quest.78BBCB68691334D9.quest_desc: ["Route one item and one fluid shipment, test a blocked destination, then restore flow without voiding cargo."]
	quest.78BBCB68691334D9.quest_subtitle: "Compact technical routing follows visible Create and freight handling."
	quest.78BBCB68691334D9.title: "Modern Dynamics Enclosed Routing"
	quest.78D02B4658DC4839.quest_desc: [
		"Stage two large oxygen tanks, two Rocketnautics thrusters, and two Big Fuel Tank Upgrades for sustained late-flight operations."
		"This reserve links the Space Race to the mature fleet-production routes opened in Cosmonautics."
	]
	quest.78D02B4658DC4839.quest_subtitle: "Oxygen, thrusters, and two fleet tank upgrades support sustained late-flight operations."
	quest.78D02B4658DC4839.title: "Stage the Three-Shift Reserve"
	quest.78D66599CD3A14E1.quest_desc: ["Build and operate the first electric furnace with a stable electrical supply and clear output.","After Space Aluminum research, ordinary electric furnaces also supply the large electric furnace controller with its native hull, heating wires and casings, Greate aluminum ventilation and extra refractory. This adds bulk ordinary heating; the electric blast furnace remains the separate alloy-metallurgy facility."]
	quest.78D66599CD3A14E1.quest_subtitle: "The first electric furnace makes controlled high heat another load the grid must carry."
	quest.78D66599CD3A14E1.title: "Assemble the Electric Blast Furnace"
	quest.78FAADC20C3595A1.quest_desc: [
		"Stock thirty-two Electro Energetics wires and eight connectors."
		"Do not reuse heat-damaged terminations; correct the load or protection before closing the circuit."
	]
	quest.78FAADC20C3595A1.quest_subtitle: "Wire spools and connectors replace a failed EE or Electro Energetics branch from isolated terminal to isolated terminal."
	quest.78FAADC20C3595A1.title: "Burned Wire Stock"
	quest.79074CED9461BDA5.quest_desc: ["Drive an EE alternator from the kinetic district using its rotor, stator and brushes. Complete the EE converter to supply the first MI machines."]
	quest.79074CED9461BDA5.quest_subtitle: "A generator housing and turbine define where steam ends, electricity begins, and maintenance can reach both."
	quest.79074CED9461BDA5.title: "Lay Out Generation and Service"
	quest.7912D59F16DCF8A6.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat one Stellaris mogler during a prepared sweep."
		"Light and mark the tunnel, avoid fighting beside the only exit, and return with life support in reserve."
	]
	quest.7912D59F16DCF8A6.quest_subtitle: "A mogler in confined ground makes tunnel visibility and retreat space part of the encounter."
	quest.7912D59F16DCF8A6.title: "Mogler Tunnel Sweep"
	quest.7955D4D0EE64FB75.quest_desc: [
		"Install and inspect a Electro Energetics device connector on an operating branch."
		"Keep the connection accessible for isolation and verify the attached load does not exceed the branch’s generation or storage."
	]
	quest.7955D4D0EE64FB75.quest_subtitle: "A device connector makes the handoff from the visible grid to one machine deliberate and serviceable."
	quest.7955D4D0EE64FB75.title: "Connect an MV Device Safely"
	quest.797E0732927C018D.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four seeking eyes and sixteen neutron piles."
		"Keep the eyes with the outpost kit and the neutron piles in controlled industrial storage."
	]
	quest.797E0732927C018D.quest_subtitle: "Four seeking eyes and sixteen neutron piles make another expedition and compression run independently recoverable."
	quest.797E0732927C018D.title: "Prepare a Second Astral Shift"
	quest.7985F331A44D4756.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four MI motors and sixteen copper wire from the current factory supply."
		"Refill copper coils, cord, magnetic rods, and lubricant afterward so the rebuild does not empty the next maintenance job."
	]
	quest.7985F331A44D4756.quest_subtitle: "Fresh wire and motors prove the electrical shop still reaches back to steel, copper, and rubber."
	quest.7985F331A44D4756.title: "Rebuild Motors from Feedstock"
	quest.79A93E92FC1E235D.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an AE2 inscriber."
		"Install the correct press, supply one processor line at a time, and keep printed parts separated."
	]
	quest.79A93E92FC1E235D.quest_subtitle: "The inscriber makes processor fabrication repeatable, but its presses and material order still matter."
	quest.79A93E92FC1E235D.title: "Inscriber Workflow"
	quest.79C67DEEDE3F85A5.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare TerraFirmaCraft barley seed."
		"Store it dry and separate from grain intended for milling or animal feed."
	]
	quest.79C67DEEDE3F85A5.quest_subtitle: "A protected seed reserve keeps the next planting out of the current food supply."
	quest.79C67DEEDE3F85A5.title: "Seed Bank Ledger"
	quest.79D36DEED49BD9EB.quest_desc: [
		"Hold one AE2 engineering processor in the dedicated expansion buffer."
		"Keep it reserved for controller, CPU, or storage work and refill the inscriber inputs."
	]
	quest.79D36DEED49BD9EB.quest_subtitle: "A dedicated processor buffer proves expansion stock has a controlled destination rather than an item-dropping shortcut."
	quest.79D36DEED49BD9EB.title: "Hold an Engineering Processor Expansion Buffer"
	quest.7A0AD8FE949D3755.quest_desc: [
		"Complete Mekanism’s injection-chamber advancement with the current pack recipe."
		"Connect its gas input through labeled advanced tubing and provide clean solid outputs."
	]
	quest.7A0AD8FE949D3755.quest_subtitle: "The injection-chamber advancement marks pressure chemistry becoming controlled enough for higher-order processing."
	quest.7A0AD8FE949D3755.title: "Injection Chamber Seal"
	quest.7A1D7230AA352583.quest_desc: [
		"Build and retain two Cargo Boats motorboats."
		"Assign distinct routes or cargo roles so the second boat adds capacity rather than confusion."
	]
	quest.7A1D7230AA352583.quest_subtitle: "Two motorboats allow one route to keep moving while the other unloads or undergoes repair."
	quest.7A1D7230AA352583.title: "Open a Second River Service"
	quest.7A2480E01B9BFE31.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and store sixteen AE2 certus quartz dust."
		"The live inscriber route accepts certus crystal; keep crystal and dust inventories separate so automation respects both uses."
	]
	quest.7A2480E01B9BFE31.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen certus dust supports glass, fiber, and processor work without grinding every crystal in sight."
	quest.7A2480E01B9BFE31.title: "Fill the Certus Dust Drawer"
	quest.7A2817DD1538BF97.quest_desc: ["This is a mature LV/MV component standard: its silicone and control suppliers follow Chemical Industry. Machine voltage labels do not make it a pre-space bootstrap requirement."]
	quest.7A2817DD1538BF97.quest_subtitle: "All eight real Low Voltage functional families form one exact standard."
	quest.7A2817DD1538BF97.title: "LV Component Standard"
	quest.7A3B40776103D3CF.quest_desc: [
		"Shape and fire a ceramic jug before making a longer survey."
		"Fill it before leaving camp; TFC travel becomes dangerous quickly when water is an afterthought."
	]
	quest.7A3B40776103D3CF.quest_subtitle: "A fired jug extends every safe route away from fresh water."
	quest.7A3B40776103D3CF.title: "Carry Water Beyond Camp"
	quest.7A3FDD3915DE5AEB.quest_desc: [
		"Build thatch bed and thatch."
		"Gather straw with a knife, make thatch, then place the bed inside a small weatherproof shelter."
	]
	quest.7A3FDD3915DE5AEB.quest_subtitle: "Dry thatch and a bed turn the first roof into somewhere worth returning to."
	quest.7A3FDD3915DE5AEB.title: "Thatch Bed and First Shelter"
	quest.7A4B49F04CAE7CC8.quest_desc: [
		"Produce four Infinity nuggets and four crystal-matrix ingots from current inputs."
		"Audit the entire route backward and correct any authority that cannot replace its contribution."
	]
	quest.7A4B49F04CAE7CC8.quest_subtitle: "Four nuggets and four matrix ingots made after the first proof show the line begins in working factories, not old stock."
	quest.7A4B49F04CAE7CC8.title: "Rebuild Convergence from Inputs"
	quest.7A5918BF8F0FF0A8.quest_desc: [
		"After condensing the first controlled UU Matter, produce Eclipse Alloy and time crystals through the authored convergence routes."
		"Age 14 supplies the LUV, nuclear, and Starlight ingredients; Age 15 supplies the matter-engineering step."
	]
	quest.7A5918BF8F0FF0A8.quest_subtitle: "Quantum matter engineering turns the Age 14 precursor stock into temporal containment."
	quest.7A5918BF8F0FF0A8.title: "Eclipse Alloy and Temporal Components"
	quest.7A5F2FC5739D08F9.quest_desc: ["Assemble the Mekanism Isotopic Centrifuge and use it to begin controlled isotope work."]
	quest.7A5F2FC5739D08F9.quest_subtitle: "Separate nuclear feedstock inside a finished machine body."
	quest.7A5F2FC5739D08F9.title: "Isotope Separation Line"
	quest.7A6302A7F53E277E.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight turbine blades and four unloaded fission fuel assemblies."
		"Store them in separate controlled areas and document which reactor and turbine design each batch fits."
	]
	quest.7A6302A7F53E277E.quest_subtitle: "Eight turbine blades and four fuel assemblies make power conversion and fuel geometry jointly accountable."
	quest.7A6302A7F53E277E.title: "Stage Turbine Blades and Fuel Assemblies"
	quest.7A9C813B740B6FE9.quest_desc: [
		"Acquire one TFC banana sapling from the live fruit-tree world route."
		"Plant only after checking the TFC climate range and space, and preserve a replacement before expanding the orchard."
	]
	quest.7A9C813B740B6FE9.quest_subtitle: "A TFC banana sapling is a long-term food promise whose climate and placement matter before its harvest."
	quest.7A9C813B740B6FE9.title: "Orchard Reserve"
	quest.7AAF529D77079CEB.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger AE2’s Crafting CPU advancement after the provider branch."
		"Run a real craft and inspect co-processing, storage, and cancellation behavior."
	]
	quest.7AAF529D77079CEB.quest_subtitle: "The crafting-CPU advancement proves the network can schedule work after providers and channels already function."
	quest.7AAF529D77079CEB.title: "Crafting CPU Throne"
	quest.7AD7B8724B36B4C1.quest_desc: [
		"Trigger Re:Avaritia’s Infinity Catalyst advancement with the live craft."
		"Review the advancement only for its trigger; the pack recipe remains the mechanical source of truth."
	]
	quest.7AD7B8724B36B4C1.quest_subtitle: "The catalyst advancement records that every historical ingredient reached the final table under its rightful authority."
	quest.7AD7B8724B36B4C1.title: "Catalyst of Ash"
	quest.7AD8280CC0E8D33A.quest_desc: ["Craft twenty-seven Railcraft Coke Oven Bricks for the heavy-industry coke works.","Use the Railcraft oven for creosote and rail fuel. TFMG’s separate cast-iron coke ovens produce TFMG coal coke and process gas; collect the process gas and keep its output drained."]
	quest.7AD8280CC0E8D33A.quest_subtitle: "A complete brick set proves the heavy-fuel district can be built without the removed MI coke oven."
	quest.7AD8280CC0E8D33A.title: "Raise the Coke Oven"
	quest.7B15A7C2E9406D3F.quest_desc: ["Reach Jupiter and commission a local atmospheric station with a Vacuumator, Tier 4 Fluid Tank, and Rocket Station."]
	quest.7B15A7C2E9406D3F.quest_subtitle: "Jovian progress is proven by the real infrastructure that makes local atmospheric harvesting possible."
	quest.7B15A7C2E9406D3F.title: "Return with the Elixir: Jupiter"
	quest.7B209BE21F7C1CC3.quest_desc: [
		"Stock four basic chemical tanks and sixteen HDPE sheets."
		"Leave at least one tank clean and unassigned so shutdown work never depends on dumping a valuable gas."
	]
	quest.7B209BE21F7C1CC3.quest_subtitle: "Four tanks and sixteen sheets provide transfer space and material for more than one interrupted process."
	quest.7B209BE21F7C1CC3.title: "Stage Three-Shift Containment"
	quest.7B3474DF11467444.quest_desc: [
		"Produce eight Mekanism substrate through the normal HDPE feed chain."
		"Replace every gas and solid input consumed so the next sheet batch can begin without scavenging."
	]
	quest.7B3474DF11467444.quest_subtitle: "Eight substrate made again shows biofeed, hydrogen, and the reaction chamber can sustain polymer work."
	quest.7B3474DF11467444.title: "Repeat the Substrate Line"
	quest.7B8719374610E88F.quest_desc: [
		"Stage four rocket fins and eight raw desh ingots."
		"Keep flight parts separate from planetary cargo and document which batch belongs to the next vehicle."
	]
	quest.7B8719374610E88F.quest_subtitle: "A complete fin set beside raw desh records what left Earth and what successfully returned."
	quest.7B8719374610E88F.title: "Fin Assembly Rack"
	quest.7B95BBC96811B34A.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect an MI bronze macerator during a real batch."
		"Feed bounded input and verify it stops cleanly when either steam or output capacity disappears."
	]
	quest.7B95BBC96811B34A.quest_subtitle: "The bronze macerator is a useful unattended test because its modest rate makes every blocked output visible."
	quest.7B95BBC96811B34A.title: "Keep a Bronze Line Running"
	quest.7BA0ECF99B0119B7.quest_desc: ["Build and place the base Loot Fabricator after proving the Simulation Chamber.","Keep prediction input and output storage separated so the later industrial fabricators inherit a traceable material route.","Optional Digital simulation under COM-04. Hostile models and drops do not prove factory control or replace first-resource acquisition."]
	quest.7BA0ECF99B0119B7.quest_subtitle: "Prediction becomes useful only when a fabricator can turn it into recoverable material output."
	quest.7BA0ECF99B0119B7.title: "Prove the Base Loot Fabricator"
	quest.7BDD03AD021299B3.quest_desc: [
		"Reach a Stellaris Venus Desert biome."
		"Mark the landing and shelter route, monitor survival equipment, and turn back before the independent return reserve is touched."
	]
	quest.7BDD03AD021299B3.quest_subtitle: "Venus desert heat turns every delay outside shelter into a cost paid by life support."
	quest.7BDD03AD021299B3.title: "Venus Desert Heat Claim"
	quest.7BF799817E0F29EA.quest_desc: [
		"Complete TFC’s sheet advancement at the anvil."
		"Watch temperature and strike order; a correct plan finished too cold still wastes time and fuel."
	]
	quest.7BF799817E0F29EA.quest_subtitle: "Sheet working proves repeated hammer plans can produce consistent structural stock."
	quest.7BF799817E0F29EA.title: "Prove Sheet Working"
	quest.7BF834462C225706.quest_desc: [
		"Build and store two Stellaris rocket engines."
		"Keep them protected at the launch site with the fan, motor, pump, mechanism, plate, and battery inputs needed to replace them again."
	]
	quest.7BF834462C225706.quest_subtitle: "Two spare engines turn an abort from a dead end into a repair with a known duration."
	quest.7BF834462C225706.title: "Stock Spare Rocket Engines"
	quest.7C1CEA2091E54BD7.quest_desc: ["Complete a TFMG steel mechanism through the live three-loop Create sequence.","Each loop uses a steel casing, 250 mB lubricant, nickel plate, lead plate, and pressing on a heavy-plate base.","Mechanical commissioning: finish this sequence with a Steel Greate Press or higher. Build the press with the existing precision-mechanism line first; its construction does not consume the steel mechanism it will produce. Use the existing assembler batch when recurring demand grows."]
	quest.7C1CEA2091E54BD7.quest_subtitle: "The steel mechanism is Heavy Industry condensed into one precise, lubricated assembly."
	quest.7C1CEA2091E54BD7.title: "Mechanism Rebuild Bench"
	quest.7C45D11F8641A5FC.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect a neutron compressor after Extreme Industry is repeatable."
		"Feed it from collectors, prevent output deadlock, and route compressed matter into controlled fabrication."
	]
	quest.7C45D11F8641A5FC.quest_subtitle: "The planetary megaforge replaces isolated forming lines with continuous neutron feed, restricted storage, and shared heavy services."
	quest.7C45D11F8641A5FC.title: "Planetary Megaforge"
	quest.7C6331DB01CBB2D3.quest_desc: [
		"Complete MI’s advanced-upgrade advancement with the installed recipe."
		"Apply upgrades only where generation and cable capacity can support the higher throughput."
	]
	quest.7C6331DB01CBB2D3.quest_subtitle: "The advanced-upgrade advancement records the moment LV machinery gains a deliberate path into MV work."
	quest.7C6331DB01CBB2D3.title: "Advanced Upgrade Writ"
	quest.7C9745FD73DD79C9.quest_desc: [
		"Find 8 small cassiterite."
		"Place the cassiterite claim where loose ore, host rock, and prospector readings agree."
	]
	quest.7C9745FD73DD79C9.quest_subtitle: "Eight cassiterite samples are enough to mark a claim worth following underground."
	quest.7C9745FD73DD79C9.title: "Cassiterite Claim Marker"
	quest.7CA73CADB9E37FAF.quest_desc: [
		"Stage eight turbine casings and inspect the chemical washer."
		"Simulate loss of main power with the reactor off, then verify backup controls, coolant, waste isolation, and restart order."
	]
	quest.7CA73CADB9E37FAF.quest_subtitle: "Turbine casing stock and a working washer preserve heat removal and chemistry after generation stops."
	quest.7CA73CADB9E37FAF.title: "Practice the Decay-Heat Shutdown"
	quest.7CD717F767630AA3.quest_desc: [
		"Build an MI electric blast furnace after the steel route is open."
		"Place it where bulk feed, hot output, cooling, and plate or casing production can expand around it."
	]
	quest.7CD717F767630AA3.quest_subtitle: "An electric blast furnace justifies a steel works when heat, gas, ore, cooling, and forming lines can be shared at scale."
	quest.7CD717F767630AA3.title: "Steel Works"
	quest.7CFD90C02A07659F.quest_desc: [
		"Build another LV steam turbine and retain sixteen MI copper wire."
		"Stage the turbine cold, then connect it only after steam supply, storage, and protection can accept another generator."
	]
	quest.7CFD90C02A07659F.quest_subtitle: "A spare turbine and wire stock make generation expandable without stripping the live grid."
	quest.7CFD90C02A07659F.title: "Stage a Spare LV Turbine"
	quest.7D1FF5291D063836.quest_desc: [
		"Place a Create basin in the foundry floor and keep an andesite casing ready for the next machine."
		"Leave access for belts or depots, heat below the basin, and enough shaft clearance to service the drive."
	]
	quest.7D1FF5291D063836.quest_subtitle: "A basin, casing, and clear work lane make the foundry a plant instead of a pile of blocks."
	quest.7D1FF5291D063836.title: "Lay Out the Foundry Floor"
	quest.7D41C26DE2441DEB.quest_desc: [
		"Produce sixteen aethersent ingots and four neutron ingots."
		"Replenish the seeded astral and neutron-compression lines before transferring the batch."
	]
	quest.7D41C26DE2441DEB.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen aethersent and four neutron ingots make a serious Quantum feed batch without demanding an arbitrary warehouse."
	quest.7D41C26DE2441DEB.title: "Aethersent Ingot Batch"
	quest.7D4379577F1739C0.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect an AE2 energy acceptor during restart."
		"Bring up local power, verify storage access, then enable crafting workcells one branch at a time."
	]
	quest.7D4379577F1739C0.quest_subtitle: "The energy acceptor is the right recovery point: restore power before asking storage or crafting to answer."
	quest.7D4379577F1739C0.title: "Cold-Restart Network Power"
	quest.7D43C155A4A1452F.quest_desc: [
		"Build and store two Rocketnautics rocket thrusters."
		"Seal the matched pair with its intended craft and keep iridium, titanium, electronics, and pump replenishment records nearby."
	]
	quest.7D43C155A4A1452F.quest_subtitle: "One recipe batch yields the two rocket thrusters needed for a controlled propulsion replacement."
	quest.7D43C155A4A1452F.title: "Crate a Thruster Pair"
	quest.7D56E7A156627990.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the placed AE2 controller and stage sixteen fluix glass cable."
		"Leave physical access to drives and bulk stores, and keep import, export, terminal, and crafting branches distinguishable."
	]
	quest.7D56E7A156627990.quest_subtitle: "A visible controller and cable reserve make channels, power, storage, and service routes part of the floor plan."
	quest.7D56E7A156627990.title: "Lay Out the Digital Factory"
	quest.7D6499EC8771BC3C.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a Electro Energetics LV switch."
		"Start with downstream loads open, energize controls and storage, then close branches one at a time."
	]
	quest.7D6499EC8771BC3C.quest_subtitle: "An LV switch keeps the recovery sequence visible: controls first, loads only after measurements agree."
	quest.7D6499EC8771BC3C.title: "Prove the Cold-Start Disconnect"
	quest.7D6A954794030611.quest_desc: ["Run preflight, mine a bounded assignment, return physically, unload, refuel, and recover from obstruction."]
	quest.7D6A954794030611.quest_subtitle: "A programmable field miner remains smaller and less productive than a bulk quarry."
	quest.7D6A954794030611.title: "Mining Turtle Field Program"
	quest.7D75C2FB9EEC9670.quest_desc: [
		"Produce 96 charcoal."
		"Complete the charcoal burn before the copper campaign so the first heat demand cannot consume camp fuel."
	]
	quest.7D75C2FB9EEC9670.quest_subtitle: "Ninety-six charcoal makes the copper run a planned operation rather than a hopeful firing."
	quest.7D75C2FB9EEC9670.title: "Charcoal for the Copper Run"
	quest.7D912C3360ECA295.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare a wool chestplate and leather flask after establishing field-water discipline."
		"Practice returning, warming, hydrating, and replacing the used kit without relying on radiation medicine."
	]
	quest.7D912C3360ECA295.quest_subtitle: "Warm clothing and a filled field flask are the first checks before anyone leaves shelter again."
	quest.7D912C3360ECA295.title: "Run the Exposure Recovery Drill"
	quest.7DAC27C37229DEBD.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect the Mekanism Fission Reactor Logic Adapter."
		"Its sixteen-operation safety-package line integrates the port, fuel and irradiation subsystems, processors, meters, shutdown hardware, cooling, supervised control, grid isolation, lubricant, and structural closure."
		"This is the principal reactor controller: cooling, irradiation, turbines, spent fuel, radiation, and reprocessing remain Mekanism responsibilities."
	]
	quest.7DAC27C37229DEBD.quest_subtitle: "The principal Mekanism reactor begins only after monitoring, access, fuel custody, and a deliberate shutdown path exist."
	quest.7DAC27C37229DEBD.title: "Mekanism Fission Logic Adapter"
	quest.7DB406C7E801DB1C.quest_desc: [
		"Run another heated bronze batch, then inspect the placed foundry lid while the setup is still assembled."
		"Keep copper and tin buffered in the three-to-one ratio so repeating the cast does not depend on leftover inputs."
	]
	quest.7DB406C7E801DB1C.quest_subtitle: "The second bronze batch proves the foundry lid survived its first success."
	quest.7DB406C7E801DB1C.title: "Run a Second Bronze Batch"
	quest.7DF2BB3DFF551E6D.quest_desc: [
		"Travel one hundred thousand centimeters by boat during real freight or survey work."
		"Use marked docks and carry enough supplies for the return leg."
	]
	quest.7DF2BB3DFF551E6D.quest_subtitle: "One kilometer by boat proves the waterway has useful length, landings, and a route home."
	quest.7DF2BB3DFF551E6D.title: "River Freight Record"
	quest.7E25D2E8B8104F74.quest_desc: [
		"Inspect the fusion reactor and demonstrate one hundred million FE of reserve."
		"Disconnect primary generation, verify the convergence controls remain available, then restore systems without spending protected inputs."
	]
	quest.7E25D2E8B8104F74.quest_subtitle: "Even at Infinity, safe recovery still begins with an inspected reactor and power that survives its loss."
	quest.7E25D2E8B8104F74.title: "Run the Convergence Blackout Drill"
	quest.7E2C0F5826A32CFB.quest_desc: [
		"Demonstrate two hundred fifty million FE of protected storage."
		"Open primary generation, restore control and logistics in order, and leave heavy processes off until inspected."
	]
	quest.7E2C0F5826A32CFB.quest_subtitle: "Two hundred fifty million stored FE tests whether a civilization-scale site can recover its controls without the main plant."
	quest.7E2C0F5826A32CFB.title: "Run the Project Blackout Drill"
	quest.7E2F37A4005BB466.quest_desc: ["Commission the steel distillation controller to prove coke, refractory work, extraction, crude separation, rubber, and contained storage support one heavy-industry district.", "Coke, refractory, petroleum, rubber and lubrication become permanent industrial feedstocks."]
	quest.7E2F37A4005BB466.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 4 PROOF — Heavy Industry"
	quest.7E2F37A4005BB466.title: "Heavy Industry District Proven"
	quest.7E7FC246088E63B9.quest_desc: [
		"Produce and store eight MI titanium large plates."
		"Keep the vault physical and restricted so small automated crafts cannot consume structural stock."
	]
	quest.7E7FC246088E63B9.quest_subtitle: "Eight large plates give the vault enough structural titanium for one serious hull or containment job."
	quest.7E7FC246088E63B9.title: "Fill the Titanium Large-Plate Vault"
	quest.7E815FA4400E10A9.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Astikor Carts oak seed drill."
		"Fill it from reserved seed, test spacing on prepared soil, and keep the next planting stock out of the hopper."
	]
	quest.7E815FA4400E10A9.quest_subtitle: "A seed drill makes logistics visible in the rows planted from the supplies the cart delivered."
	quest.7E815FA4400E10A9.title: "Drawn Seed Drill"
	quest.7E836FD1DBA61467.quest_desc: [
		"Build an MI bronze machine casing as the first scale reference."
		"Treat a late industrial district as a distributed machine. Its reactors, tanks, controls, logistics, hazards, maintenance routes, and recovery systems must operate together even when no single controller represents the entire site."
	]
	quest.7E836FD1DBA61467.quest_subtitle: "A district is a machine whose inputs, hazards, maintenance, and workers no longer fit around one controller."
	quest.7E836FD1DBA61467.title: "Read Industrial Districts as Machines"
	quest.7E8EA9CA3047460C.quest_desc: [
		"Build or recover an Eternal Starlight crystalborn catalyst after entering the dimension."
		"Store it with source notes and keep it away from unrestricted matrix and occult crafting."
	]
	quest.7E8EA9CA3047460C.quest_subtitle: "One catalyst in controlled storage proves astral containment through evidence, not unrelated combat."
	quest.7E8EA9CA3047460C.title: "Quarantine a Crystalborn Catalyst"
	quest.7EB453C5398D7457.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare a second turbine shift without consuming emergency stock: casings, protected connectors, two rotors, four electromagnetic coils, and two condensers."
		"These are mature production batches; the first native turbine components must already exist as retained seeds."
	]
	quest.7EB453C5398D7457.quest_subtitle: "Casings, protected power, rotors, coils, and condensers give steam conversion a complete second shift."
	quest.7EB453C5398D7457.title: "Prepare a Second Nuclear Turbine Shift"
	quest.7EC1123AD1DDC707.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Supplementaries notice board."
		"Place it at the transfer point and record information that changes how freight is handled."
	]
	quest.7EC1123AD1DDC707.quest_subtitle: "A notice board makes route closures, destination changes, and cargo priority visible to everyone using the yard."
	quest.7EC1123AD1DDC707.title: "Freight Notice Board"
	quest.7EE6C0C35E1F23C2.quest_desc: [
		"Bring eight raw Rubberworks rubber and mechanically press eight Rubberworks sheets from it."
		"Keep the sapper, resin line, rotational compressor, and mechanical press supplied for the full batch."
	]
	quest.7EE6C0C35E1F23C2.quest_subtitle: "Raw rubber and finished sheets together prove the vat route starts before the refinery output."
	quest.7EE6C0C35E1F23C2.title: "Rubber from Fresh Feedstock"
	quest.7F2FF8EB08226E28.quest_desc: [
		"After Tier 15 opens, inspect an MI fusion reactor."
		"Trace protected control power, main output, isolation, and black-start supply before connecting the stellar source."
	]
	quest.7F2FF8EB08226E28.quest_subtitle: "Fusion belongs on the same grid diagram as every smaller source, even when its scale changes the drawing."
	quest.7F2FF8EB08226E28.title: "Fusion and Stellar Preview"
	quest.7F4A860BF440D2D2.quest_desc: ["Install it at an authorized remote dimension with a substation, physical freight, return stock, and a first-discovery sample already secured."]
	quest.7F4A860BF440D2D2.quest_subtitle: "Required discipline mastery — contributes to the canonical age proof."
	quest.7F4A860BF440D2D2.title: "Deep-Space Selective Digital Miner"
	quest.7F52D305917DC979.quest_desc: [
		"Build two Mekanism dosimeters."
		"Issue one to each active role, record the reading before entry, and define the level that ends the job."
	]
	quest.7F52D305917DC979.quest_subtitle: "Two dosimeters let exposure follow the people doing the work instead of disappearing into a shared office instrument."
	quest.7F52D305917DC979.title: "Issue Shift Dosimeters"
	quest.7F5CB4893E467C64.quest_desc: [
		"Place and inspect a cast-iron fluid tank in a contained fuel-storage area."
		"Provide a shutoff path and clear access; the tank should be removable from service while the rest of the refinery is idle."
	]
	quest.7F5CB4893E467C64.quest_subtitle: "Fire safety starts with a tank that can be isolated without draining the whole district."
	quest.7F5CB4893E467C64.title: "Contain the Fuel Buffer"
	quest.7F61706E10A2E45C.quest_desc: [
		"Keep an oak hand cart and a Cargo Boats capacity upgrade ready."
		"Establish the manual bypass first, then restore loaders, schedules, and automatic routing in stages."
	]
	quest.7F61706E10A2E45C.quest_subtitle: "A hand cart and spare boat capacity move urgent cargo before every automated connection is restored."
	quest.7F61706E10A2E45C.title: "Restart Freight by Hand"
	quest.7F823C3B731BF62E.quest_desc: ["Milestone 5: maintain genetic records and reference colonies. The gene indexer and bee extractor require a royal jelly bottle from the Bumblezone.","Acquire that native input through the bee-dimension branch, then connect breeding records to the existing digital apiary. Resource bees amplify acquired material; they do not replace its first geological or planetary discovery."]
	quest.7F823C3B731BF62E.quest_subtitle: "The gene indexer makes breeding records actionable without turning every bee into an interchangeable resource source."
	quest.7F823C3B731BF62E.title: "Apiary Records Office"
	quest.7F89E1DA13F9EC0A.quest_desc: [
		"Feed thirty-two Superconductor Cables into the seeded four-coil cryogenic winding run."
		"The original one-coil recipe remains the bootstrap route; the batch improves automation and throughput at Quantum power."
	]
	quest.7F89E1DA13F9EC0A.quest_subtitle: "Thirty-two cables and a retained first coil prove cryogenic winding at service scale."
	quest.7F89E1DA13F9EC0A.title: "Wind a Four-Coil Batch"
	quest.7F95E7B9F7FEFB4D.quest_desc: ["Build a quantum machine hull from replaceable high-tier components to prove matter, power, distance, transit, and stellar construction are controlled systems.", "Greate tungsten-steel and LuV precision mechanics supply the same late factory. Stargate reconstruction unlocks instant item/fluid logistics only after the rocket, freight, fusion and dimensional-research program."]
	quest.7F95E7B9F7FEFB4D.quest_subtitle: "CANONICAL AGE 15 PROOF — Quantum and Reality Engineering"
	quest.7F95E7B9F7FEFB4D.title: "Quantum Systems Mastered"
	quest.7FCDACD26EAA3C0A.quest_desc: ["Build the mechanical servo through AIR-01 after railway engineering, using precision mechanisms, sequenced gearshifts and the steel-mechanism line.","This actuator is manual hardware. Digital metrology, gyroscopes and stabilized flight remain later capabilities."]
	quest.7FCDACD26EAA3C0A.quest_subtitle: "A mechanical servo lets the pilot command the vehicle without pretending it can yet stabilize itself."
	quest.7FCDACD26EAA3C0A.title: "Manual Flight Control"
	quest.7FE0327AF90FC126.quest_desc: [
		"Stock eight radiation-shielding modules and sixteen MI uranium dust."
		"Keep replacement protection in the control area and uranium in restricted fuel storage with meters and clear signage."
	]
	quest.7FE0327AF90FC126.quest_subtitle: "Replacement shielding and uranium feed never belong in the same unlabeled storage, even when the graph places them nearby."
	quest.7FE0327AF90FC126.title: "Emergency Shielding Cabinet"
	quest.7FF1A0692E296D4F.quest_desc: ["Refine Soulstone and build a Spirit Altar.","Collect spirits and complete a native Spirit Infusion while preserving the altar as permanent research infrastructure.","Optional during normal age progression. Esoteric evidence becomes required only at final Reality Engineering through ESO-04 to FRN-06."]
	quest.7FF1A0692E296D4F.quest_subtitle: "A repeatable experiment is more valuable than a disposable machine."
	quest.7FF1A0692E296D4F.title: "Spirit Infusion"
}
